<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PSA" style="id">-Kamano-Kafe</book>
  <para style="h">Sam-Zagame</para>
  <para style="mt1">Sam-Zagame</para>
  <para style="mt2">Namba 1ni Zagame Avontafere</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PSA 1"/>
  <para style="s">Knare avu'ava'ma nehaza vahe'ene havi avu'ava'ma nehaza vahe'mofo zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 1:1"/>Kefo avu'ava'ma nehaza vahe'mokizmi kea amage'ontege, kumi'ma nehaza vahe'mokizmi zamage ontege, mani'ne'za Anumzamofoma kiza zokago kema hunentaza vahe'enema nomaniza vahe'mo'za asomu eri'za muse hugahaze. <verse eid="PSA 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 1:2"/>Ra Anumzamofo kasegema avesi avesi hunenteno, masane haninema agesa are'are'ma ana kasegegu'ma nehia vahe'mo'a, <verse eid="PSA 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 1:3"/>tinkenare me'nea zafamo'ma kna fatgo'are raga'a knare huno renentegeno, ani'na'amo'a harari osu tretre huno meankna huno, maka zama hania zamo'a knare zanke hugahie. <verse eid="PSA 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 1:4"/>Hagi kefo zamavu'zamava'ma nehaza vahe'mo'za anara osugahazanki, zaho'mo witi hona'a eri hareno viankna hugahaze. <verse eid="PSA 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 1:5"/>E'ina hu'negu kefo avu'ava'ma nehaza vahe'mota Anumzamo'ma keagama refkohu trate'ma mani'neno keagama refko huramantesigeta anankeaga agatenoresageno, kumi'ma nehaza vahe'mo'zanena fatgo zamavu'zamava'ma nehaza vahe kevufina omanigahaze. <verse eid="PSA 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 1:6"/>Na'ankure fatgo avu'ava'ma nehaza vahe'mokizmia Ra Anumzamo'a kegava huzmantegahianki, kefo avu'ava'ma nehaza vahe'mo'za haviza hu'za fanane hugahaze.<verse eid="PSA 1:6"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="PSA 2"/>
  <para style="s">Ra Anumzamo'ma huhamprinte'nea kini ne'mofo naneke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 2:1"/>Na'a agafare ama mopafima me'nea kumatamimpi vahe'mo'za hara hunakura oku'a nanekea retro nehazage'za, vahe'mo'za nena'a fore osia nanekea oku'a retro hu'za vano nehaze? <verse eid="PSA 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 2:2"/>Hagi Ra Anumzamo'ma masavema freno huhamprinte'nea kini ne'mofone, Anumzamofonena hara huznantenakura ama mopafi kini vahetamimo'za retrotra nehazageno, kva vahe'mo'zanena ome eritrua nehaze. <verse eid="PSA 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 2:3"/>Ana hute'za anage nehaze, tagri'ma nofi'ma rerantena'a zana rukampru nehuta, kegavama huneranta'a zana zanatreta fru huta manisune hu'za nehaze.<verse eid="PSA 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 2:4"/>Monafima kini tra'are'ma mani'nea kini ne'mo'a zamagiza neregeno, Ra Anumzamo'a kiza zokago ke hunezmante. <verse eid="PSA 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 2:5"/>Ana nehuno arimpahe zampinti kea hunezmino, rimpa akahe ke huno zamazeri koro nehuno amanage hugahie, <verse eid="PSA 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 2:6"/>Nagra'ni'a Saioni ruotge agonanire kini ne'ni'a azeri oti'noe. <verse eid="PSA 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 2:7"/>Ra Anumzamo'ma trakema anaki namiankea zmasamigahue, Ra Anumzamo'a amanage huno nasmie, Kagra nenamofoga maninke'na, menina nagra kavre'na negafa'za hue. (Hibru 1:5-5) <verse eid="PSA 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 2:8"/>Nantahigege'na ama mopafi kumatmina kami'nena erisanti haresankeno, maka mopamo'a kagri'za segahie. <verse eid="PSA 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 2:9"/>Kazampina aini azompaka'a erinenka vahera kegava hunezmantenka, mopa kavo rufuzafupeankna hunka, ana vahetmina ana azompareti rufuzafupegahane. (Rev-Hufo hu'nea naneke 2:27) <verse eid="PSA 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 2:10"/>E'ina hu'negu menina kini vahetmimota knare antahi'za e'nerinkeno, ama mopafi kva vahe'mota tamavumro kea antahiho. <verse eid="PSA 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 2:11"/>Ra Anumzamofona koro hunteta agoraga'a mani'neta eri'zana erinenteta, tamahirahi nere'na koro hunteta agoraga'a mani'neta musena hiho. <verse eid="PSA 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 2:12"/>Aru arimpa ahesigeno'a tamahe fanane hanigi, nemofona agihene, agona hene hiho. Na'ankure teve anefakna huno arimpama he'zamo'a, ame huno ruhagna hugahie. Agripima frakisu'za vahe'mo'za muse hugahaze.<verse eid="PSA 2:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="PSA 3"/>
  <para style="s">Deviti'ma nemofo Absalomunku koro'ma freno umani'neno hu'nea naneke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 3:1"/>Ra Anumzamoka ha' vahenimo'za ome ra hu'za hara hunantazanki ko! Rama'a vahe'mo'za oti'za hara renantaze! <verse eid="PSA 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 3:2"/>Rama'a nagrikura hu'za, Anumzamo'a agura ovazigahie hu'za nehaze. <verse eid="PSA 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 3:3"/>Hianagi kagra Ra Anumzamoka maka kaziga hankoni'gna hunka manigaginantenka, ra nagia nenaminka naza hanke'na hara zamagate'neroe. <verse eid="PSA 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 3:4"/>Hagi Ra Anumzamo'ma nzama hinogu'ma krafage hu'na ke'zatugeno'a, ruotge agona'aretira antahinami'ne. <verse eid="PSA 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 3:5"/>Navura mase so'e hute'na onetue, na'ankure Ra Anumzamo'a kegava hunenante. <verse eid="PSA 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 3:6"/>Hanki rama'a 10tauseni'a ha' vahe'mo'zama maka kazigati'ma eme navazagi kagisazana, nagra korora zamagrikura osugahue. <verse eid="PSA 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 3:7"/>Ra Anumzamoka, otio! Nagri Anumzamoka nagu'vazio! Ha' vahe'ni'aramina zamerage rupro hunka nezmahenka, kefo avu'ava'ma nehia vahera zamave rutafrinka zamaho. <verse eid="PSA 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 3:8"/>Vahe'ma agu'vazi zana Ra Anumzamofompi me'ne. Hagi kagri asomu'mo'a, kagri vahepi megahie.<verse eid="PSA 3:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="PSA 4"/>
  <para style="s">Zavenama nehaza vahe zagame Deviti asunte'nea zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 4:1"/>Anumzanimoka kema hanugenka fatgo navu'navani'a refko hunka negenka antahinamio! Knafima mani'nogenka kagra naza hu'nane. Kasunku hunantenka nunamu'ni'a antahinamio. <verse eid="PSA 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 4:2"/>Hagi ama vahe'mota nama'a zupa ra nagima nenamiza zana eri rukrahe huta, agafa'a omne'zantera nazeri nagazea nehaze? Nama'a zupa nena raga ore nanekea avesinenteta havi nanekea nevararize? <verse eid="PSA 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 4:3"/>Hianagi antahio, Ra Anumzamo'a agri'ma nevaririza vahera zamazeri ruotge huno agrarega zamavarenenteno, nagrama nunamuma hanugeno'a antahi namigahie. <verse eid="PSA 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 4:4"/>Krimpama nehena kumira osuo, tafeka'are masenenka kea osu mani'nenka kagu'afi antahintahia huo. <verse eid="PSA 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 4:5"/>Ofa fatgo hunka Kresramana nevunka, Ra Anumzamofonte kamentinti huo. <verse eid="PSA 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 4:6"/>Rama'a hu'za, iza knare'zana taveri hugahie? hu'za nehaze. Hanki Ra Anumzamoka atregeno kavugosafinti masamo'a remsa huranteno. <verse eid="PSA 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 4:7"/>Kagra tusi'a muse'za nagu'afina ante avitenantankeno witine kasefa wainima vasagazageno rama'a hige'zama musema nehazama'a agatere'ne. <verse eid="PSA 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 4:8"/>Narimpa fru hu'na korora osu'na masegahue. Na'ankure Ra Anumzamoka naza hanke'na hazenkea e'ori knare hu'na nemanue.<verse eid="PSA 4:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="PSA 5"/>
  <para style="s">Konkempinti'ma hu zagame Deviti'ma kre'nea zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 5:1"/>Ra Anumzamoka, nunamu keni'a antahinaminka, knazampima mani'ne'nama kragima neruana, nenagenka antahinamio. <verse eid="PSA 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 5:2"/>Kagra nagri kini ne' mani'nenka, nagri Anumza mani'nananki, zavi krafage'nia kagesa antenka antahio. Na'ankure nagra kagritega nunamuna nehue. <verse eid="PSA 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 5:3"/>Ra Anumzamoka nanterama segenka nagerura nentahine, maka nanterana Kresramanama vu'zana retro huntete'na kenonama hunantesanku tusiza hu'na nagesa nente'na kavegantete'na nemanue. <verse eid="PSA 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 5:4"/>Na'ankure kagra kefo avu'avazanku muse osu Anumza mani'nanankino, kefo avu'avazamo'a kagri tavaontera erava'o osugahie. <verse eid="PSA 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 5:5"/>Hagi zamavufaga rama nehaza vahe'mo'za kagri kavuga o'otigahaze. Hagi kefo avu'a'ma nehaza vahera kavresra hunka zamagote nezmantane. <verse eid="PSA 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 5:6"/>Kagra havigema nehaza vahera nezmahane. Ha'ma huno vahe'ma ahefri zanku'ma tusi aga'manetea vahe'ene, knare agerupinti'ma masavenkema huno vahe'ma revatgama nehia vahe'enena, Ra Anumzamoka kavresa hunka zamagote'nezmantane. <verse eid="PSA 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 5:7"/>Hianagi vagaore kasunku'zamo'a rankrerfa hu'neanki'na amne nonka'afina marerige, ruotge mono nonka'ama me'nerega navugosa hunte'na korora hunegante'na keprihu'na monora hugantegahue. <verse eid="PSA 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 5:8"/>Ra Anumzamoka fatgo kavukavazampi navrenka vuo, na'ankure ha' vahe'niaramimoza nazeri haviza hu'za nehazanki, navrenkama nevana kana eri fatgo huo. <verse eid="PSA 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 5:9"/>Na'ankure nagri ha' vahe'mokizmi zamagipina tamage nanekea omnegeno, zamagu'afina vahe'ma azeri haviza hu'zamo avite'ne. Hagi zamananke nofimo'za, vahe'ma asenezmantaza mati kerigna higeno, vahe'ma masavema huno havi kampima avreno vu nanekemo'a, zamagefu'nafina avite'ne. <verse eid="PSA 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 5:10"/>Anumzamoka keaga huzmantenka hazenke zamio, zamatrege'za zamagri kefo antahintahizamo, hazenkefina zamavareno ufreno. Hazenke zamavu'zmavamo'a marerige'za ha'regantazanki, zamahe natitrege'za kagri tava'ontera omaniho. <verse eid="PSA 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 5:11"/>Hianagi kagripima eme fra'manekiza vahera zamatrege'za muse hiho. Anama nehu'za zagamema hu'za musena nehanagenka, kegava huzmanto. Kagriku'ma kavesinegantaza vahera kazana rusutenka turunara huzmantege'za kagri turunapi mani'ne'za musenkasea hiho. <verse eid="PSA 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 5:12"/>Na'ankure tamage hunka Ra Anumzamoka fatgo avu'ava'ma nehia vahera kagra asomu hunezmantenka, knare kavukavazanu hankonuma hiaza hunka maka kaziga anteso hunezmantenka kegava hunezmantane.<verse eid="PSA 5:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="PSA 6"/>
  <para style="s">8'a nofi me'nea zavena nehe'za hu zagame Deviti'ma hunte'nea zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 6:1"/>Ra Anumzamoka kasima vazizampintira kea onasuge, karimpa ahezampintira nazeri fatgoa osuo. <verse eid="PSA 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 6:2"/>Ra Anumzamoka hankaveni'a omneanki kasunku hunantenka naza nehunka, zaferinanimo'a omne amanehianki naza huo. <verse eid="PSA 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 6:3"/>Ra Anumzamoka, nagu' namemo'a tusi kna navenesianki, inankna zupa naza hugahane? <verse eid="PSA 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 6:4"/>Ra Anumzamoka rukrahe hunka naza nehunka, vagaore kavesizanka'agu nentahinka nagu'vazio. <verse eid="PSA 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 6:5"/>Fri'za vahe'mo'za fri'nazafintira antahi'nogamizanki, iza zagamera huno fri vahe kumapintira kagri kagia husga hugahie? <verse eid="PSA 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 6:6"/>Kragri'ma ruvavama huazamo nanankena segeno, maka kenagera navunumo'a tafeni'afina tiru nemaregeno, zavi'ma atoazamo'a pilonimo'a pasupanegie. <verse eid="PSA 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 6:7"/>Zavi'ma atoazamo navumo'a zoregeno, ha' vahe'nimo'zama hazazamo hige'na zavi'ma atoazamo navumofona hankave'a omane. <verse eid="PSA 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 6:8"/>Ra Anumzamo'a zavi krafage'ni'a antahianki, kefo avu'ava'ma nehaza vahe'mota rukrahe huta natreta viho. <verse eid="PSA 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 6:9"/>Asunku hunantenogu'ma krafama huana Ra Anumzamo'a nentahino, nunamuma huana nentahie. <verse eid="PSA 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 6:10"/>Ana maka ha' vahe'nimo'za tusi zamagaze nehanige'za antahintahi hakare nehu'za, havi zamagi e'neri'za, ame huno zamagaze nehina rukrahe hu'za vugahaze.<verse eid="PSA 6:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="PSA 7"/>
  <para style="s">Benjameni nagapinti ne' Kusi zagame, Deviti kre'nea naneke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 7:1"/>Ra Anumzana nagri Anumzamoka, kagripi fra nekuanki, nahenaku'ma navrarizama ne-esagenka nagu'vazinka naza huo. <verse eid="PSA 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 7:2"/>Ana'ma osnankeno'a laionimo'ma nehiaza hu'za nahe'za tagna taganu vazisageno mago vahe'mo'e huno eme naza huno nagura ovazigahie. <verse eid="PSA 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 7:3"/>Ra Anumzana nagri Anumzamoka, nagrama vahe'ma zamazeri haviza huge, nzampima hazenke'zama mege, <verse eid="PSA 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 7:4"/>hazenke'a omne vahe kefo avu'ava huntege, agafa'a omne zante ha' vahe'ni'amofo feno rohumare'na erige'ma hu'nenuana geno'a, <verse eid="PSA 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 7:5"/>zamatrege'za ha' vahe'nimo'za narotgo hu'za nazeri'za zamaga kanonu kugusopafi nahetrenage'na ra nagigura nagesa ontahi'na frineno. <verse eid="PSA 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 7:6"/>Ra Anumzamoka krimpa hezmantenka otinka, ha' vahe'niaramina kasi vazizana eri zamaveri huo. Otinka zamarimpama ahenenantaza ha' vaheni'a fatgo kavukva hunka refko huzmantenka knazana zamio. <verse eid="PSA 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 7:7"/>Atrege'za maka vahera emeri atru hu'za manigagisagenka, kagra manisga hunka mani'nenka kegava huzmanto. <verse eid="PSA 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 7:8"/>Ra Anumzana maka vahe'ma refko nehia Anumzamo nagrira refko huno keana, nagra fatgo hu'noe. Fatgo navu'nava'ene knare navu'nava hugeno, hazenke zani'a omane'neanki, marerisa Anumzamoka nagrira refko hunanto. <verse eid="PSA 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 7:9"/>Fatgo Anumzamoka kagra vahe'mofo antahintahine, tumo'enena negana Anumza mani'nananki, atregeno kefo zamavu'zmavama nehaza vahe'mokizmi kefo zamavu'zmava'mo'a vaganerena, fatgo avu'ava'ma nehaza vahera zamaza huge'za hankaveti'za maniho. <verse eid="PSA 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 7:10"/>Marerifa Anumzana agra hankoni'agino, agra tumo'amo'ma fatgoma hu'nea vahera zamagu'nevazie. <verse eid="PSA 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 7:11"/>Anumzamo'a fatgo huno keaga refko nehia Anumzankino, maka kna arimpa ahenezmante. <verse eid="PSA 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 7:12"/>Hanki mago vahe'mo'ma agu'ama rukrahe osigeno'a, Anumzamo'a kazima'a kume neganeno, ati'a refagigino karina negreno retrotrara nehie. <verse eid="PSA 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 7:13"/>Vahe'ma ahe fri ha' zama'a retro hunenteno, teve nefa'ane kevea'aramina retro hunente.<verse eid="PSA 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 7:14"/>Kefo zamavu'zmava'zama nehaza vahe'mo'za kefo avu'ava zamo zamagu'afina avitege'za, a'nemo'za zamu'ene hazaza hu'za hazenke avu'ava zana zamu'ene hu'za krunagema hu'za kasenentaze. <verse eid="PSA 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 7:15"/>Hagi iza'o vahe'moma taminogu'ma kerima kafintenimo'a, agra'a ana kerima kafintenia kerifi tamigahie. <verse eid="PSA 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 7:16"/>Vahe'ma hazenkema hunte'nia hazenkemo'a rukrahe huno agri asenire ne-enigeno, vahe'ma azeri haviza hunaku retro'ma hania havizamo'a ete rukrahe huno agri kokovite egahie. <verse eid="PSA 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 7:17"/>Fatgo avu'ava zama'agura Ra Anumzamofona susu hunente'na, muse zagame hu'na Ra Anumzana Marerifa Anumzamofona agia erisga hugahue.<verse eid="PSA 7:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="PSA 8"/>
  <para style="s">Zavena neheno hu zagame Deviti kre'nea naneke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 8:1"/>Ra Anumzana, tagri Anumzamoka maka ama mopafina Kagri kagimo'a mareri agatere'ne! Himamu masaka'amo'a, monaramina agatereno onagamu'a me'ne. <verse eid="PSA 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 8:2"/>Ne'one mofavreramine, amima nenaza mofavreramina rempi huzminke'za hankaveka'agura huama nehanageno, ha' vahe'kamo'za mago kea nosazageno, ha'ma renerantaza vahe'mofonena kezmia omane'ne. <verse eid="PSA 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 8:3"/>Tro'ma hunte'nana monaramimpima kesga huna koama, ikane ofuramima tro hunka noma'are'ma ante'terema hu'nana kazanko avoma nege'na, <verse eid="PSA 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 8:4"/>amanahu nagesa nentahue, nankna hu zaga vahera mani'nonkenka tusi antahintahi hunerantenka, vahera amnezaga mani'nonanagi kegava hunerantane? <verse eid="PSA 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 8:5"/>Hianagi monafima mani'naza ankeroramina zamazeri antesga hunka tro hunezmantenka, mopafi vahera osi'a ante fenkma atrenka tro hunezmantenka masazanu'ene ragima amizanu'ene fetorira antaninte'nane. <verse eid="PSA 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 8:6"/>Maka zama tro'ma hu'nana zantmimofo kegava hinogu kva azeri otinentenka, maka zana agri kvafi atrankeno agra kegava hu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 8:7"/>Maka sipisipi afu kevuramine, bulimakao afu kevuramine, afi zaga kafane, <verse eid="PSA 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 8:8"/>monaramimpima hareza vanoma nehaza namaramine, hagerimpi nozameramine, hagerimpima vanoma nehaza zagaraminena maka agri kavafinke atrenka kegava huo hunka ami'nane. <verse eid="PSA 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 8:9"/>Ra Anumzana tagri Ra Anumzamoka, maka ama mopafina kagimo'a mareri agatere'ne!<verse eid="PSA 8:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="PSA 9"/>
  <para style="s">Deviti'a Ra Anumzamofo agi erisaga hu zagame kre'nea zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 9:1"/>Ra Anumzamofona mika nagu'areti hu'na susu hunente'na agi'a erisga nehu'na, hentofa zama tro'ma hu'nea zamofo agenkea eri ama hugahue. <verse eid="PSA 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 9:2"/>Marerirfa Anumzamoka, muse nehu'na zagame hu'na kagia erisga hugahue. <verse eid="PSA 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 9:3"/>Hagi ha' vahe'nimo'zama rukrahe'ma hanu'za, kagri kavuga traka hu'za frigahaze. <verse eid="PSA 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 9:4"/>Na'ankure kagra kema refko hu trate mani'nenka fatgo hunka keaga refko nehunka, nagrira fatgo hunka refko hunenantane. <verse eid="PSA 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 9:5"/>Krimpama ahenezmantenka ama mopafi vahera kea nezmasunka, kefo avu'ava'ma nehaza vahera zamahe frinkeno zamagimo'a fanene nehie. <verse eid="PSA 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 9:6"/>Ha' vahera zamazeri haviza hunka nevunka, rankumazmia tra'zama tasgi hutreankna hunka vatitrankeno vahe'mo'za mago'enena zamagesa antahi nozmize. <verse eid="PSA 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 9:7"/>Hianagi Ra Anumzama kini tra'are'ma manivava huno nevia Anumzamo'a, fatgo huno keagama refko hanigura retro nehie. <verse eid="PSA 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 9:8"/>Fatgo avu'ava huno ama mopafi vahera refko hunezmanteno, fatgo huno vahetmina kegava huzmantegahie. <verse eid="PSA 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 9:9"/>Hagi Ra Anumzamo'a zamazeri havizama nehaza zamunte omne vahe'mokizmi fraki havegazmi mani'neanki'za hazenke knafina anampinka ome frakiza manigahaze. <verse eid="PSA 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 9:10"/>Kagri kagima antahi'naza vahe'mo'za kagrite zamentinti nehazanki, kagrama zamaza huogu'ma kantahima negaza vahera, Ra Anumzamoka kamefira hunozamine. <verse eid="PSA 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 9:11"/>Ra Anumzamo'a Saioni kumatera (Jerusalemi) kini tra'are manisga huno mani'neanki, zagame hunka agi'a erisga nehunka, maka zama hu'nea zamofo agenkea maka ama mopafi vahetmina zamasamio. <verse eid="PSA 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 9:12"/>Na'ankure vahe'ma zamahe frizare'ma, nona huno nezamahea Anumzamo'a knafima maniza vahera antahi nezmiankino, hazenke'ma zamiza vahe'mo'zama krafagema hanazana, ana krafage zamia antahi amnea osugahie. <verse eid="PSA 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 9:13"/>Ra Anumzamoka kasunku hunanto, zamavaresrama hunenantaza vahe'mo'za nazeri haviza nehazagenka, kasunku hunantenka, fri kahanteti'ma navresgama hu'nana Anumza mani'nane. <verse eid="PSA 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 9:14"/>Saioni (Jerusalemi) mofa'nemofo kuma kafantera zagamera hu'na nagu'ma vazi'nana zankura musena hugahue. <verse eid="PSA 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 9:15"/>Ama mopafi vahe'mo'za zamagrama kafinte'naza kerifi neramisageno, zamagrama eri aka'ma hunte'naza kukompi ufregahaze. <verse eid="PSA 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 9:16"/>Ra Anumzamo'a fatgoma huno keagama refkoma huno, agra'a avu'avara eriama nehigeno, kefo avu'ava'ma nehaza vahe'mo'za zamagrama haza kefo zamavu'zmavazamo rukrahe huno zamazeri havizana nehie. <verse eid="PSA 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 9:17"/>Hagi ama mopafima kefo avu'ava'ma nehaza vahe'mo'za, ete rukrahe hu'za fri vahe kumapi vanageno, Anumzamofoma zamagema akaninentaza vahe'mo'zanena ana zanke hugahaze. <verse eid="PSA 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 9:18"/>Hianagi keonke zanku'ma upa'ma nehaza vahera, Ra Anumzamo'a agera akaniozmante'na, zamunte omne vahe'mo'zama amuhama nehaza zamo'a, fananea osugahie. <verse eid="PSA 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 9:19"/>Ra Anumzamoka otio! Atregeno vahe'mo'a hara azerino agate'orena, atregeno ama mopafi vahe'mo'za keagare kavuga eotiho. <verse eid="PSA 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 9:20"/>Ra Anumzamoka zamazeri koro huo! Zamatrege'za ama mopafi vahe'mo'za amne vahetafa mani'none hu'za antahiho.<verse eid="PSA 9:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="PSA 10"/>
  <para style="s">Tazama hanigu hanuna nunamu zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 10:1"/>Ra Anumzamoka nahigenka afetera otinka mani'nane? Knazampima mani'nogenka nahigenka frakinka mani'nane? <verse eid="PSA 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 10:2"/>Kefo avu'ava'ma nehaza vahe'mo'za zamavufagara hu'za zamunte omne vahera zamazeri haviza hunaku nezmavaririzanki zamatrege'za zamagrama hanaza hazanke zamo zamazeri haviza hino. <verse eid="PSA 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 10:3"/>Na'ankure kefo zamavu'zmava'ma nehaza vahe'mo'za, zamavufagamofo avesizankura zamavufagara nehu'za, zamagri'ama zamazama hania zankuke nentahi'za, Ra Anumzamofona huhaviza hunente'za zamefira hunemize. <verse eid="PSA 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 10:4"/>Kefo avu'ava'ma nehia vahe'mo'a avufgara nehuno, Anumzamofonkura nohakeno, Anumzana omanine huno antahintahi'afina agesa nentahie. <verse eid="PSA 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 10:5"/>Hianagi ana vahe'mo'ma maka zama hia zamo'a, knare nehigeno kagrama azeri havizama hanana zamo'ma avegama ante'neazana nonkeno, ha' vahe'zmia kiza zokago ke hunezmante. <verse eid="PSA 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 10:6"/>Hagi agu'afina amanage huno agesa nentahie, mago zamo'a nazeri kazara osugahie nehuno, maka zupa muse huvava hu'na nevanugeno hazenke zana navatera omegahie nehie. <verse eid="PSA 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 10:7"/>Hagi agipina kazusi kene, vahe'ma revatgama hu kene, vahe'ma azeri havizama hu kemo avitegeno, agefu'nafina hazenkema hu kene, kefo avu'avazama hu kemo avite'ne. <verse eid="PSA 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 10:8"/>Hagi kuma tava'onte kafona anteno mani'neno hazenke'a omane vahera ahe nefrino, oku'a frakino mani'neno azanavama antega vahe'ma azeri havizama hania zanku nehake. <verse eid="PSA 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 10:9"/>Laionimo'ma trampima kafoma anteno mani'neno zagagafama ame huno azeriaza huno, frakino mani'neno zamagra'ama zamazama hugama osaza vahera kukozmifi zamazerite'za zamavazu hu'za nevaze. <verse eid="PSA 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 10:10"/>Hankavezmima omane vahe'ma evazageno'a, hanavezmima me'nea vahe'mo'za zamahe'za rehapatinetraze. Na'ankure kefo avu'ava'ma nehaza vahera hanavezmimo'a ra hu'nege'za anara nehaze. <verse eid="PSA 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 10:11"/>Ana kefo avu'ava'ma nehia vahe'mo'a, agu'afina amanage huno agesa nentahie, nagrama hua navunavara Anumzamo'a agenekanino, avua nonkeankino, onagegahie huno nehie. <verse eid="PSA 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 10:12"/>Ra Anumzamoka otio! Anumzamoka vahe'mo'zama zamazeri havizama nehazage'za, knazampima nemaniza vahera kagerakani ozmantenka, kazana erisga hunka zamaza huo. <verse eid="PSA 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 10:13"/>Na'a higeno kefo avu'ava'ma nehia vahe'mo'a Anumzamoka amagena hunegamino, havi avu'ava'ma hua zantera nona osugahie huno agesa nentahie? <verse eid="PSA 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 10:14"/>Hianagi Ra Anumzamoka hazenkema e'neri'za knazampima maniza vahera kenka antahinka nehanankinka, hazenkema zamiza vahera kagra'a kazanuti nona huzmantegahane. Zamagra'ama zamazama hugama osu'naza vahe'mo'za kagrite zamentintia nehaze. Kagra megusa mofavrerami zamazahu Anumza mani'nane. <verse eid="PSA 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 10:15"/>Kefo avu'ava'ma nehuno vahe'ma azeri havizama nehia vahe'mofo azana ruhanentaginka, kefo avu'ava nehaza zantera zamarotgo hunka zamahehna huo. <verse eid="PSA 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 10:16"/>Hagi Ra Anumzamofo mopafintira fanane hugahazanagi, Ra Anumzana mani vava kini mani'ne. <verse eid="PSA 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 10:17"/>Ra Anumzamoka anteramiza nemaniza vahe'mokizmi zamavesizana negenka, zamagu'a zamazeri hanavenetinka krafa kezmia kagesa antenka nentahinka, <verse eid="PSA 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 10:18"/>megusa mofavreramine vahe'mo'zama zamazeri havizama nehaza vahetega antenka zamahora nekane. E'ina'ma hanke'za ama mopafi vahe'mo'za koro nehu'za, mago'anena vahera zamazeri korora osugahaze.<verse eid="PSA 10:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="PSA 11"/>
  <para style="s">Deviti'ma zagamate vugota hu'nea ne' kremi'nea zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 11:1"/>Nagra Ra Anumzamofompinka frakina nemanuanki, nahigenka nagrikura namamo'za zamagu'vazinaku hare'za agonarega frazankna hunka korora nefrane hunka nehane. <verse eid="PSA 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 11:2"/>Na'ankure kefo avu'ava'ma nehaza vahe'mo'zama fraki'za mani'ne'za, fatgo vahera zamahenaku atizamifi keve erinte'za eri negrize. <verse eid="PSA 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 11:3"/>Hagi kasegema amage anteno fatgo avu'ava'ma hu'zama omanesigeno'a, fatgo vahe'mo'za na'a hugahaze. <verse eid="PSA 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 11:4"/>Hagi Ra Anumzamo'a Agra'a ruotage mono nompi monafina kini tra'are mani'neno, avua omege emege nehuno, Agra'a avurgareti vahera rezagneno nezamage. <verse eid="PSA 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 11:5"/>Hagi Ra Anumzamo'a fatgo vahera refko huno nezamage. Hianagi havi zamavu'zmavama nehu'za, vahe'ma hazenkema nezamiza vahera tusi avesra hunezmante. <verse eid="PSA 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 11:6"/>Hagi ana nehuno kefo avu'ava'ma nehaza vahe'ma hazenkema zamisiana monafinti amuho teve tankanuza herafi atrenigeno ko'arianka huno eramino zamahegahiankino, e'i miza zamia erigahaze. <verse eid="PSA 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 11:7"/>Hagi Ra Anumzamo'a fatgo avu'ava nehia Anumza mani'neankino, fatgo avu'ava zanku ave'nesie. Hanki fatgo avu'ava'ma nehaza vahe'mo'zage, Agri avufina kegahaze.<verse eid="PSA 11:7"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="PSA 12"/>
  <para style="s">Hazenke'ma fore'ma hanige'za hanaza zagame Deviti kre'nea zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 12:1"/>Ra Anumzamoka nazahuo, na'ankure fatgo vahera omanitfa higeno, kema antahino amage antega vahera ama mopafina omani'naze. <verse eid="PSA 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 12:2"/>Hagi mika vahe'mo'za havige vaheke nemani'za, tare zamagu'areti masavenkea nehu'za vahera rezamavataga nehaze. <verse eid="PSA 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 12:3"/>Ra Anumzamo Agrake havigema nehaza vahe'mofo zamagira ruhamunegino, zamavufaga rama nehaza zamaganefu'na ruhamunenkie. <verse eid="PSA 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 12:4"/>Zamagra ana vahe'mo'za hu'za, tagra tavufga rankema hanuna zamo vahera zmagateregahunanki, iza tagrira kva vahetia manigahie hu'za nehaze. <verse eid="PSA 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 12:5"/>Na'ankure kefo vahe'mo'za zamunte omane vahera zamazeri haviza nehu'za, kna nezamizanki'na, Nagra kegava huzmante'nuge'za havi vahe'mo'za zamazeri havizana osugahaze huno Ra Anumzamo'a hu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 12:6"/>Ra Anumzamofo nanekemo'a, agru hu'neankino silvama 7ni'a zupa tevefi kreno eri agru hiankna huno agrunentake hu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 12:7"/>Ra Anumzamoka, havi zamavu zamava'ma nehaza vahe'mo'zama zamazeri havizama hu'zankura zamagu'vazinka maka knafina kegava huzamante vava huo. <verse eid="PSA 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 12:8"/>Hagi kefo avu'avazamo'ma vahepima ome rama nehige'za kefozama nehaza vahe'mo'za zamavufaga ra huza vano nehaze.<verse eid="PSA 12:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="PSA 13"/>
  <para style="s">Hazenke knafima zamazama hanigu hanaza nunamu zagame Deviti hu'nea zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 13:1"/>Ra Anumzamoka nama'a knafi kagera kaninantegahane? Ana maka kna kaganera kaninantegahampi? Nama'a knafi kamefira hunaminka onagegosane? Ra Anumzamoka za'za knafi kagera kaninantane. Za'za kna kamefira hunaminka onagane. <verse eid="PSA 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 13:2"/>Nagra za'zate nasuzampina nemanugeno nagu'namemo'a knazampina manino nevie. Nahigenka natranke'za ha' vahe'nimo'za nazeri havizama haza zankura zamavufaga rana nehaze? <verse eid="PSA 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 13:3"/>Rukrahe hunka nenagenka Ra Anumzana nagri Anumzamoka kenona hunanto. Ru mase'nurega frinugi, navurga eri hari hunka hanavea namige'na, ofri kasefa hu'na mani'neno. <verse eid="PSA 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 13:4"/>Hagi ha' vahe'nimo'za amanage hugahaze, tagra hara hugateronkeno'e hu'za musena hugahaze. <verse eid="PSA 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 13:5"/>Hianagi nagra vagaore kavesi zanka'agu namentintia nehu'na, nagra nagu'ma nevazina zanku musena nehue. <verse eid="PSA 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 13:6"/>Nagra Ra Anumzamofonku zagamera hugahue. Na'ankure Agra knare'zana rama'a hunante'ne.<verse eid="PSA 13:6"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="PSA 14"/>
  <para style="s">Neginagi avu'ava huno havi avu'ava'ma nehia zamofo zagame Deviti kre'nea zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 14:1"/>Hagi neginagi vahe'mo'za zamagrama zamagu'afima antahi'zana Anumzana omanine nehaze. Hagi zamagra havizantfa hu'nazanki'za kasrino haviza hu'nea zamavu zamava nehu'za, havi vaheke manizageno magore huno knare vahera omani'ne. <verse eid="PSA 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 14:2"/>Hagi Ra Anumzamo'a monafinka mani'neno, kema antahi ama'ma hu vahe'mo'zama Anumzamofonku'ma antahimiza amagema nentaza vahe'ma mani'nenagura kefenkatreno ama mopafina nege. <verse eid="PSA 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 14:3"/>Hianagi mika vahe'mo'za rukrahe hu'za zamagena hunemiza, kefo vaheke mani'naze. Hagi magomo'e huno knare avu'vazana osu'neanki, mika vahe'mo'za kefo vaheke mani'naze. <verse eid="PSA 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 14:4"/>Hagi kefo zamavu zamava'ma nehaza, bretima nenazaza hu'za nagri vahera zamazeri havizama nehu'za, Ra Anumzamofona nunamuna hu'za antahi nonkazafi? <verse eid="PSA 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 14:5"/>Hianagi ana vahe'mo'za tusi'a koro hugahaze, na'ankure Anumzamo'a fatgo vahe'ene manigahie. <verse eid="PSA 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 14:6"/>Hagi zamunte'ma omane vahe'mo'zama antahintahima retro'ma nehaza zana, havi zamavu'zamava'ma nehaza vahe'mo'za huhaviza nehazanagi, Ra Anumzamo zamunte omane vahe'mokizmi frakino zamagu'vazi kumazamia mani'ne. <verse eid="PSA 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 14:7"/>Hagi nagrama antahuana, agu'vazi zana Saioni agonaregati egahiankino, Israeli vahera zamagu'vazigahie. Hagi Ra Anumzamo'ma naga'amofo maka'zama eri knarema hanigeno'a, Jekopu naga'mo'za musenkase nehanageno, Israeli vahe'mo'za tusi muse hugahaze.<verse eid="PSA 14:7"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="PSA 15"/>
  <para style="s">Saionima nemaniza vahe'mofonku huno Deviti asunte'nea zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 15:1"/>Ra Anumzamoka, iza kagri mono nompina manigara hu'ne? Iza ruotgema hu'nea agona ka'arera manigara hu'ne? <verse eid="PSA 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 15:2"/>Iza'o hazenkema nosuno fatgo avu'ava'ma nehuno, agu'aretima huno tamage kema nehuno, <verse eid="PSA 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 15:3"/>vahe'mofo azeri haviza hu kea nosuno, vahe'mofo huhaviza hunenteno, tavaoma'are'ma nemanimofoma havigema hunonteno, <verse eid="PSA 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 15:4"/>kefo avu'ava'ma nehia vahe'ma amagena hunemino, Ra Anumzamofoma amagema nentaza vahe antahine'zamino, knazampina unefreno'a, huvempama hu'nea zanku agesa nentahino runotagreno, <verse eid="PSA 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 15:5"/>zagoma ami'nerema, rama'a zagoma ante agofetu'ma huno eme zamizanku'ma nontahino, zamagri'ma zamaza huno hazenke'a omane vahe'ma zamazeri haviza hinogu'ma masavema hu'za zagoma amiza zagoma e'noria vahe'mo'a, oti hankanavetino manigahie.<verse eid="PSA 15:5"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="PSA 16"/>
  <para style="s">Deviti asunte'nea zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 16:1"/>Ra Anumzamoka nagu'vazio, na'ankure kagripinka mani'nena nagra nagura nevazue. <verse eid="PSA 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 16:2"/>Hagi Ra Anumzamofonkura nagra hu'na, mika knare zama e'neruana kagritegati ne-e. <verse eid="PSA 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 16:3"/>Hagi Anumzamofo vahe'ma amafima mani'naza vahera knare vahe mani'nazage'na, zamagranema mani'zankura nagra musena nehue. <verse eid="PSA 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 16:4"/>Hagi havi anumzama nevaririza vahe'mo'za, rama'a zamasu zampi manigahaze. Hagi nagra ana havi anumzante'ma tima tagitre ofama huogu'ma, korama eri'za eme namisazana erina ofa huontege, ana havi anumzantamimofo zamagirera huamara osugahue. <verse eid="PSA 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 16:5"/>Hagi Ra Anumzamoka nagrama erisanti hare'nua zane, tintafeni'a Kagrake mani'nenka, henkama manisua zani'a eri knare hugahane. <verse eid="PSA 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 16:6"/>Hagi mopa'ma nami'nana mopamo'a, knare hu'nege'na musena nehu'na, hentofa zantamina erisanti neharoe. <verse eid="PSA 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 16:7"/>Nagra nazeri fatgoma nehia Ra Anumzamofona agi'a erintesaga hugahue. Na'ankure hanimpinena ana nanekemo'a nagu'afi me'neno rempi hunenamie. <verse eid="PSA 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 16:8"/>Nagra antahi'noe, Ra Anumzamo'a mika knafina nagrane nemanino hanavea nenamiankina, mago zankura korora hu'na antria osugahue. <verse eid="PSA 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 16:9"/>E'ina hu'negu nagu'areti hu'na muse nehuankino, musezamo nagripina avinetege'na knare hu'na nemanue. <verse eid="PSA 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 16:10"/>Na'ankure kagra natrenanke'na fri'na fri vahe kumapina uomanige, atrenankeno ruotagema hu'nea vahekamo'a frino onkasarigahie. <verse eid="PSA 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 16:11"/>Hagi kagra nomani'zamofo kana naveri nehankeno, kagri tava'ontera musezamo'a avineteankina tamaga kaziga kzantega mani'nena musena huvava hugahue.<verse eid="PSA 16:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="PSA 17"/>
  <para style="s">Deviti nunamumofo naneke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 17:1"/>Ra Anumzamoka mani fatgo hu'na mani'nuegu kantahinegoanki nunamuni'a antahinamio. Hagi nzama huogu'ma krafagema nehu'na, nagra regavatga nosuanki nunamuni'a antahinamio. <verse eid="PSA 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 17:2"/>Hagi kagra mani'nantegatira nazahunka refko hunantenka, nazeri knare huo. Na'ankure kagrake knare'ma hu'naza vahera zamagenka refakoa nehane. <verse eid="PSA 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 17:3"/>Hagi kagra hanimpina antahizani'a refako hunka negenka, nagu'amofona renahenka negane. Hianagi mago kumira nagripina kenka erifore nosane. Hagi kegaganifina mago kefo kea omanesie hu'na nehue. <verse eid="PSA 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 17:4"/>Hagi kagri kasegema amagema nentoa zamo nazahige'na, haframa nehaza vahe'mokizmia namage'na hunezamue. <verse eid="PSA 17:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 17:5"/>Mika zupa kagri kanteke nevugeno, nagamo'a kririno havifina vuno enora nosie. <verse eid="PSA 17:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 17:6"/>Ra Anumzamoka kagritega kezana netuanki antahinamio. Ra Anumzamoka kagesa antenka nunamu keni'a antahinamio. <verse eid="PSA 17:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 17:7"/>Hagi vagaore kavesi zanka'a hentofaza hunka eri ama huo. Ha' vahezamigu'ma koroma nehaza vahera, Kagra hanave kazanu zamagu nevazina ne' mani'nane. <verse eid="PSA 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 17:8"/>Hagi Kagra kavurgama kegavama nehanankna hunka kegava hunantenka, kagekonanu refitenanto. <verse eid="PSA 17:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 17:9"/>Kefo avu'ava'ma nehaza vahe'mo'za nazeri haviza huza nehazagenka nagu'nevazinka, ha' vahe'nimo'za nahenaku'ma navazagi kaginagenka nagu'nevazine. <verse eid="PSA 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 17:10"/>Hagi zamagra mago vahekura zamasunkura hunozamante'za, zamavufaga ra hu nanekege nehaze. <verse eid="PSA 17:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 17:11"/>Hagi kama nevuge'za zamagra navaririza nevu'za, mopafi nahetrenaku navazagi kagine'za, zamavu ante'za mani'naze. <verse eid="PSA 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 17:12"/>Zamagra laionimo zagagafa aheno tapage hunaku eme krino maniaza nehu'za, agaho laionimo zagagafa ahenaku frakino maniaza hu'naze. <verse eid="PSA 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 17:13"/>Hagi Ra Anumzamoka otinka ha' vahe'nia ha' huzamantenka zamahe mopafi zamatro. Kagra'a bainati kazinknonteti kefo vahepintira hara hunka nagu'vazio. <verse eid="PSA 17:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 17:14"/>Hagi Ra Anumzamoka ama mopafi zama erisantima harenaku'ma tusizama nehaza vahe zamazampintira hanave kazanuti nagu'vazio. Ana nehunka miko knaza zamimofo avamente antenka mizana zamio. Ana nehunka zamagripintima fore hu anante nante hanaza vahera knazana zaminka vugahane. <verse eid="PSA 17:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 17:15"/>Na'ankure nagra fatgo hu'na knare hu'noankina, henkama otinu'na kagri kavufina negage'na musena hugahue.<verse eid="PSA 17:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="PSA 18"/>
  <para style="s">Ra Anumzamo Soli azampinti agu'vazi'nea zanku Deviti'a muse zagame hu'nea zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 18:1"/>Ra Anumzamoka nagra navesigantoe, nagri hanavea Kagrake mani'nane. <verse eid="PSA 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 18:2"/>Ra Anumzamo'a ra haveni'ane, vihuni'a mani'neno nagura nevaziankina, agripinka frakugeno hankoni'a mani'neno nagura nevazie. Ra Anumzamo'a nagri hankone hankavenine nazahu have mani'neno, fraki kumani'a mani'ne. <verse eid="PSA 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 18:3"/>Nagra Ra Anumzamofonku nunamu hu'na antahigogeno, ha' vahe'nimofo azampintira naza hu'neanki'na, Ra Anumzamofona ra agi nemina agi'a hentesga hugahue. <verse eid="PSA 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 18:4"/>Nofi'mo nazeri kagiankna huno fri'zamo'a nazeri kanegigeno, ti hageno refiteankna huno hazenkezamo'a refitenante'ne. <verse eid="PSA 18:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 18:5"/>Hagi fri'zamo'a nofikna huno anaki nenantegeno, fri'zamo'a krifumo zagagafa azeriankna huno naze'nerie. <verse eid="PSA 18:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 18:6"/>Hagi nagra narimpa natazane knazanifi mani'nena Ra Anumzamofona krafage hunentogeno, Agra ra mono noma'afinti ana krafageni'a agesa anteno antahi'ne. <verse eid="PSA 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 18:7"/>Hagi mopamo'a imi e'nerigeno, toretore nehigeno, agonamofo tramo'a kazakaza hu'ne. Na'ankure Ra Anumzamofona arimpa ahenegeno anara hu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 18:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 18:8"/>Hagi agonagampintira toki nehigeno, agipintira maka'zama tefanene hu tevemo hagana hagana nehigeno, teve tankanu'zamo ankanuferami ankanuferami hu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 18:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 18:9"/>Hagi Agra mona kafana erinagino ne-egeno, agagusamofo fenka kaziga haninentake hampo me'ne. <verse eid="PSA 18:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 18:10"/>Hagi serafimie nehaza ankeromofo agofetu hareno ne-eno, zaho'mofo agekonare mani'neno hareno evu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 18:11"/>Hagi haninu agra'a azeri ano nevazino, koma neria hamponteti Agra'a azeri ano vazinte'ne. <verse eid="PSA 18:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 18:12"/>Hagi masazama'amo'a ana hampona rupapa huno nevigeno, komopa komo'a nehigeno, tevemo'a teragareno vuno eno huno erami'ne. <verse eid="PSA 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 18:13"/>Hagi marerifa Ra Anumzamo monafinkati kema nehigeno'a, agerumo'a tusi'a monage hiaza hu'ne. Hagi kema nehigeno'a, tevemo'a ankanuferamino vuno eno nehigeno, komopa komo'a hu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 18:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 18:14"/>Hagi Agra keve'aramina ahetreno ha' vahe'a zamahe panani nehuno, tusi'a masa'areti kopasinamo ru marave marave hiaza huno zamahe savri hu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 18:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 18:15"/>Hagi Ra Anumzamoka kasimu'ma nentankeno'a, hagerimo'a apapa huno vuno eno higeno mopa fore nehigeno, tusi'a keri fore higeno, mopama azeri'nea tra'mo'a amate me'ne. <verse eid="PSA 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 18:16"/>Hagi Ra Anumzamo'a monafinka mani'neno azana antefenka atreno, hagerimo nazeri nakri'za nehigeno naza huno navre'ne. <verse eid="PSA 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 18:17"/>Hagi hanavenentake ha' vahe'mo'zama nahe'zama nehazageno'a, Agra naza nehuno zamavaresrama hunantaza vahepinti'enena naza hu'ne. Na'ankure ha' vahe'nimo'za hanavenentake hu'za nagri nagatere'nazagu anara hu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 18:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 18:18"/>Ha' vahenimo'za hanaveni'ama omnea knafi hara eme hunante'nazanagi, Ra Anumzamo'a naza hu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 18:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 18:19"/>Hago Agra navareno nagu'vazinia kumapi ome nantene. Na'ankure Agra nagria muse hunante'negu anara hu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 18:20"/>Hagi Ra Anumzamo'ma knare'ma hunante'neana, nagrama fatgo navunava'ma hu'noa zante nona huno mizani'a nami'ne. Nazamo'a agru higena mago hazenke'ma osu'noa zante, nona huno mizana nami'ne. <verse eid="PSA 18:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 18:21"/>Na'ankure nagra Ra Anumzamofona kasege'a amage nentena, nagra havi navu'navara hu'na Anumzamofona otre'nogu huno anara hu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 18:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 18:22"/>Nagra kasegea mika amage nentena, magore hu'na tra ke'a ruotagre'noe. <verse eid="PSA 18:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 18:23"/>Nagra kumira nosuna, Ra Anumzamofo avufina kumi'ma huzankura kegava hu'na mani'noe. <verse eid="PSA 18:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 18:24"/>Ana hu'negu Ra Anumzamo'a knare navu'nava'ma hunore nona huno mizana nami'ne. Na'ankure Agrama keana nagri nzampina hazenke'zana omneno agru hu'negu huno, anara hu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 18:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 18:25"/>Hagi manifatgoma huza maniza vahera, fatgo kavukva hunezamantenka, hazenkezmima omne vahera knare kavukva hunezmantane. <verse eid="PSA 18:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 18:26"/>Hagi agruma hu'nea zamavu zamava'ma nehaza vahera, agru hu'nea kavukava hunezmantenka, fatgoma osu zamavuzamava nehaza vahera, fatgo kavukva hunka, ana avu'avazantera nona hunezmantane. <verse eid="PSA 18:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 18:27"/>Hagi zamavufagama anteramiza maniza vahera zamazeri antesaga nehunka, zamavufagama antemareriza vahera zamazeri fenkami netrane. <verse eid="PSA 18:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 18:28"/>Hagi Ra Anumzamoka Kagra tavira rekru hunenantenka, hanizana nagripintira eri netrane. <verse eid="PSA 18:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 18:29"/>Hagi Anumzanimoka Kagra nzahankena hanave ha' vaheni'a nezamahe'na, Kagra nzahankena ranra kuma kegina takaure'na nevue. <verse eid="PSA 18:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 18:30"/>Anumzamofo avu'avamo'a knare hu'ne. Ra Anumzamoka ke'mo'a tamage ke me'ne. Hagi Agra hankogna hu'nege'za vahe'mo'za agripinka ome franekize. <verse eid="PSA 18:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 18:31"/>E'ina hunanku ina Anumzamo kagri knara huno Ra Anumzana mani'ne? Magore huno ra anumzana omani'neanki, tagri Anumzamoka Kagrake hanavenentake havetia mani'nenka, kva hunerantane. <verse eid="PSA 18:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 18:32"/>Hagi magoke Anumzamo agrake hanavea nenamino, fatgo kantera knare huno navareno nevie. <verse eid="PSA 18:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 18:33"/>Hagi Agra nagiamofona azeri hanavetige'na dia afumo'zama nehazaza hu'na agona morusapina vano nehu'na, tarakara nosue. <verse eid="PSA 18:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 18:34"/>Hagi Ra Anumzamo'a ha'ma hu'zana rempi hunenamino, hanave namige'na bronsireti tro hu'naza hanavenentake atia erigrinkenke nehue. <verse eid="PSA 18:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 18:35"/>Hagi Ra Anumzamoka Kagra nagu'vazi hanko nenaminka, tamaga kazanu nazerisga hankena, hara hu'na vahe'mokizmi zamavurera nagine vahera mani'noe. <verse eid="PSA 18:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 18:36"/>Hagi nagamo'ma krarizankura Kagra ranka varinantanke'na traka osu nevue. <verse eid="PSA 18:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 18:37"/>Hagi nagra ha' vaheni'a zamarotago hu'na ome zamazeneri'na, zamarotago huge'na otre'noanki, zamarotago huvava hu'na miko zazmia eri haviza nehu'na zamahe vagare'noe. <verse eid="PSA 18:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 18:38"/>Hagi nagra zamahe'na rehapatuge'za, nagafi ufrinte efrinte hu'za oratigara osu'naze. <verse eid="PSA 18:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 18:39"/>Hagi ha' vaheni'anema ha'ma hanua hanavea Kagra nenaminka, ha' vaheni'a zamatranke'za nagafi eme kepri hunante'naze. <verse eid="PSA 18:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 18:40"/>Hagi Kagra ha' vaheni'a zamazeri koro hanke'za, zamefira rukrahe hu'za onke fre'za vazage'na, zamavesrama hunenantaza vahera mika zamahe vagare'noe. <verse eid="PSA 18:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 18:41"/>Hagi zamazama hanaza vaheku kezati'nazanagi, magomo'e huno zamaza osige'za, Ra Anumzamofonku taza huo hu'za hazanagi, zamaza osu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 18:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 18:42"/>Hagi nagra ha' huzmante'na zamahe kasopoge'za, zahomo kugusopa eri hareno vuno eno hiankna hu'za miko kokantega umani emani hu'naze. Hagi ha' vaheni'a ha' huzmantena zamahena rehapatuge'za, kampi hapa kna hu'naze. <verse eid="PSA 18:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 18:43"/>Hagi Kagra ha'ma renenantazagenka, nagu'vazinka nzamahankena ha' vaheni'a hara huzamagatere'noe. Hagi Kagra kva vahera huhampri'nantake'na kumatamina kegava hu'noge'za, zamage'na antahina osu'noa vahe'mo'zanena nagri nagoraga manine'za erizani'a eri'naze. <verse eid="PSA 18:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 18:44"/>Hagi nagri nagenkema miko kaziga vahe'mo'zama nentahiza, zamanogu nehu'za nagri nagafi anterami'za mani'naze. <verse eid="PSA 18:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 18:45"/>Hagi ha' vahe'nimokizmia miko hanavezamia vagarege'za zamahirahiku nehu'za, fra'ma nekiza vihu'zamia atre'za nagrite e'naze. <verse eid="PSA 18:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="PSA 18:46"/>Hagi kasefa huno mani'nea Ra Anumzana nagri fraki havenia mani'neanki'na, agi'a ahentesga nehu'na, nagu'ma vazi'nea Anumzamofo agi'a ahentesga hugahue. <verse eid="PSA 18:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="PSA 18:47"/>Hagi ama ana Anumzamo, nagri'ma nazeri haviza hu'naza vahera nona huno zamazeri haviza nehuno, ru kazigati vahera zamavarenamige'za nagri nagafina mani'naze. <verse eid="PSA 18:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="PSA 18:48"/>Ha' vahe'ni'mo'zama nahenaku nehazageno'a naguvazi'ne. Hagi hazenke vahe'mo'zama nazeri havizama hu'za nehazagenka Kagra nagu'vazi'nane. <verse eid="PSA 18:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="PSA 18:49"/>E'ina hu'nanku, maka kumapi vahepintira nagra muse zagamera hu'na Ra Anumzamoka kagia erisga hugahue. <verse eid="PSA 18:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="PSA 18:50"/>Hagi Kagra kinima nazeri oti'nana ne'kamo'na hanavea nenaminkena hara azeri agatenerogenka, Kagra masavema frenka huhampri nante'nana ne'mo'na kavesinenantenka Deviti'nane nagripinti'ma fore'ma hania vahera kavesi rante vava hugahane.<verse eid="PSA 18:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="PSA 19"/>
  <para style="s">Anumzamofo hanavema erinte ama hu zagame Deviti'ma asunte'nea zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 19:1"/>Hagi monamo'a Anumzamofo hankave'a erinte ama nehigeno, monafima me'nea zantamimo'a Agri erizankama'a erinte ama hu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 19:2"/>Hagi magoke magoke knamo'a Anumzamofoku hu'ama nehigeno, maka kenagemo'a Agri antahi'zama'a erinte ama nehaze. <verse eid="PSA 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 19:3"/>Hagi masane haninemokea kegaga neha'anagi, zanagerura ontahigahaze. <verse eid="PSA 19:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 19:4"/>Naneke zanimo'a mopane mopane vuno eno hu'ne. Hagi zagemofo nonkumara Anumzamo'a monafi retro hunte'ne. <verse eid="PSA 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 19:5"/>Hagi anampinkatira zagemo'a aravema hunaku hu'nea ne'mo atiramino eaza huno ne-eno, agare zokago nerea ne'mo agarenaku muse nehia kna nehie. <verse eid="PSA 19:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 19:6"/>Hagi zagemo'a mopamofona mago kazigati hanatino mago kaziga unefreankino, mago zamo'a agri amuhofintira frakigara osu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 19:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 19:7"/>Hagi Ra Anumzamofo kasegemo'a fatgo hu'neno kasefa tasimu neramie. Hagi Ra Anumzamofo kemo'a, knare antahi'za me'neankino antahizama'a omne vahera azeri ante fatgo huno knare antahi'za nezamie. <verse eid="PSA 19:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 19:8"/>Hagi Ra Anumzamofo kasegemo'a knare zantfa hu'neankino, tagu'afina musezanente. Hagi Ra Anumzamofo kasegemo'a, agru hu'neankino vahe'mofo avua eri hari nehuno, ama' antahiza nemie. <verse eid="PSA 19:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 19:9"/>Hagi Ra Anumzamofonku'ma kore'ma huntezamo'a agru hu'neankino mevava hugahie. Hagi Ra Anumzamofo kemo'a tamage ke me'neankino, makazana fatgo huno refako nehie. <verse eid="PSA 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 19:10"/>Hagi ana ke'amo'a, rama'a golima kre'za eri agruma hu'naza golimofo mizama'a agaterene. Hagi ana ke'amofo haga'amo'a tume rima'amofo haga'a agatere'ne. <verse eid="PSA 19:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 19:11"/>Hagi ana kekamo'a eri'za vahekamo'na havi avu'ava'ma huzanku koro kea nenasmino, ana nanekeka'ama amage'ma antaza vahera knare museza nezmie. <verse eid="PSA 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 19:12"/>Hagi inankna hu'na nagripima me'nea kefozana kena antahina hugahue? Ra Anumzamoka kagrake oku'ama frakino nagripima me'nea kumini'a atrenantenka nazeri agru huo. <verse eid="PSA 19:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 19:13"/>Hagi havizama hugahuanki hu'na antahine'nama hu kumipina natrege'na uofra'neno, hagi atregeno kumi'mo'a nazeri nagatereno navareno ovuno. Hagi natrege'na kumimpintira fru hu'na mani'neno. <verse eid="PSA 19:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 19:14"/>Hagi Ra Anumzamoka atregeno kenimo'ene nagu'afima antahintahima nehua zamo'a kagri kavufina knare huno me'nena musena hunanto. Kagra Ra Anumzamoka fraki have mani'nenka, nagu'vazi ne' mani'nane.<verse eid="PSA 19:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="PSA 20"/>
  <para style="s">Deviti asunte'nea zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 20:1"/>Hagi hazenkefima ufresankeno'a, Ra Anumzamo'a kagu vazigahie. Jekopu Anumzamo'a kegava hugante'nie. <verse eid="PSA 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 20:2"/>Hagi Agra mono noma'afi mani'neno kza nehuno, Jerusalemi kumateti kza hu'zana atrenigeno egahie. <verse eid="PSA 20:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 20:3"/>Hagi mika ne'za ofama hananana, antahi'negamino tevefima kre fanene hu ofama hananana, antahi muse hanie. <verse eid="PSA 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 20:4"/>Hagi Agra kagri'ma kvesinia zana negamino, nazano tro'ma hunaku keagama retro hanana zana amane hugantenigeno knare zanke hugahie. <verse eid="PSA 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 20:5"/>Hagi Kagrama ha'ma agatere'nanketa tagra musenkase huta kaninereta, Anumzantimofo agire krauvefana erisaga hugahune. Ra Anumzamo agrake mika nunamuma hanazana antahiramisie. <verse eid="PSA 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 20:6"/>Hagi menina nagra antahi'noe, Ra Anumzamo'a monafinka ruotge kuma'afi mani'neno, Agra'ama huhampri'nante'nea kini ne'mo'na nunamuni'a antahinenamino kenona hunanteno, tamaga azanteti hanave'a eri ante ama huno naza huno navregahie. <verse eid="PSA 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 20:7"/>Hagi mago'a vahe'mo'za hosi afuzmine karisi zmimofo hanavegu antahinezamize. Hianagi tagra Ra Anumzana tagri Anumzamofonte tamentintia nehune. <verse eid="PSA 20:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 20:8"/>Hagi mago'a vahe' mo'za evuramiza haviza hugahazanagi, tagra oti'neta hankavenentake huta manigahune. <verse eid="PSA 20:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 20:9"/>Ra Anumzamoka aza hunka kini nera agu'nevazinka, taza huoguma krafagema nehanunkenka, krafa ketia antahiramio.<verse eid="PSA 20:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="PSA 21"/>
  <para style="s">Ra Anumzamo'ma azama hu'nea zanku Deviti'a muse hunenteno hu'nea zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 21:1"/>Ra Anumzamoka, kagrama kini ne'mofoma hankavema nemina zanku, agra tusi muse nehuno, azama hankeno ha' vahe'ama ha'ma huzmagatere'nea zankura tusiza huno kagrikura musenkasea hunegante. <verse eid="PSA 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 21:2"/>Agri'ma agu'afima avesiazana amne neminka, nazankuro kantahigea zana, i'ora osunka amne nemine. <verse eid="PSA 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 21:3"/>Kagra tamagerfa hunka kini nera asomu hunentenka, knare zantfa hu'nea golireti tro hu'naza kini fetori anuntera antani nentane. <verse eid="PSA 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 21:4"/>Kini nemo'ma kantahigeno za'zate kasefa hu'na manisanuema higenka, Kagra hu izo hunka asimura neminka, kna'a eri zaza hankeno mani vava nehie. <verse eid="PSA 21:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 21:5"/>Kagra kini nera aza hankeno, ha' vahe'a hara huzmagaterege'za agrira ragia ami'naze. Kagraka'a ra agima eri'zane hanavenena ami'nane. <verse eid="PSA 21:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 21:6"/>Tamagerfa hunka mevava asomura hunentenka, tavaonkare avrentankeno muse huno Kagrane nemanie. <verse eid="PSA 21:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 21:7"/>E'ina hu'negu kini ne'mo'a, Ra Anumzamofonku antahi amuhara nehuno, Marerisa Anumzamofona vagaore avesizanku nentahino, antria nosuno oti hankavetigahie. <verse eid="PSA 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 21:8"/>Ra Anumzamoka hankavenentakema hu'nea tamaga kaziga kzanteti ha' vaheka'a hara hunezmantenka, kagri'ma zamavesrama hunegantaza ha' vaheka'a zamazeri haviza hugahane. <verse eid="PSA 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 21:9"/>Kagrama efore'ma hanana knazupa, kagri ha' vahera Kagri tevenefake tevemo teno eri fanane hugahie. Ra Anumzamoka tusi krimpa ahenezmantenka tevefi zamahe fanene hugahane. Ana nehanigeno Anumzamofo tevemo'a ana vahera teno eri fanane hugahie. <verse eid="PSA 21:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 21:10"/>Ana vahepintima fore hu anante anante'ma hu'za ama mopafima mani'naza vahera, ama mopafintira zamahe vagaresnanke'za, ama mopafina omanigahaze. <verse eid="PSA 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 21:11"/>Kagrira ana vahe'mo'za kazeri haviza hunaku kea anaki'naze. Hianagi ana kezamimo'a, amne zankna hugahie. <verse eid="PSA 21:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 21:12"/>Na'ankure Kagra keveka'a atifima erintenka zamahenaku'ma eri karisnanke'za, koro atre'za fregahaze. <verse eid="PSA 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 21:13"/>Ra Anumzamoka kagri hankavegu kagia ahentesga nehune. Ana nehuta kagri hihamugu zagamera huta kagia ahentesga nehune.<verse eid="PSA 21:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="PSA 22"/>
  <para style="s">Knazampima mani'neta hanuna zagame Deviti asunte'nea zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 22:1"/>Anumzanimoke Anumzanimoke, na'a higenka kamefira hunenamine? Nazama huoguma kragima nerugenka, nahigenka naza osu afetera nemanine? (Matiu 27:46, Maki 15:34) <verse eid="PSA 22:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 22:2"/>Anumzanimoka kagritega manigasa osuna mika knafina zagene haninena kagritega zavi krafagea nehuanagi, kagra antahi nonamine. <verse eid="PSA 22:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 22:3"/>Ana hu'neanagi kagra ruotage hu'nana Anumzankinka kini trakare mani'nanke'za Israeli vahe'mo'za kagia erihentesga neheze. <verse eid="PSA 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 22:4"/>Korapara tagri tagehe'za Kagrite zamentintima hazagenka, zamagu'vazinka ete zamavare'nane. <verse eid="PSA 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 22:5"/>Kagritega zavi krafa hazagenka nentahinka, zamagu'vazi'nane. Ana nehanke'za kagrite zamentintia nehu'za zamagazegura osu'naze. <verse eid="PSA 22:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 22:6"/>Hianagi nagra vaheknara osu'na hagirfagna vahe mani'noanki'za, maka kea nenasu'za zamefi hunenamize. <verse eid="PSA 22:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 22:7"/>Maka vahe'mo'zama nenage'za, ki'za zokago ke hunenante'za, zamagefu'na hakana hunenami'za zamagena neru'za, <verse eid="PSA 22:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 22:8"/>zamagra amanage hu'za nehaze, Ra Anumzamofonte amuhara nehuno amentintia nehianki, atrenkeno Ra Anumzamo aguravazino, Agra aza hino hu'za nehaze. (Matiu 27:39, 43. Maki 15:29. Luku 23:35) <verse eid="PSA 22:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 22:9"/>Ana hu'neanagi kagrake'za naza hanke'na antanimofo arimpafintira so'e hu'na atirami'noe. Ana nehunka osi'ma manine'na antanimofo amima nenoa knafina naza hankena namentintia kagritera hu'noe. <verse eid="PSA 22:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 22:10"/>Antanimo'ma kasenante'nea knareti'ma eno menima ama knare'ma egenka, kagra kegava hunenantenka, kagra nagri Anumza mani'nane. <verse eid="PSA 22:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 22:11"/>Nagrira natrenka afetera omanio, na'ankure knazamo'a tavaonte me'neankino, mago vahe'mo'e huno naza hugara osu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 22:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 22:12"/>Rama'a ha' vahe'mo'za ve bulimakao afu'mo'za nehazaza hu'za manikagi nante'naze. Ana vahe'mokizmi hankavemo'a Basani kazigama nemaniza ve bulimakao afutamimofo hankavezmimo'ma nehiaza huza mani kaginante'naze. <verse eid="PSA 22:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 22:13"/>Nagri ha' vahe'mo'za laionimo agira aka huno mago'a zagagafa aheno nenaku krafa nehuno rotago nehiaza hu'za, nahenaku narotago nehaze. <verse eid="PSA 22:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 22:14"/>Tima eri tagi atregeno'ma hiaza huno hankavenimo'a omanegeno, zaferinanimo'a avazu hu'ne. Ana higeno tumoni'amo'a kragefe masavemo nehiaza huno nagu'afina ze'ze huno pakepake hu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 22:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 22:15"/>Zagere ante hagege hu'nea mopa kavomo tako hiankna huno hankavenimo'a omnegeno, nagefunamo'a navagu'nafare marerino antrako hu'ne. Ana higenka Anumzamoka kagra frio hunka natranke'na kugusopafina mase'noe. <verse eid="PSA 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 22:16"/>Kramo hiaza hu'za ha' vahe'nimo'za mani kanegizageno kefo vahe'mo'za navazagi kagi'naze. Nazampine, nagiafinena rerapone'naze. <verse eid="PSA 22:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 22:17"/>Ana hazagena ana maka zaferinani'a hampri'na ke'noe. Hagi ha' vahe'nimo'za uruha nenage'za zamagu muse nehu'za orevumi arevumi hu'naze. <verse eid="PSA 22:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 22:18"/>Ana nehu'za ana vahe'mo'za nagri kukena refko hu'za eri zamente hu'za eneri'za, nagri kukena erinaku satu zokago re'naze. (Matiu 27:35. Maki 15:24. Luku 23:34. Jon 19:24.) <verse eid="PSA 22:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 22:19"/>Hianagi kagra Ra Anumzamoka nagrira natrenka afetera omanio. Na'ankure kagra nagri hanave mani'nananki ame hunka enka eme naza huo. <verse eid="PSA 22:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 22:20"/>Nagu'vazinka naza huge'za vahe'mo'za kazintetira nahe ofriho. Kagra naza huge'za, knare'ma hu'na mani'nofintira kragna vahe'mo'za nahe ofriho. <verse eid="PSA 22:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 22:21"/>Laionimo'ma naheno nezama nehifintira naza nehunka, afi bulimakao afumo'ma pazivema nare'zama nefintira naza hunka nagu'vazio.<verse eid="PSA 22:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 22:22"/>Nafu nagnahe'mokizmia Kagri kagia huama hu'na nezamasami'na, atruma hu'za mono'ma hanaza vahe amu'nompi oti'na kagia ahentesga hugahue. (Hibru 2:12) <verse eid="PSA 22:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 22:23"/>Hagi izagato Ra Anumzamofonku'ma koro'ma nehanamota, Agri agia ahentesga hiho. Ana maka Jekopu agehe'mota Agri agi'a ahentesga huta monora hunteho. Israeli agehe'mota Ra Anumzamofonku koro hunenteta, Agri agorga maniho. <verse eid="PSA 22:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 22:24"/>Iza'zo zamatafima mani'ne'za zamagra'ama zamazama huga'ma nosaza vahera, Ra Anumzamo'a amefira hunozamie. Ana nehuno zamagritera ke amnea huno frara nokianki, iza'o aza hinogu'ma nunamuma huno zavi krafama huno antahigea vahera, nunamu'a antahimino aza nehie. <verse eid="PSA 22:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 22:25"/>Hanki Ra Anumzamoka kagri vahe'mo'zama mono'ma hunaku'ma eme atru'ma hanafina, Kagra muse zanka'a nagu'afina ante avite'nanke'na kagri kagia ahentesga hugahue. Kagriku'ma koroma nehaza vahe zamavufi, ko'ma huvempama hu'na hugahuema hu'na hu'noa zantamina ana maka huvagaregahue. <verse eid="PSA 22:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 22:26"/>Zamunte'ma omane vahe'mo'za ne'zana nezamu hugahaze. Ra Anumzamofonku'ma nehakesaza vahe'mo'za, Agri agia ahentesga hugahaze. Anama hanaza vahera Anumzamo'a vagaore museza antezmanteke'za, musena hu'za vugahaze. <verse eid="PSA 22:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 22:27"/>Ama mopafima maka kazigama mani'naza vahe'mo'za Ra Anumzamoka kagrira antahi negami'za rukrahe hu'za kagritega egahaze. Ana nehanage'za ama mopafima mani'naza maka vahe'mo'za nagate nofite hu'za Kagri kagiafi zamarena eme re'za monora hugantegahaze. <verse eid="PSA 22:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 22:28"/>Na'ankure Ra Anumzamo'a Agra'a kinia manino, maka ama mopafi vahera kegava hu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 22:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 22:29"/>Maka feno vahe'mo'za, ne'zana nene'za Ra Anumzamofona monora huntegahaze. Ana nehanage'za ana zanke hu'za frisaza vahe'ma mani'naza vahe'mo'za e'za, Ra Anumzamofo avuga zamarena eme re'za monora huntegahaze. <verse eid="PSA 22:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 22:30"/>Henkama fore'ma hu'za mani'zama vanaza vahe'mo'za Ra Anumzamoka kagri eri'zana eri'za nevanage'za, mofavretimo'za kaguvazama eri fore'ma hu'nana zamofo agenkea antahigahaze. <verse eid="PSA 22:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 22:31"/>Hagi ana fatgo avu'avazama hu'nea zana nezmarera rimpafima mani'naza mofavre nagamokizmia nezamasamisnage'za, maka'zama eri fore'ma hu'nea zamofo agenkea antahigahaze.<verse eid="PSA 22:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="PSA 23"/>
  <para style="s">Knare sipisipi kva ne'mofo zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 23:1"/>Ra Anumzamo'a kva vaheni'a mani'neanki'na, mago zankura atupara osugahue. <verse eid="PSA 23:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 23:2"/>Ana hu'neankino afovage huno tretre'ma hu'nea trazampi nantege'na mani fru nehue. Ana nehuno kaza osu tintega navareno vige'na, tina ne'noe. <verse eid="PSA 23:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 23:3"/>Agra hanaveni'a ete eri kasefa nehuno, Agra'a agigu nentahino navareno fatgo avu'avazamofo kantera nevie. <verse eid="PSA 23:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 23:4"/>Ana nehu'na knazamo'ma rehanima hige'na, hanimpi neviankna hugahuanagi, anankna zamo'ma eme nazeri havizama hu'zankura korora osugahue. Na'ankure Ra Anumzamoka sipisipi kva vahe'mo'zama e'nerizankna azompaka'ane, sipisipima runeharizankna knonka'a eri'nenka nagrane mani'nanke'na ana zama negogeno'a, narimpamo'a fru nehie. <verse eid="PSA 23:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 23:5"/>Ha' vahe'nimofo zamavuga, ra ne'zana retro hunenantane. Ana nehunka nasenifina masave taginka fre nenantenka, huhampri nantankeno, kapufinti'ma avite'noma herafiramiaza huno musezamo'a nagu'afintira aviteno varehineramie. <verse eid="PSA 23:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 23:6"/>Tamagerfa huno Ra Anumzamofo knare avu'ava zamo'ene agri avesi'zamo'a ofri'nama kasefa hu'na ama mopafima manisua kna'afina, namage navararino vano hugahie. Ana nehanige'na Ra Anumzamofo mono nompi maka zupa manivava hugahue.<verse eid="PSA 23:6"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="PSA 24"/>
  <para style="s">Marerisa kinimofo zagame Deviti asunte'nea zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 24:1"/>Ama mopa Ra Anumzamofo suza megeno, ama mopafima maka'zama me'nea zantamimo'a agri zanke megeno, maka vahe'mo'zanena agri vaheke mani'naze. <verse eid="PSA 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 24:2"/>Na'ankure agra ama mopamofo tra'ama amefenkame tami'nea hagerimofo agofetu tro hunenteno, timofo agofetu mopa tro hunte'ne. <verse eid="PSA 24:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 24:3"/>Ina vahe'mo Ra Anumzamofo agonafina marerigahie? Ina vahe'mo Ra Anumzamofo ruotage mono nompina ome otigahie? <verse eid="PSA 24:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 24:4"/>Hagi agu'amo'ene azamo'enema agru nehanigeno, havi anumzante'ma mono'ma hunonteno havigema nosania vahemo anampina vugahie. <verse eid="PSA 24:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 24:5"/>E'inahu vahe'mo Ra Anumzamofontegatira asomura erigahie. Anumzamo'a agu'vazino nevreno, fatgo vahe mani'ne huno huntegahie. <verse eid="PSA 24:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 24:6"/>E'inahu vahe'mo Anumzamofonkura nehakeno monora hunenteno, Jekopu Anumzamofo tvaontera urava'o nehie.<verse eid="PSA 24:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 24:7"/>Kuma kahantamimota anagita ru hagro nehinkeno, korapa'ma me'naza kahamota anagita ru hagaro nehinkeno, hankave'ane kini ne'mo'a efreno. <verse eid="PSA 24:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 24:8"/>Hagi ana hankave kinia iza'e? E'i agra Ra Anumzana hihamu'ane hankanave Anumzankino, Agra hankavetino hara hugaterega Anumza mani'ne. <verse eid="PSA 24:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 24:9"/>Kuma kahamota anagita ruhagro hiho, ana nehanageta korapa kahamota, anagita ru hagaro hiho. Ana nehinkeno hankave'ane kini ne'mo'a efreno. <verse eid="PSA 24:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 24:10"/>Hagi ana hankave kinia iza'e? Ra Anumzana hankavenentake Anumzamo agrake ugagota kinia mani'ne.<verse eid="PSA 24:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 24"/>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="PSA 25"/>
  <para style="s">Ra Anumzamo'ma kegava hurantesia zanku Deviti asunte'nea zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 25:1"/>Ra Anumzamoka kagrite nagu namena eri'na e'na ama nunamuna nehue. <verse eid="PSA 25:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 25:2"/>Kagra nagri Anumza mani'nanke'na, kagrite namentintia nehue. Kagra natrege'na nagazegura osaneno. Hanki ha' vaheni'a zamatrege'za, hara hu nagate'nere'za musena osiho. <verse eid="PSA 25:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 25:3"/>Kagrite'ma amuha nehu'za zamentintima nehaza vahera zmatresnanke'za, zamagazegura osugahaze. Hianagi kagri'ma ha'ma renegantaza vahe'mo'za, osuga zamavu zamava'ma hu'naza zanku zamagesa nentahi'za zamagazegura hugahaze. <verse eid="PSA 25:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 25:4"/>Ra Anumzamoka knare kavukva zana naveri nehunka, Kagri'ma kavaririnua kana rempi hunamio. <verse eid="PSA 25:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 25:5"/>Tamage nanekeka'afi kegava hunka navrenka nevunka, anankema amage'ma antesnua zana rempi hunamio. Na'ankure kagra nagri Anumza mani'nenka, nagu'vazinka ete nenavrane. Ana nehanku maka knafina Kagrama nazama hananku, amuhara nehue. <verse eid="PSA 25:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 25:6"/>Ra Anumzamoka kasunku zanku'ene vagaore kavesi zankura kageraokanio. Na'ankure ana kavukva zana korapa knareti hume enka, meninena ana kavukvara nehane. <verse eid="PSA 25:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 25:7"/>Ra Anumzamoka, ko'ma mofavrema mani'nenama hu'noa kumi'ene kefo avu'ava zani'a, vagaore kavesizanku kagesa nentahinka kumini'a atrenanto. Na'ankure Ra Anumzana Kagra kasunku Anumza mani'nane. <verse eid="PSA 25:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 25:8"/>Ra Anumzamo'a knare hu'neno fatgo hu'neankino, kumi'ma nehaza vahera rempi huzamige'za, agri avesi'zana amage nentaze. <verse eid="PSA 25:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 25:9"/>Zamavufgama anteramiza maniza vahera, fatgo avu'ava huno kegava huzmanteno zamavareno nevuno, Agra'a avu'ava zana rempi hunezamie. <verse eid="PSA 25:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 25:10"/>Ra Anumzamofo kasegene trakenema amage'ma nentaza vahera, agra vagaore avesi zanteti zamavesi nezamanteno, hugahue huno'ma huzmante'nea ke'are oti'neno anaza nehia Anumza mani'ne. <verse eid="PSA 25:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 25:11"/>Ra Anumzamoka, nagri kumira rama'a me'neanagi kagri kagimofo knare zanku kagesa nentahinka, muse hugantoanki kumini'a eri atrenanto. <verse eid="PSA 25:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 25:12"/>Iza'o Ra Anumzamofonku'ma koro'ma hunte'nesnia vahera, Agra'a huhampri'nesia kante vuo huno huntenigeno vugahie. <verse eid="PSA 25:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 25:13"/>Ana vahe'mo'za knare nomani'zampi nemanisnage'za, zamagrama kase zamantesnaza vahe'mo'za ama mopa erisanti hare'za so'e hu'za manigahaze. <verse eid="PSA 25:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 25:14"/>Ra Anumzamo'a agriku'ma koro nehu'za, agri agoragama nemaniza vahera, zamatrege'za agri rone'a nemanizageno, oku'a me'nea kasege'a eri ama huno nezamasamie. <verse eid="PSA 25:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 25:15"/>Maka zupa nazama hanigu Ra Anumzamofonteke navua nentoe. Na'ankure nagri'ma nazeri traka'ma hunaku'ma hania kukompintira nazeri atregahie. <verse eid="PSA 25:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 25:16"/>Ra Anumzamoka rukrahe hunka nenagenka, kasunkura hunanto. Na'ankure nasuzampi mani'noe. <verse eid="PSA 25:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 25:17"/>Nagri nagu'afima me'nea knazamo'a ome ra huno nevie. Ana knafima manine'na antahintahi hakarema nehua zampintira, katufenka navre atro. <verse eid="PSA 25:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 25:18"/>Knazamo nazeri havizama nehige'na, narimpa knafima mani'noa zana nenagenka, maka kumini'a eri atrenanto. <verse eid="PSA 25:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 25:19"/>Nagri ha' vahera rama'a efore nehu'za, nagri'ma ha'ma renenante'za zamavesrama hunantaza zana kagra ko. <verse eid="PSA 25:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 25:20"/>Kagra nagu'nevazinka kegava hunka navrenka vuo. Natrege'za nazeri nagaze osiho. Na'ankure Kagripi e'na eme franekue. <verse eid="PSA 25:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 25:21"/>Fatgo avu'avazamo'ene, mani fatgoma huno mani avu'azamo kegava hunantegahie. Na'ankure nagra nazama hanankura kagriku amuhara nehue. <verse eid="PSA 25:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 25:22"/>Anumzamoka maka Israeli vahe'ma mani'naza kna zampintira kasunku huzmantenka ete zamagu'vazinka zamavro.<verse eid="PSA 25:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 25"/>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="PSA 26"/>
  <para style="s">Ke'a omane vahe'mo'ma hania nunamumofo zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 26:1"/>Ra Anumzamoka nagrira nenagenka fatgo vahe mani'nane hunka huo. Na'ankure nomaniza'nifina fatgo navu'nava'za hu'na e'noe. Ana nehu'na rukrahe osu hankaveti'na kagrite namentintia hu'noe. <verse eid="PSA 26:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 26:2"/>Ra Anumzamoka nagrira renahenka nenagenka, nagu'ane antahintahi zani'a rezaganenka ko. <verse eid="PSA 26:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 26:3"/>Na'ankure vagaore kavesi zamo'a navuga me'nege'na nege'na, maka zupa tamage nagu'areti hu'na kamagera ante vava nehue. <verse eid="PSA 26:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 26:4"/>Nagra havigema nehaza vahe'enena vano nosu'na, tavre vahe'mofo amu'nompina nomanue. <verse eid="PSA 26:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 26:5"/>Havi zamavu zamava'ma nehaza vahe'mo'zama atruma haza atrugura navesra hunezmante'na, havi zamavu zamava'ma nehaza vahe'ma manizafina omanigahue. <verse eid="PSA 26:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 26:6"/>Ra Anumzamoka nagri'ma hazenkeni'a omane'ne hu'na kaveri'ma hanuana timpi nazana sese nehu'na, Kresramanama vu itakarera neoe. <verse eid="PSA 26:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 26:7"/>Ana nehu'na ranke hu'na muse zagamera hu'na Kagri kagia ahentesga nehu'na, mika knare'nare kagu'vazama hu'nana zankura, huama hu'na vahera zamasamigahue. <verse eid="PSA 26:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 26:8"/>Ra Anumzamoka kagrama mani'nankeno, kagri masa zamo'ma me'nea mono nonka'agura navesi navesi nehie. <verse eid="PSA 26:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 26:9"/>Hagi kumi'ma nehaza vahe'ma zamazeri havizama hanampina, nagrira nazeri haviza osuo. Ana nehunka vahe'ma zamahe'zama korama eri tagi netraza vahe'ma zamahe frisnampina, nahe ofrio. <verse eid="PSA 26:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 26:10"/>Ana vahe zamazampina kefo avu'avazamo avinetegeno, tamaga kaziga zamazampina zagore'ma masave hu'za mago'aza eri'zamo avite'ne. <verse eid="PSA 26:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 26:11"/>Hianagi nagrani'a fatgo navu'nava zanke nehugu, kasunku hunantenka ete navro. <verse eid="PSA 26:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 26:12"/>Nagra agupo hu'nea mopare oti'noanki'na, kagri vahe kerfamo'zama atruma hanafina, kagri kagia ahentesga hugahue.<verse eid="PSA 26:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 26"/>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="PSA 27"/>
  <para style="s">Ra Anumzamofoma humuse hunte nunamu zagame Deviti asunte'nea zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 27:1"/>Ra Anumzamo'a nagri tavi mani'neno, nagu'vazi ne' mani'neankina, nagra na'anku korora hugahue? Ra Anumzamo'a nagrira hankave vihuni'a mani'neanki'na, na'anku nagra nahirahikura hugahue? <verse eid="PSA 27:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 27:2"/>Hanki havi avu'ava zama nehaza vahe'mo'zama nazeri haviza hunaku erava'o nehanageno, ha' vahe'nimo'za nahenaku egahazanagi, ana vahe'mo'za traka hu'za masegahaze. <verse eid="PSA 27:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 27:3"/>Rama'a sondia vahe kerafamo'za nahenaku kafo eme ante'za navazagi kagigahazanagi, nagra korora osugahue. Ha' vahenimo'za hara agafa hu'za eme hunantegahazanagi, Ra Anumzamofonku amuhara hugahue. <verse eid="PSA 27:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 27:4"/>Ra Anumzamofona mago zanku antahigesue, Knare nagrira natresanigena kasefa'ma hu'nama manisnua kna'afina, Agri nompina manivava nehu'na, knare avu'ava'a nege'na, musena hunente'na Agri mono nompi mani'nena kama naverima hanigura kegahue. <verse eid="PSA 27:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 27:5"/>Hanki hazenke zama esania knafina, Agra'a navre franekino, Agra'a seli mono nompi navre frakigahie. Ana nehuno navresga huno onagamu'a have agofetu nantesige'na knare hu'na manigahue. <verse eid="PSA 27:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 27:6"/>Anama hanige'na nagri'ma nazeri kagi'naza ha' vaheni'a naza hanige'na hara huzmagetenerena, ranke hu'na musenkase nehu'na, Ra Anumzamofo mono nompina ofa kresramna vugahue. Ana nehu'na zavena ahe'na zagamera Ra Anumzamofontega hugahue. <verse eid="PSA 27:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 27:7"/>Ra Anumzamoka naza huogu'ma kagritegama nunamuma nehanugenka, kasunku hunantenka nunamuni'a antahinamio. <verse eid="PSA 27:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 27:8"/>Nagu'amo'a agritega nunamu hunka agriku hako huno hige'na, nagra Ra Anumzamokarega nunamuna nehue. <verse eid="PSA 27:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 27:9"/>Ra Anumzamoka kamefira hunaminka kavugosa rukrahera nehunka, eri'za vahekamo'na krimpa aheonanto. Na'ankure kagra ko'ma nagu'vazinka e'nana Anumza mani'nananki, kamefira hunaminka onatrenka, nagu'vazinka nazahuo. <verse eid="PSA 27:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 27:10"/>Nenfa'ene nenrera'enena zanamefira hunamigaha'anagi, Ra Anumzamo'a navareno kegava hunantegahie. <verse eid="PSA 27:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 27:11"/>Ra Anumzamoka Kagra'a kavukvara rempi hunamio. Ha' vaheni'amo'za kafonte'za mani'nazanki, kegava hunantenka navrenka knare huno fatgo hu'nea kantera vuo. <verse eid="PSA 27:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 27:12"/>Nagrira natrege'na ha' vahe'nimofo zamazampina va'nenkeno zamagri'ma zamavesi'niaza hu'za nazeri havizana osiho. Na'ankure ana vahe'mo'za nagrira havige hunante'za e'za nazeri koro nehaze. <verse eid="PSA 27:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 27:13"/>Tamagerfa hu'na namentintima huana, henka'a Ra Anumzamofo knare'zana, nagrama mani'nama vanua knafina kegahue. <verse eid="PSA 27:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 27:14"/>Ra Anumzamofonku avega antenka mani'nenka, oti hankavetinenka atregeno kagu'amo'a hankave enerisnigenka, Ra Anumzamo'ma kazama hanigu akohenka mani'nenka aveganto.<verse eid="PSA 27:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 27"/>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="PSA 28"/>
  <para style="s">Ra Anumzamo'ma taza hanigu hanuna nunamune</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 28:1"/>Ra Anumzamoka nagri fraki hankave haveni'a mani'nanku, kagritega kezanetuanki, kezankeni'a antahinamio. Na'ankure nagri kezankere'ma nonama osnanke'na, nagra vahe'mo'zama fri'za nevaza kumatega fri'na vugahue. <verse eid="PSA 28:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 28:2"/>Nagra Ruotage'ma hu'nea mono nonka'ama me'nea kaziga nazana erisga hu'na naza huogu nunamuna nehuanki, kezankeni'a antahinamio. <verse eid="PSA 28:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 28:3"/>Kefo zamavuzmavama nehu'za, havizama nehu'za tava'o zamire'ma nemani'za vahe'enema zamagiteti haganentake naneke nehazanagi, zamarimpafina havi avu'avamo'ma avitenege'zama havigema nehaza vahe'enena nazeri fenkamua otro. <verse eid="PSA 28:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 28:4"/>Havi zamavu' zmava'ma nehu'za, kumimofo eri'zama eri'naza vahera, havi zamavu zmava'ma nehu'za kumi'ma hu'naza avamente antenka, mizana zamitere hunka zamazeri havizana huo. <verse eid="PSA 28:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 28:5"/>Ana Ra Anumzamofo eri'zanku'ene, Ra Anumzamo'ma azampinti'ma tro'ma hu'nea zantaminkura antahi amne nehaze. Ana hu'nazankino zamazeri havizantfa hutresnige'za, mago'enena oti'za so'ea hu'za omanigahaze. <verse eid="PSA 28:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 28:6"/>Ra Anumzamofona agi'a ahentesga hugahue. Na'ankure kasunku hunanto hu'nama kezatugeno'a, kezanke'ni'a antahinami'ne. <verse eid="PSA 28:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 28:7"/>Ra Anumzamo'a hankveni'ane, hankoni'ane mani'ne. Ana hu'negeno nagu'amo'a agripi me'nege'na namentintia nehugeno, agra naza nehie. Ana nehigeno nagu'amo'a tusi muse nehianki'na, muse zagame nehu'na susu huntegahue. <verse eid="PSA 28:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 28:8"/>Ra Anumzamo'a vea kevu'amofo hankavea agra'a nezmino, masavema freno huhamprinte'nea kini ne'mo'ma fra'ma nekino, agu'ma vazisnia kumara agrake mani'ne. <verse eid="PSA 28:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 28:9"/>Ra Anumzamoka nagri vahere nehunka, fenozama hiaza hunka'ma erisinte'ma hare'nana vahera asomu hunezmantenka, zamaza huo. Ana nehunka sipisipi kva vahe'mo'ma nehiaza hunka, maka knafina kazampi zamavarentenka kegava huzmante vava hunka vuo.<verse eid="PSA 28:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 28"/>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="PSA 29"/>
  <para style="s">Hazenke'ma esania knafima Ra Anumzamofo ageru'ma antahi'zamofo zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 29:1"/>Monafima nemaniza maka ankeromota Ra Anumzamofo agia ahentesga hunenteta, agri agigu'ene hankave'agu'enena husga hunenteta muse hunteho. <verse eid="PSA 29:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 29:2"/>Ra Anumzamofoma so'e zantfama hu'nea agia ahentesga nehuta, ruotage'ma huno hankave nentake'ma hu'nea Anumzana monora hunteho. <verse eid="PSA 29:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 29:3"/>Ra Anumzamofo agerumo'a hagerimofo agofetu'ma vuno eno nehigeno, hankavenentake Ra Anumzamofo ageru'mo'a hagerimofo agofetura monagema hiaza huno runagraseno vuno eno nehie. <verse eid="PSA 29:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 29:4"/>Ra Anumzamofo agerumo'a hankavenentake higeno, konariri'amo'a avite'ne. <verse eid="PSA 29:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 29:5"/>Hagi Ra Anumzamofo agerumo'a, sida zafaramina runagaza penetreno, Ra Anumzamo'a Lebanoni kokampima me'nea Sida zafaramina, ru futagi atre'ne. <verse eid="PSA 29:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 29:6"/>Ana nehuno Lebanoni agonamofona higeno bulimakao anenta'mo'ma hiaza huno, takaure takaure nehigeno, Hemoni agonamofona higeno, afi agaho bulimakao afumo'ma hiaza huno takaunere. <verse eid="PSA 29:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 29:7"/>Ra Anumzamofo agerumo'a kopsi'namo'ma hiaza huno rumarave marave nehigeno tevenefa rukru nehie. <verse eid="PSA 29:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 29:8"/>Ra Anumzamofo agerumo'a hagege koka eri kanage nehigeno, Ra Anumzamofo agerumo'a, Kadesima me'nea ka'ma koka eri tore nehie. <verse eid="PSA 29:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 29:9"/>Ra Anumzamo'ma ageru'ma nerigeno'a, dia afu'mo'za anopa anenta nentageno, zafa ani'namo'za harari hu'za mopafinke eneramize. Ana nehazage'za agri mono nompima mani'naza vahe'mo'za hu'za, Anumzamo'a hankavenentake hu'ne hu'za agia ahentesga nehaze. <verse eid="PSA 29:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 29:10"/>Ra Anumzamo'a kini tra'are mani'neno, ranra hagerintamina kegava hu'ne. Ana hu'neankino agrake kinia mani'neno kegava hu vava hugahie. <verse eid="PSA 29:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 29:11"/>Ra Anumzamo'a agra vahe'a hankavea nezamino, rimpa fruzanteti asomura huzmantesie.<verse eid="PSA 29:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 29"/>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="PSA 30"/>
  <para style="s">Ra Anumzamofoma humusema hunteno'ma hu' nunamu zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 30:1"/>Ra Anumzamoka kagra natranke'na fri vahe kumapina mani'noge'za nagri ha' vahe'mo'za ra zamagia e'neri'za nagefenkami otrazanki, kagra anampintira navre atirami'nanku, kagri kagia ahentesga hu'na rankagia kamigahue. <verse eid="PSA 30:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 30:2"/>Ra Anumzana nagri Anumzamoka, kagrama naza huogu'ma nunamuma hugenka, kagra nazeri kanamr40 'nane. <verse eid="PSA 30:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 30:3"/>Ra Anumzamoka nagra fri'na matipi uramiza hu'noanagi, anampinti navre atirami'nane. Ana nehunka nazeri kasefa hanke'na, fri'na fri vahe kumapina uorami'na kasefa hu'na mani'noe. <verse eid="PSA 30:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 30:4"/>Anumzamofo amage'ma nentza vahe'mota zagame huta Ra Anumzamofona husga hunenteta, ruotage'ma hu'nea zanku agia aheta humuse hunteho. <verse eid="PSA 30:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 30:5"/>Na'ankure Ra Anumzamofo arimpa ahe'zamo'a zazatera meno ovugahie. Hianagi agri knare avu'avazamo'a, kasefa'ma huta manisuna kna'afina mevava huno vugahie. Hanima e'nigeta kenagera zavira ategahunanagi, nanterama ko'manetigeta musenkase hugahune. <verse eid="PSA 30:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 30:6"/>Hagi nagra maka'zama ante'na knare'ma hu'nama mani'noa kna'afima nagesama antahi'noana, mago'zamo'a nagritera eno nazeri kazara osugahie hu'na antahi'noe. <verse eid="PSA 30:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 30:7"/>Ra Anumzamoka kagra knare kavukva hunantenka nazeri hankavetinke'na agonamo'ma oti hankavetiaza hu'na oti hankaveti'noe. Hianagi kagrama kavugosama rukrahe hunka kamefi'ma hunaminke'na, nagra koro hu'noe. <verse eid="PSA 30:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 30:8"/>E'ina hu'negu Ra Anumzamoka naza huogu kagritega krafage nehu'na, kasunku'ma hunante'naku nunamuna nehue. <verse eid="PSA 30:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 30:9"/>Hagi nagrama fri'na fri vahe kumapima uramina kasrinuana, iza zagamera huno Ra Anumzamoka'ma, knare kavukva'ma nehana zankura kagia ahentesga nehuno, musena hugantegahie? <verse eid="PSA 30:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 30:10"/>Ra Anumzamoka nagrama nehuankea antahi'nenaminka, kasunkuma hunantenka naza huoguma nunamuma nehuana antahinaminka naza huo. <verse eid="PSA 30:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 30:11"/>Zavi'ma netoa zampintira nazeri muse hanke'na musena hu'na avo nehagoe. Ana nehunka nasunku kukenama hu'noa zana hate netrenka, kukenama hiaza hunka musezana eri hankre nantanke'na musenkase nehue. <verse eid="PSA 30:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 30:12"/>E'ina hu'negu nagra fruhu'na omanigahuanki, nagu'areti hu'na Ra Anumzana nagri Anumzamoka kagritega zagamera hu'na, maka zupa susu hugante vava hugahue.<verse eid="PSA 30:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 30"/>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="PSA 31"/>
  <para style="s">Agu'vazinogu Deviti hu'nea nunamu zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 31:1"/>Ra Anumzamoka kagripi franekuanki natrege'za magore hu'za nazeri nagazea osiho. Hanki fatgo kavukva zampinti nagu'vazio. <verse eid="PSA 31:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 31:2"/>Kagesa antenka nunamuni'a nentahinka, ame hunka nagu'vazio. Kagra fraki haveni'ane, hankave vihuni'agna hunka mani'nananki'na, anampi fraki'na nagura vazigahue. <verse eid="PSA 31:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 31:3"/>Ra Anumzamoka Kagra fraki haveni'ane, hankave vihuni'anena mani'nane. Kagri kagimo'ma knare haniazanku nentahinka nazeri fatgo hunka kegava hunanto. <verse eid="PSA 31:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 31:4"/>Ha' vahe'nimo'zama nahenaku'ma krifuma anagi ante'nazafintira navare atiraminka nagu'vazio. Na'ankure kagra nagri fraki kumani'a mani'nane. <verse eid="PSA 31:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 31:5"/>Kagri kazampi avamuni'a antoanki, Ra Anumzamoka nagu'vazio, na'ankure Kagra tamagege hu' Anumza mani'nane. <verse eid="PSA 31:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 31:6"/>Kaza osu havi anumzante'ma mono'ma hunentaza vahera, tusi navresra hunezmantoe. Hianagi nagra Ra Anumzamokare namentintia nehu'na antahinegamue. <verse eid="PSA 31:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 31:7"/>Nagra Ra Anumzamoka vagaore kavesizanka'agura musena hugahue. Na'ankure kagra knazani'a negenka natama eri'na vuazana antahinka kenka hu'nane. <verse eid="PSA 31:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 31:8"/>Hagi kagra ha' vahe'ni'amokizmi zamazampina nevre onte'nananki, nagu'vazinke'na ra mopafi knare hu'na mani'noe. <verse eid="PSA 31:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 31:9"/>Hagi Ra Anumzamoka kasunku hunanto. Na'ankure nagra knazampima mani'ne'na zavi'ma atoa zamo'a navumo'a pro nehigeno, navufgamo'enena ome haviza hie. <verse eid="PSA 31:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 31:10"/>Maka kna nasuzampi nemani'na, knazampima mani'na vuazamo, higeno kafuni'amo'a atupa nehie. Kumi avu'avazampi mani'na vuazamo higeno hankaveni'a omnegeno, zaferinani'a omne amne nehie. <verse eid="PSA 31:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 31:11"/>Ha' vahe'nimo'za zamavaresra hunenantazageno, tava'onte'ma nemaniza vahe'mo'za nagefenkami netrazageno, ronenimo'zama kumapima nenage'za koro nefraze. <verse eid="PSA 31:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 31:12"/>Fri'nea vahe'ma zamagekaniaza hu'za zamagekani nentazage'na nagra tako hu'nea mopa kavogna hu'noe. <verse eid="PSA 31:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 31:13"/>Rama'a vahe'mo'za huhaviza hunentaza naneke nentahi'na tusi koro hu'noe. Hagi zamagra nahe frinaku oku'a atru hu'za kea anaki'naze. <verse eid="PSA 31:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 31:14"/>Hianagi Ra Anumzamoka kagrite namentintia nehu'na nagri Anumza kagra mani'nane hu'na nehue. <verse eid="PSA 31:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 31:15"/>Nasimu'mo'a Kagri kazampi me'neanki, ha' vahe'niamo'zama nahenaku'ma nenavaririza vahe'mokizmi zamazampintira nagu'vazio. <verse eid="PSA 31:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 31:16"/>Atregeno kavugosafinti masazamo'a eri'za vaheka'arera remasa nehina, huvempama hunka huhagerafinana keka'agu nentahinka kasunku hunantenka nzahuo. <verse eid="PSA 31:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 31:17"/>Hanki Ra Anumzamoka kagripi nagra franekue. Hagi natrege'za ha' vahetmimo'za nazeri nagazea osiho. Fatgo kavu'kvaka'afinti nagu'vazio. Hagi kefo zamavu'zmava'ma nehaza vahera zamazeri zamagaze nehunka, zamagira ruhamunkige'za friza matipi maseho. <verse eid="PSA 31:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 31:18"/>Havigema nehaza zamagefu'na erirava nehenka, fatgo zmavuzmava'ma nehaza vahe'ma huhaviza nehu'za zamavufaga ra kema nehaza zamagira eriravaho. <verse eid="PSA 31:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 31:19"/>Ra Anumzamoka knare kavukvamo'a rankrerfa hu'neankinka, kagri'ma koro'ma hugante'za kagoraga'ama nemaniza vahera rama'a zmasimu ante vite'nezmantane. Hagi kagripima eme frakinaku'ma aza vahera knare kavukva zana antevite nezmantenka asomura hunezmantake'za maka vahe'mo'za nezamagaze. <verse eid="PSA 31:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 31:20"/>Ha' vahe'mo'zama zamahe'zama nehazagenka Ra Anumzamoka zamazeri franekinka, zamagipinti'ma huhavizama nehazagenka zamazeri fra'nekine. <verse eid="PSA 31:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 31:21"/>Ra Anumzamofona ra agi erisga hanue. Na'ankure ha' vahe'nimo'zama mani'noa rankumama avazagi kagizageno'a, Agra vagaore avesizama'areti nagu'vazi'ne. <verse eid="PSA 31:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 31:22"/>Hagi antrima nehu'na amanage hu'noe, Ra Anumzana atre'na nagra ogama afete e'noe hu'na hu'noe. Hianagi naza huogu'ma krafagema huana antahinka naza hu'nane. <verse eid="PSA 31:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 31:23"/>Anumzamofo vahe'mota Ra Anumzamofona tamavesinteho. Na'ankure Ra Anumzamo'a Agri'ma avariri fatgoma nehaza vahera hazenkema erizankura kegava hunezmante'anagi, zamavufaga rama nehaza vahera zamazeri havizantfa nehie. <verse eid="PSA 31:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 31:24"/>Ra Anumzamofonte'ma amuha'ma nehaza vahe'mota korora osu hankavetita maniho.<verse eid="PSA 31:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 31"/>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="PSA 32"/>
  <para style="s">Ra Anumzamofo vagaore avesi zanku Deviti asunte'nea zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 32:1"/>Kema ontahi avu'ava zama'ama Anumzamo'ma atrenenteno, kumi'ama apasente'nia vahe'mo'a tusi muse hugahie. <verse eid="PSA 32:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 32:2"/>Hagi Ra Anumzamo'ma mago vahe'mofo kefo avu'ava'ama eritrenigeno, vahe'ma revatga hu avu'avazamo'ma agripima omnenenia vahe'mo'a muse hugahie. <verse eid="PSA 32:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 32:3"/>Hagi kumini'ama huama'ma osugeno'a, nagri navufgamo'ene zaferinamo'enena tusi nata negrige'na karagi ruvava nehue. <verse eid="PSA 32:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 32:4"/>Na'ankure zagene haninena knazana nagrite ante'nankeno, tusi kna nave'nesie. Hagi zagemo'ma tima te hagege hiaza huno, hankavenimo'a hagege nehie. <verse eid="PSA 32:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 32:5"/>Ana'ma hutege'na kumini'a refiote maka kagritega huama hu'noe. Ana nehu'na nagra anage hu'noe, Ra Anumzamofonte nagra keontahi navu'nava zani'a huama hugenka, kumini'a apase nantankeno mika kumi'ni'a vagare'ne. <verse eid="PSA 32:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 32:6"/>E'ina hu'negu atrege'za Kagri kamage'ma nentaza vahe'mo'za knama me'nesire kagritega nunamuna hiho. Ana hanageno knazamo'ma tima hageazama huno esia zamo'a zamazeri onakrino. <verse eid="PSA 32:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 32:7"/>Kagra fraki kumani'a mani'nanankinka, hazenke knafina nagu'nevazinke'na, ana zankura zagame nehu'na tusi musenkase nehue. <verse eid="PSA 32:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 32:8"/>Hagi Ra Anumzamo'a huno, Nagra kegava hugante'nena rempi hugamisugenka knare kantera vugahane. Nagra navunte'na negage'na antahintahia kamigahue. <verse eid="PSA 32:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 32:9"/>Hagi antahintahizmi omne hosi afuro, miuri afu'ma aini atupa'ama zamagipi ante'neza nofi rente'za zamavazu hazage'za zamavariri'za vazanknara osiho. <verse eid="PSA 32:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 32:10"/>Kefo avu'ava'ma nehaza vahera, rama'a knazamo zamazeri haviza nehanige'za zamasuzampi manigahaze. Hianagi Ra Anumzamofona vagaore avesizamo'a Agrite'ma zamentintima nehaza vahete megahie. <verse eid="PSA 32:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 32:11"/>Fatgo avu'ava'ma nehaza vahe'mota Ra Anumzamofonku muse nehinkeno, tamagu'amo'ma fatgoma hu'nenia vahe'mota ranke huta zagamera huta agi'a erisga hiho.<verse eid="PSA 32:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 32"/>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="PSA 33"/>
  <para style="s">Muse zagame Deviti asunte'nea zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 33:1"/>Fatgo avu'ava'ma nehaza vahe'mota zagamera huta Ra Anumzamofona musena hunteho. Na'ankure fatgo avu'ava'ma nehia vahe'mo'ma Ra Anumzamofo agima erisgama haniana knare hugahie. <verse eid="PSA 33:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 33:2"/>Hapu zavena neheta zagamera huta Ra Anumzamofona agia erisga nehuta, 10ni'a strini nofi'ma me'nea zavenagu'ma laeriema nehaza zavena neheta zagamera huta musena hiho. <verse eid="PSA 33:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 33:3"/>Kasefa zagame huta agia erisga hiho. Knarezantfa huta zavena neheta ranke huta agi'a erisga huta musena hiho. <verse eid="PSA 33:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 33:4"/>Na'ankure Ra Anumzamofonkea tamage naneke me'neankino, nazano hugahuema hu'nea zantamina Agra ana maka nehie. <verse eid="PSA 33:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 33:5"/>Ra Anumzamo'a fatgo avu'avazane, mago zanke'ma huno maka zama refkohu avu'ava zanku'ene avenesigeno, ama mopafina Agri vagaore avesizamo avite'ne. <verse eid="PSA 33:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 33:6"/>Ra Anumzamo'a ke higeno mona fore nehigeno, Agra ke higeno monafima me'nea hanafitamine zagene ikanena fore hu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 33:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 33:7"/>Agra, Ra Anumzamo hagerina repapa higeno magokepina umareno moriri huno marerigeno, tinkerifima tima afinteankna huno hagerina magokepi renatinte'ne. <verse eid="PSA 33:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 33:8"/>Maka ama mopafima mani'naza vahe'mo'za Ra Anumzamofonku korora hunte'za agoraga'a maniho. Maka ama mopafi vahe'mo'za Agrira kesga hu'za monora hunte'za agorga maniho. <verse eid="PSA 33:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 33:9"/>Na'ankure Agra ke nehigeno ama mopa fore hu'ne. Agra huno, efore huo huno higeno ama mopamo'a efore hu'no me'ne. <verse eid="PSA 33:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 33:10"/>Ama mopafi vahe'mo'zama e'ina hugahune hu'zama antahintahima retro'ma haza antahintahia Ra Anumzamo'a zamahe savri nehuno, mika zama hugahune hu'zama kema anakiza zana eri haviza nehie. <verse eid="PSA 33:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 33:11"/>Hianagi Ra Anumzamo'ma mago'zama hunaku'ma antahintahima retro'ma hu'nenia zamo'a mevava huno vugahie. Hugahue huno'ma hu'nenia zana Agra tamage huno fore'ma hu anante anante'ma hanigeno manino vania vahete'enena meno vugahie. <verse eid="PSA 33:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 33:12"/>Ra Anumzanku'ma tagri Anumzane hu'zama hanaza vahe'mo'za muse nehinkeno, Nagri fenozane huno'ma eri santimahare'nea vahe'mo'za muse hiho. <verse eid="PSA 33:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 33:13"/>Monafinkatira Ra Anumzamo'a kefenka atreno ama mopafima mani'naza vahera maka nezamagie <verse eid="PSA 33:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 33:14"/>Agrama nemania kumapintira kefenka ateno mika ama mopafima nemaniza vahera nezamage. <verse eid="PSA 33:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 33:15"/>Agra vahe'mofo tumora trohunte'neankino, maka zama hu'na zana antahino keno nehie. <verse eid="PSA 33:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 33:16"/>Hankavenentake sondia vahetmimo'za kini nera agura ovazi'nageno, harafa sondia ne'mo'a agra'a hanave'aretira kini nera agura ovazigahie <verse eid="PSA 33:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 33:17"/>Hosi afu'mo'za naza hanage'na hara agateregahue hunka amuhara osuo. Na'ankure hosi afu'mofo hankavemo'a kaza huno kagura ovazigahie. <verse eid="PSA 33:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 33:18"/>Hianagi Ra Anumzamo'a Agriku'ma koro'ma hu'za agoraga'ama nemani'za, vagaore avesizama'mofonte'ma amuha'ma nehaza vahete avua anteno nege. <verse eid="PSA 33:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 33:19"/>Agra frizampintira zamagu'nevazino agatonto knafina zamatrege'za ne'zankura nofrize. <verse eid="PSA 33:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 33:20"/>Ra Anumzamofonku tagra avega anteta manineta amuhara nehunankino, Agrake'za hankotia mani'neankino, taza hugahie. <verse eid="PSA 33:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 33:21"/>Agriku tagu'amo'a musena nehie, na'ankure tagra, Agri ruotge agifi tamentintia nehune. <verse eid="PSA 33:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 33:22"/>Ra Anumzamoka kagripi amuha zantia me'neanki, vagaore kavesi'zanteti maka knafina kegava hunka refiteranto.<verse eid="PSA 33:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 33"/>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="PSA 34"/>
  <para style="s">Ha' vahe azampinti'ma agu'vazinia zamofo nunamune</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 34:1"/>Maka kna nagra Ra Anumzamofona husga hunente'na, Agri agi'a hentesga huvava hugahue. <verse eid="PSA 34:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 34:2"/>Nagra Ra Anumzamofonku musena nehu'na navufga rana hugahuanki'za, vahe'mo'zama zamazeri havizama nehaza vahe'mo'za nentahi'za muse hugahaze. <verse eid="PSA 34:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 34:3"/>Enketa Ra Anumzamofo avu'avazama'a huama nehuta, agi'a husga huntamneno. <verse eid="PSA 34:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 34:4"/>Ra Anumzamofontega nunamuna hugeno, nunamuni'a antahinamino koro'ma nehua zana eri amne hu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 34:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 34:5"/>Ra Anumzamofontegama zamavuma antete'za nemaniza vahe'mokizmi zamavugosafintira rumasa nehanige'za, muse nehanageno zamavugosafina zamagaze zamo'a refi'otegahie. <verse eid="PSA 34:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 34:6"/>Amunte omne ne'ma amama mani'nea ne'mo'a nunamu higeno, Ra Anumzamo'a antahimino ana maka knazama'afintira agu'vazi'ne. <verse eid="PSA 34:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 34:7"/>Ra Anumzamofo ankeroma'amo'a Agri'ma koro'ma hunte'za agoraga'ama nemaniza vahera manigagino kegava hunezmanteno hazenke zampintira zamagu'nevazie. <verse eid="PSA 34:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 34:8"/>Agra knare avu'ava nehia ne' mani'neanki Ra Anumzamofona rehenka ko, Agripinkama frakino manisia vahe'mo'a muse hugahie. <verse eid="PSA 34:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 34:9"/>Anumzamofo amage'ma nentaza vahe'mota Ra Anumzamofona koro hunteta agoraga'a maniho. Na'ankure Agri'ma koro'ma hunte'za agoraga'ama nemaniza vahe'mo'za mago zankura atupara nosaze. <verse eid="PSA 34:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 34:10"/>Hankavenentake laionimo'a mago'a kna agakura hugahie. Hianagi Ra Anumzamofonte'ma amentintima himo'a, knare zantaminkura upara nosie. <verse eid="PSA 34:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 34:11"/>Mofavrenimota nagrite eta eme antahiho. Ra Anumzamofoma koroma hunteno agoraga'ama mani'zana rempi huramigahue. <verse eid="PSA 34:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 34:12"/>Izaga ofrinka zaza kna ama mopafina knare hunka manizankura kave'nesie? <verse eid="PSA 34:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 34:13"/>E'ina hunaku'ma hanunka, kefo nanekene havi nanekema hu'zankura, kagira kegava huo. <verse eid="PSA 34:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 34:14"/>Kefo kavukava'ma nehanazana atrenka knare kavukva huo. Arimpa fruma huno mani zankuke nehakenka, ana kavukavake huo. <verse eid="PSA 34:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 34:15"/>Ra Anumzamo'a fatgo zamavu'zamavama nehaza vahete avua anteno kegava hunezmante. Agritegama krafagema hanageno'ma zamaza hanigu agesa anteteno nemanie. <verse eid="PSA 34:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 34:16"/>Hianagi Ra Anumzamo'a kefo zamavu'zmava'ma nehaza vahera amefi hunezmino, ama mopafintira zamahe fanane hanige'za vahe'mo'za zamagesa ru'enena antahi ozamigahaze. <verse eid="PSA 34:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 34:17"/>Fatgo zamavu'zmava'ma nehaza vahe'mo'zama Ra Anumzamofontegama krafagema nehazageno'a, Agra antahi nezmino maka hazenkefintira zamagu'nevazie. <verse eid="PSA 34:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 34:18"/>Ranknazampima mani'naza vahera Ra Anumzamo'a tva'ozmire nemanino, vahe'mo'zama knazama zami'za zamagu'ama zamazeri havizama nehaza vahera, zamagu'nevazie. <verse eid="PSA 34:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 34:19"/>Fatgo zamavu'zmava'ma nehaza vahe'mo'za rama'a hazenkefi ufretere hugahazanagi, Ra Anumzamo'a ana hazenkefintira zamaza huno zmagu'vazitere hugahie. <verse eid="PSA 34:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 34:20"/>Na'ankure Ra Anumzamo'a fatgo avu'ava'ma nehia vahe'mofo zaferina kegava huntegahiankino mago zaferina'amo'a hara ontagigahie. <verse eid="PSA 34:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 34:21"/>Kefo avu'ava'ma nehia vahera agrama nehania kefo avu'ava zamo'a ahenefrisigeno, fatgo avu'ava zanku'ma avresrama nehania vahera, ana avu'ava'zantera nona huno knazana amigahie. <verse eid="PSA 34:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 34:22"/>Hianagi Ra Anumzamo'a eri'za vahe'a agu'vazigahie. Hanki Ra Anumzamofompima frakisia vahe'mo'a hazenkefina uofregahie.<verse eid="PSA 34:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 34"/>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="PSA 35"/>
  <para style="s">Ra Anumzamo'a hankave Anumzane huno Deviti asunte'nea zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 35:1"/>Ra Anumzamoka nagri'ma mago zamarimpama hunontaza vahera mago krimpa hunozmantenka, ha'ma renantaza vahera ha'rezmanto. <verse eid="PSA 35:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 35:2"/>Ha' kukenaka'a nehunka, hankoka'a erinka enka eme naza huo. <verse eid="PSA 35:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 35:3"/>Navaririzama neaza vahera keveka'ane, karugru keveka'ane erisga hunka nezmahegena, kagu'vazigahue hunkama nehana nanekeka'agura antahineno. <verse eid="PSA 35:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 35:4"/>Nahenaku'ma nenavaririza vahe'mokizmia zamatrege'za zamagazegu hiho. Nazeri haviza hunaku'ma antahintahima nehaza vahera zamazeri haviza huge'za zamagazegu hiho. <verse eid="PSA 35:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 35:5"/>Ra Anumzamoka witi hona'ama hiaza hunka huharafu huzmatrege'za zahomo'ma hiaza hu'za Kagri ankero vahe'mo'za zamaretufe zamatreno. <verse eid="PSA 35:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 35:6"/>Kama vanaza kana eri hanintiri nehunka, eri krarintege'za Ra Anumzamoka ankeromo'a zamarotago huno vino. <verse eid="PSA 35:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 35:7"/>Nagra zamagrira zamazeri havizana osu'noanagi, zamagra karifu anaginte nante'naze. Nagra mago zana osu'noanagi zamagra nagri nazerinaku keri kafinte'naze. <verse eid="PSA 35:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 35:8"/>E'ina hu'negu atregeno zamazeri havizama huzamo'a antri hanazaza huno zamavatera ne-ena, nagri'ma nazerisie hu'zama anaginte'naza krifumo'a zamazerino. Nagri kerima kafinte'nazafi, zamagra'a tamiho. <verse eid="PSA 35:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 35:9"/>E'ina'ma hanage'na Ra Anumzamokagura tusi musenkase nehu'na, kagi'a erisaga hugahue, na'ankure Kagra naguranevazine. <verse eid="PSA 35:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 35:10"/>Ra Anumzamoka ana maka nagu'areti hu'na kagia erisga hugahue. Ra Anumzamoka magore huno Kagrikna anumzana omani'ne. Hagi zamagra'ama zamaza huga osu vahe'mofo zantamine, zmunte omne vahe'mofo zantaminema musufama neseza zamazeri havizama nehazana iza zamaza hugahie. <verse eid="PSA 35:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 35:11"/>Kezmifinti'ma vahe'ma zamazeri havizama hu vahe'mo'za, havige hu'za keaga hunenantaze. Nagra osu'noa hazenkegura kagra hazenke hu'nane hu'za havigea hunenantaze. <verse eid="PSA 35:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 35:12"/>Knare navu'nava'ma huzmantoa zantera, havi zamavuzmava zanu nona hunentaze. E'ina'ma haza zamo higeno, nagu'amo'a tusi kna nehie. <verse eid="PSA 35:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 35:13"/>Hianagi krima erizage'na nasunku hunezmante'na, atafa kukena hu'na manine'na kavera a'o hu'na ana nagamofona zamazama hananegura nunamuna hunezmantoanagi, ana nunamuni'arera nona nosane. <verse eid="PSA 35:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 35:14"/>Nagra nagaku'ma hiaza hu'na zavira atenezmante'na, nenreranku'ma hiaza hu'na nasunkura hu'na zavira atenezmantoe. <verse eid="PSA 35:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 35:15"/>Hianagi nagrama tanafa'ma hu'na mase'zama huge'za, muse nehu'za eme naregagi'naze. Hagi antahina ke'na osu'noa vahe'mo'za hara eme renenante'za huhaviza hunante vava nehaze. <verse eid="PSA 35:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 35:16"/>Kefo avu'ava'ma nehaza vahe'mo'zama nehazaza hu'za zamagra kiza zokagoke hunenante'za zamavera aninkreki hu'naze. <verse eid="PSA 35:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 35:17"/>Ra Anumzamoka hago zazate mago zana huonante natranke'za amanara hu'za neaze. Hanki hankavematiza ha'ma hunentazana naguvazio. Laionimo'ma hiaza hu'za nahe'zama nehaza vahepintira nagu'vazio. <verse eid="PSA 35:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 35:18"/>Ana'ma hananke'na rama'a mono kevuma atruma hanafina kagia ahentesga nehu'na, susu hunegante'na tusi'a vahekrerfama atruma hanafina nagra zagamera hu'na kagia erisga hugahue. <verse eid="PSA 35:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 35:19"/>Hagi atregeno ha' vahe'nimo'za nagri'ma nazeri havizama nehaza zankura musena osiho. Ana nehunka zamatrege'za zamavaresrama hunenante'za amnezampima knama nenamiza vahe'mo'za rezavumira nehu'za nagi'zana oreho. <verse eid="PSA 35:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 35:20"/>Zamagra zamarimpa fruma hu'za vahe'enema manisaza zankura keaga nosazanki, knare hu'zama zamagra'a erizante'ma vanoma nehaza vahe'ma zamahesaza keaga retro nehaze. <verse eid="PSA 35:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 35:21"/>Zamagra zamagira reaka hu'za amanage hu'za havigea hunentaze, kagriku'ma tavuma anteta haketa vanoma nehunazana, meni tagri tavumo'a kageno eri fore hie. <verse eid="PSA 35:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 35:22"/>Ra Anumzamoka kagra ama ana zana kenka antahinka hu'nananki, kea osura omanio. Ra Anumzanimoka Kagra natrenka afetera akohenka uomanio. <verse eid="PSA 35:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 35:23"/>Ra Anumzanimoka otio! Otinka nahorakenka hara huo. Kagra Ra Anumzana nagri Anumza mani'nananki nagri kaziga antenka naguravazio. <verse eid="PSA 35:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 35:24"/>Ra Anumzana nagri Anumzamoka nagra mago hazenkea osu'noanki, huama hunka zamasmio, na'ankure kagra fatgo hunka refko nehana ne' mani'nane. Hagi zamatrege'za hazenkefima unefrenuge'za ha' vahe'nimo'za nagi'zana oreho. <verse eid="PSA 35:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 35:25"/>Zamatrege'za zamagu'afina hu'za agrikuma nehuna nera hago azeri haviza hu'ne hu'za osiho. <verse eid="PSA 35:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 35:26"/>Hazenkefima mani'noge'zama musema nehu'za nagizama neraza vahera zamazeri haviza huge'za zamagazegu hiho. Zamavufga rama nehaza vahera zamazeri haviza huge'za, zamagazegu nehu'za zamagi omne vahe maniho. <verse eid="PSA 35:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 35:27"/>Hianagi nagri'ma nahomanekaza vahera museza ante vitezmantege'za muse nehuza amanage hiho, Ra Anumzana agra marerisa Anumza mani'neankino eri'za vahe'amofona muse hunenteno asomura hunteno arimpa frua nemie hu'za hiho. <verse eid="PSA 35:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 35:28"/>Ana'ma hananke'na fatgo kavukvazana huama nehu'na, maka kna zagamera hu'na kagi'a ahentesga hugahue.<verse eid="PSA 35:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 35"/>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="PSA 36"/>
  <para style="s">Deviti'a Anumzamofo vagaore avesizanku asunte'nea zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 36:1"/>Kefo avu'ava'ma nehia vahe'mofona kumimo'a sumisumi huno agu'afina nanekea nesmigeno, agra Anumzamofonkura korora nosie. <verse eid="PSA 36:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 36:2"/>Na'ankure agra avufga ra nehuno, agesama antahiana kefo navu'nava zama nehua zamo'a, amne zane huno nentahie. <verse eid="PSA 36:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 36:3"/>Maka kema hiana fatgo osu, krunagege nehuno, antahintahima huno knare avu'ava'ma huzankura avresra nehie. <verse eid="PSA 36:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 36:4"/>Hagi agra kenagera avura ovase mani'neno kumima hania antahintahi hugentahige nehie. Ana nehuno knare osu avu'ava zanke nehuno kefo avu'ava zampinti'ma atreno rukrahe'ma huno ezankura agesa nontahie. <verse eid="PSA 36:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 36:5"/>Ra Anumzamoka vagaore kavesizamo'a monamo'ma hiaza huno rankrerfa higeno, hugahuema nehana zama amagema antenka hu' kavukva zamo'a hampona azeri agatereno onaga'a me'ne. <verse eid="PSA 36:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 36:6"/>Fatgo kavukava zamo'a zaza huno ra agonagna higeno, fatgoma hunka refkoma hu' kavukva zamo'a ra hagerimo'ma amafenkame urami'ankna hu'ne. Ra Anumzamoka kagra zagagafane vahe'enena magozahu hunka kegava nehane. <verse eid="PSA 36:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 36:7"/>Anumzamoka vagaore kavesizamo'a knare zanfta hu'ne. Maka vahe'mo'za kagri kagekonamofo turunapinka franekize. <verse eid="PSA 36:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 36:8"/>Zamagra Kagri nompinti ne'zana nezamu nehazagenka, Kagri musezamo'a tinkna hu'neanki'za nene'za muse nehaze. <verse eid="PSA 36:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 36:9"/>Na'ankure kagra asimu'ma erino mani tigampui mani'nenka, tagri tavi mani'nanketa negone. <verse eid="PSA 36:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 36:10"/>Ra Anumzamoka, kagri'ma kage'za antahizama nehu'za kavesinegantaza vahera vagaore kavesi zanteti zamavesi nezmantenka, fatgo zamavu'zmava'ma nehaza vahera fatgo hunka refko huzmanto. <verse eid="PSA 36:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 36:11"/>Atregeno zamavufaga rama nehaza vahe'mo'za nagofetura zamagare'za vano nosnageno, kefo avu'ava'ma nehaza vahe'mo'za natufe kantutete natufe kamatetera osiho. <verse eid="PSA 36:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 36:12"/>Kefo avu'ava'ma nehaza vahe'mo'za traka nehazanki ko. Matevuno mopafi zamatrege'za vasene'za oti'zankura ana'ana nehazankiza ru'enena o'otigahaze.<verse eid="PSA 36:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 36"/>
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="PSA 37"/>
  <para style="s">Anumzamo'a Agra vahe'a amefira huomigahie huno asunte'nea zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 37:1"/>Kefo avu'ava'ma nehaza vahekura antahintahi hakarea osuo. Hagi kefo avu'ava'ma nehia vahera keganunua osuo. <verse eid="PSA 37:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 37:2"/>Na'ankure zamagra trazankna hu'za ame hu'za hagage huge, trazamofo amosre'agna hu'za ame hu'za frigahaze. <verse eid="PSA 37:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 37:3"/>Hagi Ra Anumzamofonte tamentinti nehuta knare tamavutmava hiho. Ama mopafina knare huta nemanita fatgo avu'ava'zama hu'zanku hankavetita eri'zana eriho. <verse eid="PSA 37:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 37:4"/>Ra Anumzamofonku musena huntegeno kagu'amo'ma ave'manesia zana kamino. <verse eid="PSA 37:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 37:5"/>Maka zama hunaku'ma hanana zana Ra Anumzamofo azampi nentenka Agrite'ma kamentintima hanankeno'a, Agra amne anazana hugahie. <verse eid="PSA 37:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 37:6"/>Agra fatgo kavu'kva zanka'a erinte ama hanigeno, nantera zagemo hanatino remsa hiankna nehanigeno, fatgoma hunka refkoma nehana kavukvara zamo'a ferusegeno zage renteankna hugahie. <verse eid="PSA 37:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 37:7"/>Ra Anumzamofo avuga akohenka mani'negeno, nazano hunaku'ma haniazana, Agra'a hino. Hanki kefo zamavu'zmava'ma nehaza vahe'mo'zama rama'a fenoma ante'za knare'ma hanaza zankura kagesa nontahinka, kefo avu'ava'ma nehaza vahe'mo'zama kefo avu'ava'ma hanaza zankura antahintahi hakarea osuo. <verse eid="PSA 37:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 37:8"/>Krimpagura osunka atregeno krimpama ahe'zamo'a evuneramina, ana zankura antahintahi hakarea osuo. Na'ankure e'i ana zamo'a kavreno hazenkefi ufregahie. <verse eid="PSA 37:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 37:9"/>Hanki kefo zamavu'zmava'ma nehaza vahe'mo'za fanane hugahazanagi, Ra Anumzamofonku'ma amuhama hunemiza vahe'mo'za mopa erisanti haregahaze. <verse eid="PSA 37:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 37:10"/>Hanki kefo zamavu'zmava'ma nehaza vahe'mo'za ame hu'za fanane hanagenka, anama mani'narega ome hakegahananagi, ozmagegosane. <verse eid="PSA 37:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 37:11"/>Hianagi zamavufagama anterami'za nemaniza vahe'mo'za ana mopa erisanti hare'za musena hu'za nemani'za, maka zampina knare hu'za manigahaze. <verse eid="PSA 37:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 37:12"/>Hagi kefo zamavu'zmava'ma nehaza vahe'mo'za Anumzamofoma amage'ma nentaza vahe' zmahenaku kea oku'a ananeki'za, zamarimpa ahenezmante'za, zamavera aninkreki nehaze. <verse eid="PSA 37:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 37:13"/>Hianagi Ra Anumzamo'a ana vahekura zamagiza nere. Na'ankure zamagri'ma keagama huzmantesia knamo'a ne-eankino, Agra antahino keno hu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 37:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 37:14"/>Hanki zamunte omane vahe'ene, vahe'ma havigema hu'za zamazeri havizama nehaza vahe'ene, fatgo avu'ava'ma nehaza vahe'mokizmia, kefo avu'ava'ma nehaza vahe'mo'za zamahe frinaku kazinknozmia hefiza zamazampi eneri'za, kevea atifi erinte'za atia eri krikraranepaze. <verse eid="PSA 37:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 37:15"/>Hianagi zamagri'a bainati kazinknomo tumozmi reragino zamaregahie. Ana nehanigeno ati zmimo'a hantagigahie. <verse eid="PSA 37:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 37:16"/>Fatgo avu'ava'ma nehuno osi'a feno ante'zamo'a, kefo avu'ava zanteti'ma feno vahe'ma mani nomani'zana agatere'ne. <verse eid="PSA 37:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 37:17"/>Na'ankure kefo avu'ava'ma nehia vahe'mofo hihamua eri amne nehie. Hianagi Ra Anumzamo'a Agri amage'ma nentaza vahera kegava hunezmante. <verse eid="PSA 37:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 37:18"/>Hagi hazenkezmima omne vahera Ra Anumzamo'a kegava hunezmantenige'za, mevavama hania zantamina erisanti haregahaze. <verse eid="PSA 37:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 37:19"/>Hanki havi knama esige'za ana vahe'mo'za zamagra zamagakura nosu'za, agatonto knafina rama'a ne'za ante'ne'za negahaze. <verse eid="PSA 37:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 37:20"/>Hianagi kefo avu'ava'ma nehaza vahe'mo'za frigahaze. Hanki Ra Anumzamofo ha' vahe'mo'za traza amosre'agna hu'nazanki'za, kumo ome amne hiankna hu'za fanane hugahaze. <verse eid="PSA 37:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 37:21"/>Hagi kefo avu'ava'ma nehaza vahe'mo'za zagoa kehu'za erite'za, ete ome nozamize. Hianagi fatgo avu'ava'ma nehaza vahe'mo'za muse hu'za keonke zana vahera nezamize. <verse eid="PSA 37:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 37:22"/>Hagi Ra Anumzamo'ma asomu'ma hunezmantesia vahe'mo'za mopa erisanti haregahazanagi, Ra Anumzamo'ma kazusima huzmantesia vahe'mo'za frigahaze. <verse eid="PSA 37:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 37:23"/>Fatgo zamavu'zmava'ma nehaza vahe'mo'zama vanoma nehazageno'a, Ra Anumzamo'a kegava hunezmanteno nomani'zazmigura musena nehie. <verse eid="PSA 37:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 37:24"/>Zamagra tanafa hugahazanagi, trakara hu'za zamasenia reofragegahaze. Na'ankure Ra Anumzamo'a zmazante zamazerigahie. <verse eid="PSA 37:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 37:25"/>Hanki mofavrereti'ma manime e'na menima ozafama emeroana, Ra Anumzamo'a fatgo avu'ava'ma nehie vahera amefira huomige, zamatregeno ana vahe'mofo mofavreramimo'za ne'zankura upara nehu'za memea hu'za vano osu'naze. <verse eid="PSA 37:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 37:26"/>Hanki fatgo zamavu'zmava'ma nehaza vahe'mo'za muse nehu'za keonke'zana vahera nezamizageno, mofavrezmia asomura hunezmante. <verse eid="PSA 37:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 37:27"/>Hanki kefo avu'ava zampinti'ma atrenka rukrahe hunka fatgo avu'ava zama hanunka, manivava hugahane. <verse eid="PSA 37:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 37:28"/>Na'ankure Ra Anumzamo'a fatgoma huno refkoma hu'zanku ave'nesiankino, fatgo avu'ava'ma nehia vahera amefira huomigahie. Agra knare huno kegava huzmantenige'za knare hu'za manivava hugahaze. Hianagi kefo avu'ava'ma nehia vahe'mofo mofavreramina zamahefri hana hugahie. <verse eid="PSA 37:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 37:29"/>Fatgo avu'ava'ma nehaza vahe'mo'za mopa erisanti hare'za manivava hugahaze. <verse eid="PSA 37:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 37:30"/>Fatgo avu'ava'ma nehaza vahe'mokizmia, zmagipintira knare antahi'zana atineramigeno, knare avu'avazane kefo avu'avazanema keama'ma hu'zana rempi hunezmie. <verse eid="PSA 37:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 37:31"/>Hagi Anumzamofo kasegemo zamagu'afina avite'neankino, hazaonkre Anumzamofona amage ante fatgo hugahaze. <verse eid="PSA 37:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 37:32"/>Hagi kefo avu'ava'ma nehaza vahe'mo'za kafo ante'za mani'neza, fatgo avu'ava'ma nehaza vahe zamahe frinaku kankamunku nehakaze. <verse eid="PSA 37:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 37:33"/>Hianagi Ra Anumzamo'a zamatrenige'za ana kefo avu'ava'ma nehaza vahe'mo'za hunaku'ma nehazazana osuge, fatgo avu'ava'ma nehaza vahe'mo'zama keagare'ma oti'nageno'a, zamazahinke'za keagafina zamazeri zamagate'oregahaze. <verse eid="PSA 37:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 37:34"/>Ra Anumzamofonte kamentintia nehunka, Agri avu'avaza'ma'a nevararigeno, rankagi negamino mopa kamigahie. Hagi negesankeno kefo avu'ava'ma nehaza vahe'mo'za haviza hugahaze. <verse eid="PSA 37:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 37:35"/>Hagi vahe'ma ha'ma renezmantaza vahe'mo'za, knare mopafima zafamo'ma afovage huno hageno mareriankna hu'za knare nomani'za nemanizage'na negoe. <verse eid="PSA 37:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 37:36"/>Hianagi mago'a knama evutege'na, ana kefo avu'ava'ene vahetmima nemanizare'ma ome koana, nomanizanki ko fanane nehaze. Ana'ma hazage'na ana vahetminku'ma hake'na vanoma huana nozamagoe. <verse eid="PSA 37:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 37:37"/>Hagi tamage kege nehu'za, fatgo avu'vazama nehu'za, zamarimpa fruma hu'za nemaniza vahe'mokizmi naga'mo'za henka knare hugahaze. <verse eid="PSA 37:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 37:38"/>Hianagi kefo zamavu'zmava'ma nehaza vahera zamahe fanane hanige'za, vahera zamagripintira fore hu'za ovugahaze. <verse eid="PSA 37:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 37:39"/>Hianagi Ra Anumzamo'a Agri'ma amage'ma nentaza vahera zamagu'nevazino hazenke knafina kegava hunezmante. <verse eid="PSA 37:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 37:40"/>Ra Anumzamo'a fatgo avu'ava'zama nehaza vahera zamaza nehuno, kefo avu'ava'ma nehaza vahe'mokizmi zamazampintira zamagu'vazige'za so'e hu'za nemanize. Na'ankure zamagra Agripinka fra'maki'za nemanizagu anara nehie.<verse eid="PSA 37:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 37"/>
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="PSA 38"/>
  <para style="s">Ra Anumzamoka kamefira huonamio huno hunte'nea zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 38:1"/>Ra Anumzamoka krimpa ahenantenka kea onasuge, karimpa ahenantenka knazana naminka nazeri fatgo hugera osuo! <verse eid="PSA 38:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 38:2"/>Keve ka'anura nahankeno nagu'a unefregenka, kazanura rentrako hunka narehapanetine. <verse eid="PSA 38:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 38:3"/>Krimpama ahenantana zamo higena kria enerugeno, kuminimo higeno zaferinanimo'a natanegrie. <verse eid="PSA 38:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 38:4"/>Na'ankure kumini'mo'a ome ra huno nazeri agateregeno, kna'amo'a narerari nehie. <verse eid="PSA 38:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 38:5"/>Nagri'a neginagi navu'navazamo higeno hi'mnage namumo'a navufgarega tusiza huno hantohanto nehie. <verse eid="PSA 38:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 38:6"/>Hagi tusi nata negrige'na pripri hu'na vano nehu'na, maka kna natagura nehu'na zavi krafa nehue. <verse eid="PSA 38:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 38:7"/>Hagi namagenamo'a teve ha' nehuno, natanegrige'na kri e'nerue. <verse eid="PSA 38:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 38:8"/>Ana nehuno hankaveni'a omnege'na tusiza hu'na havizantfa hue. Nagu'afinti'ma natamagria zamo hige'na kragira neruna krafa nehue. <verse eid="PSA 38:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 38:9"/>Ra Anumzamoka, nagri'ma navesi'a zana maka Kagra ko' kenka antahinka hu'nane. Kragi'ma nerua zana Kagra nentahine. <verse eid="PSA 38:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 38:10"/>Tumo'nimo'a fakro fakro nehigeno, hankaveni'a nomanegeno, navuragamo'a asu nehie. <verse eid="PSA 38:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 38:11"/>Hagi zamavesima nezmantoa vahe'mo'zane, aronenimo'zanena, kri ruvazirante zankure hu'za koro nehu'za afete nemanize. Nagri'a koramo'zanena anagege nehu'za afete nemanize. <verse eid="PSA 38:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 38:12"/>Hagi ha' vahe'nimo'za nahenaku krifua anagintere nehazageno, nagri'ma nazeri haviza hunaku'ma nehaza vahe'mo'za, maka zupa nagri'ma nazeri havizama hanaza keagage retro nehaze. <verse eid="PSA 38:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 38:13"/>Nagra agesa ankanire vahe'mo'ma nehiaza hu'na kea nontahi'na, kema nosia vahe'mo'ma agi'ma hamunkino maniaza hu'noe. <verse eid="PSA 38:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 38:14"/>Nagra zamagesa ankanire vahe'mo'zama nehazaza hu'na kea nontahi'na kenona huozamante'noe. <verse eid="PSA 38:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 38:15"/>Ra Anumzamoka kavega ante'na mani'noanki, Kagra kenona hunanto. Kagra Ra Anumzana nagri Anumza mani'nane. <verse eid="PSA 38:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 38:16"/>Nagra amanage hu'na nunamuna hu'na kasmi'noe, zamatrege'za ha' vahe'nimo'za traka'ma hanua zankura nagizana nere'za musena osiho hu'na kasami'noe. <verse eid="PSA 38:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 38:17"/>Na'ankure nata zamo'a mevava huno nevige'na, traka hu'za nehue. <verse eid="PSA 38:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 38:18"/>Hianagi nagra kefo avu'ava'zama hu'noa zana huama hu'na negasami'na, tusi nasunku nehue. <verse eid="PSA 38:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 38:19"/>Hagi hankavemati'za ha'ma renenantaza ha' vahe'nimo'za agafa'a omne zante zamago ate'nenantaze. <verse eid="PSA 38:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 38:20"/>Knare avu'ava'ma huzmantorera kefo avu'ava zanu nona hunante'naze. Na'ankure nagra knare avu'ava nehuge'za ha'renantaze <verse eid="PSA 38:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 38:21"/>Ra Anumzana nagri Ra Anumzamoka onatrege, natrenka afetera vugera osuo. <verse eid="PSA 38:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 38:22"/>Ra Anumzana nagu'vazi Anumzamoka ame hunka eme nazahuo.<verse eid="PSA 38:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 38"/>
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="PSA 39"/>
  <para style="s">Devitima knama manino'ma vania knagu hunte'nea zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 39:1"/>Nagra amanage hu'noe, kema hanufina kegava hu'ne'na, kema hu'zampintira kumira osugosue. Hagi Anumzamofoma amage'ma nontaza vahe'enema mani'nenuna, nagra nagira reaka hu'na kea osugosue. <verse eid="PSA 39:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 39:2"/>Hianagi nagra akohena nemanina knare zanku'ma nagima hamunki'na kema osu'na nemnugeno'a, narimpa kanazamo'a ome ra nehie. <verse eid="PSA 39:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 39:3"/>Ana zanku'ma antahintahima nehugeno'a, narimpa he'zamo'a teve arukru nehigeno, kema hu'zanimo'a amare amare nehie. <verse eid="PSA 39:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 39:4"/>Ra Anumzamoka nama'a kna ama mopafina mani'na vugahufi hunagesa huo. Mani'nama vanuankna hamprinka ketenka nasmio. Na'ankure knanimo'a tusiza huno aganere. <verse eid="PSA 39:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 39:5"/>Hagi kasefa hu'nama manisuankna eri atupa hankeno, Kagri kavurera amnezankna hie. Hagi vahe'motama tasimu'ma erita mani'zamo'a, magoke asimu'ma anteankna nehie. <verse eid="PSA 39:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 39:6"/>Hagi tagra zagemo'ma rentegeno vahe'mofo ame'ma'ama fore'ma hiaza hu'nonankita, amuhoma huta eritruma hu'na zamo'a amnezankna nehie. Fenoma eritruma nehuna zana, ina vahe'mo erisantiharegahie ontahineta eritru nehune. <verse eid="PSA 39:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 39:7"/>Hianagi menina nagra izanku amuhara hugahue? Nagra Kagriteke namentintia nehu'na amuhara nehue. <verse eid="PSA 39:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 39:8"/>Hanki kumini'afintira nagu'nevazinka, atregeno neginagi vahe'mo'za kizazokago kea huonanteho. <verse eid="PSA 39:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 39:9"/>Hagi nagira hamunki'na kea osu manigahue. Na'ankure Kagra knazana nenamine. <verse eid="PSA 39:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 39:10"/>Hianagi muse hugantoanki knazama nenamina zana hanki eritro. Hazenkema namina zamo'a tusiza huno nazeri haviza hianki natro. <verse eid="PSA 39:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 39:11"/>Hagi kumi'ma huna zante'ma knazama tamina zamo'a, zago'amo marerirfa zama antenonkeno hakanomo'ma tragama hiankna huno, tazeri haviza nehie. Maka vahe'mota tagra asimu'ma antegeno'ma vahe'mofo agipinti'ma amu'ma atiramiankna hu'nonankita, ame huta fanane hugahune. <verse eid="PSA 39:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 39:12"/>Ra Anumzamoka nunamuni'a antahio! Naza huogu'ma zavi'ma netoana krafageni'a antahinamio! Zavi'ma netogeno'ma navunumo'ma nehiazana keamnea osuo. Na'ankure nagra nantu vahekna hu'na ama mopafina e'noankina nagehemo'zama hu'nazaza hu'na ko fri'na vugahue. <verse eid="PSA 39:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 39:13"/>Hanki karimpama ahenenantana zana natrege'na, osi'a knafina musena hu'na mani'nena fri'na va'neno.<verse eid="PSA 39:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 39"/>
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="PSA 40"/>
  <para style="s">Anumzamo'ma azahanigu Deviti kre'nea zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 40:1"/>Hagi Ra Anumzamo'ma nzama hanigura akohe'na avega ante'na mani'nogeno, Agra rukrahe hunamino zavi krafageni'a antahi'ne. <verse eid="PSA 40:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 40:2"/>Ana nehuno hapake kerifima antahintahi hakarema nehu'na mani'nogeno, navazu husga huno havere nantege'na, oti hankaveti'na oti'noe. <verse eid="PSA 40:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 40:3"/>Ana huteno Anumzantimofo agima erisgama hu' zagamera kasefa zagame nami'ne. E'ina hu'neana vahe'mo'zama nege'za Ra Anumzamofoma koro'ma hunte'za Agrite'ma zamentintima hanagu anara hu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 40:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 40:4"/>Hanki zamavufaga rama nehaza vahete'ene havi anumzante'ma zamentintima nehaza vahete'ma amema renti osuno, Ra Anumzamofonte'ma amentintima hanimo'a, agra muse hugahie. <verse eid="PSA 40:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 40:5"/>Ra Anumzana nagri Anumzamoka vahe'mota osugaza rama'a hentofa zantamina hurante'nane. Tagri'ma hurante'nana zantmimofo antahintahima retro'ma huntenana antahintahia, rama'agino avompina krentegara osu'ne. Hanki mago vahe'mo'a kagri knara osu'ne. Kagrama hentofa zantmima hu'nana zantmima hampri'nama kesuana ana makara hampri vagaoregosue. <verse eid="PSA 40:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 40:6"/>Hagi kresramnama nevuno ofama hu zankura musena nosane. Hanki menina nazeri ani hanke'na antahi ani' hue. Kagra tevefima kre fananehu ofane kumi ofagura nantahinonkane. <verse eid="PSA 40:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 40:7"/>Hagi anante nagra amanage hu'noe, ko, Nagra ama oe. Anumzamofo avontafepina nagriku hu'za avona krente'naze. <verse eid="PSA 40:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 40:8"/>Anumzanimoka kagri kavesi'ma avaririzanku muse nehue. Hagi kasegeka'amo'a tumonifi me'ne. <verse eid="PSA 40:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 40:9"/>Nagra fatgo kavukava zanka'a eri fraraoki'na, ana maka vaheka'a zamasami'noe. Ra Anumzamoka Kagra kenka antahinka hu'nane, nagra vahekura korora hu'na nagira hamunki'na omani'noanki vahe'ma zmagu'ma vazi'nana zana huama hu'na vahe kevua zamasmi'noe. <verse eid="PSA 40:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 40:10"/>Hagi fatgo kavukava'ma nehana zanka'a nagu'afina atrogenora frakino omne'ne. Hanki kema hu'nana kere'ma amage'ma antenka vahe'ma zamagu'ma nevazina hihamuka'amofo agenkea eriama hu'na zamasmi'noe. Hagi tusi'a vahekrerfa mani'nazafi eriama hu'na vagaore kavesi zamofone, kema hu'nana kere'ma otinenka ana zama hu kavukavara eriama hu'na zamasmi'noe. <verse eid="PSA 40:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 40:11"/>Hanki Ra Anumzamoka, kasunkuma hunenantana zana azeorinka, vagaore kavesizane ke'ma hunana kere'ma amage'ma antenka ana zama hu kavukava zamo'a kegava hunantegahie. <verse eid="PSA 40:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 40:12"/>Na'ankure ohampriga'a hazenkemo kaginante'ne. Hagi kuminimo'a agonagna huno marerineno kama vanuankana rehiza hunantenege'na, ke'zanku nehue. Ana nehu'na kuminimofo nampamo'a nasenifima me'nea zamo'a nazokamofo nampana azeri agateregeno hankaveni'a omne amne hie. <verse eid="PSA 40:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 40:13"/>Hanki Ra Anumzamoka muse hugantoanki nagu'vazio! Ra Anumzamoka ame hunka enka nazahuo! <verse eid="PSA 40:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 40:14"/>Hanki nagri'ma nahe frinaku'ma nehaza vahe'mo'za zamagazegu nehanageno antahintahizmimo'a savari hugahie. Hanki hazenkefima mani'noge'zama musema nehaza vahe'mo'za zamagazegu hugahaze. <verse eid="PSA 40:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 40:15"/>Hanki hunte'za nagiza nere'za, ehe ehe! hu'zama nehaza vahe'mo'za zamagazegu hugahaze. <verse eid="PSA 40:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 40:16"/>Hianagi maka vahe'mo'za Kagri'ma negavaririza vahe'mo'za Kagri'enena muse hu'za manigahaze. Kagrama zamagu'mavazi'nana zanku'ma zamave'nesia vahe'mo'za, Ra Anumzamo'a marerisa Anumza mani'ne hu'za hiho. <verse eid="PSA 40:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 40:17"/>Hanki nagra namunte omne kne mani'noankino, Ra Anumzamo'a nagrikura agesa antahinami vava nehie. Ra Anumzanimoka Kagra nazahu ne'maninka nagu'vazi ne' mani'nananki, ame hunka eme nazahuo.<verse eid="PSA 40:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 40"/>
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="PSA 41"/>
  <para style="s">Deviti kre'nea zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 41:1"/>Hagi zamunte omne vahe'ma knare zamavu'zmava'ma hunezmantaza vahera hazenke zama esigeno'a, Ra Anumzamo'a zamagu'vazigahie. <verse eid="PSA 41:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 41:2"/>Ra Anumzamo'a zamagu nevazino zamaza hanige'za ofri'za knare hu'za manigahaze. Ana nehuno zamaza hanige'za maka zama hanaza zamo'a knare nehinkeno, ha' vahe'mo'zama zamahenaku'ma hanageno'a zamagu'vazigahie. <verse eid="PSA 41:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 41:3"/>Hagi krima erizageno'a, Ra Anumzamo'a kegava hunezmanteno krizmia zamazeri negnamare. <verse eid="PSA 41:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 41:4"/>Ra Anumzamokarega nunamuna nehuanki kasunku hunantenka nazeri kanamaro. Na'ankure osuo hunkama hu'nana kumi hu'noe. <verse eid="PSA 41:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 41:5"/>Hianagi ha' vahe'nimo'za huhaviza hunante'za amanage nehaze, nazupa frinigeta tagera akanigahune? <verse eid="PSA 41:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 41:6"/>Zamagra ronenimo'zama nantu'ma ante'nantazankna hu'za nantu ante nante'nazanagi, havigema hu'za nagenkema hanagu nanekea emerite'za vu'za nagenkea ome hugantikma nehaze. <verse eid="PSA 41:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 41:7"/>Zamago'ma ante'nenantaza vahe'mo'za nazeri haviza hu kea sumi sumi hu'za nanekea ananeki'za, <verse eid="PSA 41:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 41:8"/>agra havi kri erino tafe'arera mase'neankino onkanamregosie hu'za nehaze. <verse eid="PSA 41:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 41:9"/>Knare aronenima mani'negena antahima nemina, magopinti'ma ne'zama neno'a vahe'mo'a amefi hunenamie. <verse eid="PSA 41:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 41:10"/>Hianagi Ra Anumzamoka kasunku hunantenka krini'a nazeri knamrege'na ana vahera nona huzmantaneno. <verse eid="PSA 41:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 41:11"/>Nazama hananke'na ha' vahe'ni'ama ha'ma huzmagateresu'na, Kagra muse hunenantane hu'na hugahue. <verse eid="PSA 41:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 41:12"/>Ra Anumzamoka nagrira hazenkeni'a omne vahe mani'nogu hunka, maka zupa kavuga nantanke'na mani' vava nehue. <verse eid="PSA 41:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 41:13"/>Ra Anumzana Israeli vahe Anumzana mani'neno manivava Anumzanki, huta agi'a ahentesga hanune. Tamage, tamage.<verse eid="PSA 41:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 41"/>
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="PSA 42"/>
  <para style="s">Namba 2 zagame avontafere</para>
  <para style="s">Anumzamo zamaza hanigu Kora naga'mo'za hunte'naza zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 42:1"/>Dia afumo'ma tinku'ma ave'nesigeno tinku'ma hakeno vanoma nehiaza hu'na Anumzamokagura nagu'amo'a tusiza huno ave'nesie. <verse eid="PSA 42:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 42:2"/>Tinku'ma ave'nesigenoma hiaza huno nagu'amo'a kasefa'ma huno mani'nea Anumzamofonkura nave'nesige'na nazupa agri avurera vugahue hu'na nagesa nentahue. <verse eid="PSA 42:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 42:3"/>Hanine zagenena zavi'ma netogeno navunuma hiazamo'a nezaniagna nehigeno, ha' vahenimo'za hu'za kagri Anumzana iga mani'ne? hu'za hu'naze. <verse eid="PSA 42:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 42:4"/>Hagi mono'ma hunegantona knare'ma, ko'ma vahe kevuma zamavare'na mono nonka'afima, nevuge'zama zagamema hu'za musenkasema nehaza zanku'ma nagesa nentahugeno, tumonimo'a netanie. <verse eid="PSA 42:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 42:5"/>Hagi nagafare nagu'amo'a kna nehie? Nagafare tumo'nimo'a netanege'na nasunkura nehue? Nagra Anumzamokare namentintia nehuanki'na, Agrama nagu'mavazi'nea zanku agia ahentesga hugahue. <verse eid="PSA 42:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 42:6"/>Hagi menina nagu'amo'a kna nehianagi, Jodani mopafima ogantuma me'nea Hemoni agonare'ene Misa agonare mani'nena Anumzanimokagura nagesa antahimigahue. <verse eid="PSA 42:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 42:7"/>Hagi hagerimo'ma knafu knafu'ma huno agasasama neriankna huno, knazamo'a eme narefinete. <verse eid="PSA 42:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 42:8"/>Hianagi mago mago kna Ra Anumzamo'a vagaore avesizama'areti avesinentege'na, mago mago kenegera zagamera hu'na agia erisga nehu'na, nasimu'ma namige'nama mani'noa Anumzamofontega nunamuna nehue. <verse eid="PSA 42:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 42:9"/>Hagi nagra Anumzanimofontega krafagea hu'na, Anumzanimoka hankave havegani'a mani'nananki, nahigenka kagerakaninenantane? Na'a hige'za ha' vahenimo'za nazeri haviza nehazage'na nasuzampina vano nehue? <verse eid="PSA 42:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 42:10"/>Hagi maka kna ha' vahenimo'zama kefinti'ma nazeri haviza nehu'za, iga Anumzanka'a mani'ne hu'zama haza zamo'a zaferinani'a ruhantagi'za rufuzafunepaze. <verse eid="PSA 42:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 42:11"/>Nahigeno nagu'amo'a kna huno evuneramie? Hagi nahige'na nasuzampina mani'na nevue? Nagra Anumzamo'ma nazama hanigu amuhara hugahue! Nagu'mavazi ne', Anumzanimofona mago'ene zagamera hu'na agia erisga hugahie.<verse eid="PSA 42:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 42"/>
  <chapter number="43" style="c" sid="PSA 43"/>
  <para style="s">Anumzamofo masane tamage naneke'agu hunte'nea zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 43:1"/>Anumzanimoka nagrikura fatgo avu'ava'ane ne' mani'ne hunka vahepina huama huo. Kagri'ma nogavariri'za vahe'mo'zama keagama hunenantenagenka nagri kazika antenka nazahu keaga hunka naza huo. Fatgo huzama refkoma nosaza vahe'mo'zama havigema hunentazana nagu'vazio. <verse eid="PSA 43:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 43:2"/>Na'ankure Anumzanimoka Kagra fraki vihuni'a mani'nane. Nahigenka natufetranke'za, ha' vahe'mo'za knazana nenamizage'na nasuzampina vanovano nehue? <verse eid="PSA 43:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 43:3"/>Hagi Anumzamoka masazanka'ane tamage nanekeka'a atregeno kana naveri huno navareno ruotge agonaka'a, Saionima nemanintega vino. <verse eid="PSA 43:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 43:4"/>E'ina'ma hnanke'na kre sramanavu itaka'are vu'na nazeri musema nehana Anumzanimoka hapu zavena ome ahe'na zagamera hu'na kagia erisga hugahue. <verse eid="PSA 43:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 43:5"/>Nahigeno nagu'amo'a kna huno evuneramie? Hagi nahige'na nasuzampina mani'na nevue? Nagra Anumzamo'ma nazama hanigu amuhara hugahue! Nagu'mavazi'nea Anumzanimofona mago'ene zagamera hu'na agia erisga hugahue.<verse eid="PSA 43:5"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 43"/>
  <chapter number="44" style="c" sid="PSA 44"/>
  <para style="s">Anumzamo'ma aza hanigu asunte'nea zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 44:1"/>Anumzamoka korapa'ma nazano tagehe'mokizmima huzmante'nana zana ko tasamizageta tagra tagesafinti antahi'none. <verse eid="PSA 44:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 44:2"/>Kagra hihamu ka'anu ama mopafima nemaniza vahetmina zamahe kasope netrenka, ana maka mopafina tagehemokizmia avimazavi hankreankna hanke'za mani'naze. Kagra ha' vahetia zamahe hana hanke'za ama mopa tagehe'moza eri'za knare hu'za mani'naze. <verse eid="PSA 44:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 44:3"/>Hagi tagehemo'za bainati kazintetira ha' vahera harahu zamagatere'za ama mopa e'ori'naze. Huge zamagra'a hankaverera hara hu zamagateore'naze. Hanki Kagri hankavenentake tamaga kazamo'ene kavugosafinti masamo zamaza hu'ne. Na'ankure Kagra kavesizmante'nane. <verse eid="PSA 44:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 44:4"/>Kagra nagri kini mani'nenka, nagri Anumzana mani'nane. Kagra hanke'za Israeli vahe'mo'za ha' vahe'zmia hara huzmagatere'naze. <verse eid="PSA 44:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 44:5"/>Kagri hankavefi ha' vahetia hara huta zamatufeta ometre emetre nehuta, Kagri kagireti ha'ma hurantenaku'ma hanaza vahera zamagofetura tagia reta zmare hapakopatigahune. <verse eid="PSA 44:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 44:6"/>Hagi atini'agura antahinomi'na, kazinknoni'amo'a nagu'vazigahie hu'na amuhara hunomue. <verse eid="PSA 44:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 44:7"/>Na'ankure Kagrake'za taza hanketa, ha' vahetia hara huzmagaterenone. E'ina hunka zamavaresrama hunerantaza vahera zamazeri zamagaze hu'nane. <verse eid="PSA 44:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 44:8"/>Hagi maka kna nanterantetima vuno kinagama omeseana Anumzamokagu akagia nereta, zagamera huta kagia erisga nehune. <verse eid="PSA 44:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 44:9"/>Hagi menina kamefi huraminka tatrankeno ha' vahe'mo'za tazeri tagaze nehaze. Ko'ma ha'ma hunaku'ma nevunkenkama nehanaza hunka tagri'enena hatera vunka ome taza nosane. <verse eid="PSA 44:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 44:10"/>Hagi tatranketa ha' vahetimofo koro nefronke'za, ha' vahetimo'za rohu eme tre'za keonke'zantia e'nerize. <verse eid="PSA 44:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 44:11"/>Hagi tatrankeno ha' vahe'mo'za sipisipi afu'ma ahe'za nenaku'ma hiankna hu'za nerahe'za tahe panani hazageta vahe mopafina hazagreta umani emani hu'none. <verse eid="PSA 44:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 44:12"/>Hagi marerifa vaheka'a osi'a zagore atrenka mago zagoa retrora osu'nane. <verse eid="PSA 44:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 44:13"/>Kagra tatranke'za tava'ontire'ma nemaniza vahe'mo'za kiza zokago kea hurante'naze. Hagi tagri mopa atupa ometre emetrema hu'neregama manigagi'naza vahe'mo'za kizazokago ke hunerante'za tazeri haviza nehaze. <verse eid="PSA 44:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 44:14"/>Tagrira kizazokago ke hunteza tazeri retro hanke'za, zamagena neru'za kizazokago hurante'za tazeri fenkami netraze. <verse eid="PSA 44:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 44:15"/>Maka kna hugeforenenantazage'na, tusi nagazegu nehu'na vano nehue. <verse eid="PSA 44:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 44:16"/>Hagi maka kema antahunana kizazokago kema hurantaza kege nentahita, ha' vahetimo'zama nonama hu'za ha'ma hurante'zama nehaza zanke negone. <verse eid="PSA 44:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 44:17"/>Kagrira tamefira hugamita huhagerafi huvempa keka'a ha'ontaginonanagi, ama ana zantamimo'a tagritera fore nehie. <verse eid="PSA 44:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 44:18"/>Tagra Kagrira tamefira hunegamita kana atreta havi kampina ovu'none. <verse eid="PSA 44:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 44:19"/>Hianagi tahenka tazeri haviza hutranketa afi kramofo kumapi nemanune. Ana nehunka frizamofo hanizanu refitenerantane. <verse eid="PSA 44:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 44:20"/>Hagi tagrama Anumzantimofo agima aheta mono'ma huontege, tazama rusuteta ru vahe' anumzamofontegama nunamuma hunesunkeno'a, <verse eid="PSA 44:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 44:21"/>tamage huno anazana Anumzamo'a keno antahino hu'ne, na'ankure Anumzamo'a Agra tagu'afima oku'ma me'nea zana keno antahino hu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 44:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 44:22"/>Hianagi Kagri vahe'ma mani'nona kazigati maka kna tagrira tahe nefrize. Sipisipi afu'ma ahenaku'ma reharino'ma viaza hu'za rehari'za tavre'za nevaze <verse eid="PSA 44:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 44:23"/>Hagi Ra Anumzamoka otinka taza huo! Nahigenka kavura nevasane? Kagera kanirante vava osunka otinka tazahuo. <verse eid="PSA 44:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 44:24"/>Nahigenka ke'amnea nehane? Tatama tami'za tazeri havizama nehazageta knafima mani'nonana nahigenka Anumzamoka ontage vahe knara nehane? <verse eid="PSA 44:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 44:25"/>Tagu'amo'a tamino mopafi runtrako higeno, tavufgamo'a avugosaregati mopafi runtrako huno mase. <verse eid="PSA 44:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 44:26"/>Anumzantimoka otinka taza huo! Vagaore kavesizanku hunka nona hunka mizasenka tavro.<verse eid="PSA 44:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 44"/>
  <chapter number="45" style="c" sid="PSA 45"/>
  <para style="s">Anumzamofo kini tramo'a mevava hugahie huno hunte'nea zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 45:1"/>Hentofa naneke antahintahifina nentahugeno, nagu'a nazeri otie. Ana hentofa nanekea kini neku hu'na kregahue. Na'ankure nagefunamo'a avoma kre'are'ma knarezantfama hu'naza vahe'mokizmi avo azotagna hu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 45:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 45:2"/>Kagra hentofa ne' mani'nane. Kagipinti fru huno knare nanekege atineramie. E'ina agafare Anumzamo'a asomura hugante vava nehie. <verse eid="PSA 45:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 45:3"/>Hankavenentake ha' nera bainati kazinka'a erinka kasoparega atregeno uramino! Kagrira hihamu masaka'amo kagatere'nea ne' mani'nane. <verse eid="PSA 45:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 45:4"/>Masanentake hihamuka'ane vunka tamage nanekegu'ma, agu'ama anteramino mani'zanku'ma, fatgoma huno refkoma hu avu'avakura hara ome huo. Ana nehunka atregeno, tamaga kzamo'a ruzahukna kaguvazana eri fore hinke'za keho. <verse eid="PSA 45:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 45:5"/>Keveka'aramimo'a agona hu'neankino ha' vaheka'aramimofo tumotmina ahe neragie. Ana nehanke'za maka kokankoka vahe'mo'za kagafinke evuneramize. <verse eid="PSA 45:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 45:6"/>Anumzamoka kini traka'amo'a mevava hugahie. Fatgoma huno keagama refkoma nehana azompaka'anu vahera kegava nehane. <verse eid="PSA 45:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 45:7"/>Kagra fatgoma huno keagama refkoma hu zanku kave'nesinka kefo avu'avazankura kavesra nehane. E'ina hu'negu Anumzana Kagri Anumzamo'a masavena kasenifina tagino kazeri ruotgera nehuno, musezamofo masavena mago'a vahera rugatereno kagritera rama'a taginte'ne. <verse eid="PSA 45:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 45:8"/>Hagi merema nehaza mnazamofo mnama, aloveramofo mnama, kasiema nehaza zamofo mnamo'a kini vahe'mo'za za'za kukenaka'a eri mnanentake hugahie. Hagi elefanti aveteti'ma kinte'naza kini vahe kumapina strini nofite'ma rente'za nehaza zavena nehe'za kazeri muse nehaze. <verse eid="PSA 45:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 45:9"/>Kini ne'mofo mofa'nemoza agima me'nea anene mani'naze. Hagi kuini a'mo'a Ofiri kumateti eri'naza golireti trohu'naza zantaminu avasasea hu'neno kazantamaga kaziga oti'ne. <verse eid="PSA 45:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 45:10"/>Kini netema maniku'ma nehana mofamoka kama kagesa antenenka antahio. Keonke zagaka'ama kumaka'aregama zamatrenka e'nanana kagekanio. <verse eid="PSA 45:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 45:11"/>Na'ankure negave'a, kini ne'mo'a hentofa kagikagonagura tusiza huno avesinegante. Agra ranka'a mani'negu ke'a antahiminka amage anto. <verse eid="PSA 45:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 45:12"/>Hagi Tairi kumateti musezantmina eri'za eme negami'nageno, feno vahe'mo'za kagrama zamazama hananku anara hugahaze. <verse eid="PSA 45:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 45:13"/>Kini ne'mofo kasefa a'mo'a goliretima avama renenia za'za kukenama huno esigeno'a, avasase'amo'a tampre tampre hugahie. <verse eid="PSA 45:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 45:14"/>Ana avasase'ane kukena hunenige'za ana ara avre'za kini netera nevnageno avegama hu' mofaneramimo'za amage avarariza vugahaze. <verse eid="PSA 45:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 45:15"/>Maka vahe'mo'za tusi musenkase nehu'za kini ne'mofo kumapina ufregahaze. <verse eid="PSA 45:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 45:16"/>Kagri ne' mofavremo'za zmafahe'mozama hu'nazaza hu'za kini vahe manigahaze. Ana hanagenka ugagota kva vahe zamazeri otisanke'za, maka ama mopafina kva vahe manigahaze. <verse eid="PSA 45:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 45:17"/>Nagra rankagi kamisuge'za forehu anante anante'ma hu'za esaza vahe'mo'za, kagrira antahinegamiza rankagia kamivava hu'za vugahaze.<verse eid="PSA 45:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 45"/>
  <chapter number="46" style="c" sid="PSA 46"/>
  <para style="s">Anumzamo'a fraki kumati mani'ne hu'za Kora mofavre naga'mo'za hunte'naza zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 46:1"/>Anumzamo'a fraki vihutine hankavetine mani'neankino, hazenke knafima tazama hanigura maka kna retro huno nemanie. <verse eid="PSA 46:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 46:2"/>E'ina hu'neankita imima e'nerisigeno, agonamo'a ankariseno hageri amu'nompina vugahianagi, tagra korora osugahune. <verse eid="PSA 46:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 46:3"/>Hagerimo'a kranto kranto huno agrenkera nehanigeno, agonamo'a imina erino eri tore vare hugahianagi, tagra korora osugosune. <verse eid="PSA 46:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 46:4"/>Mago rantimo'a Anumzamofo rankumapi ufre efre huno Marerirfa Anumzamo'ma nemanifima me'nea zantamina tina zamino zamazeri muse nehie. <verse eid="PSA 46:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 46:5"/>Anumzamo'a e'i ana rankumapi nemaniankino, vahe'mo'za eri havizana osugahaze. Nanterama komatanigeno'a Anumzamo'a ana kumara kegava huno aza hugahie. <verse eid="PSA 46:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 46:6"/>Ama mopafima me'nea kumatamimpintira vahe'ma azeri agore hu agasasaneranigeno, kini vahe'mo'zama kegavama hu'naza kumatmimo'zanena fuzafupe'za amane zankna hugahaze. Hanki Anumzamo'ma ageru'ma aranigeno'a, tevemo'ma plastikima temramra'ma hiaza huno ama mopamo'a maramra hu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 46:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 46:7"/>Monafi sondia vahe'mokizmi Ra Anumzamo'a, tagrane magopi mani'ne. Jekopu Anumzamo'a tagrama frakita mani vihuti mani'ne. <verse eid="PSA 46:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 46:8"/>Eta Ra Anumzamo'ma ruzahu avu'avazama hiazana eme keho. Agra ra hazenke'za avreno, eno ama mopa eri haviza hie. <verse eid="PSA 46:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 46:9"/>Agra ama mopafina maka kaziga ha'ma nehaza zana eri netreno, atine, kevenena eri hantagi netreno, hankoramina teve hanavazino kre'ne. <verse eid="PSA 46:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 46:10"/>Tamagra tamagasasana eri taganeta akoheta mani'neta, Nagrikura Anumza mani'ne huta antahiho. Kokankoka vahe'mo'za nagesga hu'za ra nagi nenamisageno, ama mopafi vahe'mo'zanena nagesga hu'za ra nagi namigahaze. <verse eid="PSA 46:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 46:11"/>Monafi sondia vahe'mokizmi Ra Anumzamo'a, tagrane mani'ne. Jekopu Anumzamo'a frakita mani vihuti mani'ne.<verse eid="PSA 46:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 46"/>
  <chapter number="47" style="c" sid="PSA 47"/>
  <para style="s">Anumzamo'a maka vahe'mofo kini ne' mani'ne huno hunte'nea zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 47:1"/>Mika kokankoka vahe'mota tamazana nehetma, ranke huta muse zagamera nehutma hentofa Anumzamofona agi'a erisga hiho. <verse eid="PSA 47:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 47:2"/>Na'ankure Marerirfa Ra Anumzamo'a knare zantfa hu'nea Anumza mani'neankita, kore hunenteta agorga'a manigahune. Agra maka ama mopafina marerirfa kini ne' mani'neno, ama mopa kegava hu'ne! <verse eid="PSA 47:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 47:3"/>Agra kokankoka vahetmina hara huzmagatenereno ha' vahetia zamaheno eri tagafi atregeta, zamagofetu tagia reta oti'none. <verse eid="PSA 47:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 47:4"/>Anumzamo'a erisantima haresuna zana, huhamprirante'nea mopa tami'ne. Jekopu mofavreramima Anumzamo'ma avesima nezmantea naga'mo'zama erisantima nehare'za ra zamagima erisaza zantamina zami'ne. <verse eid="PSA 47:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 47:5"/>Kezati'za muse zagamera nehazageno, Anumzamo'a mareri'ne. Hagi ufena nerazageno, Ra Anumzamo'a anagamua mareri'ne. <verse eid="PSA 47:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 47:6"/>Zgame huta Anumzamofo agi'a erisga hiho. Zgame hiho. Zgame huta Kini netimofo agi'a erisga hiho! Zgame hiho. <verse eid="PSA 47:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 47:7"/>Na'ankure Anumzamo'a Agra maka ama mopafi vahe Kini mani'ne. Zgame avontafepima krente'naza zagame huta agi'a erisga hiho. <verse eid="PSA 47:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 47:8"/>Anumzamo'a manisga huno ruotge'ma hu'nea tra'are mani'neno, kokankoka vahera kegava hunezmante. <verse eid="PSA 47:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 47:9"/>Kokankoka vahe'mokizmi kva vahe'mo'za Abrahamu Anumzamofo naga'ene emeritru hu'naze. Na'ankure maka ama mopafi kini vahe'ma mani'nazana Anumzamofo vahe mani'naze. Ana hu'neanki'za Ra Anumzamofona agi'a ahentesga hugahaze.<verse eid="PSA 47:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 47"/>
  <chapter number="48" style="c" sid="PSA 48"/>
  <para style="s">Anumzamofo kuma Saioni ran kumaku asunte'nea zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 48:1"/>Ra Anumzana marerisa ne' mani'neankita Anumzantimofo rankumapina, Agri ruotge agonarera zagamera huta agi'a ahentesga hugahune. <verse eid="PSA 48:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 48:2"/>Hagi Anumzamofo agonamo'a, hentofaza huno mesga hu'nege'za, maka kokankoka vahe'mo'za kenakura tusi muse nehaze. Noti kaziga Saioni agonamo'a ruotge hu'neankino hentofaza hu'nea kini ne'mofo rankuma me'ne. <verse eid="PSA 48:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 48:3"/>Anumzamo'a ana kumapi mani'neno, Agra'a ana kumapinti eama huno kegava nehie. <verse eid="PSA 48:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 48:4"/>Hagi ama mopafi kini vahe'mo'za sondia vahezmia erimago hu'za ana rankumara hara hunte'naku urava'o nehaze. <verse eid="PSA 48:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 48:5"/>Hianagi e'zama eme nege'za antri nehu'za, tusi zamagogogu nehu'za, atre'za koro fre'naze. <verse eid="PSA 48:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 48:6"/>Zamagrira tusi zamahirahi nerege'za, a'nemo'za mofavre kasenteku zamatagu nehazankna hu'naze. <verse eid="PSA 48:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 48:7"/>Hagi kagra zage hanati kazigati hanavenentake zaho'mo Tasisi kumate hanave venterami eri tagana taganu vazitreankna hunka kagra zamahe vagare'nane. <verse eid="PSA 48:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 48:8"/>Ke'age nehazageta ana rankumamofo konarari'agura antahi'nonanagi, Monafi sondia vahe'mofo Ra Anumzamofo rankumara menina tagra tavufinti kone. E'i ana kumara tagri Anumzamofo rankumakino Agra'a kegava huvava hugahie. <verse eid="PSA 48:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 48:9"/>Anumzamoka mono nonka'afina mani'neta, vagaore kavesizantetima kavesinerantana zankura tagesa antahinegamune. <verse eid="PSA 48:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 48:10"/>Anumzamoka kagi'amo'ma hu'neaza hu'za zagame'ma hu'za kagima erisgama hanaza zamo'a mopa atumparega vuno eno hugahie. Hanavenentake tamaga kazampina fatgo avu'avazamo avite'ne. <verse eid="PSA 48:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 48:11"/>Saioni agonafi nemaniza veamo'za muse nehanage'za, Juda mopafima me'nea kumatamimpima nemaniza vahe'mo'za muse hiho. Na'ankure Kagra fatgo kavukvama hunka vahe'ma refkoma nehana kavukava zanku anara hugahaze. <verse eid="PSA 48:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 48:12"/>Saioni rankumara kaginka negenka, mani'neza kuma'ma kegavama nehaza za'za nontamima kinte'nazana hamprinka ko. <verse eid="PSA 48:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 48:13"/>Kuma vihuma kino mareri'nea zana negenka, fraki hankave vihu keginama hu'nea kumara ketenka, henkama efore hu'za esnaza vahera nanekea zamasmio. <verse eid="PSA 48:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 48:14"/>Na'ankure Anumzamo'a e'inahu hu'ne. Agra manivava Anumzanti mani'neankino, Agra kegava hurante'nenigeta manime vuta ufrigahune.<verse eid="PSA 48:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 48"/>
  <chapter number="49" style="c" sid="PSA 49"/>
  <para style="s">Hazenke knafima koro osnuna zagame asunte'nea zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 49:1"/>Nanekema hanuana maka vahe'motma nentahinkeno, ama mopafima mani'naza maka vahe'mo'zanena zamagesa ante'za antahiho! <verse eid="PSA 49:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 49:2"/>Marerifa vahe'ma, tami vahe'ma, feno vahe'ma, tamunte omne vahe'motanena antahiho! <verse eid="PSA 49:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 49:3"/>Na'ankure knare antahi'zamofo naneke huama nehugeno, nagu'afina antahi ama' hu antahizamo avite'ne. <verse eid="PSA 49:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 49:4"/>Nagra knare antahi'zamofo nanekegu nagesa ante'na nentahi'na, hapu zavena nehe'na, fraki nanekea zagamepi erinte ama hu'na hugahue. <verse eid="PSA 49:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 49:5"/>Hazenke zama ne-enigeno, ha' vahe'mo'zama eme navazagi kagisazana, nahanige'na nagra korora hugahue? <verse eid="PSA 49:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 49:6"/>Zamagra fenoma ante'naza zante zamentintia nehu'za, tusi zago fenoma ante'naza zanku zamavufa ra hu'za akagi neraze. <verse eid="PSA 49:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 49:7"/>Tagra antahi'none, mago vahe'mo'a frizampintira agra'a aguravazige, Anumzamofona atesinteno nefuna ovaregosie. <verse eid="PSA 49:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 49:8"/>Mago mizantetira vahe'mo'a atesino, agra'a agu'vazigara osu'ne. Na'ankure mago mizantetira mizaseno, <verse eid="PSA 49:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 49:9"/>frino onkasarino, manivava huno ovugosie. <verse eid="PSA 49:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 49:10"/>Negonke'za knare antahi'zane vahe'mo'za nefrizageno, ana hukna hu'za neginagi vahe'ene antahintahi omne vahe'mo'zanena nefrizage'za, ru vahe'mo'za ana vahe'mokizmi fenozana erisanti neharaze. <verse eid="PSA 49:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 49:11"/>Ana vahe'mo'za rama'a mopa eri'za zamagia ana mopazmirera asamregahazanagi, matimati'mo'a manivava nonkumazmi senige'za fri'za matipi umanigahaze. <verse eid="PSA 49:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 49:12"/>Hagi fenoma antene'za ra zamagima e'neriza vahe'mofo zamagimo'a zazatera meno ovugahianki, zagagafama fri fananema nehiaza hu'za fri'nageno, zamagimo'a fanane hugahie. <verse eid="PSA 49:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 49:13"/>Hagi knare vahe mani'none hu'za neginagi vahe'mo'zama nehaza vahete'ene, ana vahe'mokizmi kere'ma zamentintima nehaza vahete ama anazana fore hugahie. <verse eid="PSA 49:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 49:14"/>Sipisipi afute kva vahe'mo, sipisipi afutami zamavareno viaza huno fri'zamo'a zamavareno fri vahe kumapina vugahie. Hagi nanteramasena Anumzamofo vahe'mo'za kegava huzmantegahaze. Kumazmimofona afete'are matipi zamavufagamo'a kasrigahie. <verse eid="PSA 49:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 49:15"/>Hianagi nagrira nagu'nevazino, fri'zamofo hihamufintira Anumzamo'a eri varino navaregahie. <verse eid="PSA 49:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 49:16"/>Hagi vahe'mo'zama rama'a fenoma ante'za hage'za mareneri'nageno, nonkumazmifima knare zantmimo'ma avimatesia zankura korora osiho. <verse eid="PSA 49:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 49:17"/>Na'ankure zamagrama frisageno'a, maka fenozamimo'a amanezankna hugahiankino, anazana eri'ne'za fri kantega ovugahaze. <verse eid="PSA 49:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 49:18"/>Kasefama huno mani'nea knafina maka zampina knare hu'noe huno agra'a husga nehanigeno, vahe'mo'zanena humuse huntegahaze. <verse eid="PSA 49:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 49:19"/>Hianagi ko'ma zamagehe'zama hu'nazaza hu'za fri'za nevu'za mago'enena zagemo'ma remsa hania masa onkegahaze. <verse eid="PSA 49:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 49:20"/>Hagi fenozmigu'ma akagima neraza vahe'mo'za zamagra maka zana antahi anira nosazanki'za, afukra friaza huza frigahaze.<verse eid="PSA 49:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 49"/>
  <chapter number="50" style="c" sid="PSA 50"/>
  <para style="s">Anumzamo Agra'a ke refko hu' nera mani'ne huno Asafu asunte'nea zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 50:1"/>Ra Anumzana Hankavenentake Anumzamo'a zage fre kazigati evuno zage hanati kazigama evu'nea vahekrerfa ke huno eritru nehie. <verse eid="PSA 50:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 50:2"/>Saioni kumara konarari'amo agatererfa kuma me'neankino, Anumzamofo masazamo'a remsa huno ana kumapinti enevie. <verse eid="PSA 50:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 50:3"/>Hagi Anumzantimo'ma esiana agasasane egahiankino, maka zama tefanene hu tevemo avuga neresigeno, tusi ununko netanifi Agra egahie. <verse eid="PSA 50:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 50:4"/>Agra monane mopane ke hanigeno emanineke negesakeno, Agra'a vahera keaga huzmanteno refkoa huzmantegahie. <verse eid="PSA 50:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 50:5"/>Nagri'ma zamagu'aretima hu'za namage'ma nente'za, huhagerafi huvempa kema hune'za nagrite'ma kresramnama vunenantaza vahera ke huge'za eho. <verse eid="PSA 50:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 50:6"/>Hagi fatgoma huno refkoma hu avu'ava zama'agura monamo'a huama hino. Na'ankure Anumzamo'a Agra'a keaga refko hugahie. <verse eid="PSA 50:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 50:7"/>Nagrama kema hanuana vahe'nimota kama antahiho. Ama'na zantminte Israeli vahe'mota huama huramantegahue. Nagra Anumzankina, tamagri Anumza mani'noe! <verse eid="PSA 50:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 50:8"/>Tamagrama kresramnama nevaza zantero, tevefima krefanane hu ofama nagri navugama erita evavama nehaza zantera keaga huoramantegahue. <verse eid="PSA 50:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 50:9"/>Hianagi bulimakao afu keginaka'afinti ve bulimakao afukuro, meme afu keginaka'afinti ve meme afukura avrenka eno hu'na osugahue. <verse eid="PSA 50:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 50:10"/>Na'ankure zafa avo'nompima maka zagagafama mani'nazana nagrike zaga manizageno, tauseni'a agonaramimpima mani'naza bulimakao afutamina nagrike suza mani'naze. <verse eid="PSA 50:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 50:11"/>Maka namaramima agonafima mani'nazana nagra kena antahina nehugeno, maka zagagafama hofa avo'nompima vanoma nehaza zagaramina nagrike suza mani'naze. <verse eid="PSA 50:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 50:12"/>Hanki Nagri'ma naga'ma tenige'na mago zankura tamagrira tamantahi onkegahue. Na'ankure maka zama ama mopafima me'neana, nagrike zantaminke me'naze. <verse eid="PSA 50:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 50:13"/>Nagra ve bulimakao afutamimofo ame'ane, ve meme afu'tmimofo koranena nenofi? <verse eid="PSA 50:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 50:14"/>Marerirfa Anumzamofonte'ma huvempama hu'nana naneke avaririnka, musenkase huno susu'ma hunte ofa Anumzamofona hunto. <verse eid="PSA 50:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 50:15"/>Ana nehunka hazenkefima ufresunka nagritega nunamuna huge'na kaguvazinugenka, nagrira ra nagia namigahane. <verse eid="PSA 50:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 50:16"/>Hianagi Anumzamo'a kefo zamavu'zmava'ma nehaza vahetminkura huno, tamagra kasegeni'a huamara hugara osu'nazanki nagafare kasege'ni'a huamara nehuta, huhagerafi huvempa kea tamagitetikera nehaze? <verse eid="PSA 50:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 50:17"/>Na'ankure tamazeri fatgoma nehugeta tamavesra hunenanteta, anankeni'a tamamefi humita amagera nontaze. <verse eid="PSA 50:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 50:18"/>Musufa vahe'ma nezamageta, zamazeri rone nehuta, ru vahe'mofo aro, vema azeri savri huno anteno nemasea vahetamine tragoteta nemanize. <verse eid="PSA 50:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 50:19"/>Tamagipina, kefo avu'avazama hu nanekemo avitegeno, havigema hu nanekege tamagefu'nafintira atineramie. <verse eid="PSA 50:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 50:20"/>Tamagra zogitru huta mani'neta tamafuhe'i zamagenke nehuta, neramarera nemofo neramafuna havige hunezmantaze. <verse eid="PSA 50:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 50:21"/>E'ina'ma nehazage'na nege'na kema nosugeta, tamagrama antahi'zana, Anumzamo'a tagrikna hu'ne huta nehaze. Hianagi menina maka'zama hu'narera keaga huramantegahue. <verse eid="PSA 50:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 50:22"/>Hagi Anumzamofonku'ma tamage'ma nekaniza vahe'mota kama antahiho, tamagu'a rukrahe huta tamasunku hiho. Hanki ana'ma osnazana, tamahe'na rutagana taganu vazitranena vahe'mo'za tamaza osugahaze. <verse eid="PSA 50:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 50:23"/>Hianagi muse nehuno susu hu ofama hunenantea vahe'mo'a, Anumzamo'na ra nagi nenamianki'na, agu'mavazisua kana averi hugahue.<verse eid="PSA 50:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 50"/>
  <chapter number="51" style="c" sid="PSA 51"/>
  <para style="s">Deviti'a kumi'agu asunku zagame hunte'nea zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 51:1"/>Anumzamoka kasunku hunanto. Vagaore kavesizanteti rama'a kasunku hunantenka kumini'a eritre vagaro. <verse eid="PSA 51:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 51:2"/>Kefo avu'avazani'a sese hunantenka nazeri avusese nehunka, kumini'a sese hunka nazeri agru huo. <verse eid="PSA 51:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 51:3"/>Na'ankure nagra kumini'a ke'na antahi'na hu'nogeno, maka zupa antahintahifina eri'zana e'nerie. <verse eid="PSA 51:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 51:4"/>Nagra kagri kea hantagi'na ha' renegante'na, kagri kavurera kumi hu'noe. E'ina hu'noankinka tamage hunantenka fatgo kazigati refko hunka keaga hunenantane. <verse eid="PSA 51:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 51:5"/>Nagra kumi vahe mani'nogeno, nenrera'a kasenante'ne. Na'ankure nenrera arimpafina kumi vahe fore hu'noe. <verse eid="PSA 51:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 51:6"/>Hianagi tamage nanekemo'a nagu'afi avitesie hunka Kagra kagesa nentahine. E'ina hu'negu knare antahi'zana nagu'afina rempi hunamio. <verse eid="PSA 51:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 51:7"/>Kumini'a hisopureti nazeri agru huge'na agru ha'neno. Sese hunka nazeri agru huge'na, efeke hamponkna ha'neno. <verse eid="PSA 51:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 51:8"/>Hanki ete musenkasema huno mani avu'ava zana namigeno, nazeri fru hina ruhantaginana zaferinanimo'za musenkasena hiho. <verse eid="PSA 51:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 51:9"/>Kumini'arera ketenka omaninka, kefo avu'avazani'a eri atre vagarenanto. <verse eid="PSA 51:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 51:10"/>Anumzamoka agru tumo nagu'afina tro hunenantenka, Kagrite'ma mani fatgoma hu'za nagu'afina antenanto. <verse eid="PSA 51:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 51:11"/>Kavugatira nahenati notrenka, Ruotge Avamuka'a nagu'afintira eri otro. <verse eid="PSA 51:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 51:12"/>Nagu'ma vazinkenama musema hunoakna musezana ete nenaminka, keka'ama antahino kavariri navesi zana namio. <verse eid="PSA 51:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 51:13"/>E'ina'ma hananke'na kefo avu'ava'ma nehaza vahe'mokizmia kagri kavukavara rempi huzminuge'za, kumi vahe'mo'za ete kagrite rukrahe hu'za egahaze. <verse eid="PSA 51:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 51:14"/>Vahe'ma ahe'na korama eri tagi'noa kumira Anumzamoka apase nenantenka nagu'vazio. Ana'ma hananke'na fatgo kavukvama hunka nagu'ma vazi'nana zankura, musenkasena hu'na zagamera hugahue. <verse eid="PSA 51:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 51:15"/>Ra Anumzamoka nagira eri o'za huge'na, zagamera hu'na kagia ahentesga ha'neno. <verse eid="PSA 51:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 51:16"/>Na'ankure nagra ofa erina eme kamigahuanagi, kre fanene hu ofagura musena nosane. Kagrite'ma kre fananehu ofama kresramnama vuzankura kave'nosie. <verse eid="PSA 51:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 51:17"/>Hagi kagri'ma kavenesia kresramna vu ofa, e'i avufgama anteramino mani'zane. Avufgama anteramino nemanino agua'retima huno asunku'ma huno agu'ama rukrahema nehia vahera Anumzamoka kamefira hunomine. <verse eid="PSA 51:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 51:18"/>Kagra kavesintenka Saioni rankumara azeri knare nehunka, Jerusalemi kumamofo kegina huo. <verse eid="PSA 51:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 51:19"/>Ana hutenka mani fatgo hu'za mani'neza fatgo avu'ava'ma hu'za kresramna vanaza ofagi, tevefima kre fananehu ofagi, maka zagagafama tevefi krefanene hu ofagi, bulimakao afu'ma kresramna vu itaka'arema kresramna vu ofagura musena hugahane.<verse eid="PSA 51:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 51"/>
  <chapter number="52" style="c" sid="PSA 52"/>
  <para style="s">Doekima hu'nea havi avu'ava zanteku huno Deviti asunte'nea zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 52:1"/>Hankavenentake sondia ne'moka, nagafare kefo avu'ava zama nehana zankura kavufga rana nehane? Hagi Anumzamo'ma fatgo avu'ava'ma huno, maka knafima nevia zankura kagesa nontahino? <verse eid="PSA 52:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 52:2"/>Maka kna vahe'ma azeri haviza hu antahintahige retro nehunka, havigema huno vahe'ma azeri haviza hu kemo'a asane'nea resagna huno kagipintira atineramie. <verse eid="PSA 52:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 52:3"/>Kagra knare avu'ava zama kavesi nentana avamena agaterenka, havi avu'ava'zana kavesi nentenka, tamage kema kavesi nentanama'a agaterenka havigea kavesinentane. <verse eid="PSA 52:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 52:4"/>Knare osu keka'aretima vahe'ma azeri havizama hu'zanku kavenesia nekinka, kagra havige ne' mani'nane! <verse eid="PSA 52:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 52:5"/>Hianagi Anumzamo'a kahe fanane hanigenka, ru'enena omanigosane. Traza vatitreankna huno nonkuma ka'afintira Anumzamo'a kavazu hutrena ru'enena mopafina omanigahane. <verse eid="PSA 52:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 52:6"/>Fatgo avu'ava'ma nehaza vahe'mo'za nege'za, zamagogogu hugahaze. Anazama kagrite'ma fore'ma hanige'za negenu'za, kagiza nere'za amanage hugahaze, <verse eid="PSA 52:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 52:7"/>Anumzamo naza hugahie huno antahi omino, agra'a hankavegu'ma nehia hankavenentake sondia nete'ma fore'ma nehia zana keho. Agra'a feno zante amentinti nehuno, ru vahe'mokizmia hanavetino kefo avu'ava'zana huzmante vava huno nevie. <verse eid="PSA 52:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 52:8"/>Hianagi nagra Anumzamofo nompina olivi zafamo tretre huno amu mareankna nehuanki'na, maka kna Anumzamofo vagaore avesizante namentintia huvava hugahue. <verse eid="PSA 52:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 52:9"/>Knare kavukva'ma hunantana zankura Anumzamoka kagia erisga huvava nehu'na, Kagri kagire amuhara hugahue. Na'ankure Kagri kagimo'a, knare zantfa hu'ne. Kavariri fatgoma nehaza vahe'mokizmi zamavufi kagri kagia nagra husga hugahue.<verse eid="PSA 52:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 52"/>
  <chapter number="53" style="c" sid="PSA 53"/>
  <para style="s">Maka vahera kumi vaheke'za mani'none huno Deviti asunte'nea zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 53:1"/>Neginagi vahe'mo'zage zamagu'afina anagea nehaze, Anumzana omani'ne hu'za zamagesa nentahize. E'inahu vahera ko haviza hu'nazanki'za zamavuzmava zmimo'a kefoza hu'neankino, magomo'e huno knare avu'ava zana nosie. <verse eid="PSA 53:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 53:2"/>Anumzamo'a monafinka mani'neno, iza ama' antahi'zane vahera ama mopafina mani'neno, agrira amagera nentefi huno, kefenkma atreno maka vahera nerage. <verse eid="PSA 53:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 53:3"/>Hianagi magore huno fatgo vahera omani'neanki maka vahe'mota Anumzamofona tamagena humita havizantfa hu'none. Maka vahe'ma mani'nonana kefo avu'avake hunkeno mago'mo'e huno fatgo vahera omani'ne. <verse eid="PSA 53:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 53:4"/>Ana kefo zamavu'zmavama nehaza vahe'mo'za magore hu'za rempia hu'za nontahize. Hanki bretima neankna hu'za nagri vahera zamahe'za nene'za Anumzamofontegama nunamuma hu'zankura zamagesa nontahize. <verse eid="PSA 53:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 53:5"/>Hianagi tusi koro nehu'za zamagogofena, ha'ma regantesaza vahe'mokizmi zaferina herafi atregahie. E'ina hanigenka kagra zamazeri zamagaze hugahane. Na'ankure Anumzamo'a amagena huzmino zamatregahie. <verse eid="PSA 53:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 53:6"/>Hanki Israeli vahe'ma zamagu'ma vazisia ne'mo'a Saioni agonaregati'ma esiana knare hugahie. Hanki Anumzamo'ma Agra vahe'ama eme zamavareno ete zamazeri so'ema hanigeno'a, Jekopu naga'mo'za ranke hu'za zagamera hu'za musena nehanageno, Israeli vahe'mo'zanena musenkase hugahaze.<verse eid="PSA 53:6"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 53"/>
  <chapter number="54" style="c" sid="PSA 54"/>
  <para style="s">Ra Anumzamo kegava hunantegahie huno asunte'nea zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 54:1"/>Anumzamoka kagika'areti nagu'vazio. Hankanaveka'anu nagu'a refko hunka nago. <verse eid="PSA 54:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 54:2"/>Anumzanimoka nunamu keni'a nentahinka, nanekema kasami'nuana kagesa antenka antahio. <verse eid="PSA 54:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 54:3"/>Na'ankure ru vahe'ma emani vahe'mo'za hara renantazageno, vahe'ma zamazeri havizama nehaza vahe'mo'za nahefri'za nehaze. Zamagra Anumzamofonkura antahi amaneza nesaze. <verse eid="PSA 54:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 54:4"/>Hianagi Anumzamo nazahu nera mani'ne. Agra naza hige'na kasefa hu'na mani'noe. <verse eid="PSA 54:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 54:5"/>Ha' vahe'nimo'zama nagri'ma nazeri haviza hu antahintahima retro'ma haza antahintahia, eri arukrahe hugeno, zamagri zamazeri haviza hino. Anumzamoka kagrama huvempama hunana kante antenka, ana vahetmina zamahe fri vagarege'za mago'enena ama mopafina omaniho. <verse eid="PSA 54:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 54:6"/>Ra Anumzamoka nagra navesite kagritera ofa kresramna nevu'na, susu hugante'na kagia ahentesga hugahue. Na'ankure e'inama hanuana knare hu'ne! <verse eid="PSA 54:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 54:7"/>Na'ankure kagra maka hazenkenifintira nagu nevazinka, nazahanke'na ha' vahe'ni'aramina hara huzmagatere'noe.<verse eid="PSA 54:7"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 54"/>
  <chapter number="55" style="c" sid="PSA 55"/>
  <para style="s">Rone kamo kavreno kanazana ome kamigahie huno hunte'nea zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 55:1"/>Anumzamoka naza huogu'ma nunamuma nehuana antahi amnea osunka, kagesa antenka nunamuni'a antahinamio. <verse eid="PSA 55:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 55:2"/>Muse hugantoanki, nunamuni'a antahinaminka kenona hunanto. Na'ankure hazenke zamo'a nazeri haviza hige'na kragira nerue. <verse eid="PSA 55:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 55:3"/>Ha' vahe'nimo'za kezati'za rankege hunenantage'za, kefo avu'ava'ma nehaza vahe'mo'za knazana nami'za nazeri haviza nehu'za, tusi zamarimpa ahenenantaze. <verse eid="PSA 55:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 55:4"/>E'ina'ma hazageno'a tumonimo'a faki faki nehige'na, fri'zankura tusi koro nehue. <verse eid="PSA 55:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 55:5"/>Tusi nagogo nefegeno koro zamo'ene nahirahimo'enena nahenefrie. <verse eid="PSA 55:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 55:6"/>Maho namamofoma hiaza hunora nagekona huntenege'na, hare'na knare'ma hu'nea kumatega mani fruma hu'na umanuresina knare hisine. <verse eid="PSA 55:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 55:7"/>Nagra hare'na afete'are ka'ma kokampi umanuresine. <verse eid="PSA 55:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 55:8"/>Ununkomo'ene zasi komo'ma hifintira, nagra ame hu'na fre'na afete ome fraki'na umanuresine. <verse eid="PSA 55:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 55:9"/>Ra Anumzamoka ha' vahe'nimozama retroma nehaza antahintahia eri savri hunka eri haviza huo. Na'ankure vahe'ma azeri haviza hu avu'avazane, mani fru osu avu'avaza rankumapina negoe. <verse eid="PSA 55:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 55:10"/>Hanine zagenena ku'ma keginare vano nehu'za kegava nehazanagi, tamage huno ha'zamo'ene kefo avu'ava zamo'a kuma agu'afina avite'ne. <verse eid="PSA 55:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 55:11"/>Maka zama eri haviza hu'zamo ama ana kuma amu'nompina megeno, vahe'ma knama amino azeri haviza nehuno, revatgama hu avu'avazamo'a ana kumara atreno novie. <verse eid="PSA 55:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 55:12"/>Ha' vahe'nimozama huhaviza hunantazasina, nagra ana zankura nagesa ontahuresine. Hagi ha' vahe'nimo'zama ha'ma eme hunantazaresina nagra frakuresine. <verse eid="PSA 55:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 55:13"/>Hianagi mago avamente'ma manino'a ne'moka anara nehane. Kagra nagri'enema tagrotenka vanoma nehankena, kagena antahina hu'noa navate ronenimoka anara nehane. <verse eid="PSA 55:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 55:14"/>Korapara kagranena knare huta magopi nemanita, tusi'a vahe'ma Anumzamofo mono nontegama nevazafima magokama nevu'ane. <verse eid="PSA 55:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 55:15"/>Ha' vahe'ni'aramina atregeno antri hanazaza huno fri'zamo'a zmavatera ne-enkeno, matimo'a zamavu aga zmasgahu nakarino. Na'ankure kefo zamavu'zmava zamo'a zamagu'afina nonkino me'ne. <verse eid="PSA 55:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 55:16"/>Hianagi Anumzamofonku kea hanugeno, Ra Anumzamo'a nagu'vazigahie. <verse eid="PSA 55:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 55:17"/>Knazani'afima mani'nena nanterane, feru'ene kenage'enena krafagea nehugeno, Ra Anumzamo'a antahi nenamie. <verse eid="PSA 55:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 55:18"/>Ra ha'pintira nahokeno ete nagu'vazine. Na'ankure rama'a ha' vahe maninazafinti naza huno navare'ne. <verse eid="PSA 55:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 55:19"/>Anumzana Agra kini mani vava huno ne-ea kini ne'mo krafage'ni'a antahino zamazeri haviza hugahie. Na'ankure nagri ha' vahe'mo'za zamavu'zmavara rukrahera osuge, Anumzamofona korora huntegera nosaze. <verse eid="PSA 55:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 55:20"/>Ronenimo'a ha'renanteno huhagerafi huvempagema hu'neana ruhanentagie. <verse eid="PSA 55:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 55:21"/>Naneke'amo'a batagna huno frufru hu'neanagi, agu'afina ha'ma hu'za me'ne. Naneke'amo'a olivi masavenkna huno frufru hu'neanagi, agu'afina asane bainati kazi me'ne. <verse eid="PSA 55:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 55:22"/>Knazanka'a Ra Anumzamofo azampi antegeno, Agra knazanka'a e'nerino kazeri hanavetino. Agra fatgo zamavu'zmava'ma nehaza vahera zamatrenige'za regarari'za trakara osugahaze. <verse eid="PSA 55:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 55:23"/>Hianagi Anumzamoka kefo zamavu'zmava'ma nehaza vahera zamavarenka hazenke zamofo kerifi zamatregahane. Hagi vahe'ma zamahe nefri'za vahe'mo'zane krunagema nehaza vahe'mo'zanena kasefa vahe mani'ne'za ko frigahaze. Hianagi nagra Kagriku antahi negamina namentintia nehue.<verse eid="PSA 55:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 55"/>
  <chapter number="56" style="c" sid="PSA 56"/>
  <para style="s">Filistia vahe'mo'za Gati kumate Deviti azerinaku nehazageno asunte'nea zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 56:1"/>Anumzamoka kasunku hunanto, na'ankure vahe'mo'za nahe'za narotago nehaze. Maka kna ha' vahenimo'za nazeri havizantfa nehaze. <verse eid="PSA 56:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 56:2"/>Ha' vahe'nimo'za nahenaku knane knanena nenavararizageno, zamavufaga ra hanaza kazigati rama'a vahe'mo'za hara eme hunenantaze. <verse eid="PSA 56:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 56:3"/>Hianagi koro'ma hanua knafina, Kagrite namentintia hugahue. <verse eid="PSA 56:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 56:4"/>Anumzamo'ma huvempama hu'nea kere namentintia nehu'na, agia ahentesga nehue. Nagra Anumzamofonte namentintia nehuankina, na'a hanigena amne vahetfankura korora hugahue? <verse eid="PSA 56:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 56:5"/>Nagrama hua nanekea zamagra eri rukrahe nehu'za, nazeri haviza hunaku maka kna mani'ne'za oku'a kea retro nehaze. <verse eid="PSA 56:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 56:6"/>Nagri'ma nazeri'za nahenakura, oku'a kea retro hu'za kafona ante'za vano nehu'za, kama vano nehuge'za zamavunte'za nenagaze. <verse eid="PSA 56:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 56:7"/>Kefo zamavu'zmavama nehaza vahera ana zamavu'zmava zantera Anumzamoka zamahe kasopetro. Hanki krimpa ahezmantenka zamazeri fenkami atro. <verse eid="PSA 56:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 56:8"/>Kagra nasunku'ma huazana kavuntenka nenagane. Zavi'ma atogeno'ma navunu'ma hia navunura tafempi afinte'nane. Magoke magoke zana avompi krente'nane. <verse eid="PSA 56:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 56:9"/>Hagi nazama huogu'ma Kagritegama kezamati'nena, ha' vahe'nimo'za koro fregahaze. E'ina'ma hanage'na Anumzamoka nagri kaziga mani'nenka hara huzmantane hu'na ke'na antahi'na hugahue. <verse eid="PSA 56:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 56:10"/>Anumzamo'ma Agrama huvempama hu'nantenegu nentahina agi'a ahentesga hugahue. Tamage Ra Anumzamokama huhampri nante'nana zanku kagia erisga hugahue. <verse eid="PSA 56:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 56:11"/>Nagra Anumzamokare namentintia nehuanki, na'a hanige'na amne vahetfankura korora hugahue. Agra vahetfa mani'neanki na'a hunantegahie? <verse eid="PSA 56:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 56:12"/>Nagra huvempama hu'noa kere amage ante'na, nazama nehana zantera susu hu'na ofa hugantegahue. <verse eid="PSA 56:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 56:13"/>Na'ankure Kagra fri zampintira nagu'nevazinka, tanafa'ma hu'za nehugenka naza hu'nane. E'ina hu'nananki'na menina amne Anumzamoka kavuga vano nehu'na, vahe'moma asimu'ma erino nemania tavitera vano hugahue.<verse eid="PSA 56:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 56"/>
  <chapter number="57" style="c" sid="PSA 57"/>
  <para style="s">Solinku'ma kore'ma huno Deviti'a freno nevuno asunte'nea zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 57:1"/>Kasunku hunanto Anumzamoka, kasunku hunanto! Na'ankure nagra kagripinka franekue. Kagri kagekonamofo turunapinka, fraki'na mani'nenugeno hazenke zamo'a nagateregahie. <verse eid="PSA 57:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 57:2"/>Marerirfa Anumzamofontega nagra kezatigahue. Maka zama hugantegahuema nehia zama hunenantea Anumzamofontega kezanatigahue. <verse eid="PSA 57:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 57:3"/>Agra monafinkati nazama hu'zana atresigeno eme nagura vazigahie. Nagofetu'ma zamagama re'za vonoma nehaza vahetmina, Agra zamazeri zamagaze hugahie. Anumzamo'a monafinkati vagaore avesizane, hugahuema hu'neaza huno navesinte vava hugahie. <verse eid="PSA 57:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 57:4"/>Nagra vahe'ma amprizama nenaza laioniramimofo amu'nozmifi mani'noe. Zamave'mo'ma keve kna higeno zamagefu'namo'ma bainati kazinkno kna'ma hu'nea vahetmimofo amu'nompi mani'noe. <verse eid="PSA 57:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 57:5"/>Anumzamoka monaramina agaterenka onagamu mani'nananki'za husga hugantegahaze. Hagi masazankamo'a maka ama mopafina remsa hanie. <verse eid="PSA 57:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 57:6"/>Ha' vahe'nimo'za nahenaku krifu anagi ante'nazageno nagu'amo'a kna nehie. Hanki kama vu'na e'nama nehufina, keri kafinte'nazanagi, ana kerifina zamagra'a tamigahaze. <verse eid="PSA 57:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 57:7"/>Anumzamoka nagu'areti hu'na nagra kagritera namentinti nehue. Nagra nagu'areti namentinti nehuanki'na zagamera hu'na kagia ahentesga hugahue. <verse eid="PSA 57:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 57:8"/>Nagu'amoka otio. Hapu zavenane laeri zavenanena oti'o. Nagra zagame hu'na ko'matu'zana azeri otigahue. <verse eid="PSA 57:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 57:9"/>Nagra maka kokankoka vahe'mokizmi zamavufina, susu hu'na kagia ahentesga hugahue. Maka vahe'mokizmi zamavufina zagamera hu'na Anumzamoka kagia ahentesga hugahue. <verse eid="PSA 57:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 57:10"/>Anumzamoka vagaore kavesizamo'a, monagna huno amunagamu marenerigeno, hugahuema hu'nana kema amage antenka hu kavukava zamo'a amunagamu marerino hampona avako nehie. <verse eid="PSA 57:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 57:11"/>Anumzamoka monaramina mani agaterenka onagamu mani'nanankino, vahe'mo'za husga hunegante'nageno masazanka'amo'a maka ama mopafina remsa hugahie.<verse eid="PSA 57:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 57"/>
  <chapter number="58" style="c" sid="PSA 58"/>
  <para style="s">Anumzamo'a ama mopafi vahera refko hugahie huno asunte'nea zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 58:1"/>Tamagra kva vahe'mota fatgo naneke keagafina nehazafi? Tamagra fatgo huta vahe'mokizmi naneke refko nehazo? <verse eid="PSA 58:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 58:2"/>I'o, tamagu'afina kefozama hu antahintahi retro nehuta, ama mopafi vahera zamazeri haviza nehaze. <verse eid="PSA 58:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 58:3"/>Kefo avu'ava'ma nehaza vahe'mo'za anama kasezmantetegati kana atre'za hazagre'naze. Zamagra nezamarera ku'afi mani'neza havigege hu'naze. <verse eid="PSA 58:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 58:4"/>Nanekema hazazamo'a ha' osifavemofo avu'ataga zankna nehige'za, nanekema nehazazamo'a kobra osifavemo'ma hiaza hu'za kea nontahize. <verse eid="PSA 58:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 58:5"/>Hagi zavenama aheno osifavema azeri oti vahe'mo'a, eri ruzahu ruzahu huno'ma zavenama ahesiana, ana osifavemo'a ontahigosie. <verse eid="PSA 58:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 58:6"/>Anumzamoka zamagipima me'nea zamavera rutafri atro. Ra Anumzamoka ama ana laioniramimofo zamagemazampa rutavegri atro. <verse eid="PSA 58:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 58:7"/>Zamatrege'za hagege mopafima tima tagiramino ome fananema hiaza hu'za fanene hiho. Zamatregeno zamazampima eri'naza kevemofo agonazmimo'a atupaseho. <verse eid="PSA 58:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 58:8"/>Zamatrege'za koravemo'za hagage hazaza huge, osi mofavremo ana kasentegeno zage onkeneno friankna hiho. <verse eid="PSA 58:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 58:9"/>Kavoramimo'ma tevere'ma me'neno amuhoma nehia kna'a agetereno, Anumzamo'a ame huno kasefa vahero, ozafa tavavaro, kefo avu'ava'ma nehaza vahera ruharafi hutregahie. <verse eid="PSA 58:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 58:10"/>Anumzamofoma amage'ma nentaza vahe'ma, kefo avu'ava'ma nehaza vahe'mo'zama zamazeri havizama nehaza zante'ma Anumzamo'za nonama huno zamahenige'za, kenu'za muse hugahaze. Anumzamofoma amage'ma nentaza vahe'mo'za kefo zamavu'zamava'ma nehaza vahe'mofo korampi zamagia sese hugahaze. <verse eid="PSA 58:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 58:11"/>Ana hanige'za maka vahe'mo'za amanage hugahaze, tamage huno fatgo avu'ava'ma nehaza vahe'mokizmia mizazmia me'neankino, fatgo huno'ma ama mopafima vahe'ma refkoma nehia Anumzana mani'ne hu'za hugahaze.<verse eid="PSA 58:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 58"/>
  <chapter number="59" style="c" sid="PSA 59"/>
  <para style="s">Ha' vaheni'amofo zamazampinti Anumzamoka nagu'vazio huno Deviti asunte'nea zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 59:1"/>Anumzamoka ha' vahe'nimofo zamazampintira nagu'vazio. Ha' vahe'nimo'zama ha' hunantenaku'ma neazana nahokenka navre frakio. <verse eid="PSA 59:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 59:2"/>Kefo avu'ava'ma nehaza vahe'mokizmi zamazampintira nazeri vario. Vahe korama eri taginaku'ma, tusi'zama hu'za vanoma nehaza vahe'mokizmi zamazampintira nagu'vazio. <verse eid="PSA 59:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 59:3"/>Hagi ko, zamagra nagri nahenaku kafona nentaze. Ra Anumzamoka nagra havizana hunozmante'na kumira osu'noanagi, hankavenentake ha' vahe'mo'za nahenaku antahintahia retro nehaze. <verse eid="PSA 59:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 59:4"/>Nagra mago havizana osu'noanagi, ha' hunante'naku zamaga re'za ome retrotra nehaze. Otio! Otinka nagri'ma hunante'zama nehaza zana negenka naza huo. <verse eid="PSA 59:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 59:5"/>Ra Anumzana Monafi sondia vahe'mokizmi Anumzamoka, Kagra Israeli vahe Anumza mani'nananki, otinka kokankoka vahe'mo'zama ha'ma hunante'zama nehaza vahera knazana zaminka zamazeri haviza huo. Kefo avu'ava'ma nehaza vahe'tmina, kasunkura huozamanto. <verse eid="PSA 59:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 59:6"/>Ana maka kinaga e'za rankumamofona megi'a eme kagigagi nehu'za, kramo'ma nehiaza hu'za hauhau hu'za vano nehaze. <verse eid="PSA 59:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 59:7"/>Knare osu nanekema zamagipinti'ma atineramiana ko. Zamagipinti'ma rukahama huneramia nanekemo'a, bainati kazi atiramiankna nehige'za amanage nehaze, Iza naneketia antahigahie hu'za nehaze. <verse eid="PSA 59:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 59:8"/>Hianagi Ra Anumzamoka Kagra ana vahetmina zamagiza nerenka, kokankoka vahetamina kiza zokago ke hunezmantane. <verse eid="PSA 59:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 59:9"/>Kagra nagri hankave mani'nananki'na, Kagri kavega mani'nenugenka, nagura vazigahane. Na'ankure Kagra Anumzamoka, nagrama frakisua hankave vihuni'a mani'nane. <verse eid="PSA 59:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 59:10"/>Nagri Anumzamo'a vagaore avesizama'areti avesima nenantea ne'mo naza hugahie. Anumzamo'a naza hanige'na, ha' vaheni'a zamage fenkaminete'na zamagiza regahue. <verse eid="PSA 59:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 59:11"/>Ra Anumzamoka zamahe ofrio. Na'ankure nagri vahe'mo'za ame'ama hu'za rempima huzmina zana zamagenekanize. Hanki hihamukanu zamahe arava hege'za zamarena reho. Ra Anumzamoka kagra tagri hanko mani'ne. <verse eid="PSA 59:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 59:12"/>Hagi ana vahe'mo'za kumi'mo avite kege nehaze. Na'ankure ana vahe'mokizmi zamagipina kefo kemo avite'ne. Zamatregeno zamagri zamavufaga ra hu'zamo, zamazeri haviza hino. Na'ankure zamagra kazusi ke nehu'za, krunage nehaze. <verse eid="PSA 59:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 59:13"/>Ra Anumzamoka karimpa ahe zamantenka zamahe fanane huo! Zamahe fanane huge'za magore hu'za omaniho. E'ina huge'za maka ama mopafi vahe'mo'za Anumzamo'a Jekopu naga Israeli vahera kegava huzmantene hu'za ke'za antahi'za hiho. <verse eid="PSA 59:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 59:14"/>Ana maka kinaga ete e'za rankumamofona megi'a eme kagigagi nehu'za, kramo'ma nehiaza hu'za, hauhau hu'za vano nehaze. <verse eid="PSA 59:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 59:15"/>Zamagra ne'zankura maka kaziga hake'za vano nehu'za, ne'zama nezamu'ma nosu'za hauhau hu'za vano nehaze. <verse eid="PSA 59:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 59:16"/>Hianagi nagra hihamukagura zagamera hugahue. Maka nanterana vagaore kavesizankura zagamera hu'na kagia ahentesga hugahue. Na'ankure Kagra knazampima mani'nogenka, nagrira fraki kuma'ene naguvazi kuma'ene mani'nane. <verse eid="PSA 59:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 59:17"/>Anumzamoka kagra hankavenia mani'nananki'na, Kagritega zagamera hu'na kagia ahentesga hugahue. Kagra fraki kumani'a mani'nanankinka, vagaore kavesizanka'aretima kavesima nenantana Anumza mani'nane.<verse eid="PSA 59:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 59"/>
  <chapter number="60" style="c" sid="PSA 60"/>
  <para style="s">Anumzamo ha' vahetia agianu rehapatigahie huno hunte'nea zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 60:1"/>Anumzamoka, Kagra ko tatrenka tazeri haviza hu'nane. Kagra krimpa aherantenka e'nananki, menina ete tazeri knare huo! <verse eid="PSA 60:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 60:2"/>Kagra mopa eri tore hankeno, kekora reno vuno eno hu'neanki, ana kekokana renagro. Na'ankure mopamo'a zahufa kazara nehie. <verse eid="PSA 60:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 60:3"/>Kagra vaheka'amofona rama'a knaza zaminka zamazeri amuho nehunka, hankave waini taminketa neteta neginagia hu'none. <verse eid="PSA 60:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 60:4"/>Hianagi Kagri'ma koro'ma hugante'za, mono'ma hunegantaza vahera kevemo'ma zamavate'ma zamazeri zankura, mago avameza zami'nane. <verse eid="PSA 60:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 60:5"/>Kagrama kavesima nezmantana vahera zamagu'vazio. Tamaga kazanu taguranevazinka, nunamuntia antahiraminka kenona huranto. <verse eid="PSA 60:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 60:6"/>Ruotge hu'nea konarari'afi mani'neno, ama huvempa kea hu'ne. Nagra muse hu'na Sekemu kumara eri fako nehu'na, Sukoti agupomofo zaza'ane upa'anena mesarimi hu'na kegahue. <verse eid="PSA 60:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 60:7"/>Giliati'ene Manase'enena nagri suza mani'na'e. Hanki Efraemi'a Nagri fetori manigeno, Juda'a kini azompani'a mani'ne. <verse eid="PSA 60:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 60:8"/>Hianagi Moapu mopa tima nefroa zuompani'a me'nigeno, Edomu mopare nagia anona zafitregahue. Filistia vahera hara huzamagatere'na musena hugahue. <verse eid="PSA 60:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 60:9"/>Hagi iza navareno hankavenentake vihuma me'nea rankumapina vugahie? Iza navareno Edomu moparera vugahie? <verse eid="PSA 60:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 60:10"/>Anumzamoka Kagra tatrenka kamefira huneramino? Kagra ru'enena tagri sondia vahetaminena hatera ovugosano? <verse eid="PSA 60:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 60:11"/>Taza hunka ha' vahetia hara huzmanto, na'ankure vahetfamo'za taza hugara osu'naze. <verse eid="PSA 60:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 60:12"/>Anumzamofo hanavereti ha' vahetia hara huzmagateregahune. Agra ha' vahetia zamahetreteno, zamagofetu agia reno zamare hapatigahie.<verse eid="PSA 60:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 60"/>
  <chapter number="61" style="c" sid="PSA 61"/>
  <para style="s">Havere navrenka vuo huno hunte'nea zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 61:1"/>Anumzamoka krafage'ni'a antahio! Nunamu ke'ni'a kagesa antenka antahio! <verse eid="PSA 61:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 61:2"/>Nagu'amo'ma knama nehige'na, mopa atumparegati naza huogura Kagritega kezana netue. Hanki navrenka hanavenentake havere marerige'na nagu'vazi'neno. <verse eid="PSA 61:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 61:3"/>Na'ankure Kagra fraki kuma'ni'a mani'nenka, vihuni'a mani'nanankino ha' vahe'nimo'za eme onahegahaze. <verse eid="PSA 61:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 61:4"/>Natrege'na mono nonka'afi manivava hu'na va'neno. Natrege'na Kagri kagekonafinka fraki'na mani'neno. <verse eid="PSA 61:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 61:5"/>Na'ankure huvempama hu'noana, Anumzamoka antahi'nane. Kagri kagigu'ma koro'ma hu'za mono'ma hugantesaza vahe'mo'za erisanti haregahaze hunkama ante'nana zana nagri nami'nane. <verse eid="PSA 61:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 61:6"/>Kini ne'mofona mago'ene kafuzage'a erinte za'za huo. Vahe'ma forehu anante anante'ma huno'ma vania knafina, agra zazate ama mopafina manigahie. <verse eid="PSA 61:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 61:7"/>Agra Anumzamofo avuga kini manivava huno vugahie. Hagi vagaore kavesi zamo'ene hugahuema hu'nana zama hu kavukva zamo'a, kegava huntesie. <verse eid="PSA 61:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 61:8"/>Ana'ma hananke'na knane knanena kagia ahentesga huvava hugahue hu'nama huvempama hu'noa kante antena, zagamera hu'na kagia ahentesga hugahue.<verse eid="PSA 61:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 61"/>
  <chapter number="62" style="c" sid="PSA 62"/>
  <para style="s">Nagra kagrikuke kavegante'noe huno hunte'nea zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 62:1"/>Anumzamo'ma nazama hanigu akohe'na avegante'na mani'noe. Na'ankure Agrake nagura nevazie. <verse eid="PSA 62:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 62:2"/>Agrake'za fraki haveni'a mani'neno, nagura nevazie. Agra fraki kumani'a mani'neankina, antria hu'na korora osugahue. <verse eid="PSA 62:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 62:3"/>Hago zazate ana maka vahe'mota magoke nera hara renteta aze. Ana maka'moza nahenaku nenavararize. Zamagrama nagazana nagra fraguvazirami have keginagna huge, kuraramperami keginagna hu'noe. <verse eid="PSA 62:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 62:4"/>Nagrama ra nagima eri'na mani'noa zana, nazeri fenkami atrenaku, keaga retro nehaze. Havigema hu'za nagri'ma nazeri havizama hu'nakura tusi muse nehaze. Navurera husga hunenantazanagi, zamagu'afina antahi haviza hunenantaze. <verse eid="PSA 62:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 62:5"/>Anumzamoka Kagrikuke nagra akohe'na kavega ante'na mani'noe. Nagra Kagripi amuha zani'a ante'noe. <verse eid="PSA 62:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 62:6"/>Agrake'zage framaki hanave havenia mani'neankino, kegava hunenanteno nagu'nevazie. Agra fraki kumani'a mani'neankina, antria hu'na korora osugahue. <verse eid="PSA 62:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 62:7"/>Anumzamoke nagura nevazino, ra nagia nenamie. Anumzamoke havegani'ane, fraki kumani'anena mani'ne. <verse eid="PSA 62:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 62:8"/>Vahe'nimota Agriteke maka kna tamentintia hiho. Maka tamagu'a Agriteke anteho, na'ankure Agra fraki kumati mani'ne. <verse eid="PSA 62:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 62:9"/>Agima me'nea vahetetima vuno agima omane vahetema vu'neana, mago asimu'ma hutreankna hu'nazankiza, zamagra amne'za Agri avufina mani'naze. Hanki zamagra'a knama sigelire'ma erinte'zama kesazana, knazmimo'a zahomofo kna'a agateore'ne. <verse eid="PSA 62:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 62:10"/>Vahe'ma knama amino azeri havizama hu'zamo naza hugahie hunka kamentintina huge, musufamase avu'avazamo naza hugahie hunka amuhara huge, fenozanka'amo'ma ome rama huno nevanigenka, ana zamo'a naza hugahie hunka amuhara osuo. <verse eid="PSA 62:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 62:11"/>Anumzamo'ma magoke kema nehige'na, tare zanku nagesa nentahue. Hihamu hankaveane Anumza mani'nane. <verse eid="PSA 62:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 62:12"/>Vagaore kavesizana, Ra Anumzamoka Kagri suzane. Tamage hunka maka vahera refko huzmantenka nazanoma hu'nenarera nona hunka mizana zamigahane.<verse eid="PSA 62:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 62"/>
  <chapter number="63" style="c" sid="PSA 63"/>
  <para style="s">Tinku'ma hiaza huno Anumzamokagura nave'nesie huno asunte'nea zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 63:1"/>Anumzamoka Kagra nagri Anumza mani'nanke'na, Kagrikura tusiza hu'na nehakroe. Nagu'amo'a tinku'ma hiaza huno, Kagrikura navenesigeno, tima omne hagage kokampina navufgamo'a Kagrikura tusiza nehie. <verse eid="PSA 63:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 63:2"/>Hagi Anumzamoka mono nonka'afina negage'na hihamukane, masaka'anena ke'noe. <verse eid="PSA 63:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 63:3"/>Na'ankure vagaore kavesi zamo'a asimu'ma erino mani'zana agatere'neanki'na, kagi'a erisga huvava hugahue. <verse eid="PSA 63:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 63:4"/>Nasimu'ma erina mani'na vanua knafina, kagi'a ahentesga nehu'na, nazana erisga hu'nena Kagritega nunamuna hugahue. <verse eid="PSA 63:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 63:5"/>Knare ne'zama naminke'na nenamura nehuankina, muse zagame hu'na husga hugantegahue. <verse eid="PSA 63:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 63:6"/>Hanki tafenire'ma masenena, kagrikura nagesa nentahi'na, ana kenagera nunamuna nehu'na, nagesa antahigami'noe. <verse eid="PSA 63:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 63:7"/>Na'ankure Kagra nazahu ne' mani'nananki'na, nagra Kagri kagekonamofo turunapinka mani'nena muse zagamera hugahue. <verse eid="PSA 63:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 63:8"/>Anumzamoka nagu'amo'a Kagrite tragoteno me'negenka, tamaga kazanu nazeri antrako nehane. <verse eid="PSA 63:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 63:9"/>Hianagi nagri'ma nahenaku'ma nehaza vahe'mo'za haviza hugahaze. Zamagra friza fri vahe'mofo kumapi amefenkame mopa agu'a uramigahaze. <verse eid="PSA 63:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 63:10"/>Bainati kazinknonu zamahe vagaresigeno, afi kramo'za zamavufaga'a traga hu'za negahaze. <verse eid="PSA 63:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 63:11"/>Hianagi kini ne'mo'na Anumzamokagu musena hugahue. Anumzamofonte'ma zamentintima nehaza vahe'mo'za, Anumzamofona agia erisga nehanageno, havigema nehaza vahe'mo'za kea osugahaze.<verse eid="PSA 63:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 63"/>
  <chapter number="64" style="c" sid="PSA 64"/>
  <para style="s">Anumzamo aza hanigu vahe'mo nunamu hu'nea zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 64:1"/>Anumzamoka narimpa havizama hu'zama huama'ma hanuana antahi nenaminka, ha' vahe'mo'za nazeri koro ke nehu'za, nahe'za nehazanki kegava hunanto. <verse eid="PSA 64:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 64:2"/>Kefo avu'ava'ma nehaza vahe'mo'za nahenaku nanekea oku'a retro nehazanki, nazeri franekinka, ranke rankema nehaza kefo vahe'mokizmi zamavureti nazeri frakio. <verse eid="PSA 64:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 64:3"/>Zamagra ana vahe'mo'za bainati kazin kume'ma kaneaza hu'za, zamagefu'na kumera negane'za, nanekema hazana, kefo nanekezmimo'a kevema ahetrazaza nehaze. <verse eid="PSA 64:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 64:4"/>Ana vahe'mo'za kafoma ante'nazafinti kezmima omane vahera kevea nezmahe'za, antri hazaza hu'za korora osu tusiza hu'za hara hunezmantaze. <verse eid="PSA 64:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 64:5"/>Zamagra kefo avu'avazama hunakura kea huganti hugama hu'za zamazeri hankaveneti'za, vahe krifuma anagintesagura oku'a keaga retro nehaze. Ana nehu'za mago vahe'mo'a onketfa hugahie hu'za nehaze. <verse eid="PSA 64:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 64:6"/>Hazenkema hu' kema retroma nehu'za amanage nehaze, knare antahintahirafa retro hune hu'za nehaze. Vahe'mofo agu'afine antahintahifina vahe'ma revatga huzamoke avite'neankinka keamara osutfa hugahane. <verse eid="PSA 64:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 64:7"/>Hianagi Anumzamo'a Agra kevea zamahe'nige'za, ame hu'za hazenkea erigahaze. <verse eid="PSA 64:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 64:8"/>Zamagri zamagefu'namo zamazeri haviza hanige'za, zamagesaza vahe'mo'za zamagena neru'za, kiza zokago kea huzmantegahaze. <verse eid="PSA 64:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 64:9"/>Ana hanige'za maka vahe'mo'za koro nehu'za, Anumzamo'ma kaguvazama hia zankura huama nehu'za, maka avu'avazama eri fore'ma hia zamofonkura antahintahia huvava hugahaze. <verse eid="PSA 64:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 64:10"/>Anumzamofoma amage'ma nentaza vahe'mo'za Ra Anumzamofonkura muse nehu'za, Agri turunapinka manigahaze. Ana nehanage'za fatgo zamavuzmava'ma nehaza vahe'mo'za, muse nehu'za agi'a ahentesga hugahaze.<verse eid="PSA 64:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 64"/>
  <chapter number="65" style="c" sid="PSA 65"/>
  <para style="s">Anumzamoka tagu'vazi ne' mani'nane huno asunte'nea zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 65:1"/>Anumzamoka Saioni kumapi rankagia kamigahaze. Na'ano hugantegahune hutama ko'ma huvempama hu'nenuna zana tagra hugahune <verse eid="PSA 65:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 65:2"/>Na'ankure Kagra nunamuntia nentahine. Maka vahera Kagriteke egahune. <verse eid="PSA 65:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 65:3"/>Tagrama kumitigu'ma antahintahi hakarema nehunkenka, Kagra ana kumitia apaserante'nane. <verse eid="PSA 65:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 65:4"/>Kagrama huhamprintankeno, ruotge kuma tava'onte'ma nemanimo'a rama'a asomu erigahie. Kagri mono nompinka rama'a knare zane musezamo'enena avite'ne. <verse eid="PSA 65:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 65:5"/>Anumzamoka knarezantfa huno mareri agatere'nea fatgo kavukva hunka nunamuntia antahinka nona hunerantane. Anumzamoka Kagra tagu'vazi ne' mani'nane. Ama mopafi vahe'mo'za Kagrite zamentintia nehazageno, hagerimpima afetema nemaniza vahe'mo'zanena kagrite zamentintia nehaze. <verse eid="PSA 65:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 65:6"/>Kagra hihamukareti agonaramina trohunentenka, hanaveka'a eri ama hu'nane. <verse eid="PSA 65:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 65:7"/>Hagerimo'ma krantokrantoma nehigenka, Kagra azeri arava nehenka, kokankoka mopafi vahe'mo'zama rankerankema nehazagenka, zamazeri neraganane. <verse eid="PSA 65:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 65:8"/>Mopa atumparegama nemaniza vahe'mo'za ruzahu ruzahu kaguva zantamima erifore'ma hana zankura, ama zana, naza fore nehie hu'za nehu'za, tusi zamagogogu nehaze. Zage hanati kazigati vuno zage fre kazigama umani emanima nehaza vahe'mo'za Kagrama hana kavukvamo zamagu'a zamazeri otige'za tusi muse nehaze. <verse eid="PSA 65:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 65:9"/>Kagra mopa kegava hunenka tina aminkeno mopamo'a knare huno masavena nehie. Anumzamoka maka kaziga tina tro hunte'nanankino, knare huno witia tina amigeno, rama'a raga renente. Na'ankure Kagraka'a e'inahu huno fore hugahie hunka retro hunte'nana kante anteno efore nehie. <verse eid="PSA 65:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 65:10"/>Hozama rekorinte mopafina Kagra kora atrankeno runteno mopa ru fru nehuno, mopa ragana runezmane. Ana nehunka ata kora atrankeno hozafina runtegeno ne'zamo'a knarera huno nehageno rama'a ne'zana renente. <verse eid="PSA 65:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 65:11"/>Kagra mago kafufina asomu hurantankeno, ne'zamo'a tusi'za huno amponere. Ana nehigeno kama vanoma hupinena nezamo'a aviteno herafineramie. <verse eid="PSA 65:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 65:12"/>Hanki ka'ma kokampina trazamo'a hageno tretre nehigeno, agonaramimpina trazamo'a tretre huno refitegeno musena nehaze. <verse eid="PSA 65:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 65:13"/>Hanki krahopina sipisipi afutamine, meme afutamimo'za avitazageno, agupofina witi hozamo'a fankanino kankmuna omnetfa hu'ne. Ana maka trazama nenaza afu'mozane hozamozanena ranke hu'za zagamera hu'za musena nehaze.<verse eid="PSA 65:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 65"/>
  <chapter number="66" style="c" sid="PSA 66"/>
  <para style="s">Anumzamofo susu hunte'za agi'a ahentesga hu'naza zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 66:1"/>Maka ama mopafima nemaniza vahe'mota, ranke huta zagamera huta Anumzamofona agi'a ahentesga hiho! <verse eid="PSA 66:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 66:2"/>Anumzana Agri agimofo hihamu hanave'agura zagamera huta agi'a ahentesga hiho. Zgame huta Agri hihamu masazama'agura erinte ama hiho! <verse eid="PSA 66:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 66:3"/>Anumzamofonkura, kavukva zamo'a knare zantfa huno mareri agatere'ne hiho. Ha' vahekamo'za Kagri hihamu hankavegura koro hu'za zamavufaga eri anaki'za Kagritega neaze. <verse eid="PSA 66:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 66:4"/>Maka ama mopafima me'nea zantamimo'za monora hunegante'za, zagamera hu'za kagia ahentsga hugahaze. Zgamera hu'za rankagia ahentesga hugahaze. <verse eid="PSA 66:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 66:5"/>Eta tagri Anumzamo'ma hu'nea zana eme keho. Agra knarezantfa huno mareri agatere'nea avu'avaza, maka vahe'mofontera eri fore hu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 66:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 66:6"/>Hagerina eripapa hugantigama huno kana erifore hige'za, Agri vahe'mo'za hagege mopafi rugitagi'za kantukaziga vu'naze. Hanki Agriku musena hanune. <verse eid="PSA 66:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 66:7"/>Agra kinia mani'neno tusi'a hihamu'areti kegava huvava hugahie. Agra kokankoka vahera maka kna avua anteno nezmageanki, ke ontahi vahe'mo'za hara reonteho. <verse eid="PSA 66:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 66:8"/>Maka ama mopafi vahe'mota Anumzamofona husga hunteho. Ranke huta agia ahentesga nehinke'za vahe'mo'za antahiho. <verse eid="PSA 66:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 66:9"/>Tagrama fri'zankura kegava huneranteno, tatregeta regaririta trakara nosune. <verse eid="PSA 66:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 66:10"/>Anumzantimoka rerahenka knazana neraminka, silvama tevefi kreno eri agru hiaza hunka tazeri agru hane. <verse eid="PSA 66:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 66:11"/>Kagra kuko atrenka tazeritenka, tagumpina tusi'a knaza eri kofirantane. <verse eid="PSA 66:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 66:12"/>Ana nehunka tatrankeno tasenia refrage mafrage hu'za karisia eri'za vano hu'naze. Tevefine timpinena ufre'nonanagi, ete Kagra tavrenka anketa maka'zama ampore'nea mopafi one. <verse eid="PSA 66:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 66:13"/>Nagra tevefi kre fanane hu ofa mono nonka'afi eme hugantegahue. Nagrama huvempama hu'noa zantera ofa hugahue. <verse eid="PSA 66:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 66:14"/>Nagra ra hazenkefi mani'nena, huvempa hu'noe. <verse eid="PSA 66:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 66:15"/>E'ina agafare tevefima kre fanene hu ofa Kagritega hugahue. Nagra so'ema hu'nenia agonknaza ohari ve sipisipi afu kresramna vanugeno knare mna nevina, Nagra ve bulimakao afu'ene meme afu'enena Kagritega kresrama vanugeno, knare mna marerigahie. <verse eid="PSA 66:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 66:16"/>Anumzamofoma koro'ma hunentaza vahe'mota, eta eme nentahinke'na Anumzamo'ma hunante'nea zana tamasmi'neno. <verse eid="PSA 66:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 66:17"/>Nazama hinogura Agritega krafa nehu'na, nanekema hufina agi'a erisga huvava nehue. <verse eid="PSA 66:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 66:18"/>Nagrama kumini'ama huama'ma osuresina, Ra Anumzamo'a nunamunkeni'a ontahisine. <verse eid="PSA 66:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 66:19"/>Hianagi Anumzamo'a nunamuni'a nentahie. Nunamunkeni'a agesa anteno nentahie. <verse eid="PSA 66:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 66:20"/>Anumzamo'a ra agi erisie. Agra nunamuni'a antahi amnea nosuno vaga ore avesizama'a nagritetira eri notre.<verse eid="PSA 66:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 66"/>
  <chapter number="67" style="c" sid="PSA 67"/>
  <para style="s">Anumzamofonku'ma muse huno hu zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 67:1"/>Anumzamoka kasunku hurantenka asomura hunerantenka, kavugosa rukrahe huramigeno kavugosafinti masamo'a remsa huranteno taza hino. <verse eid="PSA 67:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 67:2"/>E'ina hanankeno Kagri kavukva zana ama mopafi vahe'mo'za ke'za antahi'za nehanageno, tagu'ma vazi'nana hihamu hankaveka'a kokankoka vahe'mo'za ke'za antahi'za hugahaze. <verse eid="PSA 67:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 67:3"/>Anumzamoka, vahe'mo'za kagia ahentesga hugahaze. Tamage maka kokankoka vahe'mo'za zagamera hu'za kagia ahentesga hugahaze. <verse eid="PSA 67:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 67:4"/>Ana maka vahe'ma ama mopafima nemaniza vahe'mo'za musena nehu'za, zagamera hu'za kagia ahentsga hugahaze. Na'ankure Kagra mago avamenteke fatgo hunka vahera refko henezmantenka, kokankoka vahera antahintahia zaminka zamazeri fatgo nehane. <verse eid="PSA 67:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 67:5"/>Maka vahe'mo'za zagamera hu'za Ra Anumzamoka kagia erisga hugahaze. Ana maka vahe'mo'za kagia erisga hugahaze. <verse eid="PSA 67:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 67:6"/>Ana hanageno ama mopafina ne'zamo'a amporegahie. Anumzana tagri Anumzamo'a rama'a zampi asomura hunerante. <verse eid="PSA 67:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 67:7"/>Anumzamo'a asomu hurantesie! E'ina'ma hanigeno'a ana maka vahe'ma ama mopafima mani'naza vahe'mo'za Anumzamofona korora huntesaze.<verse eid="PSA 67:7"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 67"/>
  <chapter number="68" style="c" sid="PSA 68"/>
  <para style="s">Anumzamo'a ha' vahe'aramina zamahe panani hugahie huno asunte'nea zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 68:1"/>Anumzamo'a otino ha' vahe'aramina zamahe panani hanie! Agri'ma avesrama hunentaza atre'za koro fregahaze. <verse eid="PSA 68:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 68:2"/>Zamahe panani huge'za zahomo tevegu eri amne huno vuno eno nehiaza hu'za freho. Fukimo tevemofo tava'onte me'neno temramra hiaza hu'za, kefo avu'ava'ma nehaza vahe'mo'za Anumzamofo avuga haviza hu'za fanene hugahaze! <verse eid="PSA 68:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 68:3"/>Hianagi fatgo zamavu'zamava'ma nehu'za Anumzamofo amage'ma nentaza vahe'mo'za muse hiho. Anumzamofo vahe'mo'za agri avuga musena nehanageno, musezamo'a zamagripina avitegahie. <verse eid="PSA 68:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 68:4"/>Anumzamofona zagamera huta agi'a ahentesga hiho. Hampo agofetu'ma manino vanoma nehia nera husga hunteho. Agi'a Ra Anumzanki, Agri avuga musena hiho. <verse eid="PSA 68:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 68:5"/>Agra megusa mofavre'ramimofo nezmafa mani'ne. Agra ruotge hu'nea kuma'afi mani'neno, kento a'neramina zmahonekea Anumza mani'ne. <verse eid="PSA 68:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 68:6"/>Hagi agraku'ma nemania vahera Anumzamo'a naga'afi avrentegeno muse huno nemanigeno, kinama hu'zama mani'naza vahera kinafintira zamavare fegi atrege'za musena hu'za knare nomani'zana nemanize. Hianagi Agri'ma ha'ma renentaza vahera, hagege hu'nea mopafi zamantege'za nemanize. <verse eid="PSA 68:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 68:7"/>Anumzamoka vaheka'ama Isipiti'ma zamavare atineraminka kagia kazana ometre eme atre hunka masi hunka hagege kokampima vugota hunka nevankeno, <verse eid="PSA 68:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 68:8"/>mopamo'a momi'momi huno tore'vare hu'ne. Anama hu'neana Anumzamoka kavuga, Sainai agonamofo Anumzane, Israeli vahe Anumzamoka kavuga anara hu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 68:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 68:9"/>Kagri vahe'mo'zama erisantiharesaze hunkama hagege mopama zami'nana mopafina, rama'a ko atrankeno, kora aru kasri kasri huno maka zana azeri kasefa hu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 68:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 68:10"/>Ana mopafi na Kagri vahera mani'nazagenka, ne'zana eri amporenampinti zamunte omne vahera ne'zana Anumzamoka zami'nane. <verse eid="PSA 68:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 68:11"/>Ra Anumzamo'ma vahe'mokizmima nanekema zamasamigeno, rama'a a'neramimo'za ana nanekea eri'za vu'za ome huama hu'naze. <verse eid="PSA 68:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 68:12"/>Hagi Kini vahe'mo'zane sondia vahe'mo'zanena maka zana atre'za fre'naze. Zamagra makazana atre'za frazage'za Israeli a'neramimo'za fenozmia refko hu'za eri'naze. <verse eid="PSA 68:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 68:13"/>Hagi zamagra sipisipi afu kevufima nemasageno, maho namamofo agekonare silvanu rekamarenteankna nehuno, azokate golinu rekamrenteankna huno refitegahie. <verse eid="PSA 68:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 68:14"/>Hankavenentake Anumzamo'ma ana mopafima nemaniza kini vahe'ma zamahe panani'ma hu'neana, Zalmoni agonafi ko'mopa ko tamiankna huno zamahe panani hu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 68:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 68:15"/>Basani agonaramina tusinasi agonarami me'ne. Basania rama'a agonaramina amunagamu mareri'nea agonarami me'naze. <verse eid="PSA 68:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 68:16"/>Rama'a agona morusama me'nea agonamoka, nagafare Saioni agonare'ma Anumzamo'ma manigahue hu'noma hu'nea agonagura, kegasanea nehane? Tamagerfa huno Ra Anumzamo'a ana agonare manivava huno vugahie. <verse eid="PSA 68:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 68:17"/>Ohampriga'a karisiramimo'za Ra Anumzamofona azeri kaginte'nazageno, Saioni agonaretira eno ruotgema hu'nea mono noma'afinka emareri'ne. <verse eid="PSA 68:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 68:18"/>Hanki mareri agatere'nea agonafima marenerinka kina vahetmina zamavarenka marerinke'za, ke ontahi vahe'mo'zane ha'ma renegantaza vahe'mo'zanena musezana negamize. Menina Ra Anumzamo'a tagrane ama agonafina manigahie hu'za nehaze. <verse eid="PSA 68:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 68:19"/>Ra Anumzana tagu'vazi Anumzamofona husga hunteho! Na'ankure maka knafina knazantia Agra e'nerie. <verse eid="PSA 68:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 68:20"/>Tagri Anumzana Agra tagu'ma nevazia Anumza mani'ne. Mareri agatere'nea Ra Anumzamo frizampintira tagura nevazie. <verse eid="PSA 68:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 68:21"/>Hianagi Anumzamo'a ha' vahe'aramina zamaseni rurako huno nezmaheno, ke ontahi kefo zamavu'zmava zanku'ma zmavesinente'za ana zamavu'zmavama nevaririza vahera Anumzamo'a zamaseni zaferina rufuzafupegahie. <verse eid="PSA 68:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 68:22"/>Ra Anumzamo'a huno, ha' vahera Basanitira zamavare'na egahue. Amefenkame hageri agu'atira zamavare'na marerigahue. <verse eid="PSA 68:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 68:23"/>Ana hanugeta nagri vahe'mota zamagri korampi tamagia sese nehanageno, kraramimo'zanena ana korana negahaze. <verse eid="PSA 68:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 68:24"/>Anumzamoka Kagri nagara rama'amo'za erimpi hu'za neazage'za vahe'mo'za nezamagaze. Nagri Anumzana kini'nimoka naga'mo'za mono nompi erimpi hu'za unefraze. <verse eid="PSA 68:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 68:25"/>Zgame'ma hu' vahe'mo'za vugota hazageno, zamefira ruzahu ruzahu zavenama ahe vahetami vazageno, amu'nompina mofa'nemo'za nevu'za nase'nasepana nehaze. <verse eid="PSA 68:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 68:26"/>Maka Israeli vahe'ma atruma hanafina zagame huta Anumzamofona agi'a hentesga hiho. Israeli vahe'ma zamasimu'ma nezmia Ra Anumzana Zgame huta agi'a husga hunteho. <verse eid="PSA 68:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 68:27"/>Osi nagara Benzameni naga'mo'za egote'za azageno, rama'a kva vahetmina Juda nagapinti azageno, maka Zebuluni nagapinti'ene Naftali nagapinti maka kva vahetmina e'naze. <verse eid="PSA 68:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 68:28"/>Anumzamoka hihamuka'a eriama huo. Anumzamoka korapa'ma hu'nanaza hunka hankaveka'a eriama huo. <verse eid="PSA 68:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 68:29"/>Ama mopafi kini vahe'mo'za musezana eri'za mono nonka'afi Jerusalemi egahaze. <verse eid="PSA 68:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 68:30"/>Kokankokama ha' vahetamima mani'naza vahetamina zamazeri korio. Varoza trazampima afi zagama mani'naza zagaramina zamazeri korio. Bulimakao afutmima hankavezmi omne bulimakao anenta taminema mani'nazana zamazeri korio. Zamazeri arava hege'za silvane golinena eri'za takisia eme kamiho. Hanki ha'ma hu'zanku'ma musema nehaza vahetmina, zamahe panani huge'za freho. <verse eid="PSA 68:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 68:31"/>Isipi vahe'mo'za zago'amo'ma marerirfa haveramina eri'za musezana eme negamisageno, Itiopia vahe'mo'za eme kepri hu'za monora hugantegahaze. <verse eid="PSA 68:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 68:32"/>Ama mopafima kini vahe'mo'zama kegavama hu'naza kumatamimpima nemaniza vahe'mota, Ra Anumzamofona zagamera huta agia ahentesga hiho. <verse eid="PSA 68:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 68:33"/>Korapa'ma me'nea hampomofo agofetu'ma manino'ma harenoma enevia nera zagamera huta agia erisga hiho. Kema nehigeno'a, agerumo'a monagemo'ma hiaza nehie. <verse eid="PSA 68:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 68:34"/>Anumzamofo hihamu hankavemofo agi agenkea, huama hunka vahera zamasamio. Agri konarari masa'amo'a Israeli vahera remsa hunezmantegeno, anami monafina hankave'amo'a avite'ne. <verse eid="PSA 68:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 68:35"/>Anumzamo'a mono noma'afina knare'zanfta huno mareri agatereno mani'ne. Israeli vahe Anumzamo Agra'a vahera hihamu hankavea nezmiankino, Agrake'za ragia erisie!<verse eid="PSA 68:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 68"/>
  <chapter number="69" style="c" sid="PSA 69"/>
  <para style="s">Anumzamoka nagu'vazio huno asunte'nea zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 69:1"/>Anumzamoka nagu'vazio! Na'ankure timo'a ti hageno nazeri nakrinaku nanankente ne-e. <verse eid="PSA 69:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 69:2"/>Hapapi hampakanena amefenkame supa'nena uneramue. Hankave moparera nagia noroe. Timu'nompi nevugeno timo'a nazeri nakari'za nehie. <verse eid="PSA 69:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 69:3"/>Anumzamoka nazama huogu'ma kavegama ante'nena krafagema nehua zamo'a hanaveni'a omanegeno, navurgamo'a nata negrigeno, nanankemo'a tusiza huno hagege nehie <verse eid="PSA 69:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 69:4"/>Mago haviza osu'nore'ma zamavaresrama hunenantaza vahe'mo'za nanumpima me'nea nazokara agatere'za rama'a vahe mani'naze. Anumzamoka hankavenentake ha' vahe'mo'za havige hu'za nahe fri'za nehaze. Havige hu'za e'ori'noa zankura musufa se'nananki tamio hu'za nehaze. <verse eid="PSA 69:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 69:5"/>Anumzamoka Kagra neginagi navu'nava zani'a kenka antahinka hu'nanankino, maka kumini'amo'a Kagri kavurera frara okigahie. <verse eid="PSA 69:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 69:6"/>Ra Anumzamoka kagrite'ma zamentintima nehaza vahera, nagrama hanua navu'navazamo'a zamazeri zamagazea osino. Monafi sondia vahe'mofo Ra Anumzamoka nagrama hanua navu'nava zantera zamazeri fenkamia ozmatro. Kagra Israeli vahe Anumza mani'nane. <verse eid="PSA 69:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 69:7"/>Na'ankure nagra Kagri kamagema antoa zanku kiza zokago kea hunenantazage'na nagazegura nehue. Ana nehugeno nazeri havizama nehaza zamo'a tusiza huno nazeri nagaze nehie. <verse eid="PSA 69:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 69:8"/>Nafuhemo'zama nenage'za keno antahino'ma osu'nea vahe'ma agatereankna nehaze. Hagi nenrera mofavremo'za rurega vahe'ma huntazankna zamavu'zamava hunenantaze. <verse eid="PSA 69:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 69:9"/>Mono nonka'agu'ma navesintoa zamo'a nagu'afina tevema reankna nehigeno, Kagri'ma kazeri havizama hu kema nehaza vahe'mo'za nagri'enena nazeri haviza hu naneke nehaze. <verse eid="PSA 69:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 69:10"/>Hanki zavi'ma nete'na kave'ma a'o'ma hu'na nunanuma nehuge'za vahe'mo'za, nazeri haviza hu ke nehaze. <verse eid="PSA 69:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 69:11"/>Nasunku'ma nehu'na nasunku kukenama huazankura, zamagra hunte'za kiza zokago ke hazage'na nagra zamagri zamavurera kiza zokago zankna hue. <verse eid="PSA 69:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 69:12"/>Hanki rankuma kafante'ma nemaniza kva vahe'mo'za nagenke nehazageno, akatima nene'za neginagima nehaza vahe'mo'za nazeri haviza hu zagame asunenantaze. <verse eid="PSA 69:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 69:13"/>Hianagi menina kna fatgo'are nunamuna nehuanki Anumzamoka vagaore kavesi zanteti kavesinantenka nona hunantenka tamage hunka nagu'vazio. <verse eid="PSA 69:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 69:14"/>Anumzamoka hapapintira navresga hunka nagu'vazio. Hanki natrege'na hapapina hampakanena uofra'neno. Zamavresrama hunenantaza vahe'mokizmi zamazampintira nagu nevazinka, tirupintira navazuhuti atro. <verse eid="PSA 69:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 69:15"/>Anumzamoka natregeno tima hageno esiantimo'a eme narefi otege, tirumo'a nazeri onakrige, fri vahe kerimo'a nasgahu onakrino. <verse eid="PSA 69:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 69:16"/>Ra Anumzamoka nunamuni'a antahinaminka nona hunanto, na'ankure vagaore kavesizamo'a knarezantfa hu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 69:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 69:17"/>Anumzamoka eri'za vahekamo'na kamefira huonaminka, ame hunka nunamu keni'a antahinka nona hunanto. Na'ankure ra hazenkefi mani'noe! <verse eid="PSA 69:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 69:18"/>Anumzamoka erava'o hunka nahokenka nagu'vazio. Ha' vahe'ni'amofo zamazampintira ete nagu'vazinka navro. <verse eid="PSA 69:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 69:19"/>Ha' vahe'nimo'zama nazeri nagaze nehu'za, hu haviza hunenante'za, nagima eri havizama nehaza zana Kagra ko kenka antahinka hu'nane. <verse eid="PSA 69:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 69:20"/>Kema nenasuza nazeri havizama haza zamo'a, tumoni'a netanege'na kria enerue. Hagi zamasunku hunantegahazafi hu'nama hua vahe'mo'za zamasunkura hunonantaze. <verse eid="PSA 69:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 69:21"/>Hagi ne'zama namigazana netre'za, vahe'ma ahe nefriaza avu'atgaza nezampina ante'za nenami'za, tinku'ma navenesige'za tima namigazana atre'za, aka waini nami'naze. <verse eid="PSA 69:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 69:22"/>Atregeno rama'a ne'zama retro hunte'za nenaza zamo'a, kukonkna huno zamazeri haviza nehina, maka zampima knare'ma hu'za nemaniza nomanizamo'a krifugna huno zamazeri haviza hino. <verse eid="PSA 69:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 69:23"/>Atregeno zamavumo'a asu nehinke'za, zamavua onkeho. Ana nehunka zamatregeno zamavufagafina hanavezmia omne amne nehina, hanavezmia atreme vu'za ome haviza hiho. <verse eid="PSA 69:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 69:24"/>Kagra karimpa ahe'zamantenka zamazeri haviza nehunka, tusi'a kasivazi nezmantenka zamahe hana huo. <verse eid="PSA 69:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 69:25"/>Nonkumazmimo'a haviza nehinkeno, nevasaza seli nozmimo'a vahera omaninigeno zutesie. <verse eid="PSA 69:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 69:26"/>Na'ankure Kagrama knama zaminka zamazeri havizama hana vahera zamahe'za zamasu'za nehu'za, zamazeri havizama nehanke'za zamatagu'ma nehaza vahe'mokizmia ki'za zokago ke hunezmantazageno mago'ane zamatagura nehaze. <verse eid="PSA 69:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 69:27"/>Kumi'zmia erinte agofetu agofetu nehunka, ana kumizmia apasezmantenka zamagura ovazio. <verse eid="PSA 69:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 69:28"/>Asimu eri avontafepima zamagima me'neana renehaganenka, fatgo avu'ava'ma nehaza vahe'mokizmi zamagima krentesampina zamagia kreonto. <verse eid="PSA 69:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 69:29"/>Anumzamoka knazampi mani'nena natagu nehuanki, vahe'ma zamagu'ma nevazina hihamuka'anu nagu'vazio. <verse eid="PSA 69:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 69:30"/>E'inama hananke'na zagame hu'na kagia ahentesga nehu'na, susu hugante'na husga hugantegahue. <verse eid="PSA 69:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 69:31"/>Na'ankure e'i ana'ma hanua zamo'a bulimakao afu'ma aheno kresramna vuge, maka pazive'ene agigo azankonema me'nenigeno kresramna vanigeno Ra Anumzamo'ma musema hu'zana agatere'ne. <verse eid="PSA 69:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 69:32"/>Zamavufama anterami'za nemaniza vahe'mo'za Anumzamo'ma eri'zama erisia zana nege'za, musena hugahaze. Anumzamofonku'ma nehake'za nunamuma hunentaza vahe'mo'za hankavea erigahaze. <verse eid="PSA 69:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 69:33"/>Na'ankure Ra Anumzamo'a maka zanku'ma upama nehaza vahe'mokizmi krafagea nentahino, Agri naga'ma zamavare'za kinama ome huzmante'naza vahera ozmatregahie. <verse eid="PSA 69:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 69:34"/>Maka monamotane, ama mopamokanena Ra Anumzamofona agia ahentesga nehinkeno, hagerine maka ana hageri agu'afima nemaniza zagamotanena zagamera huta agia ahentesga hiho. <verse eid="PSA 69:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 69:35"/>Na'ankure Anumzamo'a Jerusalemi kumara agu'nevazino, Juda rankumatamina eri fatgo huno kigahie. Ana hanige'za Agri vahe'mo'za anampi mani'ne'za zamagra mopazmia erisanti haregahaze. <verse eid="PSA 69:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 69:36"/>Eri'za vahe'amofo nezmagehoza erisanti hare'za nemanisage'za, agri'ma amagema nentaza vahe'mo'za anampina manigahaze.<verse eid="PSA 69:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 69"/>
  <chapter number="70" style="c" sid="PSA 70"/>
  <para style="s">Anumzamoka ame' hunka nazahuo huno asunte'nea zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 70:1"/>Muse hugantoanki Anumzamoka nagu'vazio! Ra Anumzamoka ame hunka enka eme nazahuo. <verse eid="PSA 70:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 70:2"/>Nahenaku'ma nehaza vahera zamazeri fenkami netrenka, zamazeri zamagaze huo. Hagi hazenkefima mani'noge'zama musema nehaza vahera zamazeri rukrahe huge'za zamagazegu nehu'za viho. <verse eid="PSA 70:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 70:3"/>Oho! Meni keta eri fore hu'ne hu'zama nagriku'ma nehaza vahetmina, zamazeri zamagaze huge'za zamagazegu hiho. <verse eid="PSA 70:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 70:4"/>Hianagi Kagriku'ma nehakaza vahe'mokizmia, tusi'a muse'za ante avite'zmantesane. Zamagu'ma vazi'nana zanku'ma zamave'nesia vahe'mo'za Anumzana marerirfa Anumza mani'ne hu'za ranke hu'za kagia ahentesga huvava hanaze! <verse eid="PSA 70:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 70:5"/>Hianagi nagra namunte omne maka zankura upa nehua ne' mani'noe. Hanki Anumzamoka muse hugantoanki, ame hunka eme naza huo. Kagrake'za naza hunka naguvazi' nera mani'nananki, Ra Anumzamoka ame hunka eme nazahuo.<verse eid="PSA 70:5"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 70"/>
  <chapter number="71" style="c" sid="PSA 71"/>
  <para style="s">Anumzamoka hankaveni'ma evuneraminigenka onatro huno asunte'nea zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 71:1"/>Ra Anumzamoka kegava hunantogu Kagritega neoanki, natrege'za ha' vahenimo'za nazeri nagazea osiho. <verse eid="PSA 71:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 71:2"/>Nahokenka nagu'vazio, na'ankure Kagra fatgo avu'ava zanke nehana Anumza mani'nane. Kagesa antenka krafageni'a nentahinka nagu'vazio. <verse eid="PSA 71:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 71:3"/>Hanavenentake havegani'a mani'nege'na anampinka fre'na maka kna ome frakineno. Kagra huzmantege'za nagura vaziho. Na'ankure Kagra nagu'vazi havegani'ane vihuni'ane mani'nane. <verse eid="PSA 71:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 71:4"/>Kefo zamavu'zmava'ma nehaza vahe'mokizmi zamazampinti'ene, vahe'ma zamazeri havizama nehaza vahe'mokizmi zamazampintira nagu'vazio. <verse eid="PSA 71:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 71:5"/>Na'ankure Ra Anumzamoka kagrake'za nagri amuha zani'a mani'nane. Mofavrema mani'nena agafa hu'na kagritera namentintia hu'noe. <verse eid="PSA 71:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 71:6"/>Kasema nanteneregati kagrake'za naza hankena mani'na e'noe. Kagra nenarera arimpafintira navre atirami'nane. E'ina agafare zagamera hu'na Kagri kagia ahentesga huvava hugahue. <verse eid="PSA 71:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 71:7"/>Maka zama nagri mani'zampima fore'ma nehia zana, rama'a vahe'mo'za ke'za antahi'za nehu'za rempi nehaze. Na'ankure kagra hanaveni'a mani'nenka, kegava hunenantane. <verse eid="PSA 71:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 71:8"/>E'ina agafare tagane'na omani zagamera hu'na kagi'a ahentesga huvava hugahue. Ana nehu'na maka kna kagri hihamu masakagura huama hugahue. <verse eid="PSA 71:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 71:9"/>Hanki ozafama renugenka Anumzamoka onatro. Hankaveni'ama omanenigenka kamefira huonamio. <verse eid="PSA 71:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 71:10"/>Na'ankure ha' vahe'nimo'za nazeri haviza hu naneke nehu'za, nahe frinaku oku'a nanekea retro nehaze. <verse eid="PSA 71:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 71:11"/>Zamagra amanage nehaze, Anumzamo'a amefi humianki, avaririta ome azerisune. Na'ankure mago vahe'mo'a ahora okegosie hu'za nehaze. <verse eid="PSA 71:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 71:12"/>Anumzamoka nagrira natrenka afetera omanio. Anumzani'amoka ame hunka enka eme naza huo. <verse eid="PSA 71:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 71:13"/>Havigema hunante'za nazeri havizama nehaza vahe'mokizmia, zamazeri zamagaze nehunka zamazeri haviza huo. Hanki hazenkema naminaku'ma nehaza vahera zamazeri fenkami netrenka, zamazeri zamagaze huo. <verse eid="PSA 71:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 71:14"/>Hianagi nagra kagrite amuhara huvava nehu'na, zagamera hu'na mago'ene kagia ahentesga huvava hugahue. <verse eid="PSA 71:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 71:15"/>Fatgo kavukava zanka'agura nagra huama nehu'na, vahe'ma agu'ma nevazina zankura maka zupa huama hugahue. Na'ankure kagra tagu'ma vazi'nanana ra zankrefa tro hu'nanankina, nagra ke'na antahina hugara osu'noe. <verse eid="PSA 71:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 71:16"/>Ra Anumzamoka hanavenentake eri'zama eri'nana zankura nagra husga hugantegahue. Kagra maka'zama kegava hu'nana Anumzana mani'nanankina, fatgo kavukava'ene Anumza kagrake mani'nane hu'na mika vahera zamasmigahue. <verse eid="PSA 71:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 71:17"/>Anumzamoka mofavrema mani'noretima agafa huno amare'ma eana, Kagra rempi hunaminka neanke'na hentofazama hu'nea kavukva zanka'agura huama hu'na vahera zamasami vava nehue. <verse eid="PSA 71:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 71:18"/>Ozafama resugeno efe nazoka'ma tagisiana, Anumzamoka onatrenka naza huge'na mani'nena, hihamu hankaveka'ane, ranra kaguvazama erifore'ma hu'nana zantminkura, menima fore'ma nehaza vahera zamasmi'neno. <verse eid="PSA 71:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 71:19"/>Anumzamoka fatgo kavukva zankamo'a mona agatereno ame'anagema mareri'ne. Kagra ruzahu ruzahu kaguva zanke erifore hu'nane. Anumzamoka kagri kna vahera ama mopafina omani'ne. <verse eid="PSA 71:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 71:20"/>Kagra antahinenka natranke'na hazenkefine knazampinena unefroe. Hianagi kagra nazeri knare nehunka, amefenkame mopa agu'ama mani'nofintira ete navre atiramigahane. <verse eid="PSA 71:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 71:21"/>Navresga hunka ra nagi nenaminka, mago'ane nazeri knare hunanto. <verse eid="PSA 71:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 71:22"/>Hapu zavena ahena kagia ahentesga hugahue. Na'ankure kagra huvempama hu'nana keka'are amage ante Anumzani'a mani'nane. Israeli vahete'ma Ruotge'ma hu'nana Anumzamoka, nagra laeri zavena nehe'na zagamera hu'na kagia ahentesga hugahue. <verse eid="PSA 71:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 71:23"/>Nagra ranke hu'na muse zagamera nehu'na, Kagia ahentesga hugahue. Na'ankure kagra nagu'vazinka ete navre'nane. <verse eid="PSA 71:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 71:24"/>Hagi fatgo kavukva zanka'agura maka kna huama hu'na vahera zamasami vava hugahie. Na'ankure nazeri havizama hunaku'ma nehaza vahera zamazeri fenkami netrenka zamazeri zamagaze hu'nane.<verse eid="PSA 71:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 71"/>
  <chapter number="72" style="c" sid="PSA 72"/>
  <para style="s">Solomoni asunte'nea zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 72:1"/>Anumzamoka fatgoma huno refkoma hu' avu'ava zana kini nera neminka, fatgo kavukva zanka'a kini ne'mofo nemofona amio. <verse eid="PSA 72:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 72:2"/>Fatgo avu'ava huno vaheka'a refko hunezmanteno, zamunte omne vahera fatgo avu'ava hunezmanteno kegava huzmantesie. <verse eid="PSA 72:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 72:3"/>Ranra agonaramimo'za knare huno manifru hu nomani'za avre'za vahetera ne-enageno, neone agonaramimo'za fatgo avu'ava zamofona nena raga'a rentegahaze. <verse eid="PSA 72:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 72:4"/>Zamunte omane vahera zamahonekeno, maka zanku'ma upa'ma nehaza vahe'mokizimi mofavreramina zamagu nevazino, vahe'ma ha'ma renezmantaza vahera zamazeri haviza hugahie. <verse eid="PSA 72:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 72:5"/>Zagema reno nevanigeno ikamo'ma remsa nehanire, fore'ma hu anante anante'ma hu'za vanaza vahe'mo'za korora hunegante'za monora hugante vava hu'za vanaze. <verse eid="PSA 72:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 72:6"/>Hagi kini ne'mo'ma vahe'ma kegavama hania avu'ava zamo'a, menima apri'nea apepate'ma ko'ma runteankna nehuno, mopafima atako'ma runteankna hugahie. <verse eid="PSA 72:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 72:7"/>Kini ne'mo'ma kegavama hania kna'afina, Anumzamofoma amage'manentaza vahe'mo'za mani'za zmifina knare hu'za hagegahaze. Ikamo'ma remsama nehanifima maka'zama hanaza zamo'a, knare zanke huno tretre hanie. <verse eid="PSA 72:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 72:8"/>Hagi mago hagerinteti'ma vuno mago hagerintema vanigeno, Yufretisi tinteti'ma vuno, mopa atumparegama vuno e'noma haniana, ana kini ne'mo miko vahera kegava hanie. <verse eid="PSA 72:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 72:9"/>Hanki hagage kokampima nemaniza vahe'mo'za agrite zmarena emere'za kepri nehanageno, ha' vahe'aramimo'za zamavugosaregati avuga masene'za kugusopa negahaze. <verse eid="PSA 72:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 72:10"/>Hanki Tasisi kumate kini vahe'mo'zane, hageri amu'nompima nemaniza vahe'mo'zanena takisi zagoa eri'za kini nera eme amigahaze. Ana nehanageno Seba kumate kini ne, Seba'enena ana hu'za musezana eri'za kini nera eme amigahaze. <verse eid="PSA 72:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 72:11"/>Maka kini vahe'mo'za agrite kepri hunentesageno, maka kokankoka vahe'mo'za agri eri'za erintegahaze. <verse eid="PSA 72:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 72:12"/>Na'ankure zamunte omne vahe'mo'zama krafagema nehanageno'a, agra antahizmino zamagu vazigahie. Vahe'mo'za zamazeri havizama nehazage'zama, vahe'mo'zama zamazama nosaza vahera, agra zamaza hugahie. <verse eid="PSA 72:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 72:13"/>Zamunte omne vaheku'ene maka zanku'ma upama nehaza vahekura agra asunku hunezmanteno zamagu' vazi'nige'za ofrigahaze. <verse eid="PSA 72:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 72:14"/>Vahe'mo'zama knama zami'za zamazeri haviza nehu'za, ha'ma rezmantaza vahera zamahokeno zamagu vazigahie. Na'ankure agri avurera vahera raza mani'naze. <verse eid="PSA 72:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 72:15"/>Kini ne'moka zazate manigahane! Seba kumateti golia eri'za kagri eme kamisaze. Maka zupa kagrikura nunamuna hunegante'za, asomu kea hugantesaze. <verse eid="PSA 72:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 72:16"/>Ama mopafina witimo'a rama'a nehanigeno, agonafinena witimo'a hageno, marerino umase emase hanie. Lebanoni zafaramimo'ma nehiaza huno zafa ragamo'a knare huno renentenigeno, ran kumapima nemaniza vahe'mofo nomani'zamo'a tra'zama hageno tretre hiankna huno, knare'za huno afovage huno tretre hugahie. <verse eid="PSA 72:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 72:17"/>Hanki kini ne'mofo agimo'a mevava huno nevina, zagemo'ma me'neno'ma remsama huno vania kna'afina kini ne'mofo agia erisga hugahaze. Anumzamo'ma agri'ma asomu'ma hunte'neankna huno maka ama mopafi vahera asomura hunezmantesige'za nege'za ana nera husga huntesaze. <verse eid="PSA 72:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 72:18"/>Ra Anumzana Israeli vahe Anumzamofona agi'a ahentesga hanune. Agrake'za knare huno mareri agatere avu'ava zana erifore nehie. <verse eid="PSA 72:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 72:19"/>Ra Anumzamofona hihamu masa'ane agi'a ahentesga huvava hanune! Hankavenentake masa'amo'a maka ama mopafina remsa hanie! Tamage! Anazana fore hanie. <verse eid="PSA 72:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 72:20"/>Jesi nemofo Deviti nunamumo'a amare eme vagare'ne.<verse eid="PSA 72:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 72"/>
  <chapter number="73" style="c" sid="PSA 73"/>
  <para style="s">Namba 3 zagame avontafere</para>
  <para style="s">Anumzamo'a nagri hankaveni'a mani'neno Nagri Anumza mani'ne huno Asapu asunte'nea zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 73:1"/>Tamagerfa huno Anumzamo'a Israeli vahe'mokizmia knare hunezmanteno, zamagu'amo'ma agruma hu'nea vahe'mokizmia knarera hunezamante. <verse eid="PSA 73:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 73:2"/>Hianagi nagiamo'a krarige'na traka hu'na masekate'noe. Nagiama renakeroana regaririna masekatoe. <verse eid="PSA 73:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 73:3"/>Na'ankure zamavufaga rama nehaza vahera kanive renezmante'na, kefo avu'ava'ma nehaza vahe'mokzimi nomanizamo'ma knare zanke'ma hia zama nege'na, kenanunu hu'noe. <verse eid="PSA 73:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 73:4"/>Na'ankure ana vahe'mokizmia zamavufagafina zamatazana omanege'za, kria e'ori hanaveti'za nemanize. <verse eid="PSA 73:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 73:5"/>Mago'a vahe'mo'zama nehazaza hu'za hazenkefina uofrege, ruga'a vahe'mo'zama nehazaza hu'za knazampina unofraze. <verse eid="PSA 73:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 73:6"/>E'ina hu'negu zamavufaga rama hu' zamo'a, zmanankempima nentaniza pasesugna nehigeno, vahe'ma hazenkema zamizamo'a kukena antanizankna hu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 73:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 73:7"/>Ana vahe'mokizmi zamagu'amo'a hanavenetino tapari'nege'za kefo avu'ava zana huvava hu'za nevaze. <verse eid="PSA 73:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 73:8"/>Zamagra kiza zokago kene kefo kege nehu'za, zamavufaga ra nehu'za vahe'ma zamazeri haviza hu kankuke nehakaze. <verse eid="PSA 73:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 73:9"/>Zamagrama nanekema nehu'za monafima mani'naza vahera huhaviza hunezmante'za, zamagra mopa eri nafa'a hu nanekege nehaze. <verse eid="PSA 73:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 73:10"/>Ana hazage'za zamagogogu nehazageno, antahintahi zmimo'a savri nehie. Ana nehu'za ana vahe'mokizmi nanekea tima nazaza hu'za nenaze. <verse eid="PSA 73:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 73:11"/>Ana vahe'mo'za amanage nehaze, inankna huno Anumzamo'a keno antahinora hugahie? hu'za nehaze. Marerirfa Anumzamo'a amafima fore'ma nehia zana, keno antahinora osugahie hu'za nehaze. <verse eid="PSA 73:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 73:12"/>Kefo avu'ava'ma nehaza vahera zamageho, knare nomani'za mani'nazageno fenozmimo'a ome ra huno nevie. <verse eid="PSA 73:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 73:13"/>Nagra nagu'a kegava hugeno agru huno me'negena, kumira osu'noanki, e'i ana zama hu'noa zamo'a amnezankna hugahifi? <verse eid="PSA 73:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 73:14"/>Maka knafina hazenkefi nagra mani'na nevue, maka nanterana nazeri haviza hankena natagura hu'na nevue. <verse eid="PSA 73:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 73:15"/>Nagra ama anazamofo nanekema vahetmima zamasamuresina, ha' vahe zamazampi vaheka'a zamavarente'naku nagra komoru huresine. <verse eid="PSA 73:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 73:16"/>Hianagi inankna hu'za kefo avu'ava'ma nehaza vahe'mo'za, nomaniza zamifina knarera nehaze. Nagra antahi amara osu'na, tusi knazampi nemanue. <verse eid="PSA 73:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 73:17"/>Ana'ma hute'na Anumzamoka mono nompima ufre'na, kefo avu'ava'ma nehaza vahe'mofonte'ma henkama efore'ma hania zana ke'na antahi'na hue. <verse eid="PSA 73:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 73:18"/>Tamagerfa hunka Anumzamoka krari'nenia kampi zamavarentege'za rekrari'za zavapi urami'za hazenke eriho. <verse eid="PSA 73:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 73:19"/>Zamagra ame hu'za hazenkea eri'za haviza nehanageno, korozamo zamahe frigahie. <verse eid="PSA 73:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 73:20"/>Vahe'mo'ma ava'nama keteno nanterama otigeno, ana ava'namo'ma fanenema hiankna hunka Anumzamoka zamazeri fanenema hugahane! <verse eid="PSA 73:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 73:21"/>Ana zama ke'na antahi'nama nehugeno'a, musezanimo'a omanegeno narimpa aka nehegeno, tumo'nimo'a natagri'ne. <verse eid="PSA 73:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 73:22"/>Nagra ana zana anira osu'noanki, neginagi hu'na antahintahi'a omne afi zaga kafagna kagri kavurera hu'noe. <verse eid="PSA 73:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 73:23"/>Hianagi nagra katre'na ovu maka knafina kagrane mani'nogenka, tamaga kaziga nazante nazeri'nane. <verse eid="PSA 73:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 73:24"/>Ana nehunka knare antahintahi naminka, nazeri fatgo nehanankinka, henka navrenka masanentake kumapina vugahane. <verse eid="PSA 73:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 73:25"/>Monafina nagri vahera omani'neanki, kagrake'za mani'nane. Hagi mopafina mago zankura navesi ontegahuanki, kagrike'za navesi kantegahue. <verse eid="PSA 73:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 73:26"/>Nagu'amo'ene navufgamo'enena zaferina omne amne huno navresra nehianagi Anumzamoke'za nagu'amofona nazeri hankavenetiankino, nagri Anumza Agra mani vava nehie. <verse eid="PSA 73:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 73:27"/>Kagri'ma katre'za afetema nemaniza vahe'mo'za fanane hugahaze. Na'ankure kamefi'ma hugamiza vahera zamazeri haviza nehane. <verse eid="PSA 73:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 73:28"/>Hianagi nagrama Anumzamofo tvaonte'ma nemanua zamo'a knare nehie. Ra Anumzamo'a nagri Anumza mani'neno, nagu vazi kuma mani'neankina, knare'ma huno mareri agatere avu'ava zama'agura huama hugahue.<verse eid="PSA 73:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 73"/>
  <chapter number="74" style="c" sid="PSA 74"/>
  <para style="s">Mono noma eri haviza hu'naza zanku hunte'naza zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 74:1"/>Anumzamoka nahigenka kamefira huraminka mani vava hunka nevane? Nahigenka trazampi zmantanke'zama vanoma nehaza sipisipi afutaminkura, Kagra krimpa ahenezmantane? <verse eid="PSA 74:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 74:2"/>Korapama Nagri vahe manigahaze hunkama huhampri'nana vahe mani'nonanki, kagera okaninka kagesa antahiramio. Tagu'ma nevazinka mareri fenozani'agna huta manigahaze hu'nana vahe tagra mani'none. Kagra Saioni agonarema nemanina agonagura (Jerusalemi) kagesa antahio. <verse eid="PSA 74:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 74:3"/>Eri havizama hazageno havizama huteno zazate'ma me'noma nea rankumapi, nevunka ko. Ha' vahetimo'za Kagri mono nona eri haviza hu'naze. <verse eid="PSA 74:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 74:4"/>Kagri ha' vahe'mo'za ana mono nompi mani'ne'za kezana neti'za, ha'ma hugatere'naza avame'zana, krauvefana (flek) asenentaze. <verse eid="PSA 74:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 74:5"/>Saumenuma zafama antagitre'naku'ma nehazaza hu'za nona antagi tapage nehaze. <verse eid="PSA 74:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 74:6"/>Hagi mono no zafare'ma antreno'ma keonke'zamofo amema'ama trohunteno avasasema hunte'nea zana, sasume tunuti'ene hamanteti antagi hantagutagi atre'ne. <verse eid="PSA 74:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 74:7"/>Ana ha' vahe'mo'za zamagra teve tagintazageno mono nonka'a teno ko mopafi tepasaru huramigeno, Kagri kagima me'nea nona eri ankrare kre'naze. <verse eid="PSA 74:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 74:8"/>Zamagra amanage hu'za antahintahia antahi'naze, ana maka zana eri haviza hutregahune hu'za hute'za, ana mopafima Anumzamofoma mono'ma hunentaza nonkumatamina teve tagintazageno te'ne. <verse eid="PSA 74:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 74:9"/>Anumzamoka tamagrane mani'noe hunka mago avamezana eri fore hanketa onkone. Hagi ana maka kasnampa vahe'mo'za omanizageno, ama knazamo'ma vagamaresia zama tasami'naza vahera omani'naze. <verse eid="PSA 74:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 74:10"/>Anumzamoka nama'agna atresankeno ha' vahetimo'za huhavizana hugantegahaze? Hagi zamatre'sanke'za maka zupa kagia eri haviza huvava hanazo? <verse eid="PSA 74:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 74:11"/>Nahigenka hankavenentake tamaga kazana rusutenka taza nosane? Hanavenentake kazana renamaginka omaninka rusutenka zamahe frio. <verse eid="PSA 74:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 74:12"/>Hianagi Anumzamoka korapama evu'nea knafine meninena nagri kini ne' mani'nenka, ama mopafina tagura vazi'nane. <verse eid="PSA 74:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 74:13"/>Kagra hankaveka'areti hagerina eri atanankeno tare kaziga otikenka, hagerimpima nemania afizagamofo aseniramina rupraro vazi'nane. <verse eid="PSA 74:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 74:14"/>Laviataniema hu'za nehaza afi zagama hagerimpi nemania zagamofo aseniramina rupraro vazitenka, hagage kokampima nemaniza zagagafa zaminke'za ne'naze. <verse eid="PSA 74:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 74:15"/>Kagrake'za kampu'i tine, neone tinena erinkazo hankeno, timo'a krohupeno enevigenka, ontaneno evuvavama nehia tirantamina eri neranane. <verse eid="PSA 74:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 74:16"/>Masane, haninena anantarega kagri suza me'na'e. Kagrake'za zagene ikanena, tro hunte'nane. <verse eid="PSA 74:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 74:17"/>Kagrake'za mopamofona isagana antetere nehunka, amuho knane zasi'ma hu kna trohu ante'nane. <verse eid="PSA 74:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 74:18"/>Ra Anumzamoka ha' vahe'mo'zama huhavizama hunegantazana kagesa nentahinka, neginagi vahe'mo'zama kagi'ama huhaviza nehaza zana ko. <verse eid="PSA 74:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 74:19"/>Hagi atregeno maho namaka'a afi zagamo'za zamahe'za oneho. Vahe'mo'zama knama nezamiza vaheka'a kagerakani zamante vava osuo. <verse eid="PSA 74:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 74:20"/>Huhagerafi huvempa kema hu'nana zana kagera okanio. Na'ankure ama mopafima hanintirima hu'nefina, vahe'ma ohefri ahefrima hu'zamo'a avite. <verse eid="PSA 74:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 74:21"/>Vahe'mo'zama zamazeri havizama nehaza vahera zamatrege'za, zamagazegura nehu'za rukrahe hu'za oviho. Hanki atrege'za zamunte omne vahe'mo'zane, maka zanku'ma atupa'ma nehaza vahe'mo'za kagi'a ahentesga hiho. <verse eid="PSA 74:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 74:22"/>Anumzamoka otinka tagri kaziga antenka tahoko. Neginagi vahe'mo'za maka knafina, hago zazate huhaviza hugante'za nevaze. <verse eid="PSA 74:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 74:23"/>Ha' vahekamo'zama nehazankea antahi amnea osuo. Hagi ranke hu'zama huhaviza hunegantaza zamo'a anagamu mareri vava nehie.<verse eid="PSA 74:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 74"/>
  <chapter number="75" style="c" sid="PSA 75"/>
  <para style="s">Anumzamofo agi'ama ahentesgama hu zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 75:1"/>Anumzamoka susu huganteta kagia ahentesga hune. Na'ankure tagri tava'onte kagra mani'nane. Knare'za huno mareri agatere'nea kavukva zanka'agura vahe'mo'za huge antahige nehaze. <verse eid="PSA 75:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 75:2"/>Anumzamo'a huno, vahe'ma refko hu knama erinte'noa kna fatgore, vahera mago avamenteke ante'na refko huzmantegahue. <verse eid="PSA 75:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 75:3"/>Hagi mopama momi'ma higeno, vahe'mofo mani'zamo'a herave korave nehigena, Nagra mopama azeri'nea trara azeri akona nehue. <verse eid="PSA 75:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 75:4"/>Zamavufga rama nehaza vahekura tamavufga rana osiho nehu'na, kefo avu'ava'ma nehaza vahekura hu'na, hara agateregahune huta tamimiza runafege nehuta, hankavetamia erita mareoriho hu'na zamasamigahue. <verse eid="PSA 75:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 75:5"/>Hara hu agateregahune huta hankavetamia erita marenerita, tamanankena antesga huta tamavufga rankea osiho. <verse eid="PSA 75:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 75:6"/>Vahe'mofoma azeri antesgama hu'zana, zage hanati kazigatiro, zage fre kazigatiro, hagage kokampintira omegahie. <verse eid="PSA 75:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 75:7"/>Anumzamoke vahera refko huno, nezmageno avre anagamu netreno, avre henkama netreno hugahie. <verse eid="PSA 75:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 75:8"/>Na'ankure mnanentake zantamine waini tinema eri havia hu'nea hankave tina agrema'age nehigeno, Ra Anumzamo'a azampi azeri'ne. Agra maka ama mopafima kefo avu'ava'ma nehaza vahete tagitresigeno, ana vahe'mo'za nene'za ro'afima me'nia ankarere'anena nehana hugahaze. <verse eid="PSA 75:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 75:9"/>Hianagi nagra maka kna Anumzamo'ma tro'ma hu'nea zankura huama hu vava nehu'na, zagamera hu'na Jekopu Anumzamofona agi'a ahentesga hugahue. <verse eid="PSA 75:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 75:10"/>Na'ankure Anumzamo'a huno, kefo avu'ava'ma nehaza vahe'mokizmi hankavea eri atregahuanagi, fatgo avu'ava'ma nehaza vahe'mokizmia mago'ane hankavea zamigahue.<verse eid="PSA 75:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 75"/>
  <chapter number="76" style="c" sid="PSA 76"/>
  <para style="s">Mago vahe'mo'a kagri kavuga otigara osu'ne huno Asapu asunte'nea zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 76:1"/>Juda vahe'mo'za Anumzamofona ke'za antahi'za hu'neza kesga hunentazageno, Israeli mopafina agimo'a haruharu hu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 76:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 76:2"/>Jerusalemia Agrama nemania kuma megeno, Saioni agonare noma'a me'ne. <verse eid="PSA 76:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 76:3"/>E'i anampina ha' vahe'mokizmi kevemofo agonare'ma tevema nerea kevema, hankoma, bainati kazinknone mago'a hazantamine ruhantagi atre'ne. <verse eid="PSA 76:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 76:4"/>Kagri hihamu hankavene masazanka'amo'a, zagagafama ahe'za nenaza agonaramina agatere'ne. <verse eid="PSA 76:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 76:5"/>Hankave ha' vahetmina zamarohu zamarenka zamahe fri'nanankiza mago'mo'a otino hara huorantegahie. <verse eid="PSA 76:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 76:6"/>Jekopu Anumzamoka hate'ma ne-enka ivimo agazamo'ma hunka ankeno'a, hosi afu'mo'ene hosi agumpima vanoma nehu'za ha'ma nehaza vahe'mo'zanena, kazara osu'za mopafi mase'naze. <verse eid="PSA 76:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 76:7"/>Na'ankure kagoro huga vaheki'za Kagrikura vahe'mo'za korora hugahaze. Hagi krimpa ahezamo'ma tevema neresifina, iza knarera hu'nenia vahe'mo kavuga otigahie? <verse eid="PSA 76:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 76:8"/>Ha' vaheka'ama knazama zamisana kea monafinkati huama nehankeno, mopafima nemaniza vahe'mo'za zmahirahiku nehu'za, kea osu kavuga akohe'za nemanize. <verse eid="PSA 76:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 76:9"/>Hagi Anumzamo'a otino vahe'mo'zama zamazeri havizama nehaza vahera refko huzmantegahie. <verse eid="PSA 76:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 76:10"/>Vahe'mo'za zamarimpama nehaza zamo'a, rankagi negamize. Na'ankure mago'ama mesia rimpahe'za erinka kanankempi kavasese hugahane. <verse eid="PSA 76:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 76:11"/>Ra Anumzana tamagri Anumzamofontega huvempa nehuta, anama huvempama hanaza kea eri ragareho. Knare'zantfama huno mareri agatere'nea ne'tega miko vahe'mota musezana erita agrite eho! <verse eid="PSA 76:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 76:12"/>Na'ankure ugagota kva vahe'mo'zama antene'za, akagima neraza zantamina, Agra ahe hantagi netrege'za, ama mopafi kini vahe'mo'za koro hunentaze.<verse eid="PSA 76:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 76"/>
  <chapter number="77" style="c" sid="PSA 77"/>
  <para style="s">Hazenke knafina Ra Anumzamofonku hakregahue huno asunte'nea zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 77:1"/>Anumzamofontega ranke hu'na nagra krafagea hugahue. Nazama hinogura ranke hu'na krafa hanugeno Anumzamo'a antahi namigahie. <verse eid="PSA 77:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 77:2"/>Hazenkefima unefre'na, Ra Anumzamofonku hake'noe. Kinagareti'ma agafama huno vuno ko'ma ome tu'neana monafinka nazana rusutete'na nunamuna hu'noanagi, narimpamo'a kna hu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 77:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 77:3"/>Anumzamokagu'ma nagesama nentahi'na, natagura karagi neru'na, kagriku'ma nentahi'na nunamuma nehugeno, zaferinani'a omne amne hu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 77:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 77:4"/>Kagra navua eri hari hanke'na maka kinaga navura omase mani'nena, tusi antahintahi hakare nehu'na kea osu'noe. <verse eid="PSA 77:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 77:5"/>Ko'ma evu'nea knafima knare'ma hu'na mani'noa zanku nagesa nentahi'na, ko'ma evu'nea kafuramimpima fore'ma hu'nea zantaminkura nagesa nentahue. <verse eid="PSA 77:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 77:6"/>Nagrama kenage'ma nehua zagamenigura nagesa nentahi'na, nagu'afina antahintahia hu'noe. Anante antahintahinimo'ma ama'ma higena, ko'ma hu'noa zagamekura nagesa nentahi'na, anage hu'noe, <verse eid="PSA 77:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 77:7"/>Anumzamo'a ha natreno amefi hu'namifi? Ete mago'anena avesinanteno nazeri so'ea huonantegahifi? <verse eid="PSA 77:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 77:8"/>Vagaore avesizamo'a ha fanene hu vagarefi? Huvempama hu'nea kemo'a hago vagarefi? <verse eid="PSA 77:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 77:9"/>Anumzamo'a asunku'ma hurante zankura agekanifi? Hifi tusi'a arimpa aheneranteno asunku zama'a azenerifi? <verse eid="PSA 77:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 77:10"/>Anante anage hu'na antahi'noe, Marerirfa Anumzamo hara renante hu'na hu'noe. <verse eid="PSA 77:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 77:11"/>Hianagi Anumzamo'ma hu'nea avu'ava zankura nagera okanigahue. Tamage, nagra korapa'ma ruzahu ruzahu kaguvazama hu'nana zankura nagera okanigahue. <verse eid="PSA 77:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 77:12"/>Maka zama tro'ma hu'nana zankura nagesa antahigami vava nehu'na, ranra avu'avazama hu'nana zantmimofonku nagu'afina antahi vava hugahue. <verse eid="PSA 77:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 77:13"/>Anumzamoka kavukva zankamo'a ruotagetfa hu'ne. Tagri hankavenentake Anumzankna Anumzana magore huno omanitfa hu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 77:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 77:14"/>Kagra ruzahu ruzahu kagu'vaza eri fore hu'nana Anumza mani'nane. Kagra vahe'mokizmi amu'nompi hankaveka'a erifore hu Anumza mani'nane. <verse eid="PSA 77:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 77:15"/>Kagra hankavenentake kazanuti vaheka'a Jekopu mofavreramine, Josefe mofavreraminena zamagu'vazi'nane. <verse eid="PSA 77:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 77:16"/>Anumzamoka timo'ma negageno'a, koro nehigeno, hagerimo'ma negageno'a koro huno ahirahiku hu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 77:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 77:17"/>Hampompintira ko'mo'a herafi neramigeno, monagemo'a kragugu nehigeno, kopsinamo'a rutrage huno kevema ahene trazankna huno enevie. <verse eid="PSA 77:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 77:18"/>Kagra hankeno monagemo'a ununkomofo agasasa nerigeno, kopsinamo'a maka kokantega trage huno rumsa huno vuno eno nehigeno, ama mopamo'a kaza nehuno tusi agogogu nehie. <verse eid="PSA 77:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 77:19"/>Kama vanoma nehana kamo'a hageri amu'nompi vu'ne. Kagra tusi'a hankave timpi nevankeno, vahe'mo'za kagiaka nonkaze. <verse eid="PSA 77:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 77:20"/>Sipisipi afutami avreno viankna hunka, vaheka'a ana kampina zamavarenka vananke'za, Aroni'ene Mosesekea sipisipi afu kva vahekna huke zamavareke vu'na'e.<verse eid="PSA 77:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 77"/>
  <chapter number="78" style="c" sid="PSA 78"/>
  <para style="s">Henkama fore'ma hanaza vahera zamasmiho huno asunte'nea zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 78:1"/>Rempima huramisua zana vahe'nimota antahiho, nanekema tamasmisuana tamagesa ante'neta antahiho. <verse eid="PSA 78:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 78:2"/>Na'ankure nagra mago fronka ke tamasamigahue. Rempima huramiga zantamima korapama oku'ama me'nea zantmi rempi huramigahue. <verse eid="PSA 78:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 78:3"/>Kanihe'ma ko'ma antahi'nona kanihe tamasamigahue, ko'ma tagehe'mozama hurasmi anante anante'ma hu'za e'naza kanihe tamasamigahue. <verse eid="PSA 78:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 78:4"/>Hagi ama ana tamage nanekea, mofavretirera frara okigosunanki, Ra Anumzamo'ma hihamu hankave'anuti'ma ruzahu ruzahu kaguva zantmima erifore'ma hu'nea zantamina, menima fore'ma nehaza vahetmina zamasamigahune. <verse eid="PSA 78:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 78:5"/>Na'ankure Agra Jekopuna trake'a nemino, kasege'a Israeli vahera zami'ne. Ana nehuno tagehe'mofonkura, mofavre nagatamia ama ana nanekea rempi huzamiho huno zamasmi'ne. <verse eid="PSA 78:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 78:6"/>Ana hinkeno henkama fore hu anante anante'ma hu'za vanaza vahe'mo'za, ama ana nanekea antahine'za, mofavrezmia rempi hu'za zamasami vava hu'za viho. <verse eid="PSA 78:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 78:7"/>E'ina hanage'za fore hu anante anante'ma hu'za vanaza vahe'mo'za Anumzamofonkura amuhara nehu'za, kasegea amage nente'za, ruzahu ruzahu kaguva zama hu'nea zankura zamagera okanigahaze. <verse eid="PSA 78:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 78:8"/>E'ina nehu'za zamagehemo'zama zamagu'ama eri hanavemati'naza zana nosu'za, hara renonte'za, kea antahi'za avarari fatgo nosu'za, zamagu'a Anumzamofona omi'nazanknara osugahaze. <verse eid="PSA 78:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 78:9"/>Hagi Efraemi sondia vahe'mo'za ati kevea zamazampi eri'nazanagi, ha'ma hazafina zamage'na humi'za hara osu koro fre'naze. <verse eid="PSA 78:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 78:10"/>Zamagrama huhagerafi huvempa kema Anumzanema hu'nazankea runetagre'za, kasege'ama avarari zankura zamavaresra hu'naze. <verse eid="PSA 78:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 78:11"/>Anumzamo'ma maka ruzahu ruzahu zama zamaveri'ma hu'nea zankura zamagenekani'za, kagu'vazama hu'nea zankura zamagesa ontahi'naze. <verse eid="PSA 78:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 78:12"/>Hagi Zoani kaziga Isipi mopafina zamafahe'mofo zamavufina, Agra ruzahukna kaguvaza erifore hu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 78:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 78:13"/>Na'ankure Agra hagerina amu'nompinti eri ataneno, kana eri fore huno zamavreno kantu kaziga vigeno, timo'a emare hihi huno mareri'ne. <verse eid="PSA 78:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 78:14"/>Hagi masafi'na hamponteti kana zamaveri huno zamavareno nevuno, maka hanimpina teve anefanu remsa huzmanteno zamavareno vu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 78:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 78:15"/>Ka'ma kopina Agra havea rutaneno tina zamigeno, timo'a krohupeno ege'za ne'naze. <verse eid="PSA 78:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 78:16"/>Hagi Agra neone tintamina erifore higeno, havefintira hanatino tirantima eviaza huno enevie. <verse eid="PSA 78:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 78:17"/>Hianagi ana hagege ka'ma kopina amnea omani'za kumira hu'za ne-eza, marerirfa Anumzamofona hara rente'za e'naze. <verse eid="PSA 78:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 78:18"/>Zamagra zamagu'areti hu'za Anumzamofona rehe'za nege'za, zamavesi zmavesima nehia nezankura Anumzamofona antahige'naze. <verse eid="PSA 78:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 78:19"/>Ana nehu'za Anumzamofona huhaviza hunente'za amanage hu'naze, Anumzamo'a Agra amne hagege kokampintira ne'zana eri fore huramigahio? hu'za hu'naze. <verse eid="PSA 78:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 78:20"/>Tamage Agra havea rutanegeno timo'a krohupeno evuno aviteno megahianagi, Agra bretine ame'anena vahe'a zamigahifi?<verse eid="PSA 78:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 78:21"/>Hagi Ra Anumzamo'ma ana nanekema nentahigeno'a, arimpama ahe'zamo'a teveregeno Jekopu nagara teve krenerasegeno, mago'a Israeli vahe'mokizmia tevereti krerasage'ne. <verse eid="PSA 78:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 78:22"/>Na'ankure zamagra Anumzamofontera zamentintia nosu'za, kegava hurantegahie hu'za antahi omi'naze. <verse eid="PSA 78:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 78:23"/>Hianagi Agra monamofonkura kafana anagio, higeno monamo'a kafana anagino erihagro hu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 78:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 78:24"/>Mana ne'zanema nehaza ne'zana ko'ma riankna huno monafinkati herafi tregeno, monafintira witia zmige'za ne'naze. <verse eid="PSA 78:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 78:25"/>Ankeromofo ne'za zamige'za vahe'mo'za nenazageno, nezmu'ma huga avamente Anumzamo'a rema'a ne'za zamige'za ne'naze. <verse eid="PSA 78:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 78:26"/>Zage hanati kaziga zahora huntegeno monafina zahora erino enevigeno, Agra'a hihamu'areti sauti kaziga zahora azeri fatgo higeno Agra antahia kantera nevie. <verse eid="PSA 78:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 78:27"/>Agra monafinti ame'a atregeno eramino mopafina kugusopamo hihi huno mareriankna nehigeno, namama zmi'neana namaramimo'a rama'a hu'za hagerinkena kasepagna hu'naze. <verse eid="PSA 78:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 78:28"/>Ana namaramina Anumzamo'a higeno seli noma ki'za mani'naza amu'nompine, seli noma ki'zama nemanizafinena erami erami hu'naze. <verse eid="PSA 78:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 78:29"/>Zamagrama zmanankenku'ma haza zaga Agra zamige'za nezamu hu'naze. <verse eid="PSA 78:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 78:30"/>Hianagi ana ne'zana nevaga orenazageno, ana ne'zamo'a zahufa zamagipi me'nege'no, <verse eid="PSA 78:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 78:31"/>Anumzamo'a ana vahetamina tusi arimpa ahe'zmanteno hankavenentake vahezmia zamahehna hu'ne. Hagi hankavenentake Israeli nehazaveramina zamahehna hu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 78:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 78:32"/>E'inara hu'neanagi, ana vahe'mo'za ana zankura zamagesa ontahi'za kumira hu'za vu'naze. Anumzamo'ma knare eri'zama eri'nea zankura antahimi'za Agrite'ma zamentintima hu'zankura zamavaresra hu'naze. <verse eid="PSA 78:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 78:33"/>E'ina hazageno ame' huno zamazeri haviza hige'za amne zankna nehazageno, zamazeri koro hige'za koro hu'naze. <verse eid="PSA 78:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 78:34"/>Hagi Anumzamo'ma agafa huno zamahema nefrige'za nege'za, maka zana netre'za ete rukrahe hu'za Anumzamofontera hanaveti'za zamentintia hu'naze. Ana nehu'za zamagu'a rukrahe hu'za Anumzamofona zamagu'areti hu'za avariri'naze. <verse eid="PSA 78:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 78:35"/>Anumzamo'a tagri fraki haveganti mani'ne hu'za zamagesa nentahi'za, Mareri Agatere Anumzana tahokeno tavre'nea nere hu'za antahi'naze. <verse eid="PSA 78:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 78:36"/>Hianagi ana maka zama hu'nazana zamagiteti hu'nazanki tamage hu'za zamagu'a omi'naze. Zamagra amne zamagiteti havige hu'naze. <verse eid="PSA 78:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 78:37"/>Zmagu'amo'a tamagea huno Anumzamofontera hankvetino omnene. Ana hige'za Anumzanema huhagerafi'naza huvempa kea kegava osu'za ru hantagi'naze. <verse eid="PSA 78:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 78:38"/>Hianagi Anumzamo'a asunku Anumzankino kumizmia atrenezmanteno, zamahe fri vagaore'ne. Rama'a knafi rimpahe'zana azenerino, zamahe vaga ore'ne. <verse eid="PSA 78:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 78:39"/>Ana nehuno vahekura amne vahetfa mani'naze huno agesa antahi'ne. Vahe'mo'za zahomo'ma evu huhu huno vuteno omeankna huza vagaregahaze. <verse eid="PSA 78:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 78:40"/>Hagi hagage kokampima mani'neza rama'a zupa Ra Anumzamofona hararenentazageno arimpa knanena mani'ne. <verse eid="PSA 78:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 78:41"/>Hagi mago'ane Ra Anumzamofona rehe'za nege'za Israeli vahe ruotge Anumzamofona rimpagna erimi vava hu'za vu'naze. <verse eid="PSA 78:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 78:42"/>Zamagra ha' vahe'zmimofo zamazampinti'ma zamagu'ma vazi'nea hihamu'agura zamage kaninte'naze. <verse eid="PSA 78:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 78:43"/>Isipi mopafima ruzahu ruzahu kaguvazama erifore nehuno, Zoani kazigama knare huno mareri agatere'nea ruzahu ruzahu kaguvazama eri fore'ma hu'nea zankura zamagesa nontahizageno, <verse eid="PSA 78:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 78:44"/>Agra tirazmia eri rukrahe higeno korasege'za ana tintetira tina one'naze. <verse eid="PSA 78:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 78:45"/>Agra tusi'a kosintami huzmantege'za kregre hu'za nezamampri'zageno, hogatmi huntege'za rama'a hazenkea zami'naze. <verse eid="PSA 78:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="PSA 78:46"/>Agra neonse kenu'ene ranra kenu'ene huzmantege'za, hozazmia ne'za erihna hu'naze. <verse eid="PSA 78:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="PSA 78:47"/>Agra ranra komopa ko atregeno waini zafa zamia ahe haviza nehigeno, neonse komopa ko atregeno, sikamo zafazmia ahe haviza hu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 78:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="PSA 78:48"/>Hagi Agra bulimakao afuzmia ranra komopa ko atregeno zamahe nefrigeno, kopsina atregeno trazama nenaza afuzagama kegavama hu'nazana zamaheno eri vagare'ne. <verse eid="PSA 78:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="PSA 78:49"/>Agra tusi'a arimpa ahe'nezmanteno, vahe'ma zamazeri haviza hu ankero vahetamina mago'a huzmantege'za, zamazeri haviza nehu'za zamahe fri'nagura e'naze. <verse eid="PSA 78:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="PSA 78:50"/>Agra arimpa ahezamofo kana retro huno magore huno Isipi vahetmina zamagura ovazi'neanki, knazana zamino zamazeri haviza hu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 78:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="PSA 78:51"/>Isipi vahetmimofo nompintira ese ne' mofavreramina Agra zamahe fri'ne. Hamu nagamokizmi zamagonesa mofavreramina agra zamahe fri'ne. <verse eid="PSA 78:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="PSA 78:52"/>Hianagi Anumzamo'a Agra'a vahetmina sipisipi afutmima vugoteno avreno'ma viankna huno hagege kokampina kegve huzmante so'e huno zamavareno vu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 78:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="PSA 78:53"/>Agra'a kegava huzamanteno zamavareno vige'za zamagra korora osu'naze. Hianagi ha' vahe'zmimo'za hagerimpina ti nakri'naze. <verse eid="PSA 78:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="PSA 78:54"/>Agra ruotge'ma hu'nea mopa atupare zamavareno e'ne. Agra tamaga azantetima ha'ma huno'ma eri'nea agona kokampi zamavareno e'ne. <verse eid="PSA 78:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="PSA 78:55"/>Hagi Agra zamavugama ana mopafima mani'naza vahera zamahe kasopenetreno, ana mopa erisantihareho huno zami'ne. Ana hige'za avamente avamente hu'za refko hu'za Israeli naga nofimo'za seli nonkuma ki'za mani'naze. <verse eid="PSA 78:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="PSA 78:56"/>Hianagi zamagra Anumzamofona rehe'za nege'za, Marerirfa Anumzana ha' renente'za, kasege'a ovarari'naze. <verse eid="PSA 78:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="PSA 78:57"/>Zamagra Anumzamofona zmagena hunemi'za, zamagehemo'zama hu'nazaza hu'za Anumzamofona avarari fatgo osazageno, ati amagenamo'ma kazakiankna huno zmavu'zamava zmimo'a kazaki'naze. <verse eid="PSA 78:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="PSA 78:58"/>Zamagra havi anumzantamimofoma mono'ma hunente'za, kumama tro husgama hunte'naza zamo Anumzamofona azeri arimpa nehe'za, havi anumzama antre'za tro'ma huntaza zanku Anumzamo'a azeri kanivea rezmante'ne. <verse eid="PSA 78:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="PSA 78:59"/>Hanki Anumzamo'ma ana nanekema nentahino'a tusi arimpa ahegeno, Israeli vahera amefi huzamino zamatre vagare'ne. <verse eid="PSA 78:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="PSA 78:60"/>Ana nehuno Silo kumate'ma seli mono noma'afima nemaniretira atreno vu'ne. Vahe amu'nompima seli noma'afima nemaniretira atreno vu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 78:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="PSA 78:61"/>Agra huhagerafi huvempage vogisia ha' vahe zamazampi antege'za eri'za kumazmirega vu'naze. Agri hihamu hankvema huvame huno me'nea zana ha' vahemoza eri'za ome antene'za ana zamofona ke amne zankna hu'naze. <verse eid="PSA 78:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="PSA 78:62"/>Agra vahe'aramina ha' vahe zamazampi zamavarentege'za ha' vahe'mo'za zamahe'za kazinteti traga hu'naze. Na'ankure Agra'ama erisantiharege'za Agri ruotge vahe'ma mani'naza vahekura tusi arimpa ahezmante'ne. <verse eid="PSA 78:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="PSA 78:63"/>Kasefa nehazaveramina tevemofo neza nesazageno, kasefa mofaneramimo'zama vema erisaza vene'nea omanige'za, masinezmante'zama nehaza zagamera osu'naze. <verse eid="PSA 78:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="PSA 78:64"/>Hagi pristi vahera bainati kazinteti zamahe vagarazage'za, ana pristi vahe'mokizmi kento aneramimo'za zamasunkura hu'za zavira ote'naze. <verse eid="PSA 78:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="PSA 78:65"/>Vahe'mo'zama mase'nazafinti'ma otizaza huno Ra Anumzamo'a oti'ne. Hanave sondia ne'mo'ma hanave waini tima neteno, neginagima huno mase'nereti'ma otiankna huno oti'ne. <verse eid="PSA 78:65"/><verse number="66" style="v" sid="PSA 78:66"/>Ha' vahe'aramina Agra zamahe panani hige'za ete freza nevazageno, zamagazema huvavama hu'are zamazeri haviza hu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 78:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="PSA 78:67"/>Hianagi Josefe nagara avesra huzmanteno nezmatreno, Efraemi naga nofi'enema mani'zankura avresra hu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 78:67"/><verse number="68" style="v" sid="PSA 78:68"/>Hianagi Juda naga huhamprino zamagrane umani'ne. Na'ankure Agra Saioni agonagu avesi'ne. <verse eid="PSA 78:68"/><verse number="69" style="v" sid="PSA 78:69"/>E'i anante ruotgema hu'nea mono noma'a Agra kisga huno kintegeno, anagamu marerino monarega mareri'ne. Ana nehuno ana nomofo tra'ama ante'neana mopamo'ma hanavetiankna huno hanaveti'neankino mevava hugahie. <verse eid="PSA 78:69"/><verse number="70" style="v" sid="PSA 78:70"/>Agra eri'za vahe'a Deviti huhamprinteno, sipisipi afu keginafinti ke higeno e'ne. <verse eid="PSA 78:70"/><verse number="71" style="v" sid="PSA 78:71"/>Anumzamo'a Devitima avre'neana a sipisipine amima nenea anenta'aramima kegavama nehia eri'zampinti avreno Jekopu agehemofo, Ra Anumzamo'a Agra'a feno zama'agna huno huhampri'nea Israeli vahe'a kegava hu eri'zana ami'ne. <verse eid="PSA 78:71"/><verse number="72" style="v" sid="PSA 78:72"/>Hagi Deviti'a maka agu'areti'ene maka zama tro'ma hu'are'ma antahi ani'ma hu'nea ne'kino, Israeli vahera kegava hu'ne.<verse eid="PSA 78:72"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 78"/>
  <chapter number="79" style="c" sid="PSA 79"/>
  <para style="s">Asapu asunte'nea zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 79:1"/>Anumzamoka megi'a vahe'mo'za hara eme huragatere'za erisanti'ma hare'nana mopaka'a e'neri'za, ruotgema hu'nea mono nonka'a eri haviza nehu'za, Jerusalemi kumara tagna vazitrazageno hihi huno mareri'ne. <verse eid="PSA 79:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 79:2"/>Eri'za vaheka'aramine Kagrima negavaririza vaheka'aramina zamahete'za zamavufaga'a atrazageno namamo'zane zagagafamo'za ne'naze. <verse eid="PSA 79:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 79:3"/>Jerusalemi kumapina zamahe'za korana tagitrazageno tihageno eviankna nehigeno, asezmante'nia vahera magore huno omani'ne. <verse eid="PSA 79:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 79:4"/>Mika tagri tava'onte'ma nemaniza vahe'mo'za huhaviza hunerantazageno, mani kagirante'naza kumapinti vahe'mo'za ki'za zokago ke hurante'naze. <verse eid="PSA 79:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 79:5"/>Ra Anumzamoka nama'a kna krimpa aherantenka vugahane? Kagra karimpa aherante vava hunka vugahampi? Maka kna kanive renerantankeno ana zamo'a tevenefakna hu vava huno vugahifi? <verse eid="PSA 79:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 79:6"/>Mono'ma hugante'zanku'ma zamavaresrama hunegantaza vaheku karimpa ahenezmantenka, kini ne'mo'ma kegavama hu'nea kumatamimpi vahe'mo'zama kagihanta'ma novaziza vahetami karimpa ahezmanto. <verse eid="PSA 79:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 79:7"/>Na'ankure Kagri vahe Israeli vahera zamahe'za eri vagarazageno, mopazmimo'a vahe omani hagege kokankna hie. <verse eid="PSA 79:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 79:8"/>Ko'ma tagehemo'zama hu'naza kumitera antahintahi ka'afina ana zankura antahinka ovuo. Kasunku hurantenka ame hunka enka eme taza huo. Na'ankure tagra tusi'a hazenkefi manune. <verse eid="PSA 79:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 79:9"/>Anumzana tagu'vazi ne' mani'nananki taza huo. Kagra'a kagimofo knare zanku nentahinka taza huo. Kagri kagima husgama hugantesaza zanku netahinka, kumitia apase nerantenka tagu'vazio. <verse eid="PSA 79:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 79:10"/>Na'a hanige'za ru vahe'mo'za hu'za, iga zamagri Anumzana mani'ne? hu'za hugahaze. Tagona kema hunka ana vahetmima ha'ma huzmante'sana zana, tagra kamneno. Na'ankure zamagra eri'za vaheka'aramimofo korana zamahe'za eri tagi atre'naze. <verse eid="PSA 79:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 79:11"/>Kinama hu'naza vaheka'amo'zama zamatagu'ma nehu'za, kragi'ma neraza zana antahio. Frigahaze hu'zama hazage'zama mani'naza vahera, marerirfa hihamuka'anu zamagu'vazio. <verse eid="PSA 79:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 79:12"/>Anumzamoka tava'ontire'ma nemaniza vahe'mo'zama Kagri'ma huhavizama hugantazarera, 7ni'a zupa ana zantera nona huzmanto. <verse eid="PSA 79:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 79:13"/>Ana'ma hananketa Kagri vahe'mota tretre'ma hu'nea trazampima tantenanketa sipisipigna huta mani'nomota musena nehuta, susu hugante vava nehanunkeno, henkama forehu anante anante hu'zama esaza vahe'mo'za ana zanke hugahaze.<verse eid="PSA 79:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 79"/>
  <chapter number="80" style="c" sid="PSA 80"/>
  <para style="s">Anumzamoka ete tazeri knare huo huno hu'nea zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 80:1"/>Sipisipi afu kevuma kegavama nehazaza hunkama Israeli vahe'ma kegavama nehana kva ne'moka, kagesa antenka antahio. Sipisipi afu'ma kegavama huno viazama hunka Josefe agehe'mofoma, avrenka nevamoka antahio. Kagra serafimiema nehaza ankerontremofo amu'nompima manisga hunkama nemanina Anumzamoka masazanka'a remsa hunerantenka eme taza huo. <verse eid="PSA 80:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 80:2"/>Efraemi naga'ma, Benzameni naga'ma, Manase nagate'enena Hankaveka'a eri ama' hunka tagu'vazio. <verse eid="PSA 80:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 80:3"/>Etenka tazeri knare nehunka, kavugosafinti masanu remsa hunerantenka taguravazio. <verse eid="PSA 80:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 80:4"/>Ra Anumzana Monafi sondia vahetmimofo Anumzamoka, zazate kagri vahe'mota nunamuma huta neonkenka karimpa ahenerantane. <verse eid="PSA 80:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 80:5"/>Tasunkuzana bretima hiaza hunka neraminka, tima hiaza hunka tavunura rama'a taminketa ne'none. <verse eid="PSA 80:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 80:6"/>Tava'ontire'ma nemaniza vahetmina zamatranke'za, tagri mopareku hu'za hara hunerante'za, ki'za zokago kea hunerantaze. <verse eid="PSA 80:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 80:7"/>Monafinka sondia vahe'mofo Anumzamoka ete tazeri knare nehunka, atregeno kavugosafinti masa zamo'a remsa hunerantesigenka taguravazio. <verse eid="PSA 80:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 80:8"/>Kagra Isipitira waini avina rukafrinka erinka, ama mopafima megi'a vahetmima mani'nazana eme zamahenati netrenka, tagrira ama ana mopafi avimzama seaza hunka eme hankre'nane. <verse eid="PSA 80:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 80:9"/>Kagra ama mopa emeri ama' hurantanketa, tagra ama ana mopafi arafu'na reta mani avite'none. <verse eid="PSA 80:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 80:10"/>Ana waini zafamofo turuna'mo agonaramina turuna hunentegeno, azankuna'amo'za hankave sida zafa refite'ne. <verse eid="PSA 80:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 80:11"/>Hagi azankunamo'a hageno zage fre kaziga Mediterenia hagerintega vigeno, agatamo'a hageno zage hanati kaziga Yufretisi tinte uhanati'ne. <verse eid="PSA 80:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 80:12"/>Hianagi nahigenka hoza kegina ahe fragu vazitranke'za karankama vanoma nehaza vahe'mo'za ufre'za krepi raga musufa neragize? <verse eid="PSA 80:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 80:13"/>Zafa tanopafinti zamagonknazama ohari afi afu'mo'za ana wainia zamaganuti repripro nehazageno, afi zagagafamo'za ana zafa raga nenaze. <verse eid="PSA 80:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 80:14"/>Monafinka sondia vahe'mofo Anumzamoka muse hugantonanki etenka eno. Waini hozaka'afima nehia zana Monafinkatira kefenkma atrenka negenka, ama ana waini zafaka'a kegava huo. <verse eid="PSA 80:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 80:15"/>Ana wainia Kagraka'a kazampinti kri'nane. Ana ne'mofavrea Kagraka'a azeri nena hu'nane. <verse eid="PSA 80:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 80:16"/>Ana waini hozaka'a teve negre'za, rukafri kafro hutre'naze. Karimpa ahenka kavugosa hunezmantenka zamahe fanene huo. <verse eid="PSA 80:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 80:17"/>Hanki kazana rusutenka kaza tamaga kazigama mani'nea ne' hankavea neminka, Nagri vahe manigahaze hunkama tazeri nenama hu'nana vahe mani'nonanki tazeri hankavetio. <verse eid="PSA 80:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 80:18"/>E'ina hugeta tamefira huonkamimneno. Ete tazeri kasefa hugeta, Kagritega nunamuna nehuta, kagia ahentesga hamneno! <verse eid="PSA 80:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 80:19"/>Monafinka sondia vahe'mofo Anumzamoka ete tazeri knare nehunka, atregeno kavugosafinti masazamo'a remsa huranteno taguravazino.<verse eid="PSA 80:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 80"/>
  <chapter number="81" style="c" sid="PSA 81"/>
  <para style="s">Vahe'nimo'za ke'ni'a antahiho huno hu'nea zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 81:1"/>Anumzamo'a Agra tagri hankaveti mani'neanki zagame huta agi'a erisga hanune. Jekopu Anumzamofontega muse zagamera huta agi'a erisga hiho? <verse eid="PSA 81:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 81:2"/>Zgamera nehuta nasenasepana neheta, knare ageru'ma neria hapu zavenane laeri zavenanena aheho. <verse eid="PSA 81:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 81:3"/>Kasefa ikama eme antesigeta sipisipi afu'mofo paziveteti ufena nereta, ikamo'ma zarama vagehinigeta, ra ne'za kreno nekna egahianki, ne'zana kreta neneta musenkase hiho. <verse eid="PSA 81:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 81:4"/>Ama'i Israeli vahe'mofo trake, Jekopu Anumzamo'ma Israeli vahe'motama tami'nea kasegene trake. <verse eid="PSA 81:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 81:5"/>Anumzamo'ma Isipi vahe'ma ha'ma renenteno'a, Josefe naga'mozama avaririsaza trake huno retro hunte'ne. Nagra ontahi'noa agerupinti agerura runo anage hu'ne, <verse eid="PSA 81:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 81:6"/>Nagra zamafunte'ma me'nea knazana eri atroe. Kna zama e'neriza ekaeka kutamia tamazampintira eri atre'noe. <verse eid="PSA 81:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 81:7"/>Knafima mani'neta krafa nehazagena, tamagu'vazi'noe. Nagra hanintiri hampompinti monagema hiaza hu'na kenonatamia huramante'noe. Meriba tinte tamamentintia reramahe'na tamage'noe. <verse eid="PSA 81:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 81:8"/>Tamavumro tamantena tamazeri fatgo hunaku huanki, vahe'nimota antahiho! Israeli vahe'mota tamavumro'ma nentenugeta kea osu mani'neta amne tamagesa antahiho. <verse eid="PSA 81:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 81:9"/>Ru vahe'mokizmi anumzantera monora huontege, havi anumzantera tamarena reta monora huonteho. <verse eid="PSA 81:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 81:10"/>Nagra Ra Anumzana tamagri Anumzamo'na Isipi mopafintira tamagura vazi'na tamavre'na emareri'noa Anumza mani'noe. Tamagira eri aka hunenke'na knare zantaminura tamagipina ante vita'neno. <verse eid="PSA 81:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 81:11"/>Hianagi nagri vahe'mo'za keni'a nontahi'za, namagera onte'naze. <verse eid="PSA 81:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 81:12"/>Zamagu'amo'ma hanavetige'na zamatroge'za zamagra zamavesi avariri'za vu'naze. <verse eid="PSA 81:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 81:13"/>Tamagra nagri vahe'mota keni'a nentahinkeno, Israeli vahe'mota nagri kante'ma navaririta vanageno'a knare hugahie. <verse eid="PSA 81:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 81:14"/>Nagra ame hu'na tamagri ha' vahera zamahe rava hugahue. Ha'ma renezmantaza vahera nazana rusute'na hara huzmagateregahue. <verse eid="PSA 81:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 81:15"/>Ra Anumzamofoma zamavaresrama hunentaza vahe'mo'za agri avurera antri nehu'za tatapa hugahaze. Ana knazana eri vava hu'za vugahaze. <verse eid="PSA 81:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 81:16"/>Hianagi knare zantfama hu'nea witi tami'nena negahaze. Ana nehu'na havefinti afi tumeri taminena neramu hugahaze.<verse eid="PSA 81:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 81"/>
  <chapter number="82" style="c" sid="PSA 82"/>
  <para style="s">Hankavezmima omne vahe'ene maka zanku'ma upa'ma nehaza vahe'ma zamagu'vazisia zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 82:1"/>Anumzamo Agra mona kumapina vugota huno mani'neno, anumza mani'nonema huza nehaza kva vahetamima omeritruma hu'za keagama nehazageno'a, nanekea refko nehuno antahintahi'a huama nehie. <verse eid="PSA 82:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 82:2"/>Tamagra nama'a zupa havizama nehaza vahe'mokizmia zamavesi nezmanteta, kefo avu'ava'ma nehaza vahera knare avu'avara hunezmantaze? <verse eid="PSA 82:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 82:3"/>Hankavezmima omne vahe'ene megusa mofavre nagara zamaza nehuta, zamunte omne vahe'ene zamazeri havizama nehaza vahe'enena zamahokeho. <verse eid="PSA 82:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 82:4"/>Zamunte omne vahe'ene maka zanku'ma upa'ma nehaza vahe'enena zamagu'nevazita kefo avu'ava'ma nehaza vahe'mokizmi zamazampintira zamahoketa zamavareho. <verse eid="PSA 82:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 82:5"/>Hagi vahe'ma zamazeri havizama nehaza vahe'mota, mago zana antahita keta osuta hanimpi vano nehazageno, ama mopamofo tra'amo'a tore'vare nehie. <verse eid="PSA 82:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 82:6"/>Nagra amanage hu'noe, tamagra anumza mani'naze, ana makamota tamagra Marerirfa Anumzamofo mofavre mani'naze hu'na hu'noe. <verse eid="PSA 82:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 82:7"/>Hianagi vahe'mo'zama nehazaza huta frigahaze. Mago'a kva vahe'mo'zama nehazaza huta frigahaze. <verse eid="PSA 82:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 82:8"/>Anumzamoka otinka ama mopafi vahera keaga huzmanto. Na'ankure ana maka vahe'ma mani'nazana kagri vaheke'za mani'naze.<verse eid="PSA 82:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 82"/>
  <chapter number="83" style="c" sid="PSA 83"/>
  <para style="s">Anumzamoka kea osura omanio huno hu'nea zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 83:1"/>Anumzamoka kea osura omanige, agesa ankanire vahe knara hunka omanige, akohenka omanio. <verse eid="PSA 83:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 83:2"/>Ha' vahekamo'zama ranke rankema nehaza zana nontahino? Zamavesrama hunegantaza vahe'mo'zama zamavufaga rankema nehazana nonkano? <verse eid="PSA 83:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 83:3"/>Vaheka'a zamahenaku amne vaheknama hu'za vano nehu'za, marerirfa fenozani'e hunkama hu'nana vaheka'a zamahenaku oku'a nanekea retro nehaze. <verse eid="PSA 83:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 83:4"/>Zamagra amanage nehaze, enketa Israeli vahera mopazmifintira zamahehna hamneno hu'za nehaze. Zamahehna hanunkeno, ama mopafina Israeli vahe zamagia omnenige'za mago'ane antahi ozamisaze. <verse eid="PSA 83:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 83:5"/>Zamagra mago zamarimpa hu'za ana nanekea retro nehu'za, kagri'ma ha'ma regante'naza nanekea huhagenerafi'za huvempa nehaze. <verse eid="PSA 83:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 83:6"/>Hagi ana nanekema nehaza vahetamina Idomu vahetmima, Ismaeli vahetmima, Moapu vahetmima, Hagri vahetmima, <verse eid="PSA 83:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 83:7"/>Gebali vahetmima, Amoni vahetmima, Ameleki vahetmima, Filistia vahetamine, Tairi rankumapi vahe'mo'zane anara hu'naze. <verse eid="PSA 83:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 83:8"/>Asiria vahe'mo'zanena anampina efre'za Loti agehe'mokizmia hankave zami'naze. <verse eid="PSA 83:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 83:9"/>Midieni vahe'ma huzmante'nanaza nehunka, Kisoni tirampima Siserane Jabininema huznantenana zana huzmanto. <verse eid="PSA 83:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 83:10"/>Ana vahetmina Endori mopafi zamahehna hankeno zamavufagamo'ma anampima kasri'neankna hino. <verse eid="PSA 83:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 83:11"/>Zamatrege'za hankavenentake vahe'zmimo'za Orebike Zebikema hu'na'aza hu'za nefrinkeno, ugagota kva vahe'zmimo'za Zebake Zalmunakema hu'na'aza hu'za friho. <verse eid="PSA 83:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 83:12"/>Na'ankure zamagra hu'za, Anumzamo'ma traza ne' afu'tmima kegavama nehia mopa aheta hanaregahune hu'za hu'naze. <verse eid="PSA 83:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 83:13"/>Anumzamoka zamahe panani huge'za kagikagi zahomo kugusopa eri harafi huno freankna nehu'za, zaho'mo witi hona eri hareno viankna hiho. <verse eid="PSA 83:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 83:14"/>Zamatrege'za zafafi afe taginteankna hu'za nerenkeno, agonafi afe'ma tagintegeno ruhagna hagna huno teankna hiho. <verse eid="PSA 83:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 83:15"/>Ununko huntegeno nezmavrarino keonke'zana eri tasagihu agumpi agumpi huno zamazeri korora hino. <verse eid="PSA 83:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 83:16"/>Zamazeri zamagaze huge'za tusi zmagazegu nehu'za, Ra Anumzamoka kagifi eme anterami'za mani'neza kamage anteho. <verse eid="PSA 83:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 83:17"/>Zamazeri zamagaze nehunka, zamarimpa zamazerigna huvava huge'za zamagazegu nehu'za friho. <verse eid="PSA 83:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 83:18"/>E'ina huge'za Ra Anumza mani'nane hu'za kage'za antahi'za nehanageno, maka mopafi vahe'mo'za kagrake'za Marerirfa Anumzana mani'nane hu'za ke'za antahi'za hugahaze.<verse eid="PSA 83:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 83"/>
  <chapter number="84" style="c" sid="PSA 84"/>
  <para style="s">Ra Anumzamofo nonkumapi umanisuegu nagesa antahi vava nehue hu'nea zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 84:1"/>Monafinka Sondia vahe'mokizmi Ra Anumzamoka nemanina kumakamo'a hentofaza hu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 84:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 84:2"/>Ra Anumzamofo mono nompima mani'zankura nagu'areti hu'na navesinavesi nehue. Nagra nagu'areti'ene, maka navufgareti'enena muse nehu'na ranke hu'na kasefa huno mani'nea Anumzamofona zagamera hu'na agi'a ahentesga hugahue. <verse eid="PSA 84:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 84:3"/>Kisve namamo'zane suvi namamo'zanena kresramna vu ita tava'onte nozmia kine'za amura ante'za mofavre'zmia azeri'nena nehaze. Monafi sondia vahe'mofo Ra Anumzamoka nagri kini mani'nenka, Anumzani'a mani'nane. <verse eid="PSA 84:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 84:4"/>Ra Anumzamoka kagri nompima nemaniza vahe'mo'za muse nehu'za, zagamera hu'za kagia ahentesga huvava hugahaze. <verse eid="PSA 84:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 84:5"/>Ra Anumzamokaregati'ma hankavema e'neriza vahe'mo'za muse nehanageno, Saioni agonare'ma vu'za mono'ma ome hugante'naku'ma zamagesa are'are'ma nehaza vahe'mo'za muse hugahaze. <verse eid="PSA 84:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 84:6"/>Hagi balsam zafamo'ma hu'nea Baka agupofima rugitagi'zama vanu'za, ana agupofinti'ma tima hanatiaza hu'za maka zana eri kasefa hugahaze. E'ina hanigeno ko'ma arania zamo'a, kerifina timo'a avitegahie. <verse eid="PSA 84:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 84:7"/>Anama nevu'za ome hankavetime vu'za hanavenentake vahetami Ra Anumzamofo avuga Jerusalemi kumatera uhanatigahaze. <verse eid="PSA 84:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 84:8"/>Ra Anumzana Hankavenentake Anumza Jekopu Anumzamoka nunamuni'a antahinamio. <verse eid="PSA 84:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 84:9"/>Anumzana tagri hanko mani'nananki, masavema taginka frenentenka huhamprinte'nana kini ne'mofona kavuntenka negenka kegava hunto. <verse eid="PSA 84:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 84:10"/>Magoke knama Kagri mono nompima mani'zamo'a, tauseni'a knama megi'ama mani'zana agatere'ne. Kefo avu'ava'ma nehaza vahe'mofo, nompima knare nomani'zama mani'zana atre'na, Anumzamoka nomofo kafante'ma mani'suana knare hugahie. <verse eid="PSA 84:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 84:11"/>Na'ankure Ra Anumzamo tagrira kegava huneranteno masati mani'ne. Agra'a asunku hunezmanteno razmagia nezamie. Fatgo zamavu zamavama nehaza vahe'mokizmia knare zantamina azeori nezamie. <verse eid="PSA 84:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 84:12"/>Monafi hankavenentake sondia vahe'mokizmi Ra Anumzamoka, kagrite'ma zamentintima nehaza vahe'mo'za muse hugahaze.<verse eid="PSA 84:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 84"/>
  <chapter number="85" style="c" sid="PSA 85"/>
  <para style="s">Anumzamoka tazeri kasefa huo hu'nea zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 85:1"/>Ra Anumzamoka mopaka'a azeri knare hu'nane. Kagra etenka Jekopu nagamofo fenozana erinte avitente'nane. <verse eid="PSA 85:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 85:2"/>Kagra vaheka'amofo kefo avu'ava zana atre'nezmantenka, maka kumizmia refite zmante'nane. <verse eid="PSA 85:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 85:3"/>Krimpa akama nehegenka azenerinka, krimpa ahezamo'ma tevenefa'ma nehigenka krimpa aheozmante'nananki azeri'nane. <verse eid="PSA 85:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 85:4"/>Anumzana tagu'vazi ne'moka krimpa aherantenka kea orasunka, ete tazeri knare huo. <verse eid="PSA 85:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 85:5"/>Kagra krimpa aherante vava hunka vugahampi? Kagra vahetmima forehu anante nante'ma hu'za vanaza vahera krimpa ahezmantegahampi? <verse eid="PSA 85:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 85:6"/>Kagra ete tazeri kasefara hananketa, vaheka'amota kagrikura musena huta ovanuno? <verse eid="PSA 85:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 85:7"/>Ra Anumzamoka vagaore kavesizana, taveri nehunka tagu'vazio. <verse eid="PSA 85:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 85:8"/>Ra Anumzana Agra Anumzamo'ma haniankea nagra antahi soe hugahue. Na'ankure Agri kema antahiza amagema nentaza vahera rimpa fru nezamie. Hagi ana atre'za neginagi zamavu'zmavara ete osiho. <verse eid="PSA 85:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 85:9"/>Hagi Anumzamofoma koro'ma hunente'za agri agoragama nemaniza vahera tamage huno zamagu vazigahie. Ana hanigeno tagri mopafina Agri masazamo'a avitegahie. <verse eid="PSA 85:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 85:10"/>Vagaore avesizamo'ene tamage nanekemo'enena eme tutagiha nehakeno, fatgo avu'avazane, arimpa fruzamo'enena eri mago hu'na'e. <verse eid="PSA 85:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 85:11"/>Hugahuema hu'nea kema amage'ma anteno ana zama hu' avu'avazamo'a mopafinti hageno atiramigeno, fatgo avu'avazamo'a monafinkati ke fenkma atreno nege. <verse eid="PSA 85:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 85:12"/>Ra Anumzamo'a knare'ma hu'nea zana tamisigeno ama mopafina nezamo'a amporesigeta vasagegahune. <verse eid="PSA 85:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 85:13"/>Fatgo avu'avazamo'a vugota huno nevuno kama vania kana retro huno vugahie.<verse eid="PSA 85:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 85"/>
  <chapter number="86" style="c" sid="PSA 86"/>
  <para style="s">Anumzamoka vagaore kavesizamo'a rankrerfa hu'ne huno Deviti asunte'nea zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 86:1"/>Ra Anumzamoka kagesa antenka nunamu keni'a antahinka nona hunanto. Na'ankure nagrira kna nami'za nazeri haviza nehazage'na, maka zankura atupa nehu'na, naza hugara osu'noe. <verse eid="PSA 86:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 86:2"/>Anumzamoka kegava nagrira hunanto. Na'ankure kagri kavariri fatgo nagra nehue. Kagrite'ma namentintima nehua Anumzanimoka eri'za vahekamo'na nagu'vazio. <verse eid="PSA 86:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 86:3"/>Ra Anumzamoka kasunku hunanto, na'ankure maka kna kagritega nunamuna huvava nehue. <verse eid="PSA 86:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 86:4"/>Ra Anumzamoka eri'za vahekamo'na nagu'afina muse'za antenanto, na'ankure kagritega nunamuna nehu'na monora hunegantoe. <verse eid="PSA 86:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 86:5"/>Ra Anumzamoka kagra knare'zantfa hu'nanankinka kumizmia atrezmante'naku retro hu'nane. Zamazama hananegu'ma kagri'ma kantahigaza miko vahe'mokizmia vagaore kavesizanu ante avite'nezmantane. <verse eid="PSA 86:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 86:6"/>Ra Anumzamoka kagesa antenka nunamu ke'ni'a antahinamio. Kasuraginantenka nazama huogu'ma krafama nehua krafageni'a antahinamio. <verse eid="PSA 86:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 86:7"/>Hazenke knafima ufresuna kagritega nunamuna hanugenka, nunamu keni'a antahinamigahane. <verse eid="PSA 86:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 86:8"/>Ra Anumzamoka kagrikna anumzana magore huno omani'ne. Kagrama nehana kna kagu'vazana mago'a anumzantmimo'za osugahaze. <verse eid="PSA 86:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 86:9"/>Mika kokankoka vahe'ma tro'ma huzmante'nana vahe'mo'za Ra Anumzamoka kavuga e'za monora eme hunegante'za ruotge'ma hu'nea kagia ahentesga hugahaze. <verse eid="PSA 86:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 86:10"/>Na'ankure kagra knarezantfa huno mareri agatere'nea kavu'kvaza erifore nehane. Kagrake'za Anumzana mani'nane. <verse eid="PSA 86:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 86:11"/>Ra Anumzamoka kavukva zanka'a rempi hunamige'na, tamage nanekeka'a amage antena va'neno. Nagu'a nazeri agru huge'na, kagri kagigura koro hunte'na agorga mani'neno. <verse eid="PSA 86:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 86:12"/>Ra Anumzana nagri Anumzamoka nagu'areti hu'na susu hunegante'na, zagamera hu'na kagia ahentesga hugahue. Kagi'a ahentesga huvava hu'na vugahue. <verse eid="PSA 86:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 86:13"/>Na'ankure Kagrama navesi'nantenka knare'ma hunenantana zamo'a rankrerfa hu'ne. Kagra fri vahe kumapinti nagu'vazi'nane. <verse eid="PSA 86:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 86:14"/>Hazenke vahe'mo'za ha'renantaze. Vahe'ma zamahe'za zamazeri havizama nehaza vahe'mo'za nahe fri'za nehu'za, Kagrira kagefenkami atre'za kage amneza nehaze. <verse eid="PSA 86:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 86:15"/>Hianagi Ra Anumzana kagra keke nehunka kasunku hu Anumza mani'nanankino, vagaore kavesizanu knare hunerantenka, ame hunka krimpa ahenorantenka, kema hu'nana kema avaririnka ana zama hu kavukva zamo'a kagripina avite'ne. <verse eid="PSA 86:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 86:16"/>Ra Anumzamoka kavugosa hunaminka, kasunku hunanto. Eri'za vaheka'amofona hankavea neminka, eri'zama erinegantea a'mofo nemofona agu'vazio. <verse eid="PSA 86:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 86:17"/>Ra Anumzamoka nagri'ma navesi nenantana zamofo avame'zana naveri huo. E'ina hugeno zamavaresrama hunentaza vahe'mo'za nege'za zamagazegura hugahaze. Na'ankure Ra Anumzamoka knarera hunenantenka naza nehane.<verse eid="PSA 86:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 86"/>
  <chapter number="87" style="c" sid="PSA 87"/>
  <para style="s">Ra Anumzamoka vagaore kavesizamo'a rankrerfa hu'ne hu'nea zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 87:1"/>Ruotge agonarera Ra Anumzamo'ma tro'ma hu'nea rankumara me'ne. <verse eid="PSA 87:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 87:2"/>Agra mago'a rankuma'ma Israeli mopafima me'nea rankumatmima avesima nenteama'a agatereno Jerusalemi rankumara avesinente. <verse eid="PSA 87:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 87:3"/>Anumzamofo rankuma'mokagura vahe'mo'za hentofa kege hunegantaze. <verse eid="PSA 87:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 87:4"/>Nagri'ma ke'za antahi'zama hu'naza vahe'ma antahima nezamisuna, Isipi vahe'ma Babiloni vahe'enena zamagia ahentesgahue. Filistiane Tairi kuma'ene Itiopia kuma'enena ana zanke hu'na zamagia ahentesgahue. Ana maka'mo'za Jerusalemi kumapi vahe ase'za manigahaze! <verse eid="PSA 87:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 87:5"/>Ana hugahianagi Jerusalemi kumapima nemaniza vahekura amanage hugahie, maka Jerusalemi kumapima fore'ma huta nemaniza vahe'mota, muse huta knare nomani'zante nemanisageno, Marerirfa Anumzamo'a ana rankumara Agra'a eri hanavetisigeno meno vugahie. <verse eid="PSA 87:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 87:6"/>Ra Anumzamo'ma vahe zamagima kreno evanuno'a Agra amanage hugahie, zamagra Jerusalemi kumapi kasezmantege'za, zamagra ana kumapi vahe mani'naze huno hugahie. <verse eid="PSA 87:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 87:7"/>Zgame nehaza vahe'mo'zane konkema neraza vahe'mo'zanena amanage hu'za zagamera hugahaze, Tagrama musema nehuna zamo'a, Jerusalemi kumapinti ne-e, hu'za hugahaze.<verse eid="PSA 87:7"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 87"/>
  <chapter number="88" style="c" sid="PSA 88"/>
  <para style="s">Feru'ene kenage'enena Kagri kavuga krafagea nehue hu'nea zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 88:1"/>Ra Anumzana naza nehunka nagu'ma nevazina Anumzanimoka, masare'ene haninena Kagri kavuga nunamuna nehue. <verse eid="PSA 88:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 88:2"/>Nunamuma nehua nunamu keni'a nentahinka, naza huogu'ma krafagema nehuana antahinaminka naza huo. <verse eid="PSA 88:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 88:3"/>Na'ankure nomanizanifina hazenke zamo'a avineteno, navareno fri vahe kuma tava'onte nevie. <verse eid="PSA 88:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 88:4"/>Fri'zage'zama matipima ome asenezmantaza vahekna hu'noe. Nagra hanaveni'a omane vahe kna hu'noe. <verse eid="PSA 88:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 88:5"/>Zamagra fri vahe amu'nompi natrazage'na, fri' vahe'ma matipima asentegeno'ma maseankna hu'na mase'noe. Ana hugenka Kagra kazana antenka kegava huonante natranke'na haviza hu'noe. <verse eid="PSA 88:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 88:6"/>Kagra amefenkame tami'nea kerimofona aro'are, hanintirima hu'nefi natre'nane. <verse eid="PSA 88:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 88:7"/>Krimpama ahezamo'a narentrako huno urami'ne. Hagerimo'ma hiaza hunka rugnafu knafu hunka naherava he'nane. <verse eid="PSA 88:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 88:8"/>Roneni'aramina nagritetira renatitranke'za vu'za e'za nehu'za zamago atenante'naze. Nagra frekani'a omanege'na krifu ahente'na manue. <verse eid="PSA 88:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 88:9"/>Knazama eri'na zavi'ma atoazamo'a, navunumo'a navua resuhie. Mago mago knafina Ra Anumzamokama nazama hanankura kantahinegoe. Kasunku'ma hunantenka nazama hanankura kagritega nazana erisga nehue. <verse eid="PSA 88:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 88:10"/>Kagra kagu'vazana hunka fri'nea vahera aza nehampi? Fri'naza vahe'mo'za fri'nazafintira oti'za zagamera hu'za kagia ahentesga hugahazafi? <verse eid="PSA 88:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 88:11"/>Frizage'zama matipima asezmante'naza vahe'mo'za vagaore kavesizanka'agura huamara hugahazafi? Huge keka'ama avaririnka hugahuema hu'nana zama nehana kavukva zankura keonke zamo'ma havizama hu'nefina huama hugahazafi? <verse eid="PSA 88:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 88:12"/>Kaguvazama zama hu'nana zantamina hanimpina ke'za antahi'za hugahazafi? Hifi frizage'za vahe'mo'zama zamage'ma akanizmantaza vahe'mo'za fatgo kavukva zankura keaga huge antahigamige hugahazafi? <verse eid="PSA 88:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 88:13"/>Hianagi Ra Anumzamoka naza huogu kagritega krafagea nehue. Maka nanterana kagritega nunamuna nehue. <verse eid="PSA 88:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 88:14"/>Ra Anumzamoka nahigenka nenatrenka, kavugosa rukrahera hunka kamefira hunenamine? <verse eid="PSA 88:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 88:15"/>Osi'ma mani'noregati'ma knazama eri'na e'noa zamo'a, kri eri'na fri'za hue. Kagra nazeri koro'ma hu' zanke hanke'na, rama'a knazampi mani'na oe. <verse eid="PSA 88:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 88:16"/>Krimpa ahe'zamo'a ti hageankna huno narefi netegeno, nazeri namanoma vazina zamo'a nazeri haviza nehie. <verse eid="PSA 88:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 88:17"/>Nanteranteti'ma agafama huteno tima hageno refite'nanteankna huno korozamo'a narefite'ne. <verse eid="PSA 88:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 88:18"/>Ronenine navesimanentoa vahetaminena nagripintira zamavare hana hu'nane. Ana hankeno hanimo'a, nagri arone ase'ne.<verse eid="PSA 88:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 88"/>
  <chapter number="89" style="c" sid="PSA 89"/>
  <para style="s">Ra Anumzamofo vagaore avesizama'agu Etani hu'nea zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 89:1"/>Ra Anumzamofo vagaore avesizama'agura nagra zagamera huvava hugahue. Hugahuema hu'nana kema avaririnkama hu kavukvazana huama nehanuge'za, forehu anante anante'ma hanaza vahe'mo'za antahigahaze. <verse eid="PSA 89:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 89:2"/>Na'ankure nagra amanage hu'na huama hugahue, Ra Anumzamoka vagaore kavesizamo'a mevava huno vugahie. Hugahuema hunana kema avaririnkama hu kavukvazamo'a monamo'ma nehiaza huno mevava hugahie. <verse eid="PSA 89:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 89:3"/>Ra Anumzamoka hunka, Nagrama huhamprinte'noa eri'za ne' Deviti'ene huhagerafi huvempagea nehu'na, agri'ene huvempa kea hu'noe. <verse eid="PSA 89:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 89:4"/>Devitiga kagripinti'ma fore'ma hu anante anante'ma hu'za vanaza vahepintinke, kini vahera zamazeri fore huvava hu'na vugahue hunka hu'nane. <verse eid="PSA 89:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 89:5"/>Ra Anumzamoka monamo'za knare huno mareri agatere kavukva zanka'a husga hunegantesage'za, hugahuema hu'nana ke'ma avaririnkama hu kavukvazana, atruma hu'za mani'saza ankero vahe'mo'za husga hugahaze. <verse eid="PSA 89:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 89:6"/>Iza monafima nemanizafintira Ra Anumzanknara hu'ne? Monafima mani'nea hanavenentake ankeromo'a Kagri knara osu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 89:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 89:7"/>Marerirfa ankero vahe'mo'za, Anumzamofonkura kesga hu'za koro hunentaze. Anumzamo'a Agri'ma tra'are'ma manigaginte'naza ankero vahetmina, zamagatereno mareri agatere'nea Anumza mani'ne. <verse eid="PSA 89:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 89:8"/>Ra Anumzana Monafinka Sondia vahe'mofo Anumza mani'nane! Kagrikna hankave Anumzana omani'ne. Ra Anumzamoka kagra hankavenentake Anumza mani'nenka, hugahuema hu'nana kema avaririnkama hu kavukvazamo'a kazeri kagi'ne. <verse eid="PSA 89:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 89:9"/>Kagra knafu knafu'ma nehia hagerina kegava hu'nane. Hagerimo'ma knafu knafu'ma higenka, Kagra zamaherava nehane. <verse eid="PSA 89:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 89:10"/>Rehapu'e hu'zama nehaza tusi'a osifave krerfama hagerimpima nemania osifavea, Kagra asenia rupraro vazinka ahe'nane. Hankavenentake kazanuti ha' vaheka'a zamahe panani hu'nane. <verse eid="PSA 89:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 89:11"/>Ra Anumzamoka mona kagri su'a megeno, mopa kagri su'a me'ne. Hagi maka ama mopafima me'nea zantamina maka kagrike zantmi me'neankinka, kagrake tro huzmante'nane. <verse eid="PSA 89:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 89:12"/>Kagrake'za noti kazigama me'nea zantamina tro nehunka, sauti kazigama me'nea zantamina tro hu'nane. Tabori agonane Hemoni agonanemokea musena nehuke, zagamera huke kagia ahentesga neha'e. <verse eid="PSA 89:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 89:13"/>Anumzamoka kazamofona hihamu hanave'amo'a agatere'ne. Kazamo'a tusiza huno hanavenentake hu'ne. Tamaga kaziga kazamo'a mareri agatereno hankavenentake hu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 89:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 89:14"/>Fatgo avu'avazane, maka zama fatgoma huno'ma refkohu avu'avazamokea kinima mani'nana traka'amofo tra me'na'e. Vagaore kavesizamo'ene tamage nanekekamo'enena kavuga neva'e. <verse eid="PSA 89:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 89:15"/>Ra Anumzamofoma mono'ma hunente'za muse zagame'ma nehaza vahe'mo'za muse hugahaze. Na'ankure zamagra Ra Anumzamofona Agri masa zampi vano nehaze. <verse eid="PSA 89:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 89:16"/>Kagri kagirera nanteranteti agafa hu'za musena nehazageno, vuno kinaga omese'ne. Fatgo kavukva zanka'amo'a zamagrira zamazeri muse nehie. <verse eid="PSA 89:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 89:17"/>Kagra masanentake hihamu hankavezmi mani'nane. Na'ankure kagra muse hurantenka hankavea neraminketa, tagra hankavenentakera nehune. <verse eid="PSA 89:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 89:18"/>Ra Anumzantimoka Kagra tagri hanko mani'nane. Israeli vahe'mofo Ruotge'ma hu'nea Ne'mo'a Agra kinia tami'ne. (2 Samuel 7:8-16) <verse eid="PSA 89:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 89:19"/>Korapara Kagri'ma kazigazima hu'za negavariri'za tagehemofona, ava'nafi nanekea amanage hunka zamasami'nane, Nagra hankavenentake sondia azeri oti'noe. Nagra amne vahepinti vahetmimofo kini manigahane hu'na huhamprinte'noe. <verse eid="PSA 89:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 89:20"/>Nagra eri'za vahe'ni'a Deviti hakena erifore hu'noe. Nagra ruotge masave anumpina taginte'na, azeri ruotge hunte'noe. <verse eid="PSA 89:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 89:21"/>Nagra nazanu hagaza nemi'na, hihamu'ane nazanu azeri hankavetigahue. <verse eid="PSA 89:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 89:22"/>Ha' vahe'amo'za revatga osuge, kefo avu'ava'ma nehaza vahe'mo'za azeri fenkamia otregahaze. <verse eid="PSA 89:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 89:23"/>Agri avuga ha' vahe'aramina zamahe'na rehapatinetre'na, zamavaresrama hunentaza vahera zamahehna hugahue. <verse eid="PSA 89:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 89:24"/>Nagra avesinte vava nehu'na, agrane mani'nenugeno nagri nagifinti hankavea erino ome hankavetigahie. <verse eid="PSA 89:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 89:25"/>Hihamu amisugeno Mediterenia hagerinteti vuno, zage hanati kaziga Yufretis tirantema uhanati'nea mopa kegava hugahie. <verse eid="PSA 89:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 89:26"/>Ana hanugeno Nagrikura amanage hugahie, Kagra Nenfaga mani'nenka, nagri Anumza mani'nanankinka, nagri naguvazi Have mani'nane huno hugahie. <verse eid="PSA 89:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 89:27"/>Nagra azeri nagonesa mofavre sa'nena, maka ama mopafina hankavenentake kini ne' fore huno manigahie. <verse eid="PSA 89:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 89:28"/>Nagra vagaore navesizanu, navesinte vava hu'na nevuna, huhagerafi huvempa ke'ni'a eri tamage hugahue. <verse eid="PSA 89:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 89:29"/>Agripinti'ma fore hu anante anante'ma hu'za vanaza vahera kegava huzmante'nanena, kini tra'amo'a monagna huno mevava huno vugahie. <verse eid="PSA 89:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 89:30"/>Hianagi agripinti fore hu anante anantema hanaza vahe'mo'zama nagri kene kasegenema novaririza, kasegeni'a novaririsaza, <verse eid="PSA 89:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 89:31"/>tra keni'a ruhanetagi'za, kasegenima ovaririnazana, <verse eid="PSA 89:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 89:32"/>Nagra ana kumizmirera sefu nezmi'na, ke'nima rutrage'narera knazana zamigahue. <verse eid="PSA 89:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 89:33"/>Hianagi Nagra navesinte vava nehu'na, agri'enema huvempama hu'noa keni'a ruha'ontagigahue. <verse eid="PSA 89:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 89:34"/>Huge huhagerafi'noa keni'a ruha'ontagige, magore hu'na kema hu'noa kea ete'na eri otregahue. <verse eid="PSA 89:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 89:35"/>Nagra ruotge hu'nea huvempage Devitina hunte'noankina, havigea osugahue. <verse eid="PSA 89:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 89:36"/>Deviti nagapintike kini vahera manivava hu'za vanageno, kini tra'amo'a zagemo'ma nehiaza huno mevava huno vugahie. <verse eid="PSA 89:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 89:37"/>Ikamo'ma monafima me'nenoma, huama'ma huno neviaza huno, tra'amo'a mevava huno vugahie. <verse eid="PSA 89:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 89:38"/>Hianagi menina kavresra hunentenka kamefi humine. Masavema anumpima tagintenka kinima azeri oti'nana nera krimpa ahentane. <verse eid="PSA 89:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 89:39"/>Eri'za vaheka'anema huhagerafi'nana huvempa kea kamefi huneminka, kini fetori'a kugusopafi zafitre'nane. <verse eid="PSA 89:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 89:40"/>Agu'ma nevazia kuma have keginaramina, maka ahe fragu vazinetrenka, fraki kuma'a eri haviza hutre'nane. <verse eid="PSA 89:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 89:41"/>Maka vahe'ma ana kante'ma enevaza vahe'mo'za arohure'za keonke zama'a eri hana nehazageno, tavaoma'arema nemaniza kini ne'mofona kizazokago ke hunte'naze. <verse eid="PSA 89:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 89:42"/>Ha' vahe'aramina hankave zaminke'za hara hugate'nere'za, musenkase nehaze. <verse eid="PSA 89:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 89:43"/>Ha'ma nehia bainati kazinknoma'a eri amnezankna nehunka, ha'ma nehigenka kamefi huminka aza osu'nane. <verse eid="PSA 89:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 89:44"/>Kagra marerirfa konariri'a eri netrenka, kini tra'a mopafi eri akaha hutre'nane. <verse eid="PSA 89:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 89:45"/>Kagra ame hunka zahufafi azeri ozafa nerenka, azeri agaze hu'nane. <verse eid="PSA 89:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="PSA 89:46"/>Ra Anumzamoka nama'agna fraki vava hunka vugahane? Krimpa ahe'zamo'a nama'gna teveareno vugahie? <verse eid="PSA 89:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="PSA 89:47"/>Kagesa antahio, nagra zazatera mani'na ovugahue. Vahe'ma tro'ma hurante'nanana, amne'za mani'none. <verse eid="PSA 89:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="PSA 89:48"/>Mago'mo'e huno mani vava huno ovugahianki, maka frisuna vaheke mani'none. Mago'mo'e huno fri'zana agatereno fregara osu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 89:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="PSA 89:49"/>Ra Anumzamoka iga vagaore kavesizana me'negenka anara nehane? Kagra huvempama Deviti'ma hunentenka, kavesinte vava hugahue hu'nane. <verse eid="PSA 89:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="PSA 89:50"/>Ra Anumzamoka eri'za vaheka'amo'na huhavizama hunenantazana antahio. Rama'a vahe'mo'zama huhavizama hunenantaza kea nagu'afi erinte'na vano nehue. <verse eid="PSA 89:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="PSA 89:51"/>Ra Anumzamoka ha' vahekamo'za kizazokago ke hunenantaze. Anumpima masavema tagintenka kinima azeri oti'nana nera, vuno eno'ma hirega hunte'za ki'za zokago ke hunentaze. <verse eid="PSA 89:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="PSA 89:52"/>Ra Anumzana ragi amivava hugahune. Tamage, tamage.<verse eid="PSA 89:52"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 89"/>
  <chapter number="90" style="c" sid="PSA 90"/>
  <para style="s">Namba 4 zagame avontafere</para>
  <para style="s">Anumzamofo vahe'mo Mosese hu'nea nunamune</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 90:1"/>Ra Anumzamoka fore hu anante anante huno'ma e'nea vahepina, kagra kumati'gna hunka maninka e'nane. <verse eid="PSA 90:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 90:2"/>Agonaramina forera osu'negeno, ama mopane kokanema tro'ma osu'nenka, ko maninka e'nana Anumzankinka eseteti'ma agafama huno atupare'ma uhanati'neana Kagrake'za Anumzana mani'nane. <verse eid="PSA 90:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 90:3"/>Vahera zamazeri rukrahe hanke'za ete kugusopafi nevazagenka amanage nehane, tamagra fri vahe mani'nazanki, ete frita kugusopa seho hunka nehane. <verse eid="PSA 90:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 90:4"/>Na'ankure 1 tauseni'a kafumo'a, kagri kavurera amneza me'neankino, mago knamo'a sondia vahe'mo'ma kenage'ma kvama krino mani'negeno ame huno eviankna hu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 90:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 90:5"/>Avanama ke'nea zamo'ma vahe antahintahifinti'ma ame huno fanane hiankna hunka vahera ahe nefrine. Vahe'mo'za nanterama trazama hageno mareriankna nehaze. <verse eid="PSA 90:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 90:6"/>Nanterana tra'zamo'a amosrea aheteno, kinagama segeno'a hagege nehie. <verse eid="PSA 90:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 90:7"/>Ra Anumzamoka krimpama aherantanketa hagege nehuta, kasima vazinerantanketa, tagra tusi tagogogu nehune. <verse eid="PSA 90:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 90:8"/>Ra Anumzamoka kumitia kavuga eri fanara huntankeno, oku'a nehu'na kumitimo'enena kagri masare amate me'negenka negane. <verse eid="PSA 90:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 90:9"/>Tagra maka kna kagri krimpa hezampi manita nevuta, tasimu'ma anteankna huta ame huta fanane nehune. <verse eid="PSA 90:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 90:10"/>Kafuma manita vanuna kafua, 70'a kafu tami'nane. Hanki tavufgamo'ma knare'ma huno me'nigeta, amne 80'a kafuzagea manigahune. Hianagi knare kafuma manita vanumpina, tatazamo'ene hazenke zamo'enena aviteno nevanigeno, kafu zagetimo'a ame huno evanigeta fanane hugahune. <verse eid="PSA 90:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 90:11"/>Krimpa ahe'zamofo hihamu'a, iza mago vahe'mo'a antahino keno hu'ne? Na'ankure krimpa ahe'zamo'a, rankrerfa hu'neanki'za kagoro hugantega vahe korora hunegantaze. <verse eid="PSA 90:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 90:12"/>E'ina hu'negu manitama vanuna kna'a rempi huramigeta knare antahi'zana enerita manita vamneno. <verse eid="PSA 90:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 90:13"/>Ra Anumzamoka ete tagritega eno. Hago zazate krimpa ahezmantenka avega antenka ananki, eri'za vaheka'aramina kasunku huzmanto. <verse eid="PSA 90:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 90:14"/>Maka nanterana vagaore kavesizanteti tazeri knare hugeta, maka knama manita vanunana, musena nehuta zagamera huta musena huvava hamneno. <verse eid="PSA 90:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 90:15"/>Tazeri havizama hunka e'nana avamente, ete tazeri muse huo. Hazenkefima manitama e'nona kafumofo avamente tazeri muse huo. <verse eid="PSA 90:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 90:16"/>Ra Anumzamoka eri'za vahekamota ranra zama tro'ma hu'nana zana taveri hananketa negesunkenka, anahu kna hunka hihamu masaka'a mofavre nagatimofona eriama hananke'za kegahaze. <verse eid="PSA 90:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 90:17"/>Ra Anumzana tagri Anumzamoka kavesizamo'a tagri'ene me'neno, maka zama hanunana eri knare nehinketa, maka zampina knare hanune.<verse eid="PSA 90:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 90"/>
  <chapter number="91" style="c" sid="PSA 91"/>
  <para style="s">Anumzamofonte'ma zamentintima nehaza vahe'mofo zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 91:1"/>Hagi iza'o marerisa Anumzamofo hankavefima ome frakino manisia vahera, Hankavenentake Anumzamo refitentenigeno ana tonapinka manigahie. <verse eid="PSA 91:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 91:2"/>Hagi nagra Ra Anumzamofonkura amanage hu'na huama hugahue. Ra Anumzamo'a nagrama frakisanua kuma'ene, nagu'vazisania kuma mani'neno, nagri Anumza mani'neanki'na agrite namentintia hugahue. <verse eid="PSA 91:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 91:3"/>Na'ankure Anumzamo'a kva hugante'neankino, katre'nigeno vahe'mo'zama krifuma anaginte'naza krifumo'a kaze'orisigeno, vahe'ma ahe nefria krimo'a kazeri havizana osugahie. <verse eid="PSA 91:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 91:4"/>Ageko'nafi kavre frakinkenka mani'nesnankeno, agekona'anu refitegantegahie. Anumzamofona vagaore huvempa ke'amo'a, hankone hankave vihugna hu'neankino kegava hugahie. <verse eid="PSA 91:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 91:5"/>Kenage'ma kamano vazi'zama fore'ma hania zankura korora osuo. Ana nehunka masare'ma kevemo'ma ame huno eno kazeri havizama huzanku'enena korora osuo. <verse eid="PSA 91:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 91:6"/>Ana zanke hunka kenage'ma rankrima esania zanku'enena korora nosunka, hazenke zamo'ma eno masare'ma eme kazeri haviza hunaku'ma hania zanku'enena korora osuo. <verse eid="PSA 91:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 91:7"/>Hagi kagri tva'ontera 1tauseni'a vahe nefrisanigeno, kazantamaga kaziga 10 tauseni'a vahe frigahaze. Hianagi ana zamo'a kagritera erava'o osugahie. <verse eid="PSA 91:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 91:8"/>Kagra kavufinti negesnankeno, havi zamavu zamava'ma hu'naza vahera Anumzamo'a zamazeri haviza hugahie. <verse eid="PSA 91:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 91:9"/>Hagi kagra Ra Anumzamofoma fraki kumaka'a eri nesenka, Marerisa Anumzamofoma, kagu'vazi kumaka'ama eri sesanana, <verse eid="PSA 91:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 91:10"/>magore huno havi zamo'a kazeri havizana nosanigeno, mago krimo'a kagrama manisana nonku'ma ka'arera erava'o osugahie. <verse eid="PSA 91:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 91:11"/>Na'ankure inantego vunka enkama hananana, Ra Anumzamo'a ankero vahe'a huzmante'na e'za, maka kama vanoma hanampina eme kegava hugantegahaze. <verse eid="PSA 91:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 91:12"/>Ana nehu'za zamazanu kavresga hanageno, havemo'a kagiafina oregahie. <verse eid="PSA 91:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 91:13"/>Laionine osifa'venena zanazeri fenkami netrenka, hankave laionine ha' osifa'venena (cobra) kagiafi zanazerintenka zanare hapatigahane. <verse eid="PSA 91:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 91:14"/>Ra Anumzamo'a huno agrama avesi nenantegu hu'na, agrira agu'nevazi'na, Nagri nagima keno antahino'ma hu'negu hu'na, kegava huntegahue. <verse eid="PSA 91:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 91:15"/>Hagi nagritegama nunamunke'ma hanige'na, agri nunamua antahimigahue. Ana nehu'na knafima mani'nesige'na, agrane magoka manine'na, aza nehu'na ra agi amigahue. <verse eid="PSA 91:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 91:16"/>Ana nehu'na mizama'ama amisanuana, kna'a erinte za'za hanugeno muse huno nemanisige'na, Nagra vahe'ma agu'ma nevazua hanaveni'a eri averi hugahue.<verse eid="PSA 91:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 91"/>
  <chapter number="92" style="c" sid="PSA 92"/>
  <para style="s">Mani fruhu kna Sabati knare'ma hanaza zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 92:1"/>Ra Anumzamoka susu huno humusema hugante zamo'a knare'zantfa hu'neanki'na, Marerisa Anumzamoka zagame hu'na kagi'a ahentesga hugahue. <verse eid="PSA 92:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 92:2"/>Anumzamoka maka zupama tagri'ma kavesirantenka knare'ma hunerantana zankura nanterana huama nehu'na, maka zupama kage'ma kaninorantana zankura kinaga huama nehu'na, <verse eid="PSA 92:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 92:3"/>Laeriema nehaza zavenareti'ene, hapureti'ene zavena nehe'na, zagamera hu'na kagia ahentesga hugahue. <verse eid="PSA 92:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 92:4"/>Ra Anumzamoka Kagrama eri'nana eri'zanu nazeri muse hankena, Kagrama kazanu'ma tro hunka eri fore'ma hu'nana zankura zagamera hu'na musena nehue. <verse eid="PSA 92:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 92:5"/>Ra Anumzamoka kagra ra eri'za eri'nanankino, Kagri antahi'zamo'a rankrerfa huno amefenkame tami'ne. <verse eid="PSA 92:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 92:6"/>Antahintahima oma'ne vahe'mo'a ana zana keamara nosigeno, neginagima nehia vahe'mo'a ana zana antahiamara nosie. <verse eid="PSA 92:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 92:7"/>Havi avu'ava zama nehaza vahe'mo'za, trazamo rehakarufeno mareriaza hu'za nehagesage'za, kefo avu'ava zama nehaza vahe'mo'za amosrema ahenteaza hu'za makazana antegahazanagi, kagra zamahe fanene hugahane. <verse eid="PSA 92:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 92:8"/>Na'ankure Ra Anumzamoka kagi'a ahentesga hu vava hu'za vugahaze. <verse eid="PSA 92:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 92:9"/>Ra Anumzamoka kagri ha' vahe'mo'za tamagerfa hu'za fanane nehanage'za, havi zamavu zamava'ma nehaza vahe'mo'za miko panani hu'za ufre efre hugahaze. <verse eid="PSA 92:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 92:10"/>Hianagi afi bulimakaomofo pazivemo'ma hankavematiaza hunka, nagrira nazeri hankave ti'nane. Ana nehunka kasefa masavereti taginka nanuntera frenantanke'na musena hu'noe. <verse eid="PSA 92:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 92:11"/>Nagra navufinti nezmagoge'za ha' vahenimo'za evu neramizageno, kefo avu'ava'ma nehaza vahe'mo'zama, ha'ma renenantaza vahe'ma, ha'ma huzmagaterazageno zavi krafama haza zana antahi'noe. <verse eid="PSA 92:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 92:12"/>Hianagi fatgo avu'ava'ma nehaza vahe'mo'za, tofe zafamo knare zantfa huno hageno mareriankna nehu'za, sida zafamo Lebanoni mopafi hageno tretre huno mareriankna hugahaze. <verse eid="PSA 92:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 92:13"/>Zamagra Ra Anumzamofo nompi hankre'naza zafagna nehu'za, tagri Anumzamofo kumapina zamagra knare'zantfa hu'za tretre hu'za hagegahaze. <verse eid="PSA 92:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 92:14"/>Fatgo vahe'mo'za tavava ozafa regahazanagi raga renente'za, zafa asi'namo tretre huno kasefa kasefa nehiaza hu'za manigahaze. <verse eid="PSA 92:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 92:15"/>Ana vahe'mo'za huama hu'za, Ra Anumzamo'a fatgo avu'ava'za nehia nekino, Agra hankave havetia mani'neankino Agripina havi avu'ava zana omne'ne hu'za hugahaze.<verse eid="PSA 92:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 92"/>
  <chapter number="93" style="c" sid="PSA 93"/>
  <para style="s">Anumzamo'a kini mani'ne hu'nea zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 93:1"/>Ra Anumzamo'a Agrake kinia mani'neno masanentake zaza kukena hu'ne. Hanave'areti kukena hu'neno hahunaku retro huno mani'ne. Ama mopa tro huntegeno hankavetino me'neankino, mago vahemo'e huno eri kazara osutfa hugahie. <verse eid="PSA 93:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 93:2"/>Ra Anumzamoka kagra maka zana forera osu'negenka korapa mani'nanankinka, kinia mani vava hunka neane. <verse eid="PSA 93:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 93:3"/>Ra Anumzamoka hagerimo'a tusiza huno kranto kranto nehigeno, monagemo'ma hiaza huno timo'a ra agasasa nerie. Ana nehigeno hagerimo'a hanavetino kranto krantora nehie. <verse eid="PSA 93:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 93:4"/>Ra Anumzamofo hanavemo'a hagerimo'ma eme runagrama neseno'ma, agasasama neriama'a agetereno tusi hankavenentake higeno, rama'a tintamimofo agasasankenena agatere'ne. <verse eid="PSA 93:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 93:5"/>Anumzamoka'ma ante'nana kasegea mago vahe'mo'a eri otregahie. Tamagerfa huno Ra Anumzamoka Kagri mono nonkamo'a ruotge huno mevava hugahie.<verse eid="PSA 93:5"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 93"/>
  <chapter number="94" style="c" sid="PSA 94"/>
  <para style="s">Anumzamo'ma havi vahe'ma azeri haviza nehuno knare vahe'ma azeri so'ema hania zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 94:1"/>Ra Anumzamoka kagri'ma ha'ma renegantaza vahera, kagra nona hunka zamazeri haviza nehana Anumza mani'nane. Ana hu'nananki krimpa ahe'zana eriama huge'za keho. <verse eid="PSA 94:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 94:2"/>Ama mopafima mani'ne'za zamavufaga rama nehaza vahera, otinka keaga huzmantenka refko hunezmantenka mizana zamio. <verse eid="PSA 94:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 94:3"/>Ra Anumzamoka nama'agna kefo zamavu zamava'ma nehaza vahe'mokizmia zamatre'nanke'za musena huza maniza egahaze? Nama'a knazami me'ne? <verse eid="PSA 94:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 94:4"/>Nama'a zupa kefo zamavu zamava'ma nehaza vahe'mo'za havigea nehu'za, kefo avu'ava'ma nehaza nama'a zupa zamavufaga erisga hu nanekea nehaze? <verse eid="PSA 94:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 94:5"/>Ra Anumzamoka ana vahe'mo'za kagri vahera zamare hapa'neti'za, Nagri vaherema hunka erisantima hare'nana vahera zamazeri haviza nehaze. <verse eid="PSA 94:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 94:6"/>Ana vahe'mo'za kento a'nene megusa mofavre nagara zamahe nefri'za, ru mopareti'ma tagri mopafima emani'naza vahe'enena zamahe nefrize. <verse eid="PSA 94:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 94:7"/>Ana vahe'mo'za hu'za Ra Anumzamo'a avua norage hu'za nehu'za, Jekopu naga'mo'za tagrama hu'na zantera Ra Anumzamo'a avua anteno norage hu'za nehaze. <verse eid="PSA 94:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 94:8"/>Tamagra neginagi nehuta keontahi vahe mani'nazanki kama antahiho, ina zupa ama' antahi'zana erigahaze? <verse eid="PSA 94:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 94:9"/>Vahe'motama tagesama tro hunte'nea Anumzamofona agesa ankani re'nefi? Vahe'mota tavuragama tro hunte'nea Anumzamofona, avua asuhu'nefi? <verse eid="PSA 94:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 94:10"/>Ama mopafi vahe'ma knama zamino zamazeri fatgoma nehia Anumzamo'a, zamavumrora anteno zamazeri fatgoa osugahifi? Ama mopafi vahe'ma rempi hunezamia Anumzamo'a antahi'zankura atupa hu'nefi? <verse eid="PSA 94:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 94:11"/>Ra Anumzamo'a vahe'mokizmi antahi'zama keno antahino'ma hiana, ana antahintahizmimo'a amnezankna huno zahoma huhu hutreankna hu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 94:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 94:12"/>Ra Anumzamokama azeri fatgoma nehunka kasege ka'afinti'ma rempima hunemina vahe'mo'a asomu erigahie. <verse eid="PSA 94:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 94:13"/>Ana vahemo'ma knafima unefregenka, kegava hunentenka arimpa fru neminka, kefo avu'ava'ma nehia vahe'mofo keria Anumzamoka kagra kafintenenka azerigahane. <verse eid="PSA 94:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 94:14"/>Na'ankure Ra Anumzamo'a vahe'a amefira hunozamino, nagri nagare huno huhampari zamante'nea vahe'agino ozamatregahie. <verse eid="PSA 94:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 94:15"/>Keagama refko'ma hanazana, fatgo avu'ava zante nege'za refko hugahaze. Ana nehanage'za fatgo avu'ava'ma nehaza vahe'mo'zama nege'za amage antegahaze. <verse eid="PSA 94:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 94:16"/>Hagi kefo avu'ava'ma nehaza vahe'mo'zama nazeri havizama nehanageno'a, iza nagritega anteno nagura nevazino, havi avu'ava'ma nehaza vahe'mo'zama nazeri haviza hu'zama nehanageno'a naza hugahie? <verse eid="PSA 94:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 94:17"/>Hagi Ra Anumzamo'ma naza osiresina, nagra ko fri'na keonke zamofo agasasankema omne fri vahe kumapi umanusine. <verse eid="PSA 94:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 94:18"/>Nagrama hu'na regarari'na umasoema hugenka, Ra Anumzamoka vagaore kavesi zanteti knare hunantenka nazerisga hu'nane. <verse eid="PSA 94:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 94:19"/>Narimpagna zamo'ma nazeri havizama hunaku'ma nehigenka, Kagra nazeri fru hunka nazeri hankavetinke'na, muse hu'noe. <verse eid="PSA 94:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 94:20"/>Fatgo avu'ava zama nosu'za, havi kasegema nente'za, vahe'ma zamaza hazage'zama kumi'ma nehaza kva vahe'mo'za Kagranena taragote'za nomanize. <verse eid="PSA 94:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 94:21"/>Ana vahe'mo'za magopi atru hu'za kea anakite'za, fatgo avu'ava zama nehaza vahera zamahe frikea hu'za kna nezami'za, ke'zami omane vahera zamahe frinaku nehaze. <verse eid="PSA 94:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 94:22"/>Hianagi Ra Anumzamo'a nagri vihuni'agino kegava hunantegahie. Anumzanimo'a nagrama frakinua havega mani'ne. <verse eid="PSA 94:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 94:23"/>Kefo avu'ava'ma nehaza vahe'mo'zama hu'naza kumira erino zamagri zamagumpi nenteno, ana kumi zamigu huno zamazeri havizana hugahie. Ra Anumzana tagri Anumzamo ana vahera zamazeri havizana hugahie.<verse eid="PSA 94:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 94"/>
  <chapter number="95" style="c" sid="PSA 95"/>
  <para style="s">Anumzamofo agima erisgama hanaza zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 95:1"/>Enketa Ra Anumzamofona muse zagame huta agi'a ahentsga nehuta, tagu'ma nevazia Havegi Ra Anumzamofona ranke huta agi'a ahentesga hanune. <verse eid="PSA 95:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 95:2"/>Enketa Agri avuga vuta susu hunenteta, muse zagame huta agi'a ahentesga hamneno. <verse eid="PSA 95:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 95:3"/>Na'ankure Ra Anumzamo'a marerisa Anumza mani'neno, maka havi anumzantamina zamagatereno, ugota Kini mani'ne. <verse eid="PSA 95:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 95:4"/>Ama mopafima kerima huno ame fenkame'ma urami'neregati'ma vuno, ame'nagame marerigatere'nea agonaregama vu'neana, ana maka Anumzamofo azampi me'ne. <verse eid="PSA 95:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 95:5"/>Hagerina Anumzamo tro hu'negu huno, Agri suza me'ne. Ana zanke huno ho'mu mopa azanuti tro hu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 95:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 95:6"/>Enketa kepri huta mono hunenteta, Ra Anumo'ma tagri'ma tro'ma hurante'nea ne' avuga tarena reta monora huntesune. <verse eid="PSA 95:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 95:7"/>Na'ankure Agra tagri Anumza mani'neankino, sipisipi afu'tamima kegavama nehiaza huno kegava hurantegeta, Agri azampi mani'none. Ana hu'neanki, meninena tamagesa ante'neta Agri agerura antahiho. <verse eid="PSA 95:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 95:8"/>Ra Anumzamo huno, Israeli vahe'mo'zama hagege kokampima ne-eza, Meriba kumaku'ma Masa kumarema nehaza kumatema, zamagu'a kafama erigi'naza zana huta tamagu'a kafana eri onkiho. <verse eid="PSA 95:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 95:9"/>Hagi tamagehe'moza hagege kokampima manine'za, maka zama eri fore'ma hua zana ko ke'nazanagi, Nagri hanave kenaku renahe'za ke'naze. <verse eid="PSA 95:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 95:10"/>Hagi 40'a kafumofo agu'afina nagote nezmantena amanage hu'na hu'noe, ama vahe'mo'za kana atre'za hazanegre'za, nagrama hihoma hu'na huzmantoa nanekea amagera nontaze. <verse eid="PSA 95:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 95:11"/>Ana'ma hu'nazagu hu'na tusi narimpa ahenezmante'na, amanage hu'na huvempa hu'noe. Nagrama huama hu'na, tamisugetama ome mani fru hugahazema hu'noa mopafina uofretfa hugahaze (Hibru 4:3).<verse eid="PSA 95:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 95"/>
  <chapter number="96" style="c" sid="PSA 96"/>
  <para style="s">Anumzamo'ma so'e avu'ava'ma hunezmantea zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 96:1"/>Tamagra Ra Anumzamofona kasefa zagame hunteho. Maka ama mopafima mani'naza vahe'mota Ra Anumzamofona zagame hunteho. <verse eid="PSA 96:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 96:2"/>Ra Anumzamofona zagame hunenteta, agi'a ahentesga hiho. Ana nehuta vahe'ma zamagu vazino etema nezamavarea zankura, maka knafina huama huta vahera zamasamiho. <verse eid="PSA 96:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 96:3"/>Agri hihamu masazama'agura kokankoka vahera huama huta nezamasamita, hanavenentake eri'zama eri'nea zankura, huama huta maka vahera zamasamiho. <verse eid="PSA 96:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 96:4"/>Ra Anumzamo'a maka zana agatereno tusi'a Anumza mani'neankino, Agrake ra agi'a erigahie. Maka havi anumzana zamagatere'neankita, Agrikuke'za korora huntegahune. <verse eid="PSA 96:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 96:5"/>Na'ankure maka ama mopafima mani'naza vahe'mokizmi havi anumzantamina, amne zamazanteti tro hu'naza zantami me'naze. Hianagi anamifima me'nea monaramina, Ra Anumzamo agra'a tro hunte'ne. <verse eid="PSA 96:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 96:6"/>Ra Anumzamo'a noma'afina ragi erino kinia mani'negeno, agri hihamune masa'amo'ene konariri'amo'enena noma'afina avite'ne. <verse eid="PSA 96:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 96:7"/>Ama mopafima kokankokama mani'naza vahe'mota, Ra Anumzamofona husga hunenteta, agri hihamu masa zama'aguenena husga hunteho. <verse eid="PSA 96:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 96:8"/>Ra Anumzamo'a agrake ra agia erigara hu'neanki agi'a erisga nehuta, ofatamia erineta, agri mono nompina ufreho. <verse eid="PSA 96:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 96:9"/>Ra Anumzamofona ruotage huno masa nentake'ma hu'nea avasase zama'afi mani'neta monora hunteho. Maka ama mopafima mani'naza vahe'mota, agri avure mani'neta, kore hunenteta, tamahirahiku hiho. <verse eid="PSA 96:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 96:10"/>Ama mopafima kokankokama mani'naza vahe'mokizmia zamasamita, Ra Anumzamo'a kini mani'ne huta hiho! Ama mopa tro huntegeno hankavetino me'neankino, mago zamo'a eri kazara osugahie. Agra ana nehuno maka ama mopafima mani'naza vahera, mago avamenteke refko huzmantegahie. <verse eid="PSA 96:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 96:11"/>Monane mopamokanena muse nehinkeno, hagerimokane tigu'ama me'nea zantami motanena, ranke huta Ra Anumzamofona husga hunteho. <verse eid="PSA 96:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 96:12"/>Hozamokane hozafima nehagaza ne'zamota, avo nehageta musenkase hiho. Ana nehanageta zafa ta'nopafima me'nea zafamota ranke huta muse zagamera hiho. <verse eid="PSA 96:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 96:13"/>Na'ankure Ra Anumzamo'ma esaniana, ama mopafima mani'naza vahe eme refko huzmanteku egahianki, agri avuga ana zana hugahaze. Ama mopafi vahe'ma eme refko huzmantesiana, fatgo avu'ava zanteti'ene, ke tamage'areti'ene huno eme refko huzmantegahie.<verse eid="PSA 96:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 96"/>
  <chapter number="97" style="c" sid="PSA 97"/>
  <para style="s">Anumzamo ugota kini mani'nea hu'nea zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 97:1"/>Ra Anumzamo'a kini mani'neno maka zana kegava hu'ne huta, maka ama mopafima mani'naza vahe'mota muse nehinke'za, hagerimofo amu'nompima me'nea mopafima nemaniza vahe'mo'zanena musena hiho. <verse eid="PSA 97:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 97:2"/>Hanintiri hu'nea hampomo'ene tapari'nea hampomo'ene azeri kagintegeno mani'ne. Fatgo avu'ava zanteti'ene mago avamenteke'ma refko'ma hu avu'ava zama'areti, kini tra'amofo trara anteno mani'ne. <verse eid="PSA 97:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 97:3"/>Tevenefa'mo agri avuga hagana hagana nehigeno, maka asoparegati'ma ha' vahe'amozama eme regaginte'naza vahera teve zamareno tefanene nehie. <verse eid="PSA 97:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 97:4"/>Agri kopasi'namo'a trege huno ama mopa remsa nehigeno, ama mopamo'ma ana zama negeno'a tusi ahirahi nere. <verse eid="PSA 97:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 97:5"/>Anumzana ama mopama kegava hu'nea ne'mofo avuga, agonaramimo'za masavemo'ma ze'ze huno pakepake nehiaza hu'za pakepake hu'naze. <verse eid="PSA 97:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 97:6"/>Anamima me'nea mona ramimo'za fatgo avu'ava zama'agu huama nehanageno, maka ama mopafima kokankokama mani'naza vahe'mo'za agri hihamu masazama'a negaze. <verse eid="PSA 97:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 97:7"/>Hagi zmazantetima antre'za tro'ma hu'naza havi anumzamofo amema'are'ma mono'ma hunente'za, zamavufaga rama nehaza vahe'mo'za zamagazegu hugahaze. Ana nehanageno maka havi anumzantamimo'za, Anumzamofo avuga zamarena re'za mono huntegahaze. <verse eid="PSA 97:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 97:8"/>Saioni kumamo'ene, Juda mopafima me'nea kumatamimo'za, anankema nentahi'za, tusi musenkase nehaze. Na'ankure Ra Anumzamokama keagama refko'ma hana zanku, anara hu'naze. <verse eid="PSA 97:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 97:9"/>Na'ankure Ra Anumzana Kagra Marerirfa Anumza mani'nenka maka ama mopa kegava hu'nane. Ana hu'nenka kagrake'za rankagia erinka, maka havi anumzantamina zamagterenka onagamu mani'nane. <verse eid="PSA 97:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 97:10"/>Ra Anumzamofoma avesima nentaza vahe'mota, kumimofona tamefi humiho. Tamagu'areti'ma huta amage'ma nentaza vahe'mota, Ra Anumzamo'a kegava huramantegahie. Ana nehuno kefo avu'ava zama nehaza vahe zamazampintira tamagu vazigahie. <verse eid="PSA 97:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 97:11"/>Fatgo avu'ava zama nehaza vahera Anumzamo'a remsa hunezmanteno, zamagu'amo'ma fatgo hu'nea vahera musezana ante nezmantege'za muse nehaze. <verse eid="PSA 97:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 97:12"/>Anumzamofoma amage'ma nentaza vahe'mota, agrama hu'nea avu'ava zankura muse hunenteta, ruotage'ma hu'nea agigura susu hunteho.<verse eid="PSA 97:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 97"/>
  <chapter number="98" style="c" sid="PSA 98"/>
  <para style="s">Anumzamo maka vahe kini mani'nea hu'nea zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 98:1"/>Ra Anumzamo'ma knare'nare zama erifore'ma hu'nea zanku huta, Agritega kasefa zagame huntesune. Agra tamaga kaziga hankavenentake azanteti'ene, ruotage'ma hu'nea azanteti'ene huno hara hugatere'ne. <verse eid="PSA 98:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 98:2"/>Ra Anumzamo'a Agrama vahe'ma zamagu'ma vazizama'a eriama nehuno, maka kokankoka vahera fatgo avu'ava zama'a eri zamaveri hu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 98:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 98:3"/>Agrama Israeli vahe'ma huvempa huzmanteno, maka zupa nagra navesi tamante vava nehu'na, namefira huozamigahue huno'ma huvempama hu'nea nanekegu agesa antahi'ne. Ama mopama ometre emetre'ma hu'neregama nemaniza maka vahe'mota, Anumzamo'ma tagu'ma vazi'nea zana ko ke'naze. <verse eid="PSA 98:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 98:4"/>Maka ama mopafima nemaniza vahe'mota ranke huta Ra Anumzamofo agia ahentesga hiho. Mago zankura rekura osuta, ranke huta muse zagamera eri otita nehuta musenkasea hiho. <verse eid="PSA 98:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 98:5"/>Hapu zavena nehenkeno knare ageru neranigeta, zagamera nehuta Ra Anumzamofona agi'a ahentesga hiho. <verse eid="PSA 98:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 98:6"/>Ufenteti'ene sipisipimofo paziveteti ufena nereta, Ra Anumzana kini ne'mofo avuga ranke huta zagamera nehuta musenkasea hiho. <verse eid="PSA 98:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 98:7"/>Hagerimokane, hagerimpima nemaniza zagaramimota tamagerura erintesga huta rantamageru riho. Anazanke huta ama mopamokane, agofetu'ma nemaniza zantamimota tamagranena anazanke hiho. <verse eid="PSA 98:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 98:8"/>Ranra tintamimoza zamazana nehesageta, agonaramimota tamagerura eri mago huta musenkase zagamera hiho. <verse eid="PSA 98:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 98:9"/>Na'ankure Ra Anumzamo'ma ne-eana ama mopafima nemaniza vahe refko huzmanteku ne-eankino, maka ama mopafima kokankokama nemaniza vahera fatgo avu'ava huno, mago avamenteke refkoa huzmantegahie.<verse eid="PSA 98:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 98"/>
  <chapter number="99" style="c" sid="PSA 99"/>
  <para style="s">Anumzamo ugagota kini mani'ne hu'nea zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 99:1"/>Ra Anumzamo'a kini manino maka zana kegava hu'neanki, maka kokanko'ma nemaniza vahe'mota korora hunenteta tamahirahiku hiho. Agra serabimie nehaza ankerontremofo amu'nompi kini tra'a anteno onagamu mani'negeno, ama mopamo'a imi enerie. <verse eid="PSA 99:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 99:2"/>Saioni kumapina Ra Anumzamo'a tusi konariri'ane mani'neno, maka kokankokama mani'naza vahetera Agra manisga huno mani'neno kegava hunezmante. <verse eid="PSA 99:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 99:3"/>Maka ama mopafima mani'naza, vahe'mo'za ra huno so'e zantfama hu'nea kagia husga hunegante'za, kagrikura ruotage hu'ne hu'za hiho. <verse eid="PSA 99:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 99:4"/>Hankavenentake'ma hu'nana kini ne'moka, fatgo avu'ava zanku kave'nesie. Kagraka'a fatgoma huno refko hu avu'ava zana eri agafa hu'nane. Ana nehunka Israeli vahera magoke avamente antenka fatgo avu'ava hunka refko hunezmantane. <verse eid="PSA 99:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 99:5"/>Ra Anumzana tagri Anumzamofona agi'a ahentesga nehuta, agri agafi ome kepri huta monora huntesnune. Na'ankure agra ruotage hu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 99:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 99:6"/>Hagi pristi eri'zama eneriza vahe amu'nompina, Mosesi'ene Aronikea pristi eri'zana eri'na'e. Agritegama nunamuma nehaza vahe amu'nompina, Samueli'a agrane nunamuna higeno, Ra Anumzamo'a nunamuzamia antahi nezamino nona huzmante'ne. <verse eid="PSA 99:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 99:7"/>Ra Anumzamo'a vimago hampompi mani'neno, Israeli vahera keaga zamasami'ne. Ana hige'za amage anteho huno'ma zamasamia tra kene, kasegenena amage ante'naze. <verse eid="PSA 99:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 99:8"/>Ra Anumzana tagri Anumzamoka nunamu zamia antahi zami'nane. Ana'ma hanke'za kagri'ma ke'za antahi'zama hazana, kumi atre zamante Anumza mani'nane hu'naze. Hianagi zamagrama kumi'ma hazagenka nona hunka zamazeri haviza nehana Anumza mani'nane. <verse eid="PSA 99:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 99:9"/>Ra Anumzana tagri Anumzamofona agi'a ahentesga nehuta, ruotage'ma hu'nea agona'afina monora huntesnune. Na'ankure Ra Anumzana tagri Anumzamo'a ruotage hu'ne.<verse eid="PSA 99:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 99"/>
  <chapter number="100" style="c" sid="PSA 100"/>
  <para style="s">Anumzamofoma agima ahentesgama hu zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 100:1"/>Maka ama mopafima mani'naza vahe'mota musenkase huta zagamera nehuta Ra Anumzamofo agi'a ahentesga hiho. <verse eid="PSA 100:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 100:2"/>Ra Anumzamofona muse huta eri'zama'a erinteho. Agri avugama nevanuta, muse zagame huta viho. <verse eid="PSA 100:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 100:3"/>Ra Anumzamo'a Anumza mani'ne huta keta antahita hiho. Agra'a tro hurantegeta agri vahe mani'none. Ana huta agri vahe mani'nonankino, sipisipi kva vahe'mo sipisipi kegava hunteankna huno kegava hurantegeta mani'none. <verse eid="PSA 100:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 100:4"/>Agri kumapima ufre kahante'ma nevuta muse hume nevuta, unefreta agi'a ahentesga hiho. Ana nehuta susu huta muse hunenteta, ra agi'a ahentesga hiho. <verse eid="PSA 100:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 100:5"/>Na'ankure Ra Anumzamo'a knare hu'negu agri vagaore avesizamo'a mevava huno vugahie. Hagi hugahuema huno hu'nea ke'are oti'neno, fore hu anante anante'ma hu'za knane knanema mani'za aza vahera zamaza nehia Anumza mani'ne.<verse eid="PSA 100:5"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 100"/>
  <chapter number="101" style="c" sid="PSA 101"/>
  <para style="s">Kini ne' Deviti'ma huvempa hu'nea zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 101:1"/>Ra Anumzamoka vagaore mevava kavesi zanka'agu'ene, fatgo kavukva zankura zagamera hugahue. Ra Anumzamoka zagame nehu'na kagri kagia ahentesga hugahue. <verse eid="PSA 101:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 101:2"/>Nagra kegava hu'na mani'nena, fatgo avu'ava zanke hu'na vugahue. Ra Anumzamoka ina zupa enka, nagrira eme naza hugahane? Nagra nonifima manine'na, inankna zama hanuana fatgo avu'ava zanke hugahue. <verse eid="PSA 101:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 101:3"/>Nagra vahe'ma agazema nemia havi avu'ava zantera navua ante'na onkegahue. Havi avu'ava zama nehaza vahe'mokizmi avu'ava zankura nago'nete. Ana hu'neanki'na ana vahe'enena rutragote'na omanigahue. <verse eid="PSA 101:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 101:4"/>Akrahe krehe avu'ava zama nehaza vahera zamatre'nuge'za nagri tva'ontera omegahaze. Ana nehu'na kefo avu'ava zana namefi humigahue. <verse eid="PSA 101:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 101:5"/>Tava'ozamire'ma nemaniza vahe'ma oku'ma zamazeri havizama nehaza vahera, ozmatre'na zamazeri haviza hugahue. Vahe'ma zamage fenkami netre'za zamavufaga ataneraza vahera ha' rezamantegahue. <verse eid="PSA 101:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 101:6"/>Zamagu'areti'ma tamagema hu'za Anumzamofoma avariri fatgoma nehaza vahera, nagra kegava huzmantegahue. Iza'o hazenke'ama omne'nenia vahe'mo Nagri eri'zana erigahie. <verse eid="PSA 101:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 101:7"/>Havigema hu'za vahe'ma rezmatgama nehaza vahera zamatre'nuge'za, nagri nompina mani'neza eri'zani'a e'origahaze. Havigema nehaza vahera zamatre'nuge'za, nagri noni'afina mago kankamuna zaminuge'za navuga omanigahaze. <verse eid="PSA 101:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 101:8"/>Ama mopafintira kefo avu'ava zama nehaza vahera, maka nantera nagra zamahe fanene huvava hugahue. Anumzamofo rankumapima havi avu'ava zama nehaza vahera zamahe fanene hugahue.<verse eid="PSA 101:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 101"/>
  <chapter number="102" style="c" sid="PSA 102"/>
  <para style="s">Vahe'mo'ma knazampima unefreno nehia nunamu zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 102:1"/>Ra Anumzamoka nunamuni'a nentahinka, naza huogu'ma zavi krafama nehuana antahinamio. <verse eid="PSA 102:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 102:2"/>Kna zampima mani'nesugenka, kavugosa rukrahe hunka kamefira huonaminka, kagesa antahinamio. Ana nehunka naza huogu'ma kezankema nehanugenka, ame hunka naza huo. <verse eid="PSA 102:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 102:3"/>Kumo'ma mareriteno ame huno fanane hiaza hu'na osi'a knafi mani'nena fanane hu'za nehugeno, zaferinanifintira teve rukru nehigeno, tevemo'ma tankanu'zama teganinkani nehiankna zaferinanimo'a nehie. <verse eid="PSA 102:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 102:4"/>Zagemo'ma trazama temagigeno'ma hiaza huno nagu'amo'a evuramitfaza nehige'na, ne'zana onesanua nagesa nehie. <verse eid="PSA 102:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 102:5"/>Karagi'ma ruazamo higeno, navufgamo'a zaferinare vuno ome kamare'ne. <verse eid="PSA 102:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 102:6"/>Hagege huno vahe omani ka'ma kokampi komutomo'ma hiaza hu'na nagrake nemani'na, atrazageno haviza hige'za vahera nomaniza kumatamimpi, komutomo'ma manino vano hiaza nehue. <verse eid="PSA 102:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 102:7"/>Kenagera navura mase'noanagi, antahintahimo'a eri'zana erivava hige'na, navura omase'noe. Ana hige'na nomofo agofetu'ma namamo agraku akoheno maniaza hu'na nemanue. <verse eid="PSA 102:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 102:8"/>Nagri ha' vahe'mo'za maka zupa kiza zokago ke hunantevava nehaze. Ana nehu'za vahe'ma kema nezamasu'za zamazeri havizama hunakura, nagri nagi ahenente'za hu havizana hunezmantaze. <verse eid="PSA 102:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 102:9"/>Ne'zama neaza hu'na ta'nefara nene'na, tima nofina navunumo'a eramige'na, navunu'ene tina ne'noe. <verse eid="PSA 102:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 102:10"/>Na'ankure kagra tusi krimpa ahenantenka, nagrira nazeri sga hutenka matevu natre'nane. <verse eid="PSA 102:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 102:11"/>Nagra za'za kna omanigahuankino knanimo'a ame huno kinaga fre zagemofo amema'amo'ma hiaza huno vaga neresnige'na, trazamo osapareaza hu'na hagege nehue. <verse eid="PSA 102:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 102:12"/>Hianagi Ra Anumzamoka kagra kinia maninka za'zate kegava hunka vugahane. Ana hu'nesnanke'za henkama mani'za vanaza vahe'mo'zanena ana zankura zamagera okanigahaze. <verse eid="PSA 102:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 102:13"/>Kagra otinka Saioni rankumakura kasunku huntegahane. Na'ankure kagrama kasunku'ma huntenka aza hugahue hunkama huhampri'nana kna fatgo eankinka, kavesinentenka aza hugahane. <verse eid="PSA 102:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 102:14"/>Saioni kumapi havemo'a haviza hu'neanagi, eri'za vahekamo'za tusiza hu'za avesinte'naze. Ana nehu'za menima kumamo'ma haviza higeno kugusopa moke'ma hu'nea zankura, tusiza hu'za zamasunku hunentaze. <verse eid="PSA 102:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 102:15"/>Maka kokankoka mopafima mani'naza vahe'mo'za Ra Anumzamofo agigura zamahirahiku nehu'za, avuga zamarena regahaze. Ana nehanage'za maka ama mopafi kini vahe'mo'za Anumzamoka hihamu masaka'agura koro hugahaze. <verse eid="PSA 102:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 102:16"/>Na'ankure Ra Anumzamo'a Jerusalemi kuma'ma ete eri so'ema huno negino, Agra'a hihamu masa'afima eama'ma hania zanku anara hugahaze. <verse eid="PSA 102:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 102:17"/>Ana nehuno zamunte omane zamavufaga zamavapa nemaniza nagamokizmi nunamuna antahi nezamino, nazankuro nunamuma hu'za antahima kesaza nunamu kezmia antahi amnea osugahie. <verse eid="PSA 102:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 102:18"/>Ama ana zankura avontafepi krente'ne sanunke'za henkama fore hu anante anante'ma hanaza vahe'mo'za hampari'za antahigahaze. Ana nehanage'za henkama fore'ma hanaza vahe'mo'za Ra Anumzamofo agi'a ahentesga hugahaze. <verse eid="PSA 102:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 102:19"/>Ra Anumzamo'a onagamu ruotgema hu'nea noma'afi mani'neno, kefenkateno ama mopafina nege. <verse eid="PSA 102:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 102:20"/>Hagi kinafima mani'naza vahe'mo'zama karagi'ma nerazazana nentahino, zamahe frigahune hu'za hu'naza kina vahera katufe zamatre'naku anara nehie. <verse eid="PSA 102:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 102:21"/>Ana'ma hanige'za Saioni agonafina Ra Anumzamofo agi'a huama nehanage'za, Jerusalemi kumapina agri agia ahentesga hugahaze. <verse eid="PSA 102:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 102:22"/>Maka ama mopafima kokankokama nemaniza vahe'mo'za, magopi eme eritru nehanage'za, maka ama mopafima kinimo'ma kvama huterema hu'nea mopareti e'za Jerusalemi kumapina Ra Anumzamofo mono eri'zana emerintegahaze. <verse eid="PSA 102:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 102:23"/>Ozafa ore kasefa vahe mani'nogeno, Ra Anumzamo'a nagri hankavea eri netreno, knani'a eri atupa hu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 102:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 102:24"/>Ana higena Anumzamofonkura amanage hu'na hu'noe. Anumzanimoka kasefa vahe mani'noanki, knani'a eri atupara hunka ama mopafintira nazeri otro. Kagra ofri manivava hunka neana Anumza mani'nane. <verse eid="PSA 102:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 102:25"/>Korapara Kagra ama mopamo'ma regrino'ma me'nia trara tro hunentenka, monare'ma me'nea zantamina Kagra kazanteti tro huzmante'nane. <verse eid="PSA 102:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 102:26"/>Ana zantamimo'za vagaresazanagi, Kagra manivava hunka vugahane. Atafa kukenamo'ma hiaza huke ome haviza hugaha'e. Kasefa kukena eri nehankreno atafa kukenama hate atregeno'ma viaza hunka zanazeri atresankeke vagaregaha'e. <verse eid="PSA 102:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 102:27"/>Hianagi Kagra mago avamenteke maninka nevnankeno, kafu kamo'enena vagaore vuvava huno vugahie. <verse eid="PSA 102:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 102:28"/>Kagri eri'za vahe'mokzimi mofavre nagara, Kagra kegava hu so'e huzmante'snanke'za knare hu'za manigahaze. Ana'ma hananke'zama manine'za kase zamantesnaza mofavre nagapinti'ma efore'ma hu'za vnaza vahe'mo'za, kagrane magoka knare hu'za manigahaze.<verse eid="PSA 102:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 102"/>
  <chapter number="103" style="c" sid="PSA 103"/>
  <para style="s">Anumzamo'ma tavesima rante'nea zanku'ma Deviti'ma asunte'nea zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 103:1"/>Maka nagu'areti hu'na Ra Anumzamofona agi'a ahentesga nehu'na, nagu'areti hu'na ruotage'ma hu'nea agi'a ahentesga hugahue. <verse eid="PSA 103:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 103:2"/>Maka nagu'areti hu'na Ra Anumzamofona agi'a ahentesga nehu'na, knare avu'ava zama huno maka zampima nazama nehia zankura naganera okanigahue. <verse eid="PSA 103:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 103:3"/>Anumzamo'a maka kumini'a eri netreno, maka krini'a eri netreno, <verse eid="PSA 103:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 103:4"/>nagu'vazino navrege'na ofri'na mani'noe. Ana nehuno vagaore avesi zane asunku zanena, fetori'ma hiaza huno nanuntera ante'ne. <verse eid="PSA 103:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 103:5"/>Anumzamo'a knare'nare zantamina namige'na eri knare nehue. Ana nehu'na nazeri kasefa higena, tumpamo'ma hanave'ama eri kasefa'ma nehiaza hu'na hanavea erina manigahue. <verse eid="PSA 103:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 103:6"/>Ra Anumzamo'a fatgo avu'avaza huzmanteno, vahe'mo'zama knamazami'za zamazeri havizama nehaza vahera, maka mago avamenteke refko hunezmante. <verse eid="PSA 103:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 103:7"/>Korapara Ra Anumzamo'ma nazano tro hunaku'ma hiazana eri ama huno Mosesena asami'ne. Ana nehuno hankave eri'zama eneria zana zamaveri hige'za Israeli vahe'mo'za ke'naze. <verse eid="PSA 103:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 103:8"/>Ra Anumzamofona asunku zamo'a aviteno mareri'ne. Ana hu'neankino, avesi rante vava nehuno, ame huno arimpa ohe Ra Anumza mani'ne. <verse eid="PSA 103:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 103:9"/>Agra kea tasuvava nosuno, arimpa aherante vava huno ovu Anumza mani'ne. <verse eid="PSA 103:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 103:10"/>Tagrama kumi'ma hu'nona avamente knazana tamigaragi anara nosuno, tagri kefozamofo avamente ranknaza tamigaragi anara nosie. <verse eid="PSA 103:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 103:11"/>Anumzamofoma koro hunte'za agoragama nemaniza vahe'ma avesima nezamantea avesizamo'a, monamo'ma mopama agatereno ame'nagame'ma meaza huno Ra Anumzamofo avesi zamo'a ame'nagame mareri'ne. <verse eid="PSA 103:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 103:12"/>Zage hanati kazigatima zage fre kazigama evu'neana afete me'neankino, anahukna huno tagri kumira afete eri netre. <verse eid="PSA 103:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 103:13"/>Nefa'ma mofavre naga'ama asunku'ma hunezmanteaza huno, Ra Anumzamo'a Agri'ma koro'ma hunente'za agoragama nemaniza vahera asunkura hunezmante. <verse eid="PSA 103:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 103:14"/>Na'ankure Agrama mopama erino tagri'ma tro'ma hurante'neana, Agra ko tageno antahino hu'neankino, tagrikura kugusopa mani'naze huno nentahie. <verse eid="PSA 103:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 103:15"/>Tagra vahe'ma ama mopafima mani'nonana trazankna hu'nonankita za'zatera omanigahune. Ana hu'neankita tra'zamofo amosremo'ma osi'a knafi rutarenteaza nehune. <verse eid="PSA 103:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 103:16"/>Anama hutegeno zaho'mo ana amosrema eri hare'noma vigeno, zamage'ma nekanizaza nehune. <verse eid="PSA 103:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 103:17"/>Hianagi Ra Anumzamofonku koro'ma nehu'za Agri agoragama nemaniza vahera, knane knanena Anumzamofona vagaore avesi zamo'a zamagrane mevava nehie. Ana nehanigeno zamagripinti'ma fore'ma hanaza vahe'mokizmi mofavre nagate'enena fatgo avu'ava huzmanteno nevie. <verse eid="PSA 103:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 103:18"/>Anumzamofo kasegene tra ke'nema kegava huso'ema hu'nezama amage'ma nentaza vahera, e'inahu avu'ava'za hunezmante. <verse eid="PSA 103:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 103:19"/>Ra Anumzamo'a Agrama kinima manisania trara monafi retro hunte'ne. Ana hu'neankino anante mani'neno, makazana kegava nehie. <verse eid="PSA 103:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 103:20"/>Hankavenentake hu'naza ankeromota Ra Anumzamofo agi'a ahentesga hiho. Hankavenentake'ma hu'neta, nazano hihoma huno higeta Agri amage'ma nentamota, nazano hihoma huno hania zamofo ke'a amage anteho. <verse eid="PSA 103:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 103:21"/>Monafima ohampriga'a ankeroramima mani'netama agri avesi'zama amage'manentaza ankeromota, Ra Anumzamofona agi'a ahentesga hiho. <verse eid="PSA 103:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 103:22"/>Maka zama tro'ma hunte'neno Agrama kegavama hu'nea mopafima nemaniza zantamimota, Ra Anumzamofona agi'a ahentesga hiho. Ana nehinke'na nagranena maka nagu'areti hu'na Ra Anumzamofona agi'a ahentesga hugahue.<verse eid="PSA 103:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 103"/>
  <chapter number="104" style="c" sid="PSA 104"/>
  <para style="s">Ra Anumzamo'ma maka'zama tro'ma hu'nea zamofo zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 104:1"/>Nagra nagu'areti hu'na Ra Anumzamofona agi'a ahentesga hugahue. Ra Anumzana Anumzanimoka kagra rankrerfa hu'nane. Za'za kukenamo'ma hiaza huno masa zankamo'ene konaririkamo'enena kazerino vazinte'ne. <verse eid="PSA 104:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 104:2"/>Za'za kukenama hiaza hunka masa zanka'a eri hankre'nane. Ana nehunka monafima me'nea zantaminena, seli noma eri atama nereaza hunka, mona eri atarente'nane. <verse eid="PSA 104:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 104:3"/>Monafima me'nea hampompima tima marenevazimofo anaga kaziga, nonka'ama vazisga hania zafaramina retrure'nane. Hagi karisifima hiaza hunka hampompina maninka vano nehunka, zahopi maninka harenka vano nehane. <verse eid="PSA 104:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 104:4"/>Kagra zaho'mofonku hankeno nanekeka'a erino vano nehie. Ana nehigeno hagna hagna'ma huno nerea tevemo, Kagri eri'za vahera mani'ne. <verse eid="PSA 104:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 104:5"/>Kagra ama mopa tro hutenka tra'are antankeno me'neankino kazara osugahie. <verse eid="PSA 104:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 104:6"/>Tavravereti'ma hiaza hunka hagerinu mopa refi'netenka, agonaramina tinu refitankeno azeri nakari fenkateno onaga me'ne. <verse eid="PSA 104:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 104:7"/>Hianagi kagrama hage rimofonku'ma hankave kema hankeno'a, koro huno nevie. Kagrama monagemo'ma hiankna hunka kageru'ma nerankeno'a, tintamimo'a ame'ama huno nevie. <verse eid="PSA 104:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 104:8"/>Agonaramimo'za marerisga nehzageno, agupo mopamo'za uramiza e'ire mano hunka hunte'nampi me'naze. <verse eid="PSA 104:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 104:9"/>Ana nehunka hagerimofona, isa kana antetenankeno ana isa kana agatereno vuno mago'anena mopa refi'otegahie. <verse eid="PSA 104:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 104:10"/>Kampu'i tina tro huntankeno, tinkagomupina nevigeno, ne'onse tintamina huntankeno agonaramimofo amu'nompinena nevuno, <verse eid="PSA 104:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 104:11"/>maka afizaga gafamofona tina nezamige'za nenazageno, afi donki afu'tamimo'za tinku'ma nezmagege'za ana tina nazageno fru zame'nesie. <verse eid="PSA 104:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 104:12"/>Hare'zama vanoma nehaza namamo'za ana timofo ankenarega nona ki'za manine'za, ana timofo ankenaregama me'nea zafaramimofo azankunate manine'za zagamera nehaze. <verse eid="PSA 104:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 104:13"/>Kagra mona kumakafi onagamu mani'nenka, kora atrankeno eramino agona ramimpina runente. Ana nehunka kagraka'a kazanko avona antenka, maka zana tro hunka ama mopafina antankeno aviteno me'ne. <verse eid="PSA 104:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 104:14"/>Bulimakao afu'mo'zama nesaza trazana kagra hankeno hagenege'za vahe'mo'za ahe'za hoza nentaze. Ana hutazagenka kagra hankeno, mopafintira ne'zamo'a hageno marerino nenarga rentege'za vahe'mo'za e'nerize. <verse eid="PSA 104:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 104:15"/>Anazanke hunka kagra hankeno wainimo'a hageno marerige'za, eri'za waini tina tro hu'za nene'za antahi musena nehazagenka, olivi masavena zaminke'za eri'za zamugosafina frageno rumsa nehigenka, ne'zama nene'za hankavema eri'za manisaza zana bretia nezamine. <verse eid="PSA 104:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 104:16"/>Ra Anumzamofo zafamo'za tina nezamu nehazageno, Ra Anumzamo'ma Lebanoni mopafima sida zafaramima hankre'nea sida zafamo'za tina nezamu nehaze. <verse eid="PSA 104:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 104:17"/>Ana sida zafa ramimpina nama ramimo'za nona eme ki'za nemanize. Ana nehazage'za afi patomo'zanena (stork) saipresi zafa ramimpi nozamia eme negize. <verse eid="PSA 104:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 104:18"/>Za'za agona ramimpima nemaniza afi meme afutamimo'za vano vano hu'za nemanize. Ana nehazage'za vare'mo'za havemofo keko kampi fraki'za zamagu nevazize. <verse eid="PSA 104:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 104:19"/>Kagra ika tro hunka ante'nankeno me'neno, ruzahu ruzahu knagura hunerasamie. Ana nehigeno inankna fatgore zagemo'a ufregahie zagemo'a agra'a keno antahino hu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 104:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 104:20"/>Kagra hanina atrankeno hania eme negie. Ana hanke'za zafa tano'pafima nemaniza zagagafamo'za rerakaure'za vano nehaze. <verse eid="PSA 104:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 104:21"/>Kenagera kasefa laioni ramimo'za zagagafama ahe'za tragama hu'za nesagura rankrafage hu'za vano nehazagenka, Anumzamoka ne'zana zaminke'za nenaze. <verse eid="PSA 104:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 104:22"/>Hagi zagema ufrege'za ana laionimo'za ete vu'za nemaniza have kampi ome nemasaze. <verse eid="PSA 104:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 104:23"/>Ana'ma nehazage'za vahe'mo'za vu'za e'za hu'za eri'za zamia ome e'nerizageno vuno kinaga nese. <verse eid="PSA 104:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 104:24"/>Ra Anumzamoka, kagra agigu agigu zantami tro hu'nane. Kagra knare antahi'za ka'areti ana maka zantamina tro hu'nane. Ana hankeno Kagrama tro hu'nana zagagafamo'za ama mopafina mani avite'naze. <verse eid="PSA 104:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 104:25"/>Hagerimo'a rankrerfa huno uvu evu hu'negeta negone. Ana hu'neankino ana hagerimofo agu'afina agigu agigu zaga, osira rana huno ohampriga'a mani avite'naze. <verse eid="PSA 104:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 104:26"/>Ana hagerimofo agofetura venteramimo'za vano nehazage'za, Laviataniema hu'za nehaza afi zagama, tro'ma hu'nana zagamo ana hagerimpina tina freno vano nehuno zokagora nereno nemanie. <verse eid="PSA 104:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 104:27"/>Ana maka tro'ma huzmante'nana zagagafamo'za, kna fatgore'ma ne'zama zamisnanku kagriteke kete'za nemanize. <verse eid="PSA 104:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 104:28"/>Kagra ne'zana zaminke'za nenaze. Kagra kazana eri atarenka ne'zana zaminke'za nazageno zamura nehie. <verse eid="PSA 104:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 104:29"/>Hianagi Kagrama rukrahe'ma hunka kamefi'ma huzaminke'za, zamagra antri hu'za antahintahi hakare nehaze. Hagi Kagrama zamasimu'ma erinke'za, zamagra fri'za ete mopanesaze. <verse eid="PSA 104:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 104:30"/>Kagra kasimura huhu huvazi zamantanke'za, zamasimura eri'za kasefa hu'za mani'naze. Ana nehunka maka ama mopamofo agofetu'ma me'nea zantamina, ete eri kasefa hankeno me'ne. <verse eid="PSA 104:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 104:31"/>Ana hu'neankino Ra Anumzamofo hihamu masazamo'a mevava huno nevanigeno, maka zama tro'ma hu'nea zankura Ra Anumzamo'a muse hugahie. <verse eid="PSA 104:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 104:32"/>Ra Anumzamo'ma kefenkateno ama mopafima uruha'ma nehigeno'a, ama mopamo'a kazakaza nehigeno, Ra Anumzamo'ma agona ramima avako'ma nehigeno'a tevegu nehie. <verse eid="PSA 104:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 104:33"/>Nagrama ofri'ma mani'nesua kna'afina, Ra Anumzamofontega zagamera hugahue. Ana nehu'na zagame hu'na Anumzamofo agi'a ahentesga hunteme nevu'na ome frigahue. <verse eid="PSA 104:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 104:34"/>Nagrama Ra Anumzamofonku'ma antahintahima nehua zama Agrama keno antahino'ma hanuno'a muse hanie. Na'ankure nagra Ra Anumzamofonte mani'nena musenkasea nehue. <verse eid="PSA 104:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 104:35"/>Hagi kumi'ma nehaza vahe'mo'za ama mopamofo agofetutira fanene nehanageno, kefo avu'ava'ma nehaza vahe'mo'za fanane hu'za omanisaze. Maka nagu'areti hu'na Ra Anumzamofona husga hunente'na, Ra Anumzamofo agi'a ahentesga hugahue.<verse eid="PSA 104:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 104"/>
  <chapter number="105" style="c" sid="PSA 105"/>
  <para style="s">Anumzamo'ma ruzahu ruzahu eri'zama eri'nea zamofo zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 105:1"/>Ra Anumzamofona agi'a aheta susu hunenteta, ranra eri'zama eri'nea zankura maka ama mopafima mani'naza vahera huama huta zamasamisune. <verse eid="PSA 105:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 105:2"/>Anumzamofontega muse zagame huta susu huntesnune. Ana nehuta knare huno hentofa eri'zama eri'nea zankura vahera zamasamisune. <verse eid="PSA 105:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 105:3"/>Anumzamofo agimo'ma ruotage'ma hu'nea zankura husga huntesune. Hagi Ra Anumzamofoma mono'ma hunentaza vahe'mota muse hiho. <verse eid="PSA 105:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 105:4"/>Ra Anumzamofonku'ene agri hankave'agu'enena nehaketa, avugosafima kesunkura hake vava hanune. <verse eid="PSA 105:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 105:5"/>Agrama ruzahu ruzahu eri'zama eri'nea zanku'ene kaguvaza eri fore nehuno, keaga refko hugahue huno'ma hu'nea zankura taganera okanisune. <verse eid="PSA 105:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 105:6"/>Hagi Agri eri'za vahe Abrahamu mofavre naga'mota, agrama huhampri ramantegeta Jekopumpinti'ma fore'ma hu'naza vahe mani'naze. <verse eid="PSA 105:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 105:7"/>Ra Anumzamo'a agrake tagri Anumzana mani'ne. Ana hu'neankino, maka ama mopafi vahera refko hunezmante. <verse eid="PSA 105:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 105:8"/>Anumzamo'ma huhagerafi huvempagema hu'nea kegura maka zupa ageraokani antahi vava hugahie. Ana hu'neankino tauseni'a zupama fore hu anante anante'ma hu'za vanaza vahete'enena ana huvempa kemo'a mevava huno vugahie. <verse eid="PSA 105:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 105:9"/>Hagi ana huhagerafi huvempagea Abrahamu'ene hu'neankino, ana huvempagea Aisakinte eri hankaveti'ne. <verse eid="PSA 105:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 105:10"/>Anumzamo'a henka ana huvempama hu'neanke'a Jekopunte eriama nehuno, Israeli vahetera ana huvempa kemo'a mevava hugahie huno zamasami'ne. <verse eid="PSA 105:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 105:11"/>Tamagrama eriterema hanare Kenani mopa tamisanugeta erisanti haresnageno, ana mopamo'a tamagri mopa mevava hugahie huno Anumzamo'a hu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 105:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 105:12"/>Ama ana nanekema Anumzamo'ma hu'neana, Kenani vahe amu'nompina Israeli vahera kraga vahekna hu'za osi'a naga mani'nazageno anankea hu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 105:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 105:13"/>Israeli vahe'mo'za vahe mopafine, ru kinimo'zama kegavama hu'naza mopafi mani'za vano vano hu'naze. <verse eid="PSA 105:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 105:14"/>Hianagi Anumzamo'a zamatregeno mago'a vahe'mo'za zamazeri havizana osu'naze. Israeli vahetega Anumzamo'a anteno zamazeri haviza hunaku'ma nehaza kini vahera ha' kea huzamine. <verse eid="PSA 105:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 105:15"/>Anumzamo'a huno nagrama huhampri'noa vahera zamavakora osiho huno nehuno, nagri kasnampa vahera zamazeri havizana osiho huno hu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 105:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 105:16"/>Anage nehuno Kenani mopafina Anumzamo'a agatontoza atregeno ne-egeno, maka ne'zana eri fanane huvagare'ne. <verse eid="PSA 105:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 105:17"/>Ana'ma nehuno'a mago ne' huntegeno ugoteno Isipi mopafima vu'neana Josefekino, kazo kazo eri'za erisanie hu'za zagoreti mizase'za avre'za vu'naze. <verse eid="PSA 105:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 105:18"/>Ana hute'za seni nofiteti agafina anakizageno atagura nehige'za, ainireti rini tro hute'za anankempina rusi hu'naze. <verse eid="PSA 105:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 105:19"/>Ana huno manino nevigeno ava'nama ke'nea zamo'ma efore'ma hania knamo'a ehanati'ne. Ana higeno Ra Anumzamo'a Josefena reheno ke'ne. <verse eid="PSA 105:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 105:20"/>Hagi kini ne' Fero'a hige'za kinafintira Josefena katufente'naze. Vahete'ma kegavama hu'nea kini ne'mo hige'za kinafintira katu fentageno vu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 105:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 105:21"/>Ana hutazageno kini ne'mo'a Josefena huhampri antegeno rankva manino, maka noma'afima me'nea zantera kegava nehuno, maka fenoma ante'nea zante'enena kegava hu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 105:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 105:22"/>Ana hu'neankino agra amne kini ne'mofo eri'za vahera kina nompina zamavarenenteno, kini ne'mofoma antahintahima nemiza vahera rempi huzamigahie. <verse eid="PSA 105:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 105:23"/>Hagi henka Israeli naga'mo'za Isipi mopafina efre'naze. Ana hutazageno Jekopu'a Hamu vahe mopafi kraga vahe seno emani'ne. <verse eid="PSA 105:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 105:24"/>Anante Ra Anumzamo'a Agra'a Israeli vahera zamaza hige'za, rama'a mofavre kasezamante'naze. Ana hume nevu'za rama'a vahe ome forehu hakare hu'za ha' vahe'zamimofo hankavea zamagatere'naze. <verse eid="PSA 105:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 105:25"/>Anante Anumzamo'a Isipi vahe antahi'zana eri rukrahe hige'za, Agri'a nagara Israeli vahera ha' rezamante'naze. Ana nehu'za Ra Anumzamofo Agri'a eri'zama eneriza Israeli vahe'ma zamazeri haviza hanaza kanku hake'naze <verse eid="PSA 105:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 105:26"/>Hianagi Ra Anumzamo'a eri'za vahe'a Mosesene, Aronine huhampari zanantegeke vu'na'e. <verse eid="PSA 105:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 105:27"/>Ana higeke Hamu nagama Isipi mopafima nemaniza vahetera vuke, Ra Anumzamo'ma hu'nea kaguvazane, avamezanena ome eri fore hu'na'e. <verse eid="PSA 105:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 105:28"/>Ra Anumzamo'a higeno Isipi mopafina hanizamo eme refite'ne. Na'ankure Anumzamofo nanekea ontahi'za Israeli vahera zamatrazage'za ovu'naza zante anara hu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 105:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 105:29"/>Anumzamo'a maka tintamina eri rukrahe higeno, kora segeno ana timpima mani'naza nozameramimo'za fri vagare'naze. <verse eid="PSA 105:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 105:30"/>Anantera hoga'mo'za Isipi mopafina avitete'za, kini ne'mo'ma nemasefinena mani vite'naze. <verse eid="PSA 105:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 105:31"/>Ra Anumzamo'a kosine umpe umpe'ene huzmantege'za eri erintagu hu'za maka Isipi mopafina emani avite'naze. <verse eid="PSA 105:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 105:32"/>Ko'mopa ko huntegeno ko'ma riaza huno eneramigeno, kopsi'na atregeno ru trage huteno tevenefa huno maka Isipi mopafina vuno eno huvagare'ne. <verse eid="PSA 105:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 105:33"/>Isipi vahe'mokizmi waini hozane, fiki zafaraminena eri haviza nehuno, Isipi mopafima me'nea zafaramina rukrara karurupetre'ne. <verse eid="PSA 105:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 105:34"/>Ana nehuno tusinasi kenutami huzmantege'za rama'a hu'za ohampriga'a e'naze. <verse eid="PSA 105:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 105:35"/>Ana kenu'mo'za trazantamina vatri'za neza maka eri hana nehu'za, hozafi me'nea ne'zantamina ne'za maka eri vagare'naze. <verse eid="PSA 105:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 105:36"/>Ana nehuno Anumzamo'a Isipi mopafina ese'ma kasezmante'nea agonesa anentatamina miko zamahe vaganereno, maka vahe'mo'za zage mofavregu'ma musema nehu'za hankavetie hu'zama nehaza ne' mofavre nagara zamahe vagare'ne. <verse eid="PSA 105:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 105:37"/>Ra Anumzamo'ma vahe'a Israeli naga'ma zamavarege'za Isipiti'ma etirami'za e'naku'ma nehu'za, rama'a silvane golinena eri'ne'za e'naze. Magomo'e huno Israeli naga nofipintira tanafara osu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 105:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 105:38"/>Israeli vahe'mo'zama Isipi mopama atre'za azage'za, Isipi vahe'mo'za tusi muse hu'naze. Na'ankure ko'ma Israeli vahe koro'ma hu'naza zanku anara hu'naze. <verse eid="PSA 105:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 105:39"/>Anumzamo'a mago hampo antegeno Israeli vahera anteso hunezmantegeno, hanimpina tevenefanu remsahu zamante'ne. <verse eid="PSA 105:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 105:40"/>Israeli vahe'mo'zama ne'zanku'ma antahigazageno'a, hifa namazaga atregeno ege'za ahe'za nenazageno, monafinti mana ne'zana atregeno ege'za eri'za nazageno zamura hu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 105:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 105:41"/>Agra havea rutanegeno timo'a rumpasasa huno krohupeno eno, hagege kokampina ranti evu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 105:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 105:42"/>E'inama hu'neana Anumzamo'a eri'za vahe'a Abrahamuma ruotge huvempa kema hunte'nea kegu agesa nentahino anara hu'ne <verse eid="PSA 105:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 105:43"/>Hagi Anumzamo'ma nagri nagare'ma huno huhampari zamante'nea Israeli vahe'ma, Isipiti'ma zamavareno ne-ege'za, ranke hu'za kezati'za musenkasea nehu'za e'naze. <verse eid="PSA 105:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 105:44"/>Ana nehuno ru vahe'mokizmi mopa eri zami'ne. Ana hige'za ru vahe'mo'za maraguzati'za hankre'naza ne'za Israeli vahe'mo'za eri nafa'a hune'za vasage'za ne'naze. <verse eid="PSA 105:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 105:45"/>Ama ana maka zama fore'ma hu'neana, Israeli vahe'mo'za nege'za, Anumzamofo kasegene tra kenena amage antesagu huno anara hu'ne. Ra Anumzamofona agi'a ahentesga hanune.<verse eid="PSA 105:45"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 105"/>
  <chapter number="106" style="c" sid="PSA 106"/>
  <para style="s">Anumzamo'ma vahe'ama knare avu'ava'ma hunezmantea zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 106:1"/>Ra Anumzamofo agi'a ahentesga nehuta susu huntesune. Na'ankure agra knare hu'ne. Agrama avesi nerantea zamo'a vagaore mevava huno nevie. <verse eid="PSA 106:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 106:2"/>Ra Anumzamo'ma hankavenentake eri'zama eri'nea zankura, iza hamprino kegara hugahie? Ana hu'neankino mago vahe'mo'a agri agi'a husga huntegahianagi, Agrama antahi'nea avamentera osugahie. <verse eid="PSA 106:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 106:3"/>Iza'o maka zupama fatgo avu'ava zama nehuno, fatgo huno refkohu avu'ava zama nehia vahe'mo'a muse hugahie. <verse eid="PSA 106:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 106:4"/>Ra Anumzamoka vaheka'ama zamazeri knare'ma nehanunka, kagesa antahi nenaminka, erava'o hunka naza hunka nagu'vazio. <verse eid="PSA 106:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 106:5"/>Kagrama huhampri zamante'nana vahe kamo'zama so'e mani'zampima musema hu'za nemanisage'na, zamagrane musema hu'zanku nave'nesige'na kagri vahe'ene musena hanue hu'na nagesa nentahue. Kagrama erisantima hare'nana vaheka'ane natrege'na magoka mani'ne'na, Kagri kagi'a ahentesga ha'neno. <verse eid="PSA 106:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 106:6"/>Tagri tagehe'mo'zama hu'nazaza huta tagra kumi hu'none. Ana nehuta kumi hu hakare huta eri hakare hu'none. <verse eid="PSA 106:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 106:7"/>Tagehemo'zama Isipima mani'neza kagrama eri fore'ma hu'nana kaguva zankura musena osu'naze. Kagrama kavesi zamantenenkama so'e kavukva'ma huzmante'nana zankura zamaganekani'naze. Ana nehu'za Koranke hagerinte'ma ne-eza ha' regante'naze. <verse eid="PSA 106:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 106:8"/>Ana hu'neanagi Anumzamo'a Agri agimofo knare zankure huno zamaguravazi'ne. Ana nehuno Agra tusi hankave'a erinte ama hanige'za kesazegu anara hu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 106:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 106:9"/>Anumzamo'a hankave ke Koranke Hagerimofona huntegeno, hageri amu'nompina ka fore huno, hagage kokampima hu'neaza huno mopa fore higeno hagege hu'ne. Ana hutegeno hagege kokampima me'nea mopare'ma viaza huno, hagerimofo amu'nompina Israeli vahera zamavareno kantu kaziga vu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 106:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 106:10"/>E'ina huno Anumzamo'a ha'ma rezmante'naza vahe'mofo zamazampintira zamagu'nevazino, ha' vahe'zmimokizmi hankavefintira zamagu'vazino ete zamavare'ne. <verse eid="PSA 106:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 106:11"/>Hianagi zamagri ha' vahera, hagerimo ete eme ruhamprino refitege'za fri vagarageno, anampintira magore huno kuzafara omani fri vagare'naze. <verse eid="PSA 106:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 106:12"/>Ana'ma hige'za Anumzamofo vahe'mo'za agrama huvempama hu'nea kegura zamentinti nehu'za, zagame hu'za agri agi ahentesga hu'naze. <verse eid="PSA 106:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 106:13"/>Hianagi Ra Anumzamo'ma erifore'ma hu'nea zankura, ame hu'za zamagekani'naze. Ana hige'za Anumzamofo antahintahigura avega onte'za nazano hunaku'ma haza zana, amne tro hu'naze. <verse eid="PSA 106:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 106:14"/>Hagege kokampima e'nazana ne'zama ne'zankura tusiza huno zamavesi zamavesi hu'ne. Ana nehige'za vahe omani ka'ma kokampina Anumzamofona rehe'za ke'naze. <verse eid="PSA 106:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 106:15"/>E'ina hazageno Anumzamofoma antahigaza zana amne zami'ne. Hianagi havizantfa hu'nea kri atregeno eme zamazeri haviza hu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 106:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 106:16"/>Seli nonkuma'ma eme ante'za mani'nafintira, mago'a oti'za Ra Anumzamo'ma huhampri zananteno zanazeri ruotagema hu'nea pristi eri'za netre Mosese'ene Aronikema e'neri'a eri'zankura kanive reznante'naze. <verse eid="PSA 106:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 106:17"/>Ana'ma hazageno'a mopamo'a ruaka huno Datanina asgahu nenakrino, anampina Abiramune mago'a naga'enena zamazeri nakrifenka atreno refite'ne. <verse eid="PSA 106:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 106:18"/>Ana naga'mokizmi kema antahi'za amage'ma nente'za vahe'mo'za havi avu'ava'ma hu'naza vahera, tevemo eramino eme te fanane hu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 106:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 106:19"/>Horepi agonafima ete'za golireti kre maramra hu'za, bulimakao anenta'mofo amema'a tro huntete'za, ana zamofo avuga kepri hu'za monora hunte'naze. <verse eid="PSA 106:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 106:20"/>Hihamu masa'ane Anumzana amne zama hiaza hu'za, tra'zama nenea zaga ve bulimakaomofo amema'are atre'naze. <verse eid="PSA 106:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 106:21"/>Isipi mopafima zamagu vazinaku'ma hankave kaguvazama erifore'ma nehuno, zamavareno etiramino'ma e'nea Anumzana, zamage kaninte'naze. <verse eid="PSA 106:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 106:22"/>Anumzamo'ma e'inahu hankave eri'zama Hamu mopafi erifore nehuno, ruzahu kaguvazama koranke hagerinte'ma erifore hige'zama ke'naza zankura zamagesa ontahi'naze. <verse eid="PSA 106:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 106:23"/>E'ina'ma hu'nazagu huno Anumzamo'a zamazeri haviza hugahue huno huama hu'ne. Hianagi Agrama huhamprinte'nea ne' Mosese'a Anumzamofone veamokizmi amu'nompi oti'neno antahigeno, krimpa ahe'zana atregeno uramino huno meme higeno, Anumzamo'a zamazeri havizana osu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 106:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 106:24"/>Hagi zamagra knare mopafima ufre zankura zamavesra hu'ne. Na'ankure Anumzamofo kegura zamagra zamentintia osu'nazagu anara hu'naze. <verse eid="PSA 106:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 106:25"/>Zamagra seli nozamifi mani'neza sumisumi hu'za kehakare nehu'za, Ra Anumzamofo nanekea amage onte'naze. <verse eid="PSA 106:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 106:26"/>Ana'ma hazagu huno Anumzamo'a aza erisga nehuno vahe omani ka'ma kokampi zamatre'nuge'za frigahaze huno huvempa kea hu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 106:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 106:27"/>Ana nehu'na zamagripinti'ma efore'ma hanaza vahera, zamazeri panani hanuge'za ru vahe moparega umani emani hu'ne'za anantega frigahaze hu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 106:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 106:28"/>Hagi henka Israeli vahe'mo'za Peori kumatera Bali havi anumzana mono hunente'za, fri vahete'ma ofama nehaza ne'zanena ne'naze. <verse eid="PSA 106:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 106:29"/>E'inahu havi avu'ava zama haza zamo Ra Anumzamofona azeri rimpa hazageno rankri atregeno eno, eme zamazeri haviza hu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 106:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 106:30"/>Hianagi Finiasi'a otino kumi'ma hu'naza vahera zamahe hana higeno, ana krimo'a vagare'ne. <verse eid="PSA 106:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 106:31"/>Ana hu'neankino ananteti'ma agafa hu'za mani'za vanaza vahe'mo'zane, henkama forehu anante nante'ma hu'za vanaza vahe'mo'za, Finiasi'a fatgo avu'ava'za hu'ne hu'za maka zupa antahimi'za vugahaze. <verse eid="PSA 106:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 106:32"/>Israeli vahe'mo'za Meriba mopafima me'nea tintaminte'ma mani'neza Ra Anumzamofona azeri rimpa ahazageno, ana'ma hazazamofo knazana Mosese agofetu erintegeno eri'ne. <verse eid="PSA 106:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 106:33"/>E'ina hu'za Mosesena azeri rimpa ahazageno, osuga naneke Mosese'a hu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 106:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 106:34"/>Anama emani'naza mopafima mani'naza vahera, Ra Anumzamo'a zamahe hana hiho huno Israeli vahera huzmante'neanagi, ana nanekea amagera ante'za zamahe hanara osu'naze. <verse eid="PSA 106:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 106:35"/>Hianagi Israeli vahe'mo'za ana mopafima nemaniza vahe'ene ruhava hu'za nemani'za, ana vahe'mokizmi kefo avu'ava zana amage ante'za hu'naze. <verse eid="PSA 106:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 106:36"/>Ana nehu'za havi anumzamofo monora hunte'naze. Ana'ma haza zamo'a krifugna huno zamazeri haviza hu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 106:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 106:37"/>Ana nehu'za ne'mofa zamia zamahe'za havi anumzante kresramna vu'naze. <verse eid="PSA 106:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 106:38"/>Hazenkezmi omane'nea ne'mofa zamia zamahe'za, korazmia eri neragi'za, Kenani vahe'mokizmi havi anumzantaminte zamahe'za Kresramanama vu'naza korazmimo mopa eri hi'nimna vu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 106:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 106:39"/>E'inahu kefo avu'ava'ma hazazamo higeza Anumzamofo avurera agrua nosu'za, havi anumzama avesima antaza zamo'a Ra Anumzamofo avurera, vere a'mo'ma neve'enema mani fatgo osuno, atreno mago venema monko avu'ava zama hiaza hu'naze. <verse eid="PSA 106:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 106:40"/>E'ina hu'negu Ra Anumzamo'a vahe'agura tusi arimpa ahenezmanteno, nagri vahere huno'ma erisanti'ma hare'nea vahera agotezmanteno avesra huzmante'ne. <verse eid="PSA 106:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 106:41"/>Ana huteno ru mopafi vahe'ma zamavesrama hunezmantaza vahe'mokizmi zamazampi zamavarentege'za, ana vahe'mo'za kegava huzmante'naze. <verse eid="PSA 106:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 106:42"/>Ana nehu'za ha' vahe'zamimo'za knazana zamiza zamazeri haviza nehazage'za, zamagri hankavefi mani'naze. <verse eid="PSA 106:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 106:43"/>Rama'a zupa Anumzamo'a zamagu vazi'neanagi, kema antahi avu'ava zana zamagripina omane'negu huno, zamagri kumimo zamazeri haviza hu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 106:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 106:44"/>Hianagi knafima mani'neza zamazama hanigu Ra Anumzamofontega zavi krafa hu'za nunamuma hazageno'a, nunamuzamia antahino asunku huzmante'ne. <verse eid="PSA 106:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 106:45"/>Anumzamo'a zamagrikure huno huvempama huzmante'nea nanekegu agesa antahi'ne. Na'ankure vaga ore mevava avesi zama'agu agesa nentahino, antahintahi'a rukrahe hu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 106:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="PSA 106:46"/>Israeli vahe'ma zamavare'za ome kina huzmante'naza vahera, Anumzamo'a zamarimpa eri rukrahe hige'za Israeli vahera zamasunku huzmante'naze. <verse eid="PSA 106:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="PSA 106:47"/>Taguvazio, Ra Anumzana tagri Anumzamoka ru vahe moparegama umani emanima hu'nontegati tavre atru huo. Ana'ma hananketa ruotage'ma hu'nea kagia neheta hu muse huneganteta, musenkase huta kagi'a ahentesga hugahune. <verse eid="PSA 106:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="PSA 106:48"/>Ra Anumzana Israeli vahe Anumzamofona agi'a ahentesga hanune. Maka zupa knane knanena agra manino nevia Anumza mani'ne. Maka vahe'mota tamage huta nehuta, Ra Anumzamofona agi'a ahentesga hanune.<verse eid="PSA 106:48"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 106"/>
  <chapter number="107" style="c" sid="PSA 107"/>
  <para style="s">Nampa 5 zagame avontafere</para>
  <para style="s">Anumzamofo knare avu'avazanku muse hu zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 107:1"/>Ra Anumzamofona susu huntesnune. Na'ankure agra knare avu'ava hu'neranteankino, avesimaranteno knare'ma hunerantea avu'avazamo'a mevava huno vugahie. <verse eid="PSA 107:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 107:2"/>Ra Anumzamo'ma ha' vahe zamazampinti'ma tamagu'vazino tamavre'nenia vahe'mota, ranke huta Ra Anumzamo ha' vahe'mofo zamazampinti tagu'vazino tavre'ne huta huama huta vahera zamasamiho. <verse eid="PSA 107:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 107:3"/>Na'ankure zage hanati kazigane, zage fre kazigane, noti kazigane, sauti kaziganema ru vahe moparegama umani emanima huta kinama huta mani'nazaregatira, agra ete zamavare atru hu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 107:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 107:4"/>Mago'amo'za vahe omani ka'ma kokampi vano vano nehu'za, manisnaza rankumaku hake'nazanagi onke'naze. <verse eid="PSA 107:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 107:5"/>Ne'zankura zamaganetege'za tinku'enena hagage nehu'za fri'za hu'naze. <verse eid="PSA 107:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 107:6"/>Ana kna zampima manine'za, Ra Anumzamofontega zavi krafa hazageno, ana kna zampintira zamagu'vazino ete zamavare'ne. <verse eid="PSA 107:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 107:7"/>Agra knare huno zamavare fatgo huno umanisaza rankumate zamavareno vu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 107:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 107:8"/>Zamatrenke'za Ra Anumzamofona vagaore mevava avesi zama'agura susu hunente'za, knare avu'ava'ma huzmante'nea zanku'enena humuse hunteho. <verse eid="PSA 107:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 107:9"/>Tinku'ma avesiaza huno maka zanku'ma ave'nesia vaheran eri knare hunente. Ne'zanku'ma hiaza huno maka zanku'ma aga'ma netea vahera, knare zantaminu agu'afina antevinete. <verse eid="PSA 107:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 107:10"/>Mago'a nagara tusi haninkino antrako hu'nefi, seni nofiteti kina huzmantage'za zamatagu nehu'za mani'naze. <verse eid="PSA 107:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 107:11"/>Na'ankure Ra Anumzamofo nanekea ha'arente'za zamefi hunemiza Marerisa Anumzamo'ma hihoma huno huzmantea nanekea amagera onte'nazagu anara hu'naze. <verse eid="PSA 107:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 107:12"/>E'ina agafare Anumzamo'a zamazeri anteramisige'za akohe'za manisazegu, zamatrege'za tusi maraguzati'za knanentake eri'zana eri'naze. Ana nehu'za traka hu'nazanagi, mago vahe'mo'e hunora zamaza osu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 107:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 107:13"/>Ana knaza zamifima zamagrama mani'ne'za, Ra Anumzamofontega zavi krafa hazageno, ana knazampintira zamaza huno zamagu'vazi'ne. <verse eid="PSA 107:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 107:14"/>Tusi hani zampinti'ene fri'zamofo turunapima mani'nazafintira Anumzamo'a zamavare atineramino, seni nofimo'ma kinama rezmante'nea zana katufezmante'ne. <verse eid="PSA 107:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 107:15"/>Ana'ma hanige'za zamatrenke'za Ra Anumzamofona vagaore mevava avesi zama'agura susu hunente'za, knare huno hentofa avu'ava'ma huzmante'nea zanku'enena susu hunteho. <verse eid="PSA 107:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 107:16"/>Bronsireti'ma tro hu'naza kahana rurapage huno rufuzafupenetreno, kafama erigi'za rentrako nehaza ainia rufutagi atre'ne. <verse eid="PSA 107:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 107:17"/>Zamagrama agri ke'ama ontahi avu'ava'ma hazazamo'a, negi vahe'mofo avu'ava'za tro nehu'za, kumi'ma haza nona'a knafina ufre'za zamatazana eri'naze. <verse eid="PSA 107:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 107:18"/>Ne'zama ne'zankura zamavesra nehu'za, fri'zamofo kahantera erava'o nehaze. <verse eid="PSA 107:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 107:19"/>Ana knazamo'ma zamazeri haviza hige'zama manine'za, Ra Anumzamofontega zavi krafa hazageno, ana hazenkefintira zamagu'vazino zamavare atirami'ne. <verse eid="PSA 107:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 107:20"/>Anumzamo'a naneke'a huntegeno eno zamazeri neganamreno, frinaku'ma nehazafintira eme zamagu'vazi'ne. <verse eid="PSA 107:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 107:21"/>Ana hu'negu zamagra Ra Anumzamofona vagaore mevava avesi zama'agu'ene, knare avu'ava'ma huzmante'nea zanku'enena susu huntegahaze. <verse eid="PSA 107:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 107:22"/>Ana nehu'za muse ofa Anumzamofontega Kresramana nevu'za, knare avu'ava'ma hu'nea zankura zagame hu'za musenkase nehu'za huama hiho. <verse eid="PSA 107:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 107:23"/>Mago'amo'za ventefi mani'za hagerimofo agofetu vu'za e'za hu'za ru moparega fenozana eri'za zagore ometre emetre nehaze. <verse eid="PSA 107:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 107:24"/>Ana vahe'mo'za zamagranena Ra Anumzamo'ma hankave eri'zama eri'nea zana ke'za antahi'za nehu'za, knare zantfama hu'nea zantamima hagerimofo agu'afima tro'ma hunte'nea zanena ke'naze. <verse eid="PSA 107:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 107:25"/>Anumzamo'a hankave zaho huntegeno eno hagerina eme vazi'zoregeno, hagerimo'a kranto kranto nehie. <verse eid="PSA 107:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 107:26"/>Ana nehuno anama mani'naza ventea erisga huno ame'nagame monafi mareriteno, atregeno hagerimpina amefenkame uneramie. Ana'ma higeno'a ventefima vanoma nehaza vahe'mo'za koro hu'za tusi zamagogogu nehaze. <verse eid="PSA 107:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 107:27"/>Ana nehu'za ventefima vanoma nehaza vahe'mo'za aka tima ne'nea vahe'mo'ma neginagi nehuno, traka huno umse emase hiaza nehu'za, ventema agu'vazi antahi'zazmimo'a vagare'ne. <verse eid="PSA 107:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 107:28"/>Ana knazamo'ma zamazeri havizama nehige'za, Ra Anumzamofontega kezati'zageno, ana knaza ramimpintira zamagu'vazino zamavare'ne. <verse eid="PSA 107:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 107:29"/>Anumzamo'a hagerimofona akohenka manio huno magoke zupa higeno, hagerimo'ma kranto kranto'ma nehia agasasamo'a urami avazage'ne. <verse eid="PSA 107:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 107:30"/>Hagerimo'ma ome avamazagegeno'a ventefima vano nehaza vahe'mo'zama nege'za tusi muse nehazageno, vunaku'ma haza kumate'ma me'nea tinkenarega zamavare so'e huno zamagu'ma vazisaza kumatega vu'ne <verse eid="PSA 107:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 107:31"/>E'ina hu'negu Ra Anumzamofona vagaore avesi zama'agura susu hunente'za, knare avu'ava'ma huzmante'nea zanku'enena susu huntegahaze. <verse eid="PSA 107:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 107:32"/>Anumzamofo vahe'ma atruma hanafina Agri agi'a ahentesga nehu'za, kva vahe'ma atruma hanafinena husga huntegahaze. <verse eid="PSA 107:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 107:33"/>Tirama ne-ea tintamina Anumzamo'a eriranegeno hagege mopa fore nehigeno, tima nehanatia kampuitamina eri ranegeno mopamo'a hagege hu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 107:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 107:34"/>Ana nehuno masave nentake'ma hu'nea mopafina, higeno hagemo'a aviteno mopa eri haviza hu'ne. Na'ankure ana mopafima nemaniza vahe'mo'zama havi avu'avazama hu'naza zanku huno anara hu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 107:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 107:35"/>Hianagi hagege kokampina Anumzamo'a higeno tirura mare'nevazigeno, ka'ma kokampina higeno tintamimo'a rama'a eforera huno ne-e. <verse eid="PSA 107:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 107:36"/>Ana'ma huteno'a ne'zanku'ma zamaga'ma netea vahera zamavareno ana mopafina vige'za umanine'za, nona ki'za ranra kumatmina erifore hu'za mani'naze. <verse eid="PSA 107:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 107:37"/>Ana mopafina hoza ome eri'za nente'za, waini hozanena antazageno raga rentege'za rama'a tagi'naze. <verse eid="PSA 107:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 107:38"/>Anumzamo'a vahe'a asomu huzmantege'za rama'a mofavre kasezamante'za eri hakare nehazageno, bulimakao afu'mo'zanena rama'a forehu hakare hu'za vu'naze. <verse eid="PSA 107:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 107:39"/>Hagi zamagra rama'a vahe'ma mani'nazaretira ome osi osi hume vu'za osi'a vahe mani'nazagu ha' vahe zamimo'za hara eme huzmagatere'za zamazeri zamagaze nehu'za, zamata nezami'za tusi knaza zamizage'za zamasunku zampi mani'naze. <verse eid="PSA 107:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 107:40"/>Ra Anumzamofo vahe'ma ha'ma eme huzmantaza vahe'mokizmi kva vahetera, Anumzamo'a arimpa ahe'zana erikaha hutrege'za, ka'ma kokampina kanku hazagre'za vano vano nehaze. <verse eid="PSA 107:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 107:41"/>Hianagi zamunte omane vahe'mo'zama knafima mani'nazageno'a, Anumzamo'a zamaza huno zamavare netreno, sipisipi afu'mo'zama nehazaza huno zamazeri hakare hige'za, rama'a mofavre zamante'za eri hakare nehaze. <verse eid="PSA 107:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 107:42"/>Fatgo avu'ava'zama nehaza vahe'mo'za ana zama nege'za muse nehanage'za, kefo avu'avazama nehaza vahe'mo'za kea osu zamagira hamunki'za mani'naze. <verse eid="PSA 107:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 107:43"/>Hagi iza'o knare antahi'zama me'nesia vahe'mo'a ama ana zankura agesa anteno nentahino, Ra Anumzamofo vagaore mevava avesi zama'a keno antahino hugahie.<verse eid="PSA 107:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 107"/>
  <chapter number="108" style="c" sid="PSA 108"/>
  <para style="s">Amentintifima oti hankavetino mani'zanku Deviti asunte'nea zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 108:1"/>Anumzamoka nagu'areti hu'na kagritera namentintia nehue. Ana nehuanki'na maka nagu'areti hu'na zagamera nehu'na, kagri kagia ahentesga hugahue. <verse eid="PSA 108:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 108:2"/>Nanterama zahufa masama osu'nesige'na oti'na laeliema nehaza zavenane, hapu'ema nehaza zavenanena nehe'na masama hu'zana azeri otisugeno masa hugahie. <verse eid="PSA 108:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 108:3"/>Maka ama mopafima mani'naza vahe'mokizmi zamavufi, Ra Anumzamoka susu hugantegahue. Ana nehu'na kokankokama nemaniza vahe'mokizmi zamavufi kagi'a ahentesga hu'na zagamera hugahue. <verse eid="PSA 108:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 108:4"/>Na'ankure vagaore mevava kavesi zamo'a mona agatereno ame'nagame mareri'ne. Ana nehigeno so'e kavukva'ma hurante vavama hunka neana zamo'a onagamu hampompi mareri'ne. <verse eid="PSA 108:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 108:5"/>Anumzamoka kagri kagia ahentesga hanunkeno monafi marenerisigeno, kagri hihamu masazankamo'a maka ama mopafina vuno eno hanige'za vahe'mo'za antahiza ke'za hanaze. <verse eid="PSA 108:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 108:6"/>Hanki menina kagrama kavesinerantana vaheka'a tagu'vazinka ete tavaro. Nunamuni'a antahi nenaminka kagra hankave ka'areti nagu'vazio. <verse eid="PSA 108:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 108:7"/>Anumzamo'a ruotage'ma hu'nea mono noma'afi mani'neno amanage huno huvempa hu'ne. Nagra hara ko hugatere'noanki'na, muse hu'na Sekemu mopane Sukoti agupo mopa refko hugahue. <verse eid="PSA 108:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 108:8"/>Giliati mopane Manase mopamokea nagri mopa menakeno, Efraemi mopamo'a bronsi fetori nanunte nentanuankna huno megeno, Juda mopamo'a kini vahe'mo'ma azampima e'neria azotani'agna hu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 108:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 108:9"/>Hagi Moapu mopamo'a tifre zuompa ni'agna hu'neankino, henka nagri eri'za vahe nemanisige'na, Idomu mopafi nagia nona zafi atregahue. Ana nehu'na Filistia vahera hara huzmagatenere'na, kezati'na musena hugahue. <verse eid="PSA 108:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 108:10"/>Iza navareno hankave vihu keginama hugagi'naza rankumapina ufregahie? Iza navareno Idomu mopafina vugahie? <verse eid="PSA 108:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 108:11"/>Anumzamoka kagra ko kamefi hurami'nampi? Anumzamoka tagri sondia vahera zamaza osugahampi? <verse eid="PSA 108:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 108:12"/>Anumzamoka taza hugeta ha' vahetia hara huzmagateramneno. Na'ankure vahe'mo'ma tazama hu'zamo'a, amne zankna hugahie. <verse eid="PSA 108:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 108:13"/>Anumzamo'a taza hanigeta hara huzmageteregahune. Na'ankure ha' vahetia agiareti zamare hapatigahie.<verse eid="PSA 108:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 108"/>
  <chapter number="109" style="c" sid="PSA 109"/>
  <para style="s">Knazampima mani'nea vahe'mofo zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 109:1"/>Anumzana kagri kagima ahentesgama nehua Anumza mani'nananki, kagasasana eri taganenka omanio. <verse eid="PSA 109:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 109:2"/>Na'ankure kefo avu'ava'zama nehu'za krunagema nehaza vahe'mo'za, zamagira reaka hu'za nazeri haviza hu nanekea nehu'za, havige hunante'za vano nehaze. <verse eid="PSA 109:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 109:3"/>Maka kazigatira huhaviza hunenantaza kemo nazeri kanegigeno, mago agafa'a omane'nea zante zamagra nenahaze. <verse eid="PSA 109:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 109:4"/>Nagra navesi nezmante'na, nunamu huzmante noanagi, zamagra rukrahe hu'za osu'noa zanku havi naneke hunante'naze. <verse eid="PSA 109:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 109:5"/>Knare avu'ava zama huzmantoa zantera, nona hu'za havi avu'ava hunante'naze. Ana nehu'za nagra navesi zmantoanagi, nagrira navesi onante'za zamavesra hunante'naze.<verse eid="PSA 109:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 109:6"/>Kefo avu'ava'ma nehia vahe huntegeno ha'ma renenantea vahera keaga hunteno, Agri ha' vahe huntegeno keaga hunteno. <verse eid="PSA 109:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 109:7"/>Hagi keaga'ama refko hania ne'mo'ma naneke'ama nentahino'a, hago hazenke hu'ne huno hugahie. Ana nehuno ana ne'mo'ma nunamuma huno e'neana, ana nunamumo'a kumizase'ne. <verse eid="PSA 109:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 109:8"/>Atregeno ana ne'mo'a ame huno nefrisigeno, mago vahe'mo agri nona eri'noe. <verse eid="PSA 109:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 109:9"/>Agri mofavre naga'mo'za megusa nemanisageno, nenaro'a kento a' manisanie. <verse eid="PSA 109:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 109:10"/>Ana ne'mofo mofavre naga'mo'za vano vano nehu'za, vahe zante meme hu'za vano nehu'za, havizama hu'nea nozamia atre'za afete hake'za vano hiho. <verse eid="PSA 109:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 109:11"/>Hagi ana ne'mo'ma mago vahe'mofo zama nofi'ma hu'neno omi'nesia zantera, anazamofo nafa'amo'a eme ana ne'mofo fenozana eri vagaregahie. Ana nehanige'za ru kumate vahe'mo'za e'za, amuhoma huno eri atruma hu'nea feno zama'a maka eri'za vugahaze. <verse eid="PSA 109:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 109:12"/>Mago vahe'mo'a ana ne'mofonkura asunkura hunteno knare avu'avara huonteno. Ana nehina ana ne'mofo megusa mofavre nagara zamasunkura huozmantegahaze! <verse eid="PSA 109:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 109:13"/>Ana nehanigeno agripinti'ma fore'ma hanaza mofavre nagara ana maka fri vagaresage'za, henkama fore'ma hanaza vahe'mo'za ana vahera antahi ozamigahaze. <verse eid="PSA 109:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 109:14"/>Ana ne'mofo agehemo'zama hu'naza kumira Ra Anumzamo'a aganera okanisie. Ana nehuno ana ne'mofo nerera'ma hu'nesia kumira avontafepintira eri otresie. <verse eid="PSA 109:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 109:15"/>Ra Anumzamo'a maka zupa ana vahe'mokizmi kumikura agesa antahi vava nehanige'za, ana ne'mofona vahe'mo'za mago'ene zamagesa antahi omigahaze. <verse eid="PSA 109:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 109:16"/>Na'ankure ana ne'mo'a vahe'ma so'e avu'ava'ma huzmante zankura avesra nehuno, zamunte omane vahe'ene ke'onke zanku atupama nehaza vahera zamazeri haviza nehie. Ana nehuno zamarimpa zamatafima mani'naza vahera zamahe fri'ne. <verse eid="PSA 109:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 109:17"/>Ana ne'mo'a sifana kema vahe'ma huzmanteno zamazeri haviza hu zankura muse nehie. Ana hu'neanki menina agri sifna kemo sifna hunteno azeri haviza hanie. Ana ne'mo'a vahera zamazeri so'ea nosia neki, ana nera azeri so'ea osanie. <verse eid="PSA 109:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 109:18"/>Agrama vahe'ma sifna kema huzmantea zamo'a, avate'ma za'za kukenama eri antaniaza nehuno, tima negeno avufgafi ufreaza nehigeno, masavemo'ma zaferinafima ufreaza hu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 109:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 109:19"/>Hagi vahe'ma sifnama huzmante'nea zamo'a ete rukrahe huno agrite eno, kukenama antaniaza huno avufgare nemesigeno, maka zupama amu nofi'ma regeno afafafima meaza hino. <verse eid="PSA 109:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 109:20"/>E'inahu knazana Ra Anumzamo'a atresigeno eno, nagri'ma nazeri haviza hu kema nehaza vahera eme zamazeri haviza hanie. <verse eid="PSA 109:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 109:21"/>Hianagi Ra Anumzana nagri Anumzamoka, kagraka'a kagigu nentahinka, enka eme naza huo. Na'ankure kavesi zankamo'a knare zantfa hu'neanki, nagu'vazinka ete navro. <verse eid="PSA 109:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 109:22"/>Nagrira namunte omanege'na, maka zankura atupa hu'na mani'nogeno, tumo'nimo'a fakifaki nehuno nata negrie. <verse eid="PSA 109:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 109:23"/>Kinaga fre zagemo rentegeno namemo ome atupa hiaza hu'na, ome vagare'za nehu'na, ra kenu'mo atafari ramiaza nehue. <verse eid="PSA 109:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 109:24"/>Nagra ne'zama a'o hu'na manua zamo higeno narenafina hanave'a nomanegeno, navufgamo'a tari'vazino zaferinare ome akamare'ne. <verse eid="PSA 109:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 109:25"/>Vahe'mo'zama nagri'ma nenage'za tusi kizazokago ke hunenante'za, zamasenia rugenka hu'naze. <verse eid="PSA 109:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 109:26"/>Ra Anumzana nagri Anumza mani'nananki naza hunka, vagaore mevava kavesi zanteti nagu'vazio. <verse eid="PSA 109:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 109:27"/>Ama ana zama nehana zankura, Ra Anumzamo Agra'a azanuti agura nevazie hu'za ke'za antahi'za hiho. <verse eid="PSA 109:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 109:28"/>Zamagra nagrira kazusi hunantegahaze. Hianagi kagra asomu hunantegahane. Nagrira nazeri haviza hugahaze. Hianagi zamagrira zamazeri haviza hananke'za zamagazegu hugahaze. Hianagi kagri eri'za vahe'mo'a musenkase hugahie. <verse eid="PSA 109:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 109:29"/>Nagri'ma havigema hunante'naza vahe'mo'za zmagazezamo'a refitezmantegahie. Ana nehanageno za'za kukenamo'ma rufiteaza huno zamagazemo'a refitezmantegahie. <verse eid="PSA 109:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 109:30"/>Ra Anumzamofona tusiza hu'na susu hunente'na, vahe'ma atruma hanaza amu'nompima mani'nena, agri agi'a ahentesga hugahue. <verse eid="PSA 109:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 109:31"/>Na'ankure Agra maka zanku'ma atupa'ma nehaza vahe kaziga mani'neno, vahe'mo'zama zamazeri havizama nehu'za zamahe frinaku'ma nehazageno'a Agra zamaza nehie.<verse eid="PSA 109:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 109"/>
  <chapter number="110" style="c" sid="PSA 110"/>
  <para style="s">Anumzamo'ma huvempama hu'nea kini nemofo zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 110:1"/>Ra Anumzamo'a Ranimofonkura amanage huno asami'ne, nazantmaga kaziga mani'nege'na, ha' vaheka'a zamazeri atresanuge'za kagiafinka mase'nagenka zamagofetu kagia renka otigahane!<verse eid="PSA 110:1"/></para>
  <para style="s">(Matiu 22:44, Aposolo 2:34, 1 Korinti 15:25, Hibru 1:1-13)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 110:2"/>Ra Anumzamo'a kazeri antesga hanigenka Jerusalemi rankumate kva mani'nenka, mago'a kuma'enena kegava nehunka, ha vaheka'anena kegava huzmantegahane. <verse eid="PSA 110:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 110:3"/>Hagi kagrama hate'ma vunaku'ma hananke'za, kagri vahe'mo'za amne zamagra'a oti'za kagrane vanageta ha' vahe'enena hara ome hugahaze. Ruotage'ma hu'nea agonafima kenage ata komo'ma, trazante runtegeno kasefa hankavema ete eriaza hunka, maka zupa hankaveka'amo'a kasefa hugahie. (Hibru 5:6, 6:20, 7:17-21.)<verse eid="PSA 110:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 110:4"/>Ra Anumzamo'a huvempa hu'neankino naneke'a amage antegahie. Melkizedeki'ma hu'neaza hunka Kagra pristi vahe fore hugahane. E'ina hu'neankinka pristia manivava hunka vugahane. <verse eid="PSA 110:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 110:5"/>Ra Anumzamo'a kazantamaga kaziga mani'neankino, arimpahe zamo'ma efore hania knazupa, kini vahera rama'a zamaheno rehapatitregahie. <verse eid="PSA 110:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 110:6"/>Ama mopafima mani'naza vahera, zamagrama hu'naza zamavu'zmava zantera Anumzamo'a keaga hunezmanteno, zamatresnige'za hapinti rama'a vahera zamahe'za eri kevu hanageno hihi huno marerigahie. Ana nehuno maka ama mopafima mani'naza kini vahetamina zamaheno rutragatrago hutregahie. <verse eid="PSA 110:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 110:7"/>Hianagi agra karanka nevuno, kantegama me'nea osi tina neneno hankavea erigahiankino hara hu agatereno asenia antesga hugahie.<verse eid="PSA 110:7"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 110"/>
  <chapter number="111" style="c" sid="PSA 111"/>
  <para style="s">Ra Anumzamofoma agi'ama ahentesgama hu zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 111:1"/>Ra Anumzamofona agi'a ahentesga hanune. Fatgo avu'ava'ma nehaza naga'ma atruma hanafina, maka nagu'areti hu'na Ra Anumzamofona susu huntegahue. <verse eid="PSA 111:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 111:2"/>Ra Anumzamo'ma eri'zama eri'nea eri'zamo'a, so'e zantfa hu'ne. Ana hu'neanki'za agrama eri'nea eri'zanku'ma musema nehaza vahe'mo'za, ana zamofo agenkea atrazageno zamagu'afi me'nege'za nentahize. <verse eid="PSA 111:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 111:3"/>Maka zama Anumzamo'ma nehia zamo'a agri hankave hihamu masa zama'anena erinte ama nehie. Ana hu'neankino Anumzamofo fatgo avu'ava zamo'a, vagaore mevava huno nevie. <verse eid="PSA 111:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 111:4"/>Anumzamo'a ruzahu hentofa eri'zama eri'nea zankura, tamaganera okanisie huno tagri antahi'zana eri o'netie. Ra Anumzana tagri Anumzamo'a asunku nehuno arimpa fru Anumza mani'ne. <verse eid="PSA 111:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 111:5"/>Anumzamofonku'ma koro'ma hunte'za agorga'ama nemaniza vahera, agra ne'zana zamige'za nenaze. Agrama huvempama hu'nea kasege'agura agera okani agesa antahi vava hugahie. <verse eid="PSA 111:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 111:6"/>Anumzamo'ma hankave'ama eri ama hige'za agri vahe'mo'zama ke'nazana, ru vahe mopa hanareno, eri zamige'za erisantihare'za menina mani'naze. <verse eid="PSA 111:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 111:7"/>Agrama hugahue huno'ma hu'nea zana maka tro nehuno, fatgo huno refko nehia Anumza mani'neankino, maka kasege'amo'a tamage ke me'neankita antahita amage antegahune. <verse eid="PSA 111:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 111:8"/>Ana kasegemo'a mevava hugahie huno eri hankaveti'neankita, maka zupa fatgo tavutva nehuta amage ante vava hugahune. <verse eid="PSA 111:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 111:9"/>Agra vahe'a mizaseno ete nezamavareno, mevava hania huhagerafi huvempage huzmante'ne. Ana hu'neankino agri agimo'a, ruotage huno hentofaza hu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 111:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 111:10"/>Ra Anumzamofoma koro'ma hunte'zana, knare antahi'zamofo agafa'a me'ne. Iza'zo agri avesi'zama amage'ma antesnaza vahe'mo'za antahintahi zampina ani hugahaze. Ana hu'negu maka zupa Anumzamo'a ra agia eri vava hanie.<verse eid="PSA 111:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 111"/>
  <chapter number="112" style="c" sid="PSA 112"/>
  <para style="s">Knare veamo'za muse hugahaze hu'nea naneke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 112:1"/>Ra Anumzamofo agi'a ahentesga hiho! Iza'o Ra Anumzamofonku'ma koro hunenteno, muse huno'ma agri kasegema amage'ma nentesnia vahe'mo'a knare asomu erigahie. <verse eid="PSA 112:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 112:2"/>Ana nehanageno mofavre naga'amo'za ranra vaheke efore hu'za maka kaziga ama mopafina knare hu'za manigahaze. Hagi ana fatgo avu'ava zama nehania vahepinti'ma, henka forehu anante nante'ma hu'za maka kazigama vanaza vahe'mo'za asomu'ene manigahaze. <verse eid="PSA 112:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 112:3"/>Ana vahe'mokizmi nompina zagone feno zamo'enena megahie. Ana nehanigeno fatgo zamavu zamavamo'a maka zupa mevava huno vugahie. <verse eid="PSA 112:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 112:4"/>Hani zana fore hugahianagi, Anumzamofo amagema nente'za vaheku'ma zamasunku'ma nehu'za, knare zmavuzmava hunezmante'za fatgo zamavu'zamava zama nehaza vahe'mokizmia tavi'mo remsa huzmantegahie. <verse eid="PSA 112:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 112:5"/>Vahe'mo'za zagoma nofi hunaku'ma nehanageno, iza'o muse huno zagoma nemino, maka zama hanifima fatgo kazigatike'ma hania vahe'mo'a, maka zama hania zamo'a knare hugahie. <verse eid="PSA 112:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 112:6"/>Fatgo avu'ava zama nehania vahera kefo avu'ava zamo'a azeri otregahie. Fatgo avu'ava zama nehaza vahera, vahe'mo'za zamagerakani ozamante'za, zamagesa antahizami vava hugahaze. <verse eid="PSA 112:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 112:7"/>Ana vahe'mo'za knazama fore hania zamofo agenkema nentahisu'za korora osugahaze. Na'ankure zamagra Ra Anumzamo'a taza hugahie hu'za amuhara nehu'za, zamentintia nehaze. <verse eid="PSA 112:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 112:8"/>Ana vahe'mo'za zamagu'a zamazeri hanaveneti'za, korora osu mani'ne'za nezmagesage'za ha' vahezmia zamazeri haviza hugahaze. <verse eid="PSA 112:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 112:9"/>Ana vahe'mo'za zamunte omane vahera refko hu'za mago'a zana amne zamigahaze. Ana nehanageno fatgo zamavu'zmavama nehaza zamo'a mevava huno nevanige'za vahe'mo'za, husga hunezmante'za ra zamagi zamigahaze. <verse eid="PSA 112:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 112:10"/>Hagi kefo zamavu'zamava zama nehaza vahe'mo'za ana zama nege'za, zamarimpagu nehu'za zamavera aninkreki hugahaze. Ana nehu'za kefo avu'ava zama nehaza vahe'mo'zama knare'nare zama erinaku'ma antahintahima hu'nesaza zana e'orisageno, mago'a zama erinaku'ma amuhama nehaza zamo'a amne zankna hugahie.<verse eid="PSA 112:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 112"/>
  <chapter number="113" style="c" sid="PSA 113"/>
  <para style="s">Knare vahe'mo'za muse hugahaze hu'nea naneke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 113:1"/>Ra Anumzamofo agi'a ahentesga hanune! Ra Anumzamofo eri'za vahe'mota Anumzamofo agi'a ahentesga hiho. Ra Anumzamofo agi'a ahentesga hiho. <verse eid="PSA 113:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 113:2"/>Menine henkanena Ra Anumzamofo agigura muse hunte vava huta vanune. <verse eid="PSA 113:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 113:3"/>Zage hanatitegati vuno zage fretegama vanigeta, maka vahe'mota, Ra Anumzamofo agi'a husga huntesune. <verse eid="PSA 113:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 113:4"/>Ra Anumzamo'a onagamu mani'neno, maka ama mopafi vahera kegava hu'negeno, Agri konarari masa zamo'a mona agatereno amenagame mareri'ne. <verse eid="PSA 113:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 113:5"/>Ina vahe'mo Ra Anumzana tagri Anumzamo'ma tra'are'ma manisgama hu'nea Anumzankna vahera mani'ne? <verse eid="PSA 113:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 113:6"/>Ana Anumzamo'a onagame mani'neno kefenkateno monane mopanena nege. <verse eid="PSA 113:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 113:7"/>Zamunte omne vahe'ma kugusopafima mase'nazana Anumzamo'a zamavazu huno zamazeri o'netino, maka zanku'ma atupa'ma nehaza vahe'ma ta'nefapima mani'nazana zamavaresga nehie. <verse eid="PSA 113:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 113:8"/>Ana huteno kva vahe'mofo trate zamantege'za, agri vahe'ma kegavama nehaza ugota kva vahe'mo'zama nemaniza tva'ontera nemanize. <verse eid="PSA 113:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 113:9"/>Mofavre onte naravo ara mofavre amigeno rama'a mofavre nenteno, tusi muse nehie. Ra Anumzamo'a ra agia erisie.<verse eid="PSA 113:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 113"/>
  <chapter number="114" style="c" sid="PSA 114"/>
  <para style="s">Anumzamo'ma koranke hagerinte'ma zamazama hige'za hu'naza zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 114:1"/>Hagi Israeli vahe'mo'zama Isipiti'ma atre'zama e'nazana, Jekopu naga'mo'za ru zamageru'ma neraza vahe'mokizmi moparegama umani'nazaregatira atre'za e'naze <verse eid="PSA 114:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 114:2"/>Ana'ma hazageno'a Juda mopamo'a Anumzamofo mono nonkna higeno, Israeli mopa Agra'a kegava hu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 114:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 114:3"/>Koranke hagerinte'ma azageno'a, ana hagerimo'a nezmageno koro fre'ne. Ana nehigeno Jodani timo'a ete rukrahe huno ne-erega vu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 114:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 114:4"/>Ranra agonaramimo'za, ve sipisipimo'zama nehazaza hu'za takaure takaure nehazageno, ne'onse agonaramimo'za anenta sipisipimo'zama nehazaza huza takaure takaure hu'naze. <verse eid="PSA 114:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 114:5"/>Nazamo higenka Koranke hagerimoka, korora nefrane? Nazamo higenka Jodani timoka, ete rukrahe hunka neantega nevane? <verse eid="PSA 114:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 114:6"/>Nazamo higeta ranra agonaramimota, ve sipisipimo'za nehazaza huta takaure takaurera nehaze? Nazamo higeta ne'onse agonaramimota, anenta sipisipi afumo'zama nehazaza huta takaure takaurera nehaze? <verse eid="PSA 114:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 114:7"/>Ama mopamoka Ra Anumzamofo avuga kahirahiku nehunka, Jekopu Anumzamofo avuga kahirahiku huo. <verse eid="PSA 114:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 114:8"/>Ana Anumzamo'a havefina higeno tirura marenevazigeno, havemoke'ma hu'nea agonafintira higeno tina hanatino ne-ea ne' mani'ne.<verse eid="PSA 114:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 114"/>
  <chapter number="115" style="c" sid="PSA 115"/>
  <para style="s">Anumzana Agrake tamage Anumzana mani'ne hu'nea naneke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 115:1"/>Ra Anumzamoka tagra rantagia e'origahunanki, kagrake rankagia erigahane. Na'ankure kagra maka zupama vagaore kavesi zanku'ene, hugahuema hu'nana zama amage'ma antenkama nehana zanku huta, kagi'a husga hunegantone. <verse eid="PSA 115:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 115:2"/>Nagafare ama mopafima mani'naza vahe'mo'za tagrikura hu'za, Anumza zamimo'a iga mani'ne hu'za nehaze? <verse eid="PSA 115:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 115:3"/>Tagri Anumzamo'a monafinka mani'neankino nazano hunaku'ma hiazana agra'a avesite amne nehie. <verse eid="PSA 115:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 115:4"/>Hianagi mago'a vahe'mokizmi havi anumzana, silvareti'ene golireti vahe'mo'za avako hu'za zamazanteti tro hu'naze. <verse eid="PSA 115:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 115:5"/>Ana havi anumzantamina zamagira me'neanagi, keaga nosu'za, zamavurga me'neanagi, onkegahaze. <verse eid="PSA 115:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 115:6"/>Hagi zamagesa me'neanagi keaga nontahi'za, zamagona me'neanagi mna ontahigahaze. <verse eid="PSA 115:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 115:7"/>Zamazana me'neanagi mago zana avakora hu'za nonke'za, zamagia me'neanagi kana ante'za vanoa nosu'za, zamanankena me'neanagi, zamagerura orugahaze. <verse eid="PSA 115:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 115:8"/>Hagi ana havi anumzantamima tro'ma nehaza vahe'mo'za ana havi anumzantamo'zama havizama nehazaza hu'za zamagra haviza nehanage'za, ana havi anumzante'ma zamentintima nehanaza vahe'mo'za zamagranena haviza hugahaze. <verse eid="PSA 115:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 115:9"/>Hagi tamagra Israeli vahe'mota Ra Anumzamofonte tamentintia hiho. Na'ankure agra hankogna huno mani'neankino, agrake'za tamahorakeno tamagura nevazino kegava huneramante. <verse eid="PSA 115:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 115:10"/>Aroni nagapinti'ma pristi eri'zama e'neriza nagamota, Ra Anumzamofonte tamentintia hiho. Na'ankure agra hankogna hu'neankino agrake'za tamahorakeno tamagura nevazino, kegava huneramante. <verse eid="PSA 115:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 115:11"/>Hagi Ra Anumzamofonku koro'ma hunteta agoraga'ama nemaniza vahe'mota, Ra Anumzamofonte tamentintia hiho. Na'ankure Agra tamazahu ne' mani'neno tamagri hanko mani'neankino, Agrake'za tamahora keno tamagura nevazino kegava huneramante. <verse eid="PSA 115:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 115:12"/>Ra Anumzamo'a ageraokani agesa antahi neramiankino, asomura hurantegahie. Israeli vahera asomura hunezmanteno, Aroni naga'ma pristi eri'zama e'neriza naga'enena asomura huzmantegahie. <verse eid="PSA 115:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 115:13"/>Zamagi me'nea vahero zamagi omane vahe'mo'zanema, Ra Anumzamofonkuma koro'ma nehaza vahera Anumzamo'a asomu huzmantegahie. <verse eid="PSA 115:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 115:14"/>Ra Anumzamo'a asomu huramantena tamagra mofavrea kasente hakare nehanageno, tamagri mofavre naga'enena asomura huzmantesnige'za mofavrea kasente hakare hanaze. <verse eid="PSA 115:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 115:15"/>Ra Anumzana monane mopanema tro'ma hu'nea Anumzamo tamagrira asomura huramantesie. <verse eid="PSA 115:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 115:16"/>Monafina Ra Anumzamo nemanino, ama mopa vahemotagu maniho huno tami'ne. <verse eid="PSA 115:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 115:17"/>Ko'ma fri'naza vahe'mo'za zagamera hu'za Ra Anumzamofo agi'a ahentesga osugahaze. Na'ankure zamagra fri'za keaga osu kumapi, matipi umani'naze <verse eid="PSA 115:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 115:18"/>Hianagi tagra Ra Anumzamofona menine henka'anena agri agi'a ahentesga huvava huta vanune. Ra Anumzamofo agi'a ahentesga hanune!<verse eid="PSA 115:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 115"/>
  <chapter number="116" style="c" sid="PSA 116"/>
  <para style="s">Anumzamofonku susu hunte zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 116:1"/>Nagra Ra Anumzamofona navesinentoe. Na'ankure Agra nagerura nentahino asunku'ma hunanteno nazama hinogu'ma krafa kema huana antahinenamie. <verse eid="PSA 116:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 116:2"/>Na'ankure Agrama agesa anteno antahi nenamia zankura, nagrama kasefa'ma hu'na manisanua kna'afina agriteke nunamuna hugahue. <verse eid="PSA 116:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 116:3"/>Fri'zamo'a nofimo'ma nazeri anakiaza nehigeno, fri vahe kumaku'ma koro huazamo'a, nazeri fenkami netre. Ana zamo hige'na knazampi nemani'na nasu zampi nemanue. <verse eid="PSA 116:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 116:4"/>Ana'ma nehige'na Ra Anumzamofo agi ahe'na, Ra Anumzamoka nagu'vazio hu'na nunamuna nehue. <verse eid="PSA 116:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 116:5"/>Ra Anumzamo'a asunku huneranteno, fatgo avu'ava nehia ne' mani'neankino, tagri Anumzamofona arimpa fruzamo'a avite'ne. <verse eid="PSA 116:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 116:6"/>Zamagra'ama zamaza osuga vahera, Ra Anumzamo'a kegava hunezmante. Korapara ra hazenkezampi mani'nogeno naguravazi'ne. <verse eid="PSA 116:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 116:7"/>Menina narimpa fru hu'na mani'noe. Na'ankure Ra Anumzamo'a knare hunante'ne. <verse eid="PSA 116:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 116:8"/>Nagrira fri'zampinti nagu'vazino nenavreno, navunura eri haminenanteno, naza hige'na trakara hu'na nomasoe. <verse eid="PSA 116:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 116:9"/>Ana nehigu nagra kasefa'ma hu'na ama mopafima manisanua kna'afina, Ra Anumzamofo avure kana vano hugahue. <verse eid="PSA 116:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 116:10"/>Nagra Ra Anumzamokare namentinti nehugu amanage hugahue. Ranknazamo nazeri haviza nehie. <verse eid="PSA 116:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 116:11"/>Nagra antahintahi hakarema nehua knafina amanage hu'na Kagritega kezana netue. Maka amama mani'naza vahera havige nehaza vahe mani'naze. <verse eid="PSA 116:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 116:12"/>Ra Anumzamo'ma maka knare avu'ava zama hunante'nea zantera, nagra na'a nona hu'na amigahue? <verse eid="PSA 116:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 116:13"/>Waini ofama erino Ra Anumzamofonte emerisga hiaza hu'na nagu'vazino navre'nea zankura musenkase nehu'na, agi'a ahentesga hugahue. <verse eid="PSA 116:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 116:14"/>Hagi Anumzamofo vahe'ma maka eme etruma hanafina, nazano hugahue hu'nama Ra Anumzamofo avure'ma huvempama hu'noa zantamina hugahue. <verse eid="PSA 116:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 116:15"/>Ra Anumzamofoma amage'manentaza vahe'ma frizana, Anumzamofo avurera so'e zantfa nehie. <verse eid="PSA 116:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 116:16"/>Ra Anumzamoka nagra kagri eri'za vahe mani'noanki'na, eri'za vahekamo'na kagri nompima eri'za e'neria a'mofo mofavre mani'noe. Ana hu'neankinka nofimo'ma kinama renante'neana katufenka nazeri fru hu'nane. <verse eid="PSA 116:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 116:17"/>Ana hu'neanki'na kagritega humuse ofani'a hunegante'na, Ra Anumzamoka kagire nunamuna hugahue. <verse eid="PSA 116:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 116:18"/>Hagi nazano hugahue hu'nama Ra Anumzamofo avure'ma huvempama hu'noa zantamina, maka Anumzamofo vahe'ma eme etruma hanafina ana zana hugahue. <verse eid="PSA 116:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 116:19"/>Jerusalemi kuma'mofo agu'afima, Ra Anumzamofo mono noma me'nea kumapi, Ra Anumzamofo agi'a husga huntesue.<verse eid="PSA 116:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 116"/>
  <chapter number="117" style="c" sid="PSA 117"/>
  <para style="s">Ra Anumzamofo agi'a ahentesga hanune hu'nea zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 117:1"/>Maka ama mopafima kokankokama nemaniza vahe'mota, Ra Anumzamofo agi'a husga hunteho. Maka mopafi vahe'mota Anumzamofona agi'a ahentesga hiho. <verse eid="PSA 117:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 117:2"/>Na'ankure Ra Anumzamo'a tusiza huno vagaore avesi zanteti avesi neranteno, Agra hugahuema hu'nea ke'a avaririno kegava hurantevava nehie. Ra Anumzamofona agi'a ahentesga hanune.<verse eid="PSA 117:2"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 117"/>
  <chapter number="118" style="c" sid="PSA 118"/>
  <para style="s">Anumzamo aza hu'nea zanku kva ne'mo muse nehuno hunte'nea zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 118:1"/>Ra Anumzamofona susu huntesune, na'ankure Agra knare avu'avaza huneranteno vagaore avesi zama'areti avesirante vava nehie. <verse eid="PSA 118:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 118:2"/>Maka Israeli vahe'mota huta, Anumzamofona vagaore avesi zama'amo'a mevava huno nevie huta hiho. <verse eid="PSA 118:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 118:3"/>Aroni naga'ma pristi eri'zama e'neriza nagamota hanazana, Anumzamofona vagaore avesi zama'amo'a mevava huno nevie huta hiho. <verse eid="PSA 118:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 118:4"/>Ra Anumzamofonku'ma koro'ma hunente'zaagoragama nemaniza vahe'mota Anumzamofona vagaore avesi zama'amo'a mevava huno nevie hu'za hiho. <verse eid="PSA 118:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 118:5"/>Nagra ra knazampima manine'na Ra Anumzamofonte nunamuma hugeno'a, Ra Anumzamo'a nunamuni'a antahinamino knazanifintira naza hige'na fru hu'na nemanue. <verse eid="PSA 118:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 118:6"/>Ra Anumzamo'a nagri kaziga mani'neanki'na, nazano vahe'mo'ma hunante'naku'ma hania zankura, korora osugahue. <verse eid="PSA 118:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 118:7"/>Tamage, Ra Anumzamo'a nagri kaziga mani'neankino, nagrira naza hugahie. Ana nehuno ha'ma renenantaza vahera zamazeri haviza nehanige'na, muse nehu'na zamage fenkami atregahue. <verse eid="PSA 118:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 118:8"/>Ra Anumzamofompima fra'makino mani'zamo'a, vahete'ma amuha'ma hu'zana agatere'ne. <verse eid="PSA 118:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 118:9"/>Ra Anumzamofompima fra'makino mani'zamo'a, ugagota kva vahete'ma amuha'ma hu'zana agatere'ne. <verse eid="PSA 118:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 118:10"/>Maka kokankoka vahe'mo'zama eme navazagi kagi'za hara hunante'naze. Hianagi Ra Anumzamofo agifi ana vahera hara huzmagatere'noe. <verse eid="PSA 118:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 118:11"/>Nagri'ma ha'ma hunante'nakura tamagerfa hu'za maka asoparegati eme navazagi kagi'naze. Hianagi Ra Anumzamofo hankavefi hara huzmagatere'noe. <verse eid="PSA 118:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 118:12"/>Ha' vahe'mo'za tumemo'ma nehiaza hu'za eme nazeri kagi'naze. Hianagi tevemo'ma osi trazampima ruhagana huno teteno fanane hiankna hu'naze. Ana nehazage'na Ra Anumzamofo agifi hara huzmagatere'noe. <verse eid="PSA 118:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 118:13"/>Ha' vahenimo'za hankaveti'za hara hunante'za e'za eme nazeri haviza hunaku hu'naze. Hianagi Ra Anumzamo'a naza hu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 118:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 118:14"/>Ra Anumzamo'a nagri hankavene, nagri zagame'ene mani'ne. Ana hu'neankino agrake naguranevazie. <verse eid="PSA 118:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 118:15"/>Fatgo avu'ava zama nehaza vahe'mo'za seli nozamifi manine'za musenkase nehu'za, muse zagame'ma hu'nazana, Ra Anumzamofo tamaga azamo'a, hankavenentake'za eri fore hu'ne hu'za hu'naze. <verse eid="PSA 118:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 118:16"/>Ra Anumzamo'a tamaga kaziga azana eri sga huno mani'neno hara hugaterene. Ra Anumzamofona tamaga kaziga azamo'a hankavenentake eri'za eri fore hu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 118:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 118:17"/>Nagra ofri'na kasefa hu'na manine'na, Ra Anumzamo'ma tro'ma hu'nea zankura huama hu'na vahera zamasamigahue. <verse eid="PSA 118:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 118:18"/>Ra Anumzamo'a nagrira nazeri fatgo hunaku knaza namino nazeri havizantfa hu'ne. Hianagi natrege'na ofri'noe. <verse eid="PSA 118:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 118:19"/>Fatgo avu'avazamofo kafana eri anaginantege'na, ufre'na Ra Anumzamofona humuse hunta'neno. <verse eid="PSA 118:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 118:20"/>Ama Ra Anumzamofo kafane. Ana hu'neanki'za fatgo vahe'mo'za ama ana kafanteti ufregahaze. <verse eid="PSA 118:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 118:21"/>Anumzamoka nagri nunamuma antahi nenaminka, nagu'mavazinke'nama knare hu'nama mani'noa zankura susu hu'na humuse hugantoe. <verse eid="PSA 118:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 118:22"/>Noma negiza eri'zama'a omane'nea have hu'zama eri atre'naza havemo'a, nomofo renagentete asetenageno noma azeri hankaveti have fore hu'ne. (Matiu 21:42, Maki 12:10-11) <verse eid="PSA 118:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 118:23"/>Ama ana eri'zana Ra Anumzamo eri fore higeta negonankino, hentofaza hu'negeta negone. <verse eid="PSA 118:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 118:24"/>Ama zagegna Ra Anumzamo tro hu'ne. Ana hu'neankita ama ana knafina musenkase huta trimpa frune manisanune. <verse eid="PSA 118:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 118:25"/>Ra Anumzamoka keke huta muse hugantonanki, tagu'vazinka neravrenka, tazeri so'e hananketa maka zampina knare huta manisanune. <verse eid="PSA 118:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 118:26"/>Iza'o Anumzamofo agifima esania vahera, Ra Anumzamo'a asomu huntegahie. Ana vahe'mofona Ra Anumzamofo nompi agia husga huntesune. (Matiu 21:9. 23:39. Maki 11: 9-10. Luku 13: 35.19: 38. Joni 12: 13) <verse eid="PSA 118:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 118:27"/>Ra Anumzana tagri Anumza mani'neankino, agra'a masa'areti remsa hurante'ne. Ofama huntesaza zana erita vuta, kresramna vu itamofo pazivete nofiteti ome anakinteho. <verse eid="PSA 118:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 118:28"/>Anumzamoka nagri Anumza mani'nanku, susu hu'na humuse hugantegahue. Kagra nagri Anumza mani'nananki'na, kagri kagi'a husga hugahue. <verse eid="PSA 118:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 118:29"/>Ra Anumzamofona susu huta humuse huntesanune. Na'ankure agra knare zantfa hu'neankino, vagaore mevava avesi zama'amo'a mevava huno vugahie.<verse eid="PSA 118:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 118"/>
  <chapter number="119" style="c" sid="PSA 119"/>
  <para style="s">Anumzamofo kasegemo'a knare zantfa hu'ne hu'nea naneke</para>
  <para style="s">
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">119:1 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Hibru kefi alfa betia amareti agafa huno vu'ne. </char>
    </note>Aleph</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 119:1"/>Iza'zo nomani'za zamifima fatgo avu'ava zama nehu'za, Ra Anumzamofo kasegema amage'manentaza vahe'mo'za muse hugahaze. <verse eid="PSA 119:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 119:2"/>Iza'zo Anumzamofo kasegema amage'ma nente'za vahe'mo'za, maka zamagu'areti'ma hu'za agriku'ma nehakaza vahe'mo'za muse hugahaze. <verse eid="PSA 119:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 119:3"/>Ana vahe'mo'za havi avu'ava zankura zamavesra nehu'za, Anumzamofoma ave'nesia avu'ava zanke hu'za amageranentaze. <verse eid="PSA 119:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 119:4"/>Anumzamoka kagra kasegeka'a neraminka tagrikura hunka, ana kasegea amage ante fatgo hiho hunka hu'nane. <verse eid="PSA 119:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 119:5"/>Nagri'ma nave'nesiana maka zupa kagri trake amage nentesugeno, nomani'zanifina ome hankavetisiegu nave'nesie. <verse eid="PSA 119:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 119:6"/>Ana'ma hanige'na nagazegura osugahue. Na'ankure kagri kasegefi navua ketena vugahiankina, nagra nagazegura osugahue. <verse eid="PSA 119:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 119:7"/>Hagi fatgoma hu'nea kasegeka'ama rempima hu'na antahisuna, fatgo nagu'areti hu'na kagrira humuse hugantegahue. <verse eid="PSA 119:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 119:8"/>Kagri tra keka'a amage antenaku nehue. Muse hugantoanki natrenka kamefira huonamio.<verse eid="PSA 119:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Beth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 119:9"/>Inankna huno nehezavemo'a nomani'za ma'afina agrua huno manigahie? Agrama mani agruma huno mani'naku'ma hanuno'a, kagri ke'ma amage'ma antesanuno, anara hugahie. <verse eid="PSA 119:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 119:10"/>Kagri'ma kagenakura nagu'areti tusiza hu'na nehakoanki, natrege'na kagri kasegea atre'na kana hazagre'na ofraneno. <verse eid="PSA 119:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 119:11"/>Kagri nanekea nagu'afi erintogeno me'neanki'na, kagri kavurera kumira osugahue. <verse eid="PSA 119:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 119:12"/>Ra Anumzamoka kagri kagia ahentesga nehuanki, tra keka'a rempi hunamio. <verse eid="PSA 119:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 119:13"/>Kagrama tasami'nana kasegeka'a, nagipintira huama hu'na vahera zamasamigahue. <verse eid="PSA 119:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 119:14"/>Kagri kasegegu'ma musema nehua zamo'a, afu fenonku'ma musema nehua zana rugatere'ne. <verse eid="PSA 119:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 119:15"/>Amage'ma antehoma hunka tami'nana tra kegura nagesa are'are nehu'na, kagri kavukva zante navua ante'na negoe. <verse eid="PSA 119:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 119:16"/>Kagri tra kegura tusi muse nehuanki'na, kagri nanekegura naganera okanigahue.<verse eid="PSA 119:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Gimel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 119:17"/>Nagra kagri eri'za vahe mani'noanki nazeri so'e huge'na, kasefa hu'na manine'na nanekeka'a amagera anta'neno. <verse eid="PSA 119:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 119:18"/>Navurga eri hari huge'na, kagri kasegefima hentofazama me'nea zana keama ha'neno. <verse eid="PSA 119:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 119:19"/>Nagra ama mopafina karaga vahe emani'noanki, nagri navurera kasegeka'a eri frara okio. <verse eid="PSA 119:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 119:20"/>Kagri kasegema amage'ma ante'zankura maka knafina nagu'amo'a tusiza huno avesi'avesi nehie. <verse eid="PSA 119:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 119:21"/>Kema ontahi veganokno'ma nehu'za kasegeka'ama atre'za hazama negraza vahera, kagra zamazeri konerinka zamatrenanke'za huviza hugahaze. <verse eid="PSA 119:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 119:22"/>Zamatrege'za kiza zokago kea hunenante'za huhaviza huonanteho. Na'ankure kagri kasegea, nagra amagera nentoe. <verse eid="PSA 119:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 119:23"/>Vugota kva vahe'mo'zanena magopi manine'za nazeri haviza hunaku keaga ana'nekize. Hianagi eri'za vahekamo'na kagri kasegegu nagesa antahintahi nehue. <verse eid="PSA 119:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 119:24"/>Kagri kasegegura tusiza hu'na musena nehugeno, ana kasegemo'a knare antahi'za nenamie.<verse eid="PSA 119:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Daleth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 119:25"/>Nagra kugusopafi urami'na mase'noanki, kagra naneke ka'areti nazeri kasefa huo. <verse eid="PSA 119:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 119:26"/>Nagrama nazano hunaku'ma nagesa antahi'noa zana kagrira kasamugenka, ke'nirera nona hunante'nane. Ana hu'nananki menina tra keka'a rempi hunamio. <verse eid="PSA 119:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 119:27"/>Nagrira naza huge'na kasegeka'amofo agafa'a antahi ama ha'neno. Ana'ma hananke'na so'e zantfama hu'nea eri'zama eri'nana zankura nagesa antahintahi hugahue. <verse eid="PSA 119:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 119:28"/>Nagu'amo'a kna nehigena, nasunku zampi mani'nena zavira netoanki, kagrama nanekefima hu'nana kante amage antenka nazeri hankavetio. <verse eid="PSA 119:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 119:29"/>Nagrama havigema nehua zampintira nazeri afete atro. Ana nehunka kasunku hunantenka, kasegeka'a rempi hunamio. <verse eid="PSA 119:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 119:30"/>Kagrira ogatre'na tamage hu'na kamage antegahue hu'na ko huhampri'noe. Ana nehu'na maka zupa kasegeka'a, nagu'areti hu'na amage antegahue hu'na nagesa antahi'noe. <verse eid="PSA 119:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 119:31"/>Kagri kasegea azeri antrako hu'noanki, Ra Anumzamoka natregeno mago zamo'a nazeri nagazea osino.<verse eid="PSA 119:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 119:32"/>Kagri kasegeka'a, amage ante'na vugahue. Na'ankure nagri antahi'zana, kagra eri ra hu'nanku anara hugahue. <verse eid="PSA 119:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 119:33"/>Ra Anumzamoka kasegeka'a rempi hunamige'na, amage ante'na nevu'na ome vagaretega va'neno.<verse eid="PSA 119:33"/></para>
  <para style="s">He</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 119:34"/>Ama' antahi'zana namige'na kasegeka'a nentahi'na amage anta'neno. Ana kasegeka'a maka nagu'areti hu'na amage antegahue. <verse eid="PSA 119:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 119:35"/>Kagra naveri huge'na kagri kasegemo'ma vuoma huno hu'nea kante vaneno. Na'ankure nagra ana kasegegu musena nehue. <verse eid="PSA 119:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 119:36"/>Nagri nagu'a eri rukrahe huge'na kagri kasegema amage ante'zanku navesi navesi nehu'na, havi kazigati zago eri'na feno vahera omani'neno. <verse eid="PSA 119:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 119:37"/>Agafa'a omane zantaminte'ma navuma negoazana eri netrenka, kagrama naneke ka'afima hu'nana kante amage antenka nazeri kasefa huo. <verse eid="PSA 119:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 119:38"/>Kagrama huvempama hu'nana zana eri'za vahekamo'nare erinteama nehananke'za, vahe'mo'za kagriku korora hugantegahaze. <verse eid="PSA 119:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 119:39"/>Vahe'mo'zama nazeri nagazema hu nanekema nehazafintira, Kagra naza huo. Na'ankure kagri kasegemo'a knare hu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 119:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 119:40"/>Kagri kasegema amage'ma ante zankura navesi navesi nehuanki, kagra fatgo kavukva hunka nazeri kasefa huo.<verse eid="PSA 119:40"/></para>
  <para style="s">Vav</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 119:41"/>Ra Anumzamoka atregeno vagaore mevava kavesi zamo'a nagritera ne-esigenka, kagrama huvempama hu'nana kante antenka, nagu'vazinka ete navro. <verse eid="PSA 119:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 119:42"/>Ana'ma hananke'na nazeri havizama hu kema nehaza vahe'mofo ke'zamirera kenona huzmantegahue. Na'ankure kagri nanekere namentintia nehue. <verse eid="PSA 119:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 119:43"/>Kagra tamage keka'a nagipintira eri otro. Na'ankure nagra kagri kasegegu amuhara nehue. <verse eid="PSA 119:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 119:44"/>Kagri kasegea nagra maka knafina amage antevava hugahue. <verse eid="PSA 119:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 119:45"/>Mago zamo'a kina reonantesige'na fru hu'na vano hugahue. Na'ankure nagra maka nagu'areti hu'na, kagri kasegea amage nentoe. <verse eid="PSA 119:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="PSA 119:46"/>Kini vahe'mokizmi zamavuga oti'na kagri kasegea huama hu'na nezamasami'na, nagazegura osugahue. <verse eid="PSA 119:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="PSA 119:47"/>Kagri kasegegura muse nehuankina, ana kasegea navesinentoe. <verse eid="PSA 119:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="PSA 119:48"/>Nagra kagri kasegere nazana erisga nehu'na, kagri kasegegura maka zupa nagesa antahintahia nehue.<verse eid="PSA 119:48"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zayin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="PSA 119:49"/>Kagri eri'za vahekamo'nama huvempama hunante'nana kegura kagesa antahio. Na'ankure anazamo hige'na, kagritera amuhara nehue. <verse eid="PSA 119:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="PSA 119:50"/>Kagrama huvempama hunante'nana nanekemo nazeri hankavenetigeno, knazampima ufroana ana nanekemo nazeri kasefara nehie. <verse eid="PSA 119:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="PSA 119:51"/>Zamavufga rama nehaza vahe'mo'za, nagrira ki'za zokago ke hunenantaze. Hianagi nagra Kagri kasegea namefira hunomue. <verse eid="PSA 119:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="PSA 119:52"/>Ra Anumzamoka korapa'ma tami'nana kasegeka'a naganera nokanue. Ana nehugeno ana nanekemo nazeri hankavenetie. <verse eid="PSA 119:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="PSA 119:53"/>Kefo avu'ava'ma nehaza vahe'mo'zama Kagri kasegema amage'ma nontageno'a, tusi narimpa nehe. <verse eid="PSA 119:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="PSA 119:54"/>Ru vahe moparega kraga'ma umanine'na, Kagri kasegea eri rukrahe hu'na asunte'noe. <verse eid="PSA 119:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="PSA 119:55"/>Ra Anumzamoka kenage'enena kagri kagigura naganera nokanue. Ana nehuanki'na kagri kasegea amage antegahue. <verse eid="PSA 119:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="PSA 119:56"/>Nagra nomani zanifina maka zupa kagri kasegea amagenentoe.<verse eid="PSA 119:56"/></para>
  <para style="s">Heth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="PSA 119:57"/>Ra Anumzamoka nagri suza mani'nane hu'na kagrira huhampari'noe. Ana nehu'na huvempa hu'noanki'na amage'ma anteho hunka'ma tami'nana nanekeka'a, amage antegahue. <verse eid="PSA 119:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="PSA 119:58"/>Kagra asomu hunanto hu'na maka nagu'areti hu'na kantahinegoe. Kagrama huvempa hu'nana kante amage antenka, kasunku hunanto. <verse eid="PSA 119:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="PSA 119:59"/>Nagrama nehua navu'nava zankura nagesa antahintahi nehu'na, rukrahe hu'na Kagri kasege amage antegahue. <verse eid="PSA 119:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="PSA 119:60"/>Nagra mago zankura avega ontegahuanki'na, amehu'na Kagri kasegea amage antegahue. <verse eid="PSA 119:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="PSA 119:61"/>Kefo avu'ava zama nehaza vahe'mo'za nazeri anaki'za nehaze. Hianagi Kagri kasegegura nagera nokanue. <verse eid="PSA 119:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="PSA 119:62"/>Kenagera oti'na fatgoma hu'nea kasegeka'agura humuse hunegantoe. <verse eid="PSA 119:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="PSA 119:63"/>Kagri'ma kamagema nente'za vahe'mo'za, Kagri kasegema amage'ma nentaza vahe'ene tragote'na nemanue. <verse eid="PSA 119:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="PSA 119:64"/>Ra Anumzamoka vagaore mevava kavesi'zamo ama mopafina avite'neanki, kasegeka'a rempi hunamio.<verse eid="PSA 119:64"/></para>
  <para style="s">Teth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="PSA 119:65"/>Ra Anumzamoka kagrama huvempama hu'nana kante amage antenka, eri'za vahekamo'na knare'zana rama'a tro hunante'nane. <verse eid="PSA 119:65"/><verse number="66" style="v" sid="PSA 119:66"/>Kagri kasegegura namentinti nehuanki, knare'ma huno refkohu avu'ava zane, ama' antahi'zana namio. <verse eid="PSA 119:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="PSA 119:67"/>Nagra kamagera onte'na kana atre'na havi kante vugenka, kagra knaza naminka nazeri fatgo hu'nane. Hianagi menina kagri nanekeka'a amagenentoe. <verse eid="PSA 119:67"/><verse number="68" style="v" sid="PSA 119:68"/>Kagra knare hu'nenka knare avu'ava zanke nehananki, kasegeka'a rempi hunamio. <verse eid="PSA 119:68"/><verse number="69" style="v" sid="PSA 119:69"/>Zamavufga rama nehaza osu'noa zanku havige hunante'za vano nehaze. Hianagi nagra nagu'areti hu'na, Kagri kasegea amagenentoe. <verse eid="PSA 119:69"/><verse number="70" style="v" sid="PSA 119:70"/>Ana vahe'mokizmi zamagu'amo'a afovamo'ma hiaza huno kakani'ne. Hianagi kagri kasegegura tusiza hu'na muse nehue. <verse eid="PSA 119:70"/><verse number="71" style="v" sid="PSA 119:71"/>Knazama naminka nazeri havizama hu'nanana nagri knare zanku anara hu'nane. Na'ankure e'i ana zamo'a Kagri kasege amage ante'za rempi hunami'ne. <verse eid="PSA 119:71"/><verse number="72" style="v" sid="PSA 119:72"/>Kagrama tami'nana kasegemo'a, rama'a tauseni'a goline silvanena rugatereno nagritera razankrerfa me'ne.<verse eid="PSA 119:72"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yodh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="PSA 119:73"/>Kagraka'a kazampinti tro hunantenka nazeri fore hu'nane. Ana hu'nanku kagri kasegema rempima hu'na antahisanugu ama' antahi'zana namio. <verse eid="PSA 119:73"/><verse number="74" style="v" sid="PSA 119:74"/>Kagriku'ma koro'ma nehaza vahe'mo'za nagri'ma nenage'za muse hugahaze. Na'ankure Kagri nanekegu amuhara nehugu anara hugahaze. <verse eid="PSA 119:74"/><verse number="75" style="v" sid="PSA 119:75"/>Ra Anumzamoka kagra fatgo hunka refkoa nehane. Nagri nazeri fatgo hunaku naneke ka'are Kagra oti'nenka, knazana nami'nane. <verse eid="PSA 119:75"/><verse number="76" style="v" sid="PSA 119:76"/>Eri'za vahe kamo'nama huvempama hunante'nana kante amage antenka, atregeno vagaore mevava kavesi zamo nazeri hankavetino. <verse eid="PSA 119:76"/><verse number="77" style="v" sid="PSA 119:77"/>Kagra kasunku hunantenka nazeri kasefa huge'na mani'neno. Na'ankure Kagri kasegegura tusiza hu'na muse nehue. <verse eid="PSA 119:77"/><verse number="78" style="v" sid="PSA 119:78"/>Zamavufga rama nehaza vahe'mo'zama havigema hu'za nazeri havizama hu'naza vahera zamazeri zamagaze huo. Hianagi nagra Kagri kasegegu nagesa antahintahi hugahue. <verse eid="PSA 119:78"/><verse number="79" style="v" sid="PSA 119:79"/>Kagri kasegema antahi'neza, kagriku'ma koro'ma nehu'za kagoraga'ama nemaniza vahera atrege'za nagrite erava'o hiho. <verse eid="PSA 119:79"/><verse number="80" style="v" sid="PSA 119:80"/>Naza hugena kagri kasege amage nente'na, havi nagia e'orisanue. Ana nehu'na nagazegura osanue.<verse eid="PSA 119:80"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kaph</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="81" style="v" sid="PSA 119:81"/>Kagrama nagu'vazinka navresnanku navesinavesi nehige'na kavega ante'na za'zate'ma manua zamo higeno, zaferinani'a omane amane nehie. Hianagi Kagri nanekegu amuhara nehue. <verse eid="PSA 119:81"/><verse number="82" style="v" sid="PSA 119:82"/>Kagrama huvempama hu'nana kemo'ma nena'ama efore hanigu navuma antete'na manua zamo'a, navunata negrie. Ana hige'na nagra hu'na, nazupa nazeri knare hugahane hu'na nehue? <verse eid="PSA 119:82"/><verse number="83" style="v" sid="PSA 119:83"/>Mememofo akrutetima troma hu'naza tintafema teverema ante hagege hazageno, ome haviza hiankna huno navufgamo'a havizantfa hu'ne. Hianagi Kagri tra kea nagra nagera okani'noe. <verse eid="PSA 119:83"/><verse number="84" style="v" sid="PSA 119:84"/>Nama'a zupa Kagrikura kavega antegahue? Nagri'ma knama nenamiza vahera, ina zupa nona hunka knazana zamigahane? <verse eid="PSA 119:84"/><verse number="85" style="v" sid="PSA 119:85"/>Zamavufga rama nehaza vahe'mo'za kagri kasegea amagera nonte'za, nagrama tnafa'ma hu'na mase'nugura kama vano nehufina keri kafinentaze. <verse eid="PSA 119:85"/><verse number="86" style="v" sid="PSA 119:86"/>Maka kasegekamo'a tamage nanekege me'ne. Agafa'a omane'nea zante vahe'mo'za havige hu'za hazenke naminaku nehazanki naza huo. <verse eid="PSA 119:86"/><verse number="87" style="v" sid="PSA 119:87"/>Ana vahe'mo'za ama mopafintira kofahu'za nahe fri'za hu'naze. Hianagi Kagri tra kea namefira huomi'noe. <verse eid="PSA 119:87"/><verse number="88" style="v" sid="PSA 119:88"/>Kagra vagaore mevava kavesi zanteti nagrira nazeri antese hunka kegava hunenantane. Ana hu'negu kagri tra kea amage ante vava hugahue.<verse eid="PSA 119:88"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lamedh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="89" style="v" sid="PSA 119:89"/>Ra Anumzamoka Kagri nanekemo'a vagaore mevava naneke me'neankino, monafinka hankavetino me'ne. <verse eid="PSA 119:89"/><verse number="90" style="v" sid="PSA 119:90"/>Kagra nazano hugahue hunkama hu'nana zama nehana kavu'ava zamo'a mevava nehuno, forehu anante nante'ma hu'za vanaza vahetera vugahie. Mopa tro hunka antankeno hankavetino me'ne. <verse eid="PSA 119:90"/><verse number="91" style="v" sid="PSA 119:91"/>Kagri kasegemo'a hankavetino meme eno ama knarera ehanati'ne. Ana hu'neankino maka ama mopafima me'nea zantamimo'za Kagri eri'zanke e'nerize. <verse eid="PSA 119:91"/><verse number="92" style="v" sid="PSA 119:92"/>Hanki Kagri kasegegu'ma tusi musema osuresina, nagrama natazama erua knafi ko frusine. <verse eid="PSA 119:92"/><verse number="93" style="v" sid="PSA 119:93"/>Nagra tamagerfa hu'na kagri kasegea nagera okanigahue. Na'ankure ana nanekemo higenka, nasimura naminke'na kasefa hu'na mani'noe. <verse eid="PSA 119:93"/><verse number="94" style="v" sid="PSA 119:94"/>Nagra kagri vahe mani'noanki nagu'vazio. Na'ankure maka zupa Kagri kasege amagera nentoe. <verse eid="PSA 119:94"/><verse number="95" style="v" sid="PSA 119:95"/>Kefo avu'ava zama nehaza vahe'mo'za kafo ante'za mani'neza nazeri haviza hunaku nehaze. Hianagi Kagri kasegegura nagesa antahintahi hugahue. <verse eid="PSA 119:95"/><verse number="96" style="v" sid="PSA 119:96"/>Nagrama ke'na antahi'na huana, mago zamo'a knare huno hankavetino mezana omane'ne. Hianagi Kagri kasegea mago zamo'a azeri ontesigeno, mevava huno vugahie.<verse eid="PSA 119:96"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="97" style="v" sid="PSA 119:97"/>Nagra Kagri kasegegura tusiza hu'na navesi nente'na, maka knafina nagesa antahintahi nehue. <verse eid="PSA 119:97"/><verse number="98" style="v" sid="PSA 119:98"/>Kagri kasegemo knare antahi'zana namige'na, ha' vaheni'a knare antahizampina zamagate'neroe. Na'ankure maka zupa Kagri kasegemo nagrane me'neno, nazeri fatgoa nehie. <verse eid="PSA 119:98"/><verse number="99" style="v" sid="PSA 119:99"/>Nagra maka zupa Kagri kasegegu nagesa antahintahi nehu'na, rempima hunenamiza vahera zamagatere'na knare antahi'zana eri'noe. <verse eid="PSA 119:99"/><verse number="100" style="v" sid="PSA 119:100"/>Ranra vahe'mokizmia zamagatere'na knare antahi'zana eri'noe. Na'ankure maka zupa Kagri tra ke amagera nentogu anara hu'noe. <verse eid="PSA 119:100"/><verse number="101" style="v" sid="PSA 119:101"/>Maka kefo avu'ava zama hu'zantera nagia renakere'na novue. Na'ankure kagri naneke amage antenaku anara nehue. <verse eid="PSA 119:101"/><verse number="102" style="v" sid="PSA 119:102"/>Nagra Kagri tra kea atre'na namefira huomi'noe. Na'ankure Kagra knare'za hunka, rempi hunami'nanku anara hu'noe. <verse eid="PSA 119:102"/><verse number="103" style="v" sid="PSA 119:103"/>Kagri nanekema nagite'ma erinte'nama koana, tusi haganentake hu'neankino, tumerimo'ma hagama nehiama'a rugatereno tusi haga hu'ne! <verse eid="PSA 119:103"/><verse number="104" style="v" sid="PSA 119:104"/>Kagri kasegemo ama' antahi'zana nenamie. E'ina hu'negu maka havi avu'ava zankura nagotenentoe.<verse eid="PSA 119:104"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nun</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="105" style="v" sid="PSA 119:105"/>Kagri nanekemo'a lamu tavikna huno nagiafina remasa hunenanteno, tavikna huno kama nevufina remsa hunenante. <verse eid="PSA 119:105"/><verse number="106" style="v" sid="PSA 119:106"/>Nagra huvempa hu'na fatgoma hu'nea trake amage antegahue. Anage nehu'na hu hankavetuanki'na amage antegahue. <verse eid="PSA 119:106"/><verse number="107" style="v" sid="PSA 119:107"/>Ra Anumzamoka nagra tusi'a kna zampi manuanki, Kagrama huvempama hu'nana kante amage antenka, nazeri kasefa huge'na ofri mani'neno. <verse eid="PSA 119:107"/><verse number="108" style="v" sid="PSA 119:108"/>Ra Anumzamoka ofagna hu'na Kagri'ma rama'a zupama susu'ma hu'na husgama hunegantoana antahi nenaminka, kasegeka'aramina rempi hunamio. <verse eid="PSA 119:108"/><verse number="109" style="v" sid="PSA 119:109"/>Maka zupa ha' vahenimo'za nahe fri'za nehaze. Hianagi Kagri kasegea naganera okanigahue. <verse eid="PSA 119:109"/><verse number="110" style="v" sid="PSA 119:110"/>Kefo avu'ava zama nehaza vahe'mo'za nagri'ma nazeri haviza hunakura, kampina krifu anagi antazankna nehaze. Hianagi Kagri kasegea atre'na hazanogroe. <verse eid="PSA 119:110"/><verse number="111" style="v" sid="PSA 119:111"/>Kagri kasegea mevava feno zankna hu'na erisanti hare'noe. Na'ankure ana nanekemo, nagu'a nazeri muse nehie. <verse eid="PSA 119:111"/><verse number="112" style="v" sid="PSA 119:112"/>Nagra kagri kasege maka zupa amage antegahue hu'na nagesa antahi'noanki'na, amage anteme nevu'na ufrigahue.<verse eid="PSA 119:112"/></para>
  <para style="s">Samekh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="113" style="v" sid="PSA 119:113"/>Kagri kasegema amage antegahune nehu'za tare antahintahima nehaza vahera nagote'nezmantoe. Hianagi Kagri kasegea navesinentoe. <verse eid="PSA 119:113"/><verse number="114" style="v" sid="PSA 119:114"/>Nagrama fra'ma kisanua kuma'ene hankonine Kagra mani'nane. Kagri nanekegu amuhara nehue. <verse eid="PSA 119:114"/><verse number="115" style="v" sid="PSA 119:115"/>Tamagra kefo avu'ava zama nehaza vahe'mota, nagrira natareta viho. Na'ankure nagra Anumzanimofo kasege amage ante'naku nehue. <verse eid="PSA 119:115"/><verse number="116" style="v" sid="PSA 119:116"/>Ra Anumzamoka kagrama huvempama hu'nana kante amage antenka, nazeri hankavetige'na ofri kasefa hu'na mani'neno. Ana nehunka atregeno amuha'ma nehua zamo'a, amne zanknara osino. <verse eid="PSA 119:116"/><verse number="117" style="v" sid="PSA 119:117"/>Nazeri sga huge'na knare hu'na nemani'na, maka zupa kasegeka'agura antahintahi huvava ha'neno. <verse eid="PSA 119:117"/><verse number="118" style="v" sid="PSA 119:118"/>Kagri kasegema amage'ma nontaza vahera kamefi hunezamine. Zamagra ana vahe'mo'zama nehaza havigemo'a amne zankna hugahie. <verse eid="PSA 119:118"/><verse number="119" style="v" sid="PSA 119:119"/>Kefo avu'ava zama nehaza vahera kagra amne zama hiaza hunka ama mopafintira reganope netrane. Ana hu'negu nagra Kagri kasegea navesinentoe. <verse eid="PSA 119:119"/><verse number="120" style="v" sid="PSA 119:120"/>Nagra kagriku koro nehugeno, navufgamo'a nahirahi nere. Kagra keagama refko'ma nehana zanku, nentahi'na korora nehue.<verse eid="PSA 119:120"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ayin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="121" style="v" sid="PSA 119:121"/>Nagra knare huno fatgo hu'nea avu'avaza hu'noanki, natrege'za vahe'ma knama zamiza zamazeri havizama nehaza vahe'mo'za nazeri havizana osiho. <verse eid="PSA 119:121"/><verse number="122" style="v" sid="PSA 119:122"/>Muse hugantoanki kagri eri'za vahekamo'na kegava hunenantenka, natrege'za zmavufga rama nehaza knazana onamiho. <verse eid="PSA 119:122"/><verse number="123" style="v" sid="PSA 119:123"/>Kagrama huvempama hu'nana kante amage nentenka, fatgo kavukva hunka havi avu'ava zama nehaza vahe'mokizmi zamazampinti'ma naza hunka nagu'vazisanegu'ma navuma antete'nama manua zamo'a navumo'a natagrie. <verse eid="PSA 119:123"/><verse number="124" style="v" sid="PSA 119:124"/>Vagaore mevava kavesi zanteti eri'za vahekamo'na kavesigante'noe hunka naveri nehunka, tra keka'a rempi hunamio. <verse eid="PSA 119:124"/><verse number="125" style="v" sid="PSA 119:125"/>Nagra Kagri eri'za vahe mani'noanki ama' antahi'zana namige'na, Kagri kasegea antahi amara ha'neno. <verse eid="PSA 119:125"/><verse number="126" style="v" sid="PSA 119:126"/>Ra Anumzamoka menina Kagri kna efore hu'negu, Kagri kasegema runetagraza vahera zamazeri haviza huo. <verse eid="PSA 119:126"/><verse number="127" style="v" sid="PSA 119:127"/>Tamagerfa hu'na Kagri kasegema navesimanentoa zamo'a, agruma hu'nea golia rugatere'ne. <verse eid="PSA 119:127"/><verse number="128" style="v" sid="PSA 119:128"/>E'ina agafare maka Kagri kasegemo'a tamage naneke me'ne hu'na nentahi'na, havi kante'ma vu'zankura nagonete.<verse eid="PSA 119:128"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="129" style="v" sid="PSA 119:129"/>Kagri kasegemo'a knare zantfa hu'negu, nagra amage nentoe. <verse eid="PSA 119:129"/><verse number="130" style="v" sid="PSA 119:130"/>Kagri nanekema eri vakare'za rempima huneramiza zamo'a, tavi remsa hiankna huno remsa hunerante. Ana hu'neankino antahizama'a omane vahe'mo'enena nanekeka'a antahi ani' hugahie. <verse eid="PSA 119:130"/><verse number="131" style="v" sid="PSA 119:131"/>Nagi'ma aka hu'nena nagefunama hagna hagna'ma nehuana, na'ankure nagu'areti tusiza hu'na Kagri kasegema navesinentogu anara nehue. <verse eid="PSA 119:131"/><verse number="132" style="v" sid="PSA 119:132"/>Kagri kagima avesinentaza vahe'ma hunezmantanaza hunka, rukrahe hunka kasunkura hunanto. <verse eid="PSA 119:132"/><verse number="133" style="v" sid="PSA 119:133"/>Kagra huvempama hu'nana kante antenka, kama vanoma hanufina kegava hunanto. Ana'ma hanankeno'a kefo avu'ava zamo'a nazeri nagate oregahie. <verse eid="PSA 119:133"/><verse number="134" style="v" sid="PSA 119:134"/>Vahe'mo'zama knama namiza nazeri havizama nehaza zampintira, Kagra ete navu'vazinka nenavrege'na, Kagri kasegea amage anta'neno. <verse eid="PSA 119:134"/><verse number="135" style="v" sid="PSA 119:135"/>Kagra kavugosafinti masaka'anu eri'za vahekamo'na remsa hunenantenka, kasegeka'a rempi hunamio. <verse eid="PSA 119:135"/><verse number="136" style="v" sid="PSA 119:136"/>Vahemo'zama Kagri kasegema amage'ma nontageno'a, navunumo'a, navufintira tinkna huno herafi neramie.<verse eid="PSA 119:136"/></para>
  <para style="s">Tsadhe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="137" style="v" sid="PSA 119:137"/>Ra Anumzamoka Kagra fatgo kavukva'ene ne' mani'nankeno, Kagri kasegekamo'enena fatgo hu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 119:137"/><verse number="138" style="v" sid="PSA 119:138"/>Kagrama tami'nana kasegemo'a fatgo hu'neankino, vahe'mo'za zamentintia hugahaze. <verse eid="PSA 119:138"/><verse number="139" style="v" sid="PSA 119:139"/>Nagri'ma ha'ma renenantaza vahe'mo'za Kagri nanekea antahi nomizageno, narimpa ahe'zamo'a tusi'za huno teve rukru nehie. <verse eid="PSA 119:139"/><verse number="140" style="v" sid="PSA 119:140"/>Kagrama huvempama hu'nana nanekeka'ama avamepima erinte'na koana knarezantfa hu'nege'na, Kagri eri'za vahekamo'na tusiza hu'na navesinentoe. <verse eid="PSA 119:140"/><verse number="141" style="v" sid="PSA 119:141"/>Nagra amne nagi omane vahe mani'noge'za, vahe'mo'za huhaviza hunenantaze. Hianagi Kagri kasegea naganera nokanue. <verse eid="PSA 119:141"/><verse number="142" style="v" sid="PSA 119:142"/>Fatgo kavukva zamo'a mevava huno vugahie. Ana hu'neankino Kagri kasegemo'a, fatgo naneke me'ne. <verse eid="PSA 119:142"/><verse number="143" style="v" sid="PSA 119:143"/>Knazamo'a nazeri navesra hianagi, kagri kasegemo nazeri muse nehie. <verse eid="PSA 119:143"/><verse number="144" style="v" sid="PSA 119:144"/>Kagri kasegemo'a maka zupa tamagerfa huno fatgo hu'ne. Kagra naza huge'na ana nanekea antahi ama nehu'na, kasefa hu'na mani'neno.<verse eid="PSA 119:144"/></para>
  <para style="s">Qoph</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="145" style="v" sid="PSA 119:145"/>Ra Anumzamoka nagra nagu'areti hu'na Kagritega zavi krafa hu'na nunamuna nehuanki, nunamuni'a antahinamio. Ana'ma hananke'na kagri tra kea amage antegahue. <verse eid="PSA 119:145"/><verse number="146" style="v" sid="PSA 119:146"/>Kagritega zavi krafa nehuanki, nagu'vazinka naza huge'na, Kagri kasegea amage anta'neno. <verse eid="PSA 119:146"/><verse number="147" style="v" sid="PSA 119:147"/>Kagrama naza hananegura zahufama masama osu'nege'na oti'na Kagritega zavi krafa nehu'na, Kagri nanekere amuhara nehue. <verse eid="PSA 119:147"/><verse number="148" style="v" sid="PSA 119:148"/>Kenage'ma navu'ma omase hari hute'nama nemanuana, na'ankure Kagri nanekegu nagesa antahintahi nehu'na anara nehue. <verse eid="PSA 119:148"/><verse number="149" style="v" sid="PSA 119:149"/>Ra Anumzamoka vagaore mevava kavesi zanteti'ma kavesi nenantana Anumza mani'nananki, zavi krafama nehuana antahi nenaminka, Kagrama hu'nana kante amage antenka nazeri kasefa huge'na nasimura eri'na mani'neno. <verse eid="PSA 119:149"/><verse number="150" style="v" sid="PSA 119:150"/>Kema ontahi vahe'mo'za nazeri haviza hunaku nagritega erava'o nehaze. Ana vahe'mo'za Kagri kasegemofo tava'ontera omani'nazanki afete mani'naze. <verse eid="PSA 119:150"/><verse number="151" style="v" sid="PSA 119:151"/>Ana hu'neanagi Ra Anumzamoka nagri tvaonte mani'nankeno, ana maka Kagri kasegemo'a tamage nanekege me'ne. <verse eid="PSA 119:151"/><verse number="152" style="v" sid="PSA 119:152"/>Nagra korapa'ma Kagri kasegema rempi hu'nama antahi'noana, Kagra kasegeka'agura vagaore mevava hugahie hunka eri fore hankeno me'ne.<verse eid="PSA 119:152"/></para>
  <para style="s">Resh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="153" style="v" sid="PSA 119:153"/>Nagrama natazama e'nerua zana negenka, ana knazampintira nazeri atro. Na'ankure nagra Kagri kasegea naganera nokanue. <verse eid="PSA 119:153"/><verse number="154" style="v" sid="PSA 119:154"/>Nagri kaziga antenka keagafina naza hunka keaga nehunka, Kagrama huvempama hu'nana kante antenka nazeri kasefa nehunka, nasimura namige'na mani'neno. <verse eid="PSA 119:154"/><verse number="155" style="v" sid="PSA 119:155"/>Kefo avu'ava zama nehaza vahe'mo'za zamagu'ma vazizamofona afete nemanizankinka zamagura ovazigahane. Na'ankure ana vahe'mo'za kagri kasegea amagera nontazagu, anara hugahane. <verse eid="PSA 119:155"/><verse number="156" style="v" sid="PSA 119:156"/>Ra Anumzamoka Kagri kasunku zamo'a rankrerfa hu'neanki, kagri kasegemo'ma hu'nea kante antenka nazeri kasefa nehunka, nasimura namige'na mani'neno. <verse eid="PSA 119:156"/><verse number="157" style="v" sid="PSA 119:157"/>Nagri'ma nazeri havizama nehaza vahe'ene knazama nenamiza vahetmina rama'a mani'naze. Hianagi Kagri kasegea atre'na namefira hunomue. <verse eid="PSA 119:157"/><verse number="158" style="v" sid="PSA 119:158"/>Havigema hu'za vahe'ma rezmavatga hazage'zama hazenkema eneriza vahe'ma nezamage'na, amutisanua nagesa nehie. Na'ankure ana vahe'mo'za Kagri nanekea antahi amneza nehaze. <verse eid="PSA 119:158"/><verse number="159" style="v" sid="PSA 119:159"/>Nagrama kagri kasegema navesimanentoa zana nenagenka, Ra Anumzamoka vagaore mevava kavesi zanteti kavesinantenka nasimura namige'na kasefa hu'na mani'neno. <verse eid="PSA 119:159"/><verse number="160" style="v" sid="PSA 119:160"/>Kagri nanekemo'a tamage naneke me'ne. Ana hu'neankino maka fatgo tra kekamo'a vagaore mevava huno vugahie.<verse eid="PSA 119:160"/></para>
  <para style="s">Shin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="161" style="v" sid="PSA 119:161"/>Mago ke agafa'a omane zante ugagota kva vahe'mo'za nazeri haviza nehaze. Hianagi nagu'areti hu'na kagri nanekegura korora nehu'na nagesa antahintahi nehue. <verse eid="PSA 119:161"/><verse number="162" style="v" sid="PSA 119:162"/>Mago vahe'mo'ma tusi fenozama eri nafa'a nehuno musema hiaza hu'na, Kagrama huvempama hu'nana nanekegura tusi muse nehue. <verse eid="PSA 119:162"/><verse number="163" style="v" sid="PSA 119:163"/>Havigema hu avu'ava zankura, nagrira nagonete. Hianagi Kagri kasegea navesi nentoe. <verse eid="PSA 119:163"/><verse number="164" style="v" sid="PSA 119:164"/>Fatgoma hu'nea kasegegura, mago zage knafina 7ni'a zupa Kagrira humuse hunegantoe. <verse eid="PSA 119:164"/><verse number="165" style="v" sid="PSA 119:165"/>Kagri kasegema amage'ma nentaza vahe'mo'za ra zamarimpa frune nemanizankino, mago zamo'a zamazeri tanafara osugahie. <verse eid="PSA 119:165"/><verse number="166" style="v" sid="PSA 119:166"/>Ra Anumzamoka nagu'vazinka etema navresnanku amuhara nehu'na kavega ante'na manine'na, Kagri kasegea amagenentoe. <verse eid="PSA 119:166"/><verse number="167" style="v" sid="PSA 119:167"/>Kagri kasegema nagrama amage'nentoana, na'ankure nagra tusiza hu'na navesinentogu hu'na amageranentoe. <verse eid="PSA 119:167"/><verse number="168" style="v" sid="PSA 119:168"/>Maka kasegeka'ane tra keka'anena nagra amagenentoe. Na'ankure nagra maka'zama nehuana, Kagra ko nagenka antahinka hu'nane.<verse eid="PSA 119:168"/></para>
  <para style="s">Tav</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="169" style="v" sid="PSA 119:169"/>Ra Anumzamoka nagri zavi krafamo'ma Kagrite'ma ne-eana antahi nenaminka, Kagrama huvempama hu'nana kante amage antenka ama' antahi'zana namio. <verse eid="PSA 119:169"/><verse number="170" style="v" sid="PSA 119:170"/>Nagrama nunamuma nehuana antahi nenaminka, kagrama huvempama hu'nana kante antenka nagu nevazinka ete navro. <verse eid="PSA 119:170"/><verse number="171" style="v" sid="PSA 119:171"/>Kagra kasegeka'ama rempima hunenamina zanku hu'na, Kagri kagia husga hunegantoe. <verse eid="PSA 119:171"/><verse number="172" style="v" sid="PSA 119:172"/>Kagri kasegegura nagra zagame hugahue. Na'ankure Kagri kasegemo'a, miko fatgo nanekege me'ne. <verse eid="PSA 119:172"/><verse number="173" style="v" sid="PSA 119:173"/>Kagra kazana rusutenka nazahuo. Na'ankure nagra Kagri kasegema amage antegahue hu'nama huhampri'noanki naza huo. <verse eid="PSA 119:173"/><verse number="174" style="v" sid="PSA 119:174"/>Ra Anumzamoka Kagrama nagu'nevazinka nazama hananku kavega ante'na mani'noe. Ana nehu'na Kagri kasegegura tusiza hu'na musena nehue. <verse eid="PSA 119:174"/><verse number="175" style="v" sid="PSA 119:175"/>Kagra natrege'na ofrina kasefa hu'na manine'na, Kagri kagia ahentesga haneno. Ana nehanugeno Kagri kasegemo naza huno vugahie. <verse eid="PSA 119:175"/><verse number="176" style="v" sid="PSA 119:176"/>Sipisipi afumo'ma hiaza hu'na kana atre'na hazagre'noe. Ana hu'noanki Kagri eri'za vahekamo'na eme hakrenka navro. Na'ankure Kagri kasegegura naganera nokanue.<verse eid="PSA 119:176"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 119"/>
  <chapter number="120" style="c" sid="PSA 120"/>
  <para style="s">Agonaregama mareneri'za nehaza zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 120:1"/>Nagrite'ma knazama fore'ma higena, Ra Anumzamofonte e'na zavi krafa hu'na antahigogeno, nunamuni'a antahi nami'ne. <verse eid="PSA 120:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 120:2"/>Nagra amanage hu'na nunamuna hu'noe. Ra Anumzamoka zamagi'arima nehu'za vahe'ma rezamatgama nehaza vahe tvaontera omanisuanki naza hunka navre atro. <verse eid="PSA 120:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 120:3"/>Havigema nehuta vahe'ma revatagama nehaza vahe'mota, Ra Anumzamo'a naza tamagrira tro huramantegahie? Inankna knaza tamagrira tamigahie? <verse eid="PSA 120:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 120:4"/>Harafa sondia vahe'mokizmia roro hu'nea keve zamireti, tamahe haruharu nehuno, brumu zafamofo teve tankanu'za nerenia erino regasrimprigahie. <verse eid="PSA 120:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 120:5"/>Nagra Meseki mopafima kraga'ma emani'nena nomani'zana mani so'ea osu'noe. Anazanke hu'na afete Kedari mopafima mani'noana, seli nontamimpi nemani'na mani so'ea osu'noe. <verse eid="PSA 120:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 120:6"/>Zamarimpa fruma huno manizanku'ma zamavesrama nehaza vahe'enena zazate mani'noe. <verse eid="PSA 120:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 120:7"/>Nagra ha' osu fru huno mani zankuke nehua neki'na, arimpa fruma huno mani zanku'ma keagama nehuge'za, ha' eri otikege nehaze.<verse eid="PSA 120:7"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 120"/>
  <chapter number="121" style="c" sid="PSA 121"/>
  <para style="s">Anumzamo kva vaheti mani'ne hu'nea zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 121:1"/>Nagra navua kesga hu'na agonaramintega koanagi, inantegati nazamahu vahera egahie? <verse eid="PSA 121:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 121:2"/>Monane mopanema tro'ma hu'nea Ra Anumzantegati naza hu'zana ne-e. <verse eid="PSA 121:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 121:3"/>Agra katre'nigenka regrarinka omasegosane. Na'ankure kagri'ma kegavama hunegantemo'a avura nomasea ne' mani'ne. <verse eid="PSA 121:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 121:4"/>Antahio, tamagerfa huno Israeli vahe'ma kegavama hunezmantemo'a, avu'tokora nosuno avura nomasea ne' mani'ne. <verse eid="PSA 121:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 121:5"/>Ra Anumzamo'a tamagrira kegava huramante'ne. Ra Anumzamo'a tona zafagna huno kagri tvaonte mani'neno, kegava hunegante. <verse eid="PSA 121:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 121:6"/>Zage feru'pima nevnankeno'a zagemo'a tenogasagesigeno, kenage'ma nevnankeno'a, ikamo'a hazenkea ogamigahie. <verse eid="PSA 121:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 121:7"/>Ra Anumzamo'a kagrira kegava hugante'sigenka, so'e hunka nemaninka hazenkea e'origahane. <verse eid="PSA 121:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 121:8"/>Meninteti'ma agafa huteno henkama maninoma vaniana, inantego vunka enka'ma hananana Ra Anumzamo'a avua anteno kegava hugante vava huno vugahie.<verse eid="PSA 121:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 121"/>
  <chapter number="122" style="c" sid="PSA 122"/>
  <para style="s">Ra Anumzamofo ra mono nontega marenerino hu' zagame, Deviti asunte'nea zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 122:1"/>Vahe'mo'za nagrikura hu'za, enketa Ra Anumzamofo mono nontegama vanune hu'za nehazage'na, tusiza hu'na musena nehue. <verse eid="PSA 122:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 122:2"/>Hagi menina Jerusalemia rankafaraminteti ufreta kumapina oti'none. <verse eid="PSA 122:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 122:3"/>Jerusalemi rankumapima me'nea nontamina magopi magopi hu'za eri hankaveti'za ki'nazageno, kuma'mo'a hankavetino knare huno me'ne. <verse eid="PSA 122:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 122:4"/>Ra Anumzamofo vahe Israeli vahe'mo'za trakemo'ma hihoma huno hu'nea kante ante'za, nagate nofite hu'za anantega mareri'za Ra Anumzamofona susu hunente'za, agi ome ahentesga nehaze. <verse eid="PSA 122:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 122:5"/>Hagi mani'neza keagama refko'ma nehaza tratami anantera me'ne. Ana tratamintera Deviti naga'mo'za kinima mani'za esaza kini tratami me'ne. <verse eid="PSA 122:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 122:6"/>Rimpa fruma huno manizankura Jerusalemi rankumakura nunamu hunteho. Jerusalemi kuma'ma avesi nentaza vahe'mo'za makazampina knare hu'za hage'za marerigahaze! <verse eid="PSA 122:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 122:7"/>Jerusalemi kuma'moka kuma keginamofo agu'afina arimpa fru huno mani avu'ava zamo megahie. Ana nehanigeno kini vahe'mofo nontamimpina hazenkea omanesige'za knare hu'za manigahaze. <verse eid="PSA 122:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 122:8"/>Nagrira nafu nagna'zane, rone'nimo'zanema Jerusalemi kumapima mani'naza nagaku nagesa nentahi'na, Jerusalemi kumapina hara omena arimpa fru'za mesanie hu'na nehue. <verse eid="PSA 122:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 122:9"/>Ra Anumzana tagri Anumzamofo mono noma me'nea zanku nagesa nentahi'na, Jerusalemi kuma'mokagura nunamuna nehanugenka maka zampina knare hunka hagenka marerigahane.<verse eid="PSA 122:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 122"/>
  <chapter number="123" style="c" sid="PSA 123"/>
  <para style="s">Ra Anumzamofo ra mono nontega marenerino hu' zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 123:1"/>Ra Anumzamoka monafinka kini trakare manisga hu'nanke'na, nagra navua kesga hu'na negagoe. <verse eid="PSA 123:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 123:2"/>Eri'za vahe'mo'za kva vahe zamimofonte zamavu kete'za nemanizageno, eri'za a'mo'a kvama hunte'nea a'mofonte azama hanigu'ma avuma keteno maniaza huta, Ra Anumzana tagri Anumzamo'ma asumantagi ranteno tazama hanigu, agrite tavua keteta nemanune. <verse eid="PSA 123:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 123:3"/>Ra Anumzamoka kasunku hunerantenka mago'ene kasuragiranto. Na'ankure tagrira tusiza hu'za vahe'mo'za tazeri haviza nehaze. <verse eid="PSA 123:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 123:4"/>Zamavufga rama nehaza vahe'mo'za za'zate tagrira kiza zokago ke hunerantage'za, keontahi vahe'mo'za tagrira tazeri haviza nehaze.<verse eid="PSA 123:4"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 123"/>
  <chapter number="124" style="c" sid="PSA 124"/>
  <para style="s">Ra Anumzamofo ra mono nontega marenerino hu' zagame, Deviti asunte'nea zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 124:1"/>Maka Israeli vahe'mota amanage huta hiho. Ra Anumzamo'ma tagri kazigama omani'neresina, inankna hugahie? <verse eid="PSA 124:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 124:2"/>Ra Anumzamo'ma tagranema omani'nesige'zama ha' vahetimo'zama ha'ma eme hurantesnazana inankna hugahie? <verse eid="PSA 124:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 124:3"/>Ha' vahetimo'zama tusi zamarimpama aherante'naresina, ko e'za magozagama asgahu nakriankna hu'za tagrira eme tavuaga tasgahu nakrizasine. <verse eid="PSA 124:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 124:4"/>Tagrira timo hageno eme tavreno nevigeno, timo tazeri nakariresine. <verse eid="PSA 124:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 124:5"/>Tusi avunema anteno hageno nea timo, tagrira eme tavreno vu'neresine. <verse eid="PSA 124:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 124:6"/>Ra Anumzamofona humuse huntesanune. Na'ankure agra tatrege'za afi zagamo'zama zagagafama ahe'za tragama nehazaza hu'za, ha' vahe'mo'za eme tahe'za traga osu'naze. <verse eid="PSA 124:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 124:7"/>Krifuma anagintegeno azeri'nea namamo'a rugraru'vazino freaza huta, tazeri'nea nofimo'a rukano higeta atreta fre'none. <verse eid="PSA 124:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 124:8"/>Ra Anumzama monane mopane tro'ma hu'nea Anumzamo tagrira taza nehie.<verse eid="PSA 124:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 124"/>
  <chapter number="125" style="c" sid="PSA 125"/>
  <para style="s">Ra Anumzamofo ra mono nontega marenerino hu' zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 125:1"/>Ra Anumzamofonte'ma zamentintima nehaza vahe'mo'za zamagra Saioni Agonama mago zamo'ma azeri tore'ma osigeno, oti hankavematino mevava huno viaza hu'za oti hanavetine'za mani'za vugahaze. <verse eid="PSA 125:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 125:2"/>Agonaramimo'ma Jerusalemi kuma'ma azeri kaginteaza huno, Ra Anumzamo'a vahe'a meninteti'ma agafa huteno vuvavama haniana manigagi zamanteno kegava huzmantegahie. <verse eid="PSA 125:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 125:3"/>Kefo avu'ava zama nehaza vahe'mo'za kva vahera efore hu'za Ra Anumzamofoma amage'ma nentaza vahe'mofo mopa kegava osugahaze. Hanki zamagrama e'ina'ma hanage'za, Anumzamofoma amage'ma nentaza vahe'mo'za, zamagranena zamage ante'za kefo avu'avaza hugahaze. <verse eid="PSA 125:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 125:4"/>Zamagu'amo'ma fatgo hu'nege'za, knare zamavu zamava'ma nehaza vahe'mokizmia, Ra Anumzamoka zamazeri knare huo. <verse eid="PSA 125:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 125:5"/>Hianagi Ra Anumzamoka, kefo avu'ava zama nehaza vahera zamazeri netrenka, anazanke hunka havi avu'ava zama nehaza vahera zamazeri atro. Israeli vahe'mo'za zamarimpa frune manisaze.<verse eid="PSA 125:5"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 125"/>
  <chapter number="126" style="c" sid="PSA 126"/>
  <para style="s">Ra Anumzamofo ra mono nontega marenerino hu' zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 126:1"/>Israeli vahe'ma kinama ome hu'naza vahe'ma Ra Anumzamo'ma ete zamavarenoma Jerusalemi kumate'ma egeta, tagra ava'na negompi huta hu'none. <verse eid="PSA 126:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 126:2"/>Ana zupa tagra tusi kizazokago nehuta, zagame huta muse hu'none. Ana'ma nehunke'za ana zupa kokankoka vahe'mo'za amanage hu'naze. Ra Anumzamo'a ruzahu'za huno Israeli vahera zamaza hie hu'za hu'naze. <verse eid="PSA 126:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 126:3"/>Tamage, Ra Anumzamo'a ruzahu'za huno tagrira taza higeta tusi muse hu'none. <verse eid="PSA 126:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 126:4"/>Negevi hagage kokampima tima enevuno mikazama eri kasefa'ma nehiaza hunka, knare'zanu Ra Anumzamoka ante vitenerantenka tazeri kasefa huo. <verse eid="PSA 126:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 126:5"/>Zavi'manete'za avimzama nehankresaza vahe'mo'za ranke hu'za muse zagame nehu'za ne'zana hamaregahaze. <verse eid="PSA 126:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 126:6"/>Avimzama hankre'naku'ma eri'za kantegama nevu'za, zavitemema nevanamo'za, hozafinti'ma ne'zama hamre'za nontegama eri'za ne-esuza ranke hu'za muse zagamera nehu'za eri'za egahaze.<verse eid="PSA 126:6"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 126"/>
  <chapter number="127" style="c" sid="PSA 127"/>
  <para style="s">Ra Anumzamofo ra mono nontega marenerino hu' zagame, Solomoni asunte'nea zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 127:1"/>Hagi Ra Anumzamo'ma mago noma onkisiana, ana noma kisia kamunta nemofo eri'zamo'a amne zankna hugahie. Hagi Ra Anumzamo'ma mago rankuma'ma kegavama osaniana, kuma kvama nehaza vahe'mokizmi eri'zamo'a, amne zankna hugahie. <verse eid="PSA 127:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 127:2"/>Kagrama ne'zama nesana zanku'ma kamu'nasisima nehunka, nanterame otinka eri'zama e'nerinkeno vuno hanima huno kenage'ma nesegenka nontegama neanana, amne zampi hankaveka'a netrane. Na'ankure Ra Anumzamo'a agrama avesi nezmantea vahera mani frua zamige'za zamura nemsaze. <verse eid="PSA 127:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 127:3"/>Ra Anumzamo'ma mofavreramima neramiana museza neramie. Ana hu'neankino Anumzamo'a asomu hunerante. <verse eid="PSA 127:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 127:4"/>Kasefa ne'mofo mofavreramimo'za harafa vahe'mo'ma azampima keveramima eriaza nehie. <verse eid="PSA 127:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 127:5"/>Keve kupima keveramima eri viteankna huno, rama'a ne' mofavreramima eri fore'ma hu'nesia ne'mo'a muse hugahie. Na'ankure agra agazegura osuno ha' vahe'anena kuma kafantera keaga hugahie.<verse eid="PSA 127:5"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 127"/>
  <chapter number="128" style="c" sid="PSA 128"/>
  <para style="s">Ra Anumzamofo ra mono nontega marenerino hu' zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 128:1"/>Ra Anumzamofoma koro'ma hunente'za agri avu'ava'ma amage'ma nentaza vahe'mo'za muse hugahaze. <verse eid="PSA 128:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 128:2"/>Kagrama kamu'nasisima hunka eri'zama eri'nesana eri'zamofo raga'a, kagraka'a taginka negahane. Ana'ma hanunka asomu'ene knare hunka manigahane. <verse eid="PSA 128:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 128:3"/>Nonka'afina kagri a'mo'a wainimo knare huno rama'a ragama renteankna hugahie. Kagri mofavre naga'mo'zama ne'zama nenaku'ma trate'ma manikagi snazana, mensi nehagea olivi zafagna hu'za manigagi kantegahaze. <verse eid="PSA 128:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 128:4"/>Tamagerfa huno e'inahu zama fore'ma haniana, Ra Anumzamofoma koro'ma hunentaza vahete fore hugahie. <verse eid="PSA 128:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 128:5"/>Ra Anumzamo'a Saioni kumate mani'neno, asomu hugantegahie. Kagrama kasefa'ma hunka manisnana kna'afina, Jerusalemi kumamo'a maka zampina so'e zantfa huno nehagesigenka kegahane. <verse eid="PSA 128:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 128:6"/>Kagra muse hunka mani'nenka mofavre naga kamo'zama kasezamante'naza mofavre nagara zamagegahane. Israeli vahe'mo'za ha'zana omanesige'za fru hu'za manisaze.<verse eid="PSA 128:6"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 128"/>
  <chapter number="129" style="c" sid="PSA 129"/>
  <para style="s">Ra Anumzamofo ra mono nontega marenerino hu' zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 129:1"/>Nagrama mofavrema mani'noreti agafama huteno'ma e'neana, ha' vahe'nimo'za hara eme hunante'za nazeri haviza hutere hu'naze. Ama ana nanekea maka Israeli vahe'mota namage anteta hiho. <verse eid="PSA 129:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 129:2"/>Nagrama mofavrema mani'noreti agafama huteno'ma e'neana, ha' vahenimo'za hara eme hunante'za nazeri haviza hutere hu'naze. Hianagi nagrira hara hunagateore'naze. <verse eid="PSA 129:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 129:3"/>Ha' vahe'mo'zama sefu'ma nami'naza zamo'a nagumpina, hozama antenaku'ma hozafu vahe'mo'za zazate'ma tinkama asazaza huno tinka evu evu hu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 129:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 129:4"/>Hianagi Ra Anumzamo'a fatgo hu'neankino, kefo avu'ava'ma nehaza vahe'mo'zama kinama renante'naza nofira ahekano hutrege'na fru hu'na mani'noe. <verse eid="PSA 129:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 129:5"/>Jerusalemi kuma'ma zamago'ma tenentaza vahera, zamarotago hanage'za rukrahe hu'za nefre'za zamagazegu hanaze. <verse eid="PSA 129:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 129:6"/>Ana vahe'mo'za nomofo agofetu'ma nehagea trazamo'ma mareri za'za osu'neno hagege hiaza hu'za, zamagra zazatera omanine'za hagege hugahaze. <verse eid="PSA 129:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 129:7"/>Ana trazana witima vasage vahe'mo'a azampina eri aviotege, kona anakigera osugosie. <verse eid="PSA 129:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 129:8"/>Hagi zamagri tvaonte'ma vahe'ma enevu'za amanahu asomu nanekea huozmantegahaze. Ra Anumzamo'a asomu huramante'nie. Tagranena Ra Anumzamofo agifi asomu ke huramantone hu'za osugahaze.<verse eid="PSA 129:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 129"/>
  <chapter number="130" style="c" sid="PSA 130"/>
  <para style="s">Ra Anumzamofo ra mono nontega marenerino hu' zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 130:1"/>Ra knazamo refite'nantegena manine'na, Ra Anumzamokarega naza huogu kezanetue. <verse eid="PSA 130:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 130:2"/>Ra Anumzamoka nagerura antahio. Kasunku hunantogu'ma kezamanetuana kagesa antenka antahio. <verse eid="PSA 130:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 130:3"/>Ra Anumzamoka Kagra tagri kumi'ma avontafepima krentantesina, keagama hurantesana zupa Kagrira keagafina, iza kagateregahie? <verse eid="PSA 130:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 130:4"/>Hianagi kagra tagri kumi'ma atrerante'nana zanku huta kagriku korora hugahune. <verse eid="PSA 130:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 130:5"/>Ra Anumzamofonku avega ante'noe. Nagu'amo'a Agriku avega ante'neankina, agri nanekere amuhara nehue. <verse eid="PSA 130:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 130:6"/>Kenage'ma kuma kvama nehaza vahe'mo'zama, ame huno nanterama rumsama hanigu avegama nentazama'a, agatereno nagu'amo'a tusiza huno Ra Anumzamofonkura avega nente. Tamage rumsama hanigu avegama nentazama'a agatereno nagu'amo'a tusiza huno Ra Anumzamofonkura avega nente. <verse eid="PSA 130:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 130:7"/>Israeli vahe'mota Ra Anumzamofonku amuhara hiho. Na'ankure agripina vagaore mevava avesi zamo'ene, vahe'ma agu'vazino ete avre avu'ava zamo'a avite'ne. <verse eid="PSA 130:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 130:8"/>Israeli vahe'mo'zama maka kumi'ma hu'naza zampintira, Ra Anumzamo'a Agrake'za kumizamia eri netreno ete zamavaregahie.<verse eid="PSA 130:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 130"/>
  <chapter number="131" style="c" sid="PSA 131"/>
  <para style="s">Ra Anumzamofo ra mono nontega marenerino hu' zagame Deviti asunte'nea zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 131:1"/>Ra Anumzamoka navufga atahara nosuna, nagra namimiza runafagera nosue. Nagra ranra zanku'ene, nagrama osuga zankura nagesa antahintahia nosue. <verse eid="PSA 131:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 131:2"/>Osi mofavremo'ma zavima ote'noma nerera azampima akoheno maseaza hu'na, akohe'na narimpa frune nemanue. Ana zanke huno nagu'amo'enena fru huno nemane. <verse eid="PSA 131:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 131:3"/>Tamagra Israeli vahe'mota meninteti'ma agafama huno vaniana Ra Anumzamofonte amuhara huvava huta viho.<verse eid="PSA 131:3"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 131"/>
  <chapter number="132" style="c" sid="PSA 132"/>
  <para style="s">Ra Anumzamofo ra mono nontega marenerino hu' zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 132:1"/>Ra Anumzamoka Devitinku'ene, agrama maka knazampima manino e'neazankura kaganera okanio. <verse eid="PSA 132:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 132:2"/>Israeli vahe'mofo Hankavenentake Anumzamoka Deviti'ma huvempagema kagrite'ma hu'neana, <verse eid="PSA 132:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 132:3"/>amanage huno hu'ne, nagra nonirega vu'na, siparera uomasegahue huno hu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 132:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 132:4"/>Nagra atre'nugeno navumo'a toko nosanige'na, navua kesuraki'na omase manine'na, <verse eid="PSA 132:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 132:5"/>Ra Anumzana Israeli vahe'mokizmi hankavenentake Anumzamo'ma manisania nona kite'na, mani frua hugahue hu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 132:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 132:6"/>Tagra Efrata (Betlehemi) kumate'ma manineta huhagerafi huvempage vogisimofo agenkea antahiteta, vuta Ja'ari mopafi me'negeta ome ke'none. <verse eid="PSA 132:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 132:7"/>Anante tagra huta, enketa Anumzamo'ma nemania nontega vuta, Agrama nemania kini tra'mofo agiafi monora huntesanune huta hu'none. <verse eid="PSA 132:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 132:8"/>Ra Anumzamoka otinka Kagri hankavema huhamprino me'nea huhagerafi huvempage vogisimo'ma, Kagrama mani fruma hanana nompima nevanigenka, Kagrane enka ana nompinka umarerio. <verse eid="PSA 132:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 132:9"/>Kagri pristi vahe'mo'za za'za kukenama hiaza huza fatgo avu'ava zana eri nehankre'za, Kagri'ma hankavetiza kamage'ma nentaza vahe'mo'za, ranke hu'za zagamera nehu'za musenkasea hugahaze. <verse eid="PSA 132:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 132:10"/>Kagri eri'za ne' Devitinku kagesa nentahinka, Kagraka'ama masavema frentenka huhampari'nana kini nera kamefira huomio. <verse eid="PSA 132:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 132:11"/>Ra Anumzamo'a Devitina hankave huvempage hunte'neankino, ana huvempagea eri otregahie. Ana huvempa kema hu'neana, kagrama kasezmante'nana mofavre nagapinti mago'mofo huhampri antesnugeno kagri nona erino kinia manigahie, huno hu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 132:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 132:12"/>Hagi kagri ne'mofavre naga'mo'zama, nagrama huhagerafi'noa huvempa kene, kasegenema amage'ma antesageno'a, zamagripinti'ma fore hu anante anante'ma hu'za vanaza mofavre naga'mo'za kinia mani vava hu'za vugahaze. <verse eid="PSA 132:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 132:13"/>Na'ankure Ra Anumzamo'a Saion kuma hunehamprino, Nagri kuma mesie huno hu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 132:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 132:14"/>Ra Anumzamo'a huno, ana kumara nagrama mani fru hanua kuma mevava hugahie. Na'ankure ana kumakura tusiza huno navenesianki'na, anampi nagra manigahue. <verse eid="PSA 132:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 132:15"/>Ana kumapi vahe'mo'zama nazankuro atupa'ma hanaza zana, amne zamazeri knare nehu'na, ana kumapima zamunte omane vahe'ma mani'naza vahera ne'zana zami'nuge'za nezamu hugahaze. <verse eid="PSA 132:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 132:16"/>Hagi Jerusalemima nemaniza pristi vahera za'za kukenama hiaza huna vahe'ma zmaguvazi zana eri hankre zamantegahue. Ana nehanuge'za hankaveti'za namage'ma nentaza vahe'mo'za, ranke hu'za zagamera nehu'za musenkasea hugahaze. <verse eid="PSA 132:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 132:17"/>Hanki Nagra Devitina hankave'a amigahue. Nagrama masavema taginte'na huhamprinte'noa ne'mo nagri vahe'mofo tavira manigahie. <verse eid="PSA 132:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 132:18"/>Nagra agri ha' vahera zamagaze zanu refite zmantegahue. Hianagi agra hihamu masa'ane kini ne' efore hugahie.<verse eid="PSA 132:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 132"/>
  <chapter number="133" style="c" sid="PSA 133"/>
  <para style="s">Ra Anumzamofo ra mono nontega marenerino hu' zagame Deviti asunte'nea zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 133:1"/>Hagi koganamo'zama mago zamarimpa hu'za magopima mani avu'ava zamo'a knare zantfa hu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 133:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 133:2"/>Mago arimpama huno mani avu'ava zamo'a, Aroni asenire masave tagino frentegeno agemazampa azokatega uramino za'za kukena'amofo ananke kante uramiankna nehie. <verse eid="PSA 133:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 133:3"/>Mago arimpa huno mani avu'ava zamo'a, Hemoni agonaregati ata ko'mo, eno Saionima me'nea agonaraminte eme runteaza hu'ne. E'ina kumate Ra Anumzamo'a asomura hunezmante'nige'za, mani vava hugahaze.<verse eid="PSA 133:3"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 133"/>
  <chapter number="134" style="c" sid="PSA 134"/>
  <para style="s">Ra Anumzamofo ra mono nontega marenerino hu' zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 134:1"/>Maka Ra Anumzamofo eri'za vahe'ma, Ra Anumzamofo mono nompima kenage eri'zama e'neriza vahemota Ra Anumzamofona agi'a ahentesga hiho. <verse eid="PSA 134:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 134:2"/>Ana nehuta nunamuma hanafina, tamazana erisga huta ruotage'ma hu'nea mono noma me'nerega hunenteta Ra Anumzamofona agi'a ahentesga hiho. <verse eid="PSA 134:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 134:3"/>Monane mopanema tro'ma hu'nea Ra Anumzamo'a Saioni agonare mani'neno asomu huramantegahie.<verse eid="PSA 134:3"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 134"/>
  <chapter number="135" style="c" sid="PSA 135"/>
  <para style="s">Ra Anumzamofo eri'zanku'ma hu musema huntesaza zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 135:1"/>Ra Anumzamofo eri'za vahe'motma Ra Anumzamofona agi'a ahentesga hiho. Ra Anumzamofona husga hunteho. Ra Anumzamofona agi'a ahentesga hiho. <verse eid="PSA 135:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 135:2"/>Ra Anumzamofo mono nompima omanetiza vahe'ene, tagri Anumzamofo mono nonkumapima oneti'za vahe'mota anara hiho. <verse eid="PSA 135:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 135:3"/>Ra Anumzamofona agi'a ahentesga hiho. Na'ankure Ra Anumzamo'a Agra knare hu'ne. Ra Anumzamofona zagame huta agi'a ahentesga hiho. Na'ankure Agri agimo'a so'e zantfa hu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 135:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 135:4"/>Na'ankure Ra Anumzamo'a Jekopunkura nagri'a suzane huno huhamprinenteno, Israeli vahekura huno nagri marerisa feno zankna hu'za manigahaze huno huhampri zamante'ne. <verse eid="PSA 135:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 135:5"/>Nagrama ke'na antahi'nama huana, Ra Anumzamo'a rankrerfa hu'ne. Ana hu'neankino maka havi anumzantamina zamagatere vagare'ne. <verse eid="PSA 135:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 135:6"/>Ra Anumzamo'a monafino, ama mopafino, hagerimofo agofeturo, hagerimofo agu'afinema nazano tro hunaku'ma hiazana amne nehie. <verse eid="PSA 135:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 135:7"/>Agra higeno mopama ome atretegatira hampomo'a eri tru huno marenerigeno, ko'ene kopasi'nanena atregeno ne-e. Ana nehuno fenoma nentea noma'afinti zahora atregeno ne-e. <verse eid="PSA 135:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 135:8"/>Isipi vahe'mokizmi agonesa mofavreramine, afukra zamifintira agonesa anenta'araminena maka ome zamahetre eme zmahetre hu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 135:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 135:9"/>Isipi vahe'mota tamagri amu'nompi, Feronte'ene, Fero eri'za vahetera kaguva zane, avamezanena eri fore huno zamazeri haviza hu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 135:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 135:10"/>Kokankokama mani'naza vahera ome zmahetre eme zmahetre nehuno, hankavenentake kini vahera zamahe fri'ne. <verse eid="PSA 135:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 135:11"/>Ana kini vahera, Amori vahe kini ne' Sihonima, Basani vahe kini ne' Ogima, maka Kenani mopafima mani'naza kini vahe'taminena zamahe hana hu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 135:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 135:12"/>Ana huteno ana vahe'mokizmi mopa Agra vahe Israeli nagara eri zamige'za erisanti hare'naze. <verse eid="PSA 135:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 135:13"/>Ra Anumzamoka kagri kagimo'a maka kna mevava huno nevie. Maka vahe'ma forehu anante nante'ma hu'za vanaza vahe'mo'za Ra Anumzamoka Kagri kavukva zankura antahigami'za vugahaze. <verse eid="PSA 135:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 135:14"/>Na'ankure Ra Anumzamo'a vahe'a refko huno nezamageno, eri'za vahe'a asunku huzmantegahie. <verse eid="PSA 135:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 135:15"/>Kaza osu havi anumzantamina, silvareti'ene golireti vahe'mo'za avako hu'za zamazanteti tro hunte'naze. <verse eid="PSA 135:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 135:16"/>Ana havi anumzaramina zamagira me'neanagi, keaga nosu'za, zamavua me'neanagi zamavua nonke'za, <verse eid="PSA 135:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 135:17"/>zamagesa me'neanagi keaga nontahiza, zamagona me'neanagi zamasimura nontaze. <verse eid="PSA 135:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 135:18"/>Hagi ana kaza osu havi anumzantamima tro'ma hu'naza vahe'ene, ana zantaminte'ma zamentintima nehaza vahe'mo'zanena, ana kaza osu havi anumzankna hugahaze. <verse eid="PSA 135:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 135:19"/>Israeli vahe'mota Ra Anumzamofo agi'a ahentesga nehinke'za, Aroni naga'nofi'ma pristi eri'zama e'neriza naga'mo'za Ra Anumzamofo agi'a ahentesga hiho. <verse eid="PSA 135:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 135:20"/>Livae naga nofi'mota Ra Anumzamofo agi'a ahentesga nehinke'za, iza'zo Ra Anumzamofonku'ma koro hunente'za vahe'mo'za Agri agoragama nemanisaza vahe'mo'za Ra Anumzamofo agi'a ahentesga hiho. <verse eid="PSA 135:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 135:21"/>Saioni agonare'ma mani'naza vahe'mota Ra Anumzamofona agi'a ahentesga hiho. Na'ankure Agra ama ana Jerusalemi kumapi nemanie. Ra Anumzamofo agi'a ahentesga hiho.<verse eid="PSA 135:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 135"/>
  <chapter number="136" style="c" sid="PSA 136"/>
  <para style="s">Ra Anumzamofoma susu hunte zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 136:1"/>Ra Anumzamofona susu huntesune, na'ankure Agra knare hu'ne. Anumzamofona vagaore avesizama'amo'a mevava huno vugahie. <verse eid="PSA 136:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 136:2"/>Anumzana susu huta humuse huntesune. Na'ankure Anumzamofona vagaore avesizama'amo'a mevava huno vugahie. <verse eid="PSA 136:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 136:3"/>Ra Anumzamofona susu hunteta husga huntesune, Agra maka ama mopafi ranra vahetmimofo Ra Anumza mani'ne. Na'ankure Anumzamofona vagaore avesizama'amo'a mevava huno vugahie. <verse eid="PSA 136:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 136:4"/>Agrake'za hankavenentake kaguvazana eri fore nehigu, Agrike'za susu hunenteta humuse huntesanune. Na'ankure vagaore avesizama'amo'a mevava huno vugahie. <verse eid="PSA 136:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 136:5"/>Monafima me'nea zantamima Agra'a antahintahireti'ma tro'ma hunte'nea Anumzamofona susu huta humuse huntesanune. Na'ankure vagaore avesizama'amo'a mevava huno vugahie. <verse eid="PSA 136:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 136:6"/>Ama mopama tro huteno, timofo agofetu'ma antegeno'ma me'nea Anumzamofona susu huta humuse huntesanune. Na'ankure vagaore avesizama'amo'a mevava huno vugahie. <verse eid="PSA 136:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 136:7"/>Monafima me'neno remsa nehia tavitamima tro'ma hunte'nea Anumzamofona susu hunteta humuse huntesanune. Na'ankure vagaore avesizama'amo'a mevava huno vugahie. <verse eid="PSA 136:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 136:8"/>Zagema tro'ma hunte'neana, masama kegavama hu'neno remsa haniegu tro hunte'ne. Na'ankure vagaore avesizama'amo'a mevava huno vugahie. <verse eid="PSA 136:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 136:9"/>Ikane hanafi'taminema tro'ma hunte'neana, kenage kegava hune'za, remsa hanazegu tro hunte'ne. Na'ankure Agrama oratreno avesirante vavama nehia zamo'a, vagaore mevava huno vugahie. <verse eid="PSA 136:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 136:10"/>Isipi vahe'mokizmi agonesa mofavreramima zamahe hana'ma hu'nea Anumzamofona susu hunteta humuse huntesanune. Na'ankure Agrama oratreno avesirante vavama nehia zamo'a, vagaore mevava huno vugahie. <verse eid="PSA 136:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 136:11"/>Israeli vahera Isipi mopafintira Agra zamavareno atiramige'za e'naze. Na'ankure Agrama oratreno avesirante vavama nehia zamo'a, vagaore mevava huno vugahie. <verse eid="PSA 136:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 136:12"/>Agra Hankavenentake azanteti rusuteno zamavareno e'ne. Na'ankure Agrama oratareno avesirante vavama nehia zamo'a, vagaore mevava huno vugahie. <verse eid="PSA 136:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 136:13"/>Koranke hagerima eri rupapama hugantigama hu'nea Anumzamofona susu huta humuse huntesanune. Na'ankure Agrama oratreno avesirante vavama nehia zamo'a, vagaore mevava huno vugahie. <verse eid="PSA 136:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 136:14"/>Ana'ma huteno'a ana hagerimofo amu'nompi Israeli vahera zamavareno vu'ne. Na'ankure Agrama oratreno avesirante vavama nehia zamo'a, vagaore mevava huno vugahie. <verse eid="PSA 136:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 136:15"/>Hianagi Ferone sondia vahe'a koranke hagerimpi zamaherege'za tinakri'za fri'naze. Na'ankure Agrama oratreno, avesirante vavama nehia zamo'a vagaore mevava huno vugahie. <verse eid="PSA 136:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 136:16"/>Agra vahe'ama zamavareno, vahe omani ka'ma kokampima e'nea Anumzamofona susu huta humuse huntesanune. Na'ankure Agrama oratreno avesirante vavama nehia zamo'a, vagaore mevava huno vugahie. <verse eid="PSA 136:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 136:17"/>Hankave kini vahetmima zamahe hana'ma hu'nea Anumzamofona susu huta humuse huntesanune. Na'ankure Agrama oratareno avesirante vavama nehia zamo'a, vagaore mevava huno vugahie. <verse eid="PSA 136:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 136:18"/>Zamagimo'ma mareri'nea kini vahetamina zamahe fri vagare'ne. Na'ankure Agrama oratareno avesirante vavama nehia zamo'a, vagaore mevava huno vugahie. <verse eid="PSA 136:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 136:19"/>Amori vahe kini ne' Sihonina ahe fri'ne. Na'ankure Agrama oratareno avesirante vavama nehia zamo'a, vagaore mevava huno vugahie. <verse eid="PSA 136:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 136:20"/>Basani vahe kini ne' Oginena ahe fri'ne. Na'ankure Agrama oratreno avesirante vavama nehia zamo'a, vagaore mevava huno vugahie. <verse eid="PSA 136:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 136:21"/>Ana'ma huteno'a Anumzamo'a ana kini vahe'mokizmi mopa, erisantiharesaze huno Agra vahe'a erizami'ne. Na'ankure Agrama oratareno avesirante vavama nehia zamo'a, vagaore mevava huno vugahie. <verse eid="PSA 136:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 136:22"/>Agri eri'za vahe Israeli vahe'mo'za ama ana mopa erisanti haregahaze huno zami'ne. Na'ankure Agrama oratreno avesirante vavama nehia zamo'a, vagaore mevava huno vugahie. <verse eid="PSA 136:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 136:23"/>Tagri hankavemo'ma evuramigetama manuna knafina Agra aganera kaninoramie. Na'ankure Agrama oratreno avesirante vavama nehia zamo'a, vagaore mevava huno vugahie. <verse eid="PSA 136:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 136:24"/>Agra tagri ha' vahe'mokizmi zamazampinti tagu'vazino ete neravare. Na'ankure Anumzamo'ma oratareno avesirante vavama nehia zamo'a, vagaore mevava huno vugahie. <verse eid="PSA 136:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 136:25"/>Anumzamo'a maka vahe'ene zagagafanena ne'zana nezamie. Na'ankure Agrama oratreno avesirante vavama nehia zamo'a, vagaore mevava huno vugahie. <verse eid="PSA 136:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 136:26"/>Monafinkama nemania Anumzamofona susu huta humuse huntesanune. Na'ankure Agrama oratreno avesirante vavama nehia zamo'a, vagaore mevava huno vugahie.<verse eid="PSA 136:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 136"/>
  <chapter number="137" style="c" sid="PSA 137"/>
  <para style="s">Israeli vahe'mo'za ru mopafi mani'neza mopazmigu nentahi'za zavite'naza zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 137:1"/>Babilonima me'nea tintamimofo ankenarega mani'neta, Jerusalemi kumakura tagesa nentahita zavira te'none. <verse eid="PSA 137:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 137:2"/>Zavenama neheta zagame'ma nehuna hapuramina, wilo zafaramimpi runtani'none. <verse eid="PSA 137:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 137:3"/>Na'ankure kinama hurante'naza vahe'mo'za tagrikura, zagame nehinketa antahisune hu'za kazikazi hu'naze. Tatama tami'za tazeri havizama nehaza vahe'mo'za hu'za Saioni agonamofo agirevare zagamera nehinketa musena hamneno hu'za tutu hu'naze. <verse eid="PSA 137:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 137:4"/>Ana hianagi ru vahe mopafima emani'nonana inankna huta Ra Anumzamofo zagamera hugahune? <verse eid="PSA 137:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 137:5"/>Nagrama Jerusalemi kuma'mokagu'ma nagane'ma kanisugeno'a, naza tamaga'amo'ma eri'zama e'neria eri'zana mago'enena e'origahie. <verse eid="PSA 137:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 137:6"/>Nagrama Jerusalemi kuma'mokagu'ma nagane'ma nekani'na, Jerusalemi kuma'mokagu'ma ugota musezani'a mani'nane hu'nama osanugeno'a, nagefunamo'a marerino navagu'nafare ome rukamaresie. <verse eid="PSA 137:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 137:7"/>Babiloni vahe'mo'zama Jerusalemi kuma'ma ha'ma eme hunte'za eri'za zupama, Idomu vahe'mo'za hu'za, Jerusalemi kumara maka tapage tapagu hutrenkeno havizantfa hinoma hu'za kezama ati'naza zankura, Ra Anumzamoka kaganera okanio. <verse eid="PSA 137:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 137:8"/>Babiloni kuma'moka havizantfa hugahananki kagesa antahio. Tagrite'ma hurante'nana avu'ava zante'ma, nonama hugantesia vahe'mo'a muse hugahie. <verse eid="PSA 137:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 137:9"/>Ana'ma hania vahe'mo'a Babiloni kuma'moka ne'onse mofavre nagaka'a zamazeriteno, haveraminte ruhapakopatino zmahegahie.<verse eid="PSA 137:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 137"/>
  <chapter number="138" style="c" sid="PSA 138"/>
  <para style="s">Ra Anumzamofoma susu hunenteno hu' zagame Deviti asunte'nea zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 138:1"/>Ra Anumzamoka nagu'areti susu hu'na humuse hunegantoe. Havi anumzantamimofo zamavufi zagamera nehu'na, kagri kagi'a ahentesga hugahue. <verse eid="PSA 138:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 138:2"/>Ruotagema hu'nea mono nonka'amofo avugama kepri hu'na kagia ahentesga nehu'na, susuma hunegantoana vagaore mevava kavesi zanka'agu anara nehue. Na'ankure Kagrama huvempama hu'nana naneke ka'amo rankagia negamie. <verse eid="PSA 138:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 138:3"/>Nagrama nunamuma nehugenka nagri nunamuntera nona nehunka, naza hunka nazeri hankavetinke'na hankaveti'na mani'noe. <verse eid="PSA 138:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 138:4"/>Maka ama mopafima mani'naza kini vahe'mo'za Ra Anumzamoka humuse hu'za susu hugantegahaze. Na'ankure kagri nanekema antahinuza anara hugahaze. <verse eid="PSA 138:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 138:5"/>Ana nehu'za Ra Anumzamoka kagri kavukva zankura zagamepi erinte'za zagame hugahaze. Na'ankure Ra Anumzamoka hihamu masazamo'a rankrerfa hu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 138:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 138:6"/>Ra Anumzamo'a marerisa Anumza mani'neankino, zamavufagama anterami'za maniza vahera kegava hunezmanteanagi, zamavufagama erisga nehaza vahera afeteti ko zamageno antahino nehie. <verse eid="PSA 138:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 138:7"/>Tusi knazamo nazeri kagige'na nemanugenka naza nehane. Ha' vahenimo'za tusi zamarimpa ahenantegahazanagi, Kagra kegava hunantegahane. Kagra tamaga kaziga kazana rusutenka nagu'nevazine. <verse eid="PSA 138:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 138:8"/>Ra Anumzamokama nazano nagri nomani'zampima fore hugahiema hunkama huvempama hu'nana zantamina, eri fore hugahane. Na'ankure Ra Anumzamoka vagaore kavesi zamo'a mevava huno nevie. Kagra kazampinti nagrira nazeri fore hu'nananki kamefira huonamio.<verse eid="PSA 138:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 138"/>
  <chapter number="139" style="c" sid="PSA 139"/>
  <para style="s">Anumzamo'a ko tagrira antahino keno hu'nea huno Deviti asunte'nea zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 139:1"/>Ra Anumzamoka nagra inanknahu vahe mani'noe, ko nagri nagu'a rezaganenka ke'nane. <verse eid="PSA 139:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 139:2"/>Nagrama manuampi, otuampi Kagra ko nagenka antahinka nehunka, afete mani'noanagi, Kagra nagri antahi'zana ko keama hu'nane. <verse eid="PSA 139:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 139:3"/>Kama vano nehufine, navu'ma masofinena Kagra kavua antenka nenagenka, maka navu'nava zama huana, ko nagenka antahinka hu'nane. <verse eid="PSA 139:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 139:4"/>Maka nanekea osu'nogenka, e'i naneke hugahie hunka Ra Anumzamoka ko antahinka kenka hu'nane. <verse eid="PSA 139:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 139:5"/>Kagra navugane namefi'ene nevunka, kazanteti refite'nante'nane. <verse eid="PSA 139:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 139:6"/>Kagri antahi'zamo'a so'e zantfa huno mareri agatere'neankina, nagra antahi amara osugahue! <verse eid="PSA 139:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 139:7"/>Nagra Kagri Avamura atre'na iga vugahue? Nagra Kagri kvatetira atre'na korora fre'na, iga ome frakigahue? <verse eid="PSA 139:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 139:8"/>Hagi nagrama monafima marerisuana, Kagra ko monafina mani'nane. Nagrama fri'na fri vahe kumapima vanuana, Kagra ko anampina mani'nane. <verse eid="PSA 139:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 139:9"/>Hagi nanterama zahufa zagema nehanatina, nagrama nageko'na huntesige'na hare'na vu'na hagerimofo amu'nompima me'nea mopafi umanuresina, <verse eid="PSA 139:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 139:10"/>anantega kegava hunenantenka nazeri ako'na hasine. <verse eid="PSA 139:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 139:11"/>Hagi tamagerfa hunka hani zamoka eme nazeri fra'nekigeno, zage ferupinagi ame hunka hani zamoka enka eme nazeri kagio hu'nama huresina, <verse eid="PSA 139:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 139:12"/>ana hanimo'a Kagri kavurera nazeri frara okiresine. Ana nehigeno hanimo'a, Kagri kavurera masa huno zage ferukna hanigeno, hanimo'ene msamo'enena Kagri kavurera mago zanke hu'na'e. <verse eid="PSA 139:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 139:13"/>Na'ankure maka nagu'a navufga Kagra tro hunante'nane. Ana hutenka antanimofo rimpafima mani'nogenka maka navufga Kagra rehatinante'nane, <verse eid="PSA 139:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 139:14"/>Kagrama nagrima tro'ma hunanana, so'e' zantfa hunku tro hunante'naku muse hunegantoe. Kagrama eri'nana eri'zamo'a, knare huno so'e zantfa hu'ne. Ana hu'neanki'na e'i ana zana nagra ke'na antahi'na hu'noe. <verse eid="PSA 139:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 139:15"/>Kagri kavurera frara oki'noanki, maninenka nenagankeno oku'a nenrera arimpafina zaferinani'mo'a eme rekanuhe rekanuhe nehige'na fore hu'noe. <verse eid="PSA 139:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 139:16"/>Nenrera'a kase onante'negenka, ko nagrira nagenka antahinka hu'nane. Ama mopafima kasefa'ma hu'na manisanua kna'afima tro'ma hanua zana, maka knamo'a ome'negenka maka zana ko avontafepi krente'nane. <verse eid="PSA 139:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 139:17"/>Anumzamoka nagriku'ma nentahina antahizamo'a, soe'zantfa huno mareri agetere'ne. Ana hu'neanki'na ana maka zantamina hampari'na kegara osu'noe. <verse eid="PSA 139:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 139:18"/>Hagi ana maka zana hampari'na kegahue hu'na hugahuanagi, hagerimofo ankenarega me'nea kaseparamina ana zantamimo'a rugatere'ne. Hagi mase'nofinti'ma omatuana Kagra magoka nagrane mani'nane. <verse eid="PSA 139:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 139:19"/>Anumzamoka nagri'ma navenesiana, havi avu'ava zama nehaza vahe'ma zamahe frisanana knare hugahie. Hazenkema eri hakarema huta vahe korama eri neragiza vahe'mota, nagri navatetira atreta afete viho. <verse eid="PSA 139:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 139:20"/>Ana vahe'mo'za Anumzamoka Kagrira huhaviza hunegante'za, ha'ma renegantaza vahe'mo'za Kagri kagi'a amnene amnene nehaze. <verse eid="PSA 139:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 139:21"/>Ra Anumzamoka Kagri'ma kavesinogantaza vahera nagra navesra hunezmante'na, kagri'ma ha'ma renegantaza vahera zamage henkami atregahue. <verse eid="PSA 139:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 139:22"/>Nagra tamagerfa hu'na ana vahera tusi narimpa ahenezmante'na, ana vahe'ma nezamage'na nagri ha' vahe mani'naze hu'na nehue. <verse eid="PSA 139:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 139:23"/>Anumzamoka nagri nagu'a rezaganenka keama nehunka, antahintahi hakare'ma nehua zana renahenka ko. <verse eid="PSA 139:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 139:24"/>Anumzamoka krimpa knazama erigami navu'navazama nagripima me'nesiana refkohu so'e hunka nenagenka, manivava asimu'ma erino mani kante navrenka vuo.<verse eid="PSA 139:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 139"/>
  <chapter number="140" style="c" sid="PSA 140"/>
  <para style="s">Anumzamo'ma kegava huntesigu Deviti hu'nea nunamu zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 140:1"/>Ra Anumzamoka havi avu'ava zama nehaza vahe'mokizmi zamazampintira nagu'nevazinka, hazenke vahe'mo'zama hazenkema namizankura kegava hunanto. <verse eid="PSA 140:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 140:2"/>Ana vahe'mo'za havi avu'ava zama hanaza zanke zamagu'afina retro nehu'za, maka zupa ha' hiho hu'za vahera zamarimpa revava nehaze. <verse eid="PSA 140:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 140:3"/>Keagama haza nanekemo'a, osifavemofo agefunamo'ma asaneankna nehu'za, ha' osifavemofo avu'atga zamo zamagipina avite'neanki'za vahera zamazeri haviza hu keaga nehaze. <verse eid="PSA 140:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 140:4"/>Ra Anumzamoka havi avu'ava zama nehaza vahe'mo'zama nazeri havizama hu'zankura kegava hunanto. Hazenkema eri hakarema nehaza vahe'mo'zama hazenkema nami'zankura kegava hunanto, na'ankure nagrira nazeri haviza hunaku oku'a keaga retro nehaze. <verse eid="PSA 140:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 140:5"/>Zamavufga rama nehaza vahe'mo'za, nagrima nazerinakura kukona antenenante'za, kama vano nehufina krifua anaginentaze. <verse eid="PSA 140:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 140:6"/>Ra Anumzamoka Kagrikura, nagri Anumza mani'nane hu'na nehuanki, Ra Anumzamoka kasunku hunantogu'ma nunamuma nehanugenka, kagesa antenka nentahinka nunamuni'a antahinamio. <verse eid="PSA 140:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 140:7"/>Anumzana nagri Ra Anumzamoka Kagra hankavenentake hu'nanankinka nagura vazinka ete nenavrane. Ha' knafina kagra hankogna hunka anteso hunenantenka, kegava hunante'nane. <verse eid="PSA 140:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 140:8"/>Ra Anumzamoka havi avu'ava zama nehaza vahe'mo'za nazano erinakura tusiza huno zamave'nesianagi, zamatrege'za anazana e'oriho. Ana nehunka havi avu'ava zama hunaku'ma kema retro'ma hanaza zana eri atregeno, anazana forera osuno. Na'ankure ana'ma osnanke'za zamagra zamavufaga erisga hugahaze. <verse eid="PSA 140:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 140:9"/>Nagri'ma ha'ma renenantaza vahera, zamatregeno nagri'ma nazeri haviza hunaku'ma nanekema retro'ma nehaza zamo'a zamagrite efore huno zamazeri haviza hino. <verse eid="PSA 140:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 140:10"/>Kagra teve nefake tankanu'za, atregeno ana vahe agofetura eramino. Ana nehunka ana vahera zamazeri atrege'za tevefi vuge, tinkerifi uramige nehu'za, korora fre'za atioramiho. <verse eid="PSA 140:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 140:11"/>Havigema nehaza vahera zamatrege'za tagri mopafina manine'za, maka zampina knarera osiho. Hazenkema eri hakarema nehaza vahera, knazamo zamavaririno zamazeri haviza hino. <verse eid="PSA 140:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 140:12"/>Hianagi nagra ke'na antahi'na hu'noankino, knama zami'za zamazeri havizama nehaza vahera Ra Anumzamo'a zamaza nehuno, zamunte omane vahera knare huno zamaza nehie. <verse eid="PSA 140:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 140:13"/>Tamagerfa hu'za fatgo avu'ava zama nehaza vahe'mo'za, Anumzamoka kagi'a husga hugantegahaze. Ana nehanage'za Kagri kavukva zama amagemanentaza vahe'mo'za, kagrane magoka manigahaze.<verse eid="PSA 140:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 140"/>
  <chapter number="141" style="c" sid="PSA 141"/>
  <para style="s">Kinagama hu nunamu zagame Deviti hu'nea zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 141:1"/>Ra Anumzamoka Kagritega kezanetuanki, ame hunka nagritega eno. Kagritega zavi krafama nehuana, nentahinka eme nazahuo. <verse eid="PSA 141:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 141:2"/>Mana nentake'za insensima kre mna nevazagenka negenka musema nehanaza hunka, nagrama nunamuma nehua nunamuntera muse huo. Zagema unefrege'za kinagama ofama kresramna nehazaza hu'na, nazana erisga nehuanki antahinamio. <verse eid="PSA 141:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 141:3"/>Ra Anumzamoka keagama hanufina, nagitera kegava hunanto. <verse eid="PSA 141:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 141:4"/>Natrege'na havi avu'ava zama hu'zantera narimpamo'a oti'otira nosanigeno, havi avu'ava zama nehaza vahera zamage ante'na ana avu'ava zana osa'neno. Ana nehunka hazenkema nehaza vahe'mo'zama ne'zama nene'za musema hanafina omanisue. <verse eid="PSA 141:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 141:5"/>Fatgo avu'ava'ma nehia vahe'mo'ma navesinenanteno'ma sefu'ma namino nazeri fatgoma haniana knare hu'ne. E'inahu avu'ava zamo'a vahe'mofo asenire maseve tagino frenteankna hu'neanki'na, i'o hu'na osugahue. Hianagi havi ava'ava zama nehaza vahekura, ana avu'avazamirera nona huzamanto hu'na, nunamuna huvava nehue. <verse eid="PSA 141:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 141:6"/>Keagama refkoma nehaza kva vahera zamazerite'za matevu zamatresage'za zavenipi uramigahaze. Ana'ma hanage'za ana havi avu'ava zama nehaza vahe'mo'zama ke'za antahi'zama hanazana, nagrama hu'noa nanekegura tamage naneke hu'ne hu'za hugahaze. <verse eid="PSA 141:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 141:7"/>Mopama reko'neria bulimakao afumo'ma, mopama reko'nerino havema refaragu'ma vaziaza huno, havi avu'ava zama nehaza vahe'mokizmi zaferinamo'a, fri vahe kerimofo avazare ruherafino vuno eno hugahie. <verse eid="PSA 141:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 141:8"/>Hianagi Ra Anumzana, Anumzanimoka kagrite navua kete'na nemanue. Kagrake'za fraki kumani'a mani'nanku, zamatrege'za nahe ofriho. <verse eid="PSA 141:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 141:9"/>Nagri'ma nazerinaku'ma havi avu'ava zama nehaza vahe'mo'zama anaginte'naza krifumo'a, atregeno naze'orino. <verse eid="PSA 141:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 141:10"/>Havi avu'ava zama nehaza vahera zamatrege'za, zamagra'ama frakinte'naza kukompi ufreho. Ana nehanage'na nagrira mago zamo'a nazeri haviza osanige'na, knare hu'na vugahue.<verse eid="PSA 141:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 141"/>
  <chapter number="142" style="c" sid="PSA 142"/>
  <para style="s">Havegampi mani'neno Deviti asunte'nea zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 142:1"/>Ra Anumzamofontega ranke hu'na kezanetue. Ana nehu'na Ra Anumzamo asunku hunanteno naza haniegu agritega ranke hu'na nunamuna nehue. <verse eid="PSA 142:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 142:2"/>Anumzamofo avuga knazani'a eri'na ne-ena, knazani'aramina Agri avure eri'na eme nesamue. <verse eid="PSA 142:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 142:3"/>Nagu'amo'ma tusi knama nehigenka, nagra na'a hugahufi Kagra ko nagenka antahinka hu'nane. Nagrama kama vanoma nehufina vahe'mo'za nagri nazerinakura krifua eme anagi fraki'naze. <verse eid="PSA 142:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 142:4"/>Vahe'mo'zama eme naza hanagu navua omente emente hu'noanagi, mago vahe'mo'e huno eme naza osu'ne. Ana hige'na fra'ma kisanua kumaku hake'noanagi, mago vahe'mo'e huno asunkura hunanteno naza osu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 142:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 142:5"/>Ra Anumzamoka naza huogu Kagritega nunamuna nehuanki, Kagrake'za fra'ma kisanua kumara mani'nane hu'na nehuankinka, ofri'na kase'fama hu'na manisanua kna'afina Kagrake'za nomani zanifina manigahane. <verse eid="PSA 142:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 142:6"/>Naza huogu'ma krafagema nehuana, kagesa antenka antahinamio. Na'ankure ranknazamo narefitege'na mani'noanki, nazeri havizama hunaku'ma narotagoma nehaza vahe zamazampintira nagu'vazinka ete navro. Na'ankure zamagri hankavemo'a, nagri hankavea agatere'ne. <verse eid="PSA 142:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 142:7"/>Nagrira kinafintira katufenanto. Ana'ma hananke'na Kagri kagia ahena susu nehu'na humuse hugantegahue. Nagri'ma rama'a knare kavukvama hunantana avu'ava zanku, Kagri kavu'kava zama amage'ma nentaza vahe'mo'za e'za eme nazeri kagigahaze.<verse eid="PSA 142:7"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 142"/>
  <chapter number="143" style="c" sid="PSA 143"/>
  <para style="s">Anumzamo aza haniegu Deviti nunamu hu'nea zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 143:1"/>Ra Anumzamoka nazama hananegu'ma nunamuma nehuana kagesa antenka antahio. Na'ankure Kagra tamage hunka hugahue hunkama nehanaza nehunka, fatgo kavukva'ma nehana Anumzamoka nunamuni'a antahinaminka nona hunanto. <verse eid="PSA 143:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 143:2"/>Nagra Kagri eri'za vahe mani'noanki, refkoa huonanto. Na'ankure mago vahe'mo'e huno Kagri kavurera fatgo huno hazenke'a omane vahera omani'ne. <verse eid="PSA 143:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 143:3"/>Ha' vahe'nimo'za nagenere'za nazerite'za, nahetrazage'na mopafi mase'noe. Ana hute'za natrazage'na fri' vahe'mo'zama fri' vahe kumapima nemanizaza hu'na hanizampi mani'noe. <verse eid="PSA 143:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 143:4"/>Ana hazageno nagu'amo'a evuramigeno hankaveni'a omane amne hige'na antahintahi hakare nehu'na koro hu'noe. <verse eid="PSA 143:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 143:5"/>Korapa'ma fore'ma hu'nea zankura nagesa nentahi'na, kagrama tro'ma hunte'nana zanku'ene, kzampinti'ma eri fore'ma hu'nana zankura nagesa antahintahi nehue. <verse eid="PSA 143:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 143:6"/>Nazana erisga hu'na nunamuna kagritega nehue. Mopamo'ma hagage huno tinku'ma avesiaza hu'na, Kagrikura tusiza huno nave'nesie. <verse eid="PSA 143:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 143:7"/>Ra Anumzamoka nagri nunamuntera ame hunka nona hunanto. Na'ankure nagu'mo'a evu neramie. Nagrira natrenka kamefira huonamio. Ana'ma hananke'na nagra fri'na haviza hugahue. <verse eid="PSA 143:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 143:8"/>Natrege'na maka nanterana vagaore mevava kavesi'zankura nagesa antahigami'neno. Na'ankure namentintia Kagrite nehugu, kama vanua kana naveri huo. Na'ankure nagrani'a Kagri kazampi nentoe. <verse eid="PSA 143:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 143:9"/>Ra Anumzamoka ha' vahe'nifintira nagu'vazio. Na'ankure kagripinka frakinaku nagare'na neoe. <verse eid="PSA 143:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 143:10"/>Rempi hunamige'na kagri kavesi zana amagera anta'neno. Na'ankure nagri Anumza Kagra mani'nane. Atregeno Kagri so'e Avamu'mo navareno fatgo hu'nesia kante vino. <verse eid="PSA 143:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 143:11"/>Ra Anumzamoka rankagika'agu kagesa nentahinka, nagrira ete kegava hunanto. Kagra fatgo kavukva nehana Anumza mani'nanku, knazampintira naza hunka nazeri atro. <verse eid="PSA 143:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 143:12"/>Vagaore mevava kavesi zanteti kavesi nante'nananki, ha'ma renenantaza vahe'ene, nazeri haviza hunaku'ma nehaza vahera zamazeri haviza hugahane. Na'ankure nagra Kagri eri'za vahe mani'noe.<verse eid="PSA 143:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 143"/>
  <chapter number="144" style="c" sid="PSA 144"/>
  <para style="s">Deviti'a Ra Anumzamo aza higeno ha'ma agatere'nea zanku susu hunte'nea zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 144:1"/>Ra Anumzamo'a nagri hankave have mani'negu hu'na Agri agi'a husga huntegahue. Agrake'za nazane nazankonena eri hankavenetino, ha'ma hu'zana rempi hunenamie. <verse eid="PSA 144:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 144:2"/>Agra vagaore avesizama'areti avesinenantea Anumza mani'neankino, hankave vihuni'a mani'ne. Agrake'za fraki kumani'a mani'neno, nagura'vazino ete nenavre. Agra hankoni'a mani'negena, agripinka fraki'na nemanugeno, ru moparega vahetamina zamazeri nagafi atrege'na kegava hunezamantoe. <verse eid="PSA 144:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 144:3"/>Vahera tagra nankna zaga mani'nonkenka, Ra Anumzamoka kegava hunerantenka, vahetfankura antahintahi hakarea nehane? <verse eid="PSA 144:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 144:4"/>Na'ankure vahe'ma mani'nonana, vahe'mo agonafinti magoke zupa asimu antegeno viankna nehuta, zage rentegeno vahe amema'amo efore huteno ame huno fanane hiaza huno vahe'mota nemanuna knatimo'a ame' huno nevie. <verse eid="PSA 144:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 144:5"/>Ra Anumzamoka anami mona eri ankro hunka eramio. Ana nehunka agonaramintera kazana eme avako hugeno tevegumo'a vemagu vemagu huno marerino. <verse eid="PSA 144:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 144:6"/>Kopasi'na atregeno ruganani huno vuno eno nehuno, Kagri'ma ha'ma renegantaza vahera zamahe panani hino. Kagra keveraminka'a ahetrenka zamazeri koro huge'za freho. <verse eid="PSA 144:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 144:7"/>Anagamu monafinkati kazana antefenka atrenka, tima hageno eme nazeri nenakrifintira naza hunka nagura nevazinka, ru vahe'mokizmi hankavefintira nagu'vazio. <verse eid="PSA 144:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 144:8"/>Ana vahe'mo'za havi nanekege nehu'za, ana hugahune hu'za huvempa nehazanagi, ana zana osugahaze. <verse eid="PSA 144:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 144:9"/>Anumzamoka kasefa zagame hu'na kagika'a erisga hugahue. Nagra 10ni'a nofi'ma me'nea hapu zavena nehe'na, zagamera hu'na kagika'a ahentesga hugahue. <verse eid="PSA 144:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 144:10"/>Kagrake'za kini vahera hankavea zaminke'za, ha' vahe'zamia hara huzamagate nerazagenka, eri'za vaheka'amo'na Deviti'na nagu'vazinke'za ha' vahe'nimo'za bainati kazinura nahe ofri'naze. <verse eid="PSA 144:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 144:11"/>Ha' vahenimokizmi hankavefintira nagu'vazinka ete navro. Ana vahe'mo'za havi nanekege nehu'za, ana hugahune hu'za huvempa nehazanagi, havige nehaze. <verse eid="PSA 144:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 144:12"/>Tagri ne' mofavre naga'mo'za zafamo ame huno hageno mareneriaza hu'za, ame hu'za ra ome hanaze. Mofa'ne nagatimo'za kini vahe'mofo noma vazisgama nehia zafaraminte'ma avasasema hunentaza kna hanaze. <verse eid="PSA 144:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 144:13"/>Ruzahu ruzahu ne'zamo, ne'zama nentona nompina avitesie. Sipisipi afu kevutimo'za rama'a tauseni'a kasenente'za, rama'a 10 tauseni'a kasentesageno sipisipi afu'ma nentona keginamo'a avitesiegu nave'nesie. <verse eid="PSA 144:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 144:14"/>Hagi bulimakao afutimo'za rama'a zantmi eri'za esaze. Tagri kumamofo have keginafintira ha' vahe'mo'za kama hage'za mareriza vahera zamavare'za kina ome huozmantesaze. Ana hanigeno ran kumatimofo kuma amunompima, knazama fore hige'za zavi krafama nehaza zana omanesie. <verse eid="PSA 144:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 144:15"/>Iza'o e'inahu asomu'ma erisania vahe'mo'a muse hugahie. Ana nehanigeno Ra Anumzamo'ma zamagri Anumzama manisia vahe'mo'za muse hugahaze.<verse eid="PSA 144:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 144"/>
  <chapter number="145" style="c" sid="PSA 145"/>
  <para style="s">Deviti'ma Anumzamofo agima ahentesga hu'nea zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 145:1"/>Anumzamoka nagri kini mani'nanku hu'na Kagrira husga hugantegahue. Ana nehu'na maka zupa, Kagri kagia ahentesga huvava hugahue. <verse eid="PSA 145:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 145:2"/>Maka kna Kagrira husga hunegante'na, kagia erisga hu vava hugahue. <verse eid="PSA 145:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 145:3"/>Ra Anumzamo'a agrake'za tusi'a Anumza mani'neankino, agrake'za ra agia erigara hu'ne. Ana hu'neankino agrake'za tusi'a Anumzana mani'neankita Agrira rezaganeta kegara osu'none. <verse eid="PSA 145:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 145:4"/>Vahe'ma fore hu anante anante'ma hu'za vanafina, Kagrama hankave eri'zama erifore'ma hu'nana zamofo agenkea zamasami anante anante hu'za nevu'za, kagri hankavegura huama hu'za vahera zmasamigahaze. <verse eid="PSA 145:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 145:5"/>Kagri hihamu hankavegu'ene, knare'nare eri'zama eri'nana zankura, nagesa antahintahi hugahue. <verse eid="PSA 145:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 145:6"/>Kagrama hankave eri'zama eri'nana eri'zamofo agenkea vahe'mo'za hugantu hugama hu'za nentahinage'na, tusi'a Anumza mani'nane hu'na vahera huama hu'na zamasamigahue. <verse eid="PSA 145:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 145:7"/>Rama'a knare'nare kavukvama hu'nana zankura maka vahe'mo'za huge antahige nehu'za, fatgo kavukva zankura zagamera nehu'za musenkase hugahaze. <verse eid="PSA 145:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 145:8"/>Ra Anumzamo'a knare avu'ava huneranteno asunku hunerantea Anumzankino, ame huno arimpa oheno, vagaore mevava avesi zanteti avesinerantea Anumza mani'ne. <verse eid="PSA 145:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 145:9"/>Ra Anumzamo'a maka vahera knare avu'avaza hunezamanteno, maka zama tro'ma hunte'nea zantamina asunku hunezamantea Anumza mani'ne. <verse eid="PSA 145:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 145:10"/>Ra Anumzamoka maka zama tro'ma hunte'nana zantamimo'a Kagrira humuse hunegantesage'za, kamage'ma nentaza vahe'mo'za Kagri kagi'a husga hugahaze. <verse eid="PSA 145:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 145:11"/>Ana nehu'za kagrama maka mopama kegava hunana hihamu masa zanka'agura nanekea nehu'za, hanaveka'agura huama hu'za vahera zamasamigahaze. <verse eid="PSA 145:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 145:12"/>Kagrama hankave eri'zama eri'nana zamofone, Kagrama kegavama hunana hihamu hankavea maka vahe'mo'za ke'za antahi'za hugahaze. <verse eid="PSA 145:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 145:13"/>Kagrama kini maninka kegavama hunana kuma'mo'a vagaore mevava huno vugahie. Mika knafima forehu anante anante'ma hu'za vanaza vahe'enena kegava huzmantenka vugahane. <verse eid="PSA 145:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 145:14"/>Tanafa'ma hu'za masaza vahera Ra Anumzamo'a zamaza nehuno, knazamo'ma rentrakoma nehia vahera zamazeri sga nehie. <verse eid="PSA 145:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 145:15"/>Maka zagamo'za kagrite zamavua antete'za amuhara nehu'za mani'nazagenka, kna fatgore ne'zana zaminke'za nenaze. <verse eid="PSA 145:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 145:16"/>Maka zagagafamo'za ne'zama nesaza zanku'ma nehazagenka, Kagra kazana rutarenka ne'zana zaminke'za nezamu nehaze. <verse eid="PSA 145:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 145:17"/>Maka zama hifina Ra Anumzamo'a fatgo avu'ava zanke nehuno, asunku huranteno ana maka zana hunerante. <verse eid="PSA 145:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 145:18"/>Tamage zamagu zamagesa regati'ma Ra Anumzamofonku'ma kezamatiza vahetera, Agra erava'o nehie. <verse eid="PSA 145:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 145:19"/>Agri'ma koro'ma hunte'za amage'ma nentaza vahe'mo'zama nazankuro atupa'ma nehaza zana nezamino, zavi krafama nehazana nentahino, zamaza huno zamagu nevazie. <verse eid="PSA 145:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 145:20"/>Ra Anumzamofoma avesinentaza vahera, Agra kegava hunezamante. Hianagi havi zamavu zamava'ma nehaza vahera, zamazeri havizantfa hugahie. <verse eid="PSA 145:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 145:21"/>Nagra Ra Anumzamofo agi'a ahentesga hugahuanki, maka zantamima agra azampinti'ma tro'ma higeta ama mopafima mani'naza zantamimota, ruotage'ma hu'nea agi'a ahentesga huvava huta vugahaze.<verse eid="PSA 145:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 145"/>
  <chapter number="146" style="c" sid="PSA 146"/>
  <para style="s">Ra Anumzamo'ma zamazama nehia zanku hu'za agi'a ahentesga hu'naza zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 146:1"/>Ra Anumzamofona agi'a ahentesga hanune. Nagra maka nagu'areti hu'na Ra Anumzamofona agi'a ahentesga hugahue. <verse eid="PSA 146:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 146:2"/>Nagrama kasefa'ma hu'na manisanua kna'afina Ra Anumzamofona agi'a ahentesga hugahue. Nasimu'ma eri'na manisanua kna'afina, Anumzanimofontega zagamera hu'na agi'a erintesga hugahue. <verse eid="PSA 146:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 146:3"/>Ama mopafima mani'naza kva vahe'mo'za taza hugahaze huza amuhara osiho. Na'ankure zamagra amne vahetfa mani'nazanki'za, tamaza hu'za tamagura ovazigahaze. <verse eid="PSA 146:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 146:4"/>Hagi ana vahe'mo'zama frizageno'a zamavufagamo'a mopanese. Anama friza zupa, nazano hugahune hu'za antahintahima retroma hu'naza zamo'a amne zankna nehie. <verse eid="PSA 146:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 146:5"/>Hianagi izano Jekopu Anumzamo'ma azama nehania vahe'mo'a muse nehanigeno, Ra Anumzana Anumzama'arema amuha'ma nehania vahe'mo'a muse hugahie. <verse eid="PSA 146:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 146:6"/>Anumzamo'a monane, mopane, hagerine, maka zantamima anampima me'nea zantamina agrake'za tro hu'ne. Ana hu'neankino nazano hugahuema huno huvempama hu'nea zana huvava huno nevie. <verse eid="PSA 146:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 146:7"/>Vahe'mo'za knama zami'za zamazeri havizama nehaza vahera, fatgo huno refko hunezamanteno, ne'zanku'ma zamaga'ma netaza vahera ne'zana nezamie. Ana nehuno Ra Anumzamo'a kinafima mani'naza vahera katufe zamantege'za fru hu'za nemanize. <verse eid="PSA 146:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 146:8"/>Zamavu'ma asuhu'nea vahera Ra Anumzamo'a zamavua eri hari nehuno, knazamo'ma zamazeri fenkami atre'nea vahera zamazeri sga nehuno, fatgo avu'ava zama nehaza vahera avesi nezamante. <verse eid="PSA 146:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 146:9"/>Megi'ati ru vahe'ma tagranema enemaniza vahera Ra Anumzamo'a kegava hunezmanteno, kento a'nane zagane megusa mofavre nagara zamaza nehie. Hianagi havi avu'ava zama nehaza vahe'mo'zama nazano hunaku'ma retro'ma haza antahi'zana eri savri nehie. <verse eid="PSA 146:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 146:10"/>Ra Anumzamo'a kinia mani vava huno vugahie. Saioni vahe'mota Anumzamo'a fore hunante anante'ma hu'za vanaza vahetera kinia manivava huno vugahianki, agi'a ahentesga hanune.<verse eid="PSA 146:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 146"/>
  <chapter number="147" style="c" sid="PSA 147"/>
  <para style="s">Ra Anumzamofoma ra agima ami'zamofo zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 147:1"/>Ra Anumzamofona agi'a ahentesga hanune. Anumzantimofoma zagamema huta agi'ama ahentesga hanuna zamo'a knare hu'ne. E'ina hu'neankino agri agima ahentesga hu avu'ava zamo'a so'e huno knare zantfa hu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 147:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 147:2"/>Ra Anumzamo'a Jerusalemi kumara ete eri so'e huno ki'ne. Ana nehuno Israeli vahe'ma zamavare'za ru moparegama ome kinama huzmante'naza vahera ete ome zamavareno eme eritru nehie. <verse eid="PSA 147:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 147:3"/>Knazamo'ma higeno zamagu'amo'ma havizama hu'nea vahera ete zamazeri so'e nehie. Ana nehuno namuma zamare'nea zana anaki nezamante. <verse eid="PSA 147:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 147:4"/>Anami monafima hanafi tamima me'neana agra ko keno antahino nehuno, mago mago hanafi'mofona agi'a amitere hu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 147:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 147:5"/>Tagri Ra Anumzamo'a ra huno hankavenentake Anumza mani'ne. Ana hu'neankino Agri antahi'zamo'a mareri agatereneankita, mago'zantera erinteta, e'ina hune huta kegara osu'none. <verse eid="PSA 147:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 147:6"/>Zamavufgama anterami'za nemaniza vahera Ra Anumzamo'a zamazerisga nehie. Hianagi havi avu'ava zama nehaza vahera kugusopafi zamazeri netre. <verse eid="PSA 147:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 147:7"/>Zgame huta Ra Anumzamofona susu henenteta humuse hunteho. Hapu zavena neheta zagamera huta, Ra Anumzana tagri Anumzamofona agi'a ahentesga hiho. <verse eid="PSA 147:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 147:8"/>Anami monafina higeno hampomo'a rufiteno enevigeno, kora huntegeno ama mopafina kora runentegeno, agonaramimpina trazamo'a hageno marenerie. <verse eid="PSA 147:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 147:9"/>Agra afi zagagafa ne'zana nezamino, kotkoti namamofo anentamo'zama ne'zanku'ma krafama nehazageno'a ne'zana nezamie. <verse eid="PSA 147:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 147:10"/>Ra Anumzamo'a hosi afu'mofo hankavegu'ene, mago vahe'mofo hanavegura antahinomie. <verse eid="PSA 147:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 147:11"/>Hianagi Agriku'ma koro nehu'za, vagaore mevava avesi zanku'ma amuha'ma nehaza vaheku, Ra Anumzamo'a musena nehie. <verse eid="PSA 147:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 147:12"/>Jerusalemi kumapima nemaniza vahe'mota Ra Anumzamofona agi'a ahentesga hiho. Saioni agonafima nemaniza vahe'mota, tamagri Anumzamofona agi'a ahentesga hiho. <verse eid="PSA 147:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 147:13"/>Na'ankure rankumatamimofo kafante'ma eri rusima nehaza ainia agrake'za eri hankavenetie. Ana nehuno ana kumapima tamagri mofavre naga'ma mani'nazana asomu hunezmante. <verse eid="PSA 147:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 147:14"/>Tamagri mopamo'ma ometre eme atrema hu'nerega agrake'za kegava higeta fru huta nemanizageno, knare zantfama hu'nea witia tamigeta neramura nehaze. <verse eid="PSA 147:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 147:15"/>Agrama mago zanku'ma ama mopafima keagama hutregeno'a, ame huno ana nanekemo'a ama mopafina eneramie. <verse eid="PSA 147:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 147:16"/>Ama mopafina aisia atregeno eramino refinetegeno, tanefa ruherafi atreaza huno aisia ruherafi atregeno mopa refi'nete. <verse eid="PSA 147:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 147:17"/>Agra monafintira have komopa ko atregeno eneramie. Anazamo higeno tusi zasi nehiankino, mago vahe'mo'a ana zasipina omanigahie. <verse eid="PSA 147:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 147:18"/>Hagi henka keaga nehigeno, keaga'amo ana aisia eri ze'ze hutegeno, zaho huntegeno eno ana tina eme ahesageno vu'ne. <verse eid="PSA 147:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 147:19"/>Agra naneke'a eri ama huno Jekopuna nesamino, kasege'ane tra ke'anena Israeli vahera huama huno zamasami'ne. <verse eid="PSA 147:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 147:20"/>Amanahu avu'ava zama tro'ma huzmante'neana, ruga'a mopafi vahe'ma agri kasegema ontahi'naza vahera anara huozmante'ne. Ra Anumzamofona agi'a ahentesga hanune.<verse eid="PSA 147:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 147"/>
  <chapter number="148" style="c" sid="PSA 148"/>
  <para style="s">Maka'zama monafine mopafinema me'nea zamo'a Anumzamofo agi ahentesga hania zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 148:1"/>Ra Anumzamofona agi'a ahentesga hanune. Amenagame monafinkatira Ra Anumzamofona agi'a ahentesga nehinkeno, anami monafintira, Ra Anumzamofo agi'a ahentesga hiho. <verse eid="PSA 148:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 148:2"/>Maka Agri ankero nagamota Anumzamofo agi'a ahentesga nehanageta, monafima maka Agri sondia vahe'ma nemaniza vahe'mota agi'a ahentesga hiho. <verse eid="PSA 148:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 148:3"/>Zagemokane ikamokanena Ra Anumzamofo agi'a ahentesga nehikeno, remsama nehaza hanafi'mota Anumzamofo agi'a ahentesga hiho. <verse eid="PSA 148:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 148:4"/>Anami hampoma agatereno onagame'ma me'nea monaramimo'za Anumzamofo agi'a ahentesga nehanage'za, hampoma agatereno onagame'ma me'nea timo'enena Anumzamofo agi'a ahentesga hugahie. <verse eid="PSA 148:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 148:5"/>Hagi ana zantamimo'za Ra Anumzamofo agi'a ahentesga hiho. Na'ankure agra fore hiho huno hige'za fore hu'za me'naze. <verse eid="PSA 148:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 148:6"/>Agra amare megahaze huno nonkuma'ma huzmantenere manevava hu'za neaze. Ana hu'neankino agrama huama'ma hu'nea kemo'a, mevava huno vugahie. <verse eid="PSA 148:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 148:7"/>Maka ama mopafi zantamimota Ra Anumzamofo agi'a ahentesga nehinkeno, hagerimpima tusinasi zagama nemaniza zagamotane, hagerimofo amefenkamema nemaniza zagamota Ra Anumzamofo agi'a ahentesga hiho. <verse eid="PSA 148:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 148:8"/>Hagi kopasi'namokane komopa ko'mokane, aisimokane ko'mokane, Anumzamofonkea amage anteho. <verse eid="PSA 148:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 148:9"/>Maka ranra agona'motane, ne'onse agona'motane, rgama renentaza zafamotane, maka sida zafa'motane, <verse eid="PSA 148:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 148:10"/>afi zagagafamotane, vahe'mo'zama kegava nehaza zagagafamotane, tamasagu regati'ma regraromaheta vanoma nehaza zaga kafamotane, hareta vanoma nehaza nama'motane, <verse eid="PSA 148:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 148:11"/>ama mopafi kini vahetamine, maka ama mopafi vahe'ene, ugagota kva vahe'motane, keagama refkoma nehaza kva vahe'motane, <verse eid="PSA 148:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 148:12"/>nehazave'motane mofa'nemotane, ozafamotane, ne'onse mofavre nagamotanena Ra Anumzamofo agi'a ahentesga hiho. <verse eid="PSA 148:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 148:13"/>Maka zantamimo'za Ra Anumzamofona agi'a ahentesga hugahaze. Na'ankure agri agimo'a rankrerfa hu'neankino, agri hihamu hankavemo'a monane mopanena agatereno onagame mareri'ne. <verse eid="PSA 148:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 148:14"/>Agra vahe'a antahizamino hankavea nezamie. E'inama hige'za agri amage'ma nentaza vahe'mo'za agi'a ahentesga nehaze. Israeli vahe'ma agri tvaonte'ma nemani'naza vahe'mota, Ra Anumzamofona agi'a ahentesga hiho.<verse eid="PSA 148:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 148"/>
  <chapter number="149" style="c" sid="PSA 149"/>
  <para style="s">Musema huno Anumzamofo agima ahentesga hu zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 149:1"/>Ra Anumzamofona agi'a ahentesga nehuta, Ra Anumzamofontega kasefa zagame hanune. Agri'ma amage nentaza vahe'motama atruma hanafina zagamera huta Agri agi'a ahentesga hiho. <verse eid="PSA 149:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 149:2"/>Israeli vahe'mota tamagri'ma tro'ma huramante'nea Anumzamofonkura muse huntegahaze. Jerusalemi kumapima nemaniza vahe'mota, kini ne'tamigura muse huntegahaze. <verse eid="PSA 149:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 149:3"/>Tamagra Agri agia ahentesga huta avoa nehageta, nase'nasepane hapu zavenanena aheho. <verse eid="PSA 149:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 149:4"/>Na'ankure Ra Anumzamo'a vahe'agura tusiza huno muse hunezmanteankino, zamavufagama anterami'za nemaniza vahera zamaza hige'za ha' vahe'zamia hara huzmagate'neraze. <verse eid="PSA 149:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 149:5"/>Anumzamofo amage'ma nentaza vahe'mota, ha'ma hugatemaneraza zankura muse hugahaze. Ana nehu'za nozamifima mase'naku'ma nehu'za ranke hu'za muse zagamera hugahaze. <verse eid="PSA 149:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 149:6"/>Zamagipintira Anumzamofo agi'a ahentesga nehu'za, tarega kazigama asane'nea bainati kazina zamazampi eri'ne'za, <verse eid="PSA 149:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 149:7"/>maka ama mopafima mani'naza vahera nona hu'za hara hunezamante'za, zamagrama hunenaza zamavu'zmava zantera nona hu'za vahera zamazeri haviza hugahaze. <verse eid="PSA 149:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 149:8"/>Ana nehu'za kini vahezmia seni nofinu kina renezmante'za, kva vahe'zaminena ainireti tro hu'naza seni nofiteti kina rezmantete'za, <verse eid="PSA 149:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 149:9"/>ke'ma refkohu vahe'mo'zama e'inahu knaza erigahaze huno'ma hu'nea kante amage ante'za, ana vahera knazana zami'za zamazeri haviza hugahaze. Ana hu'neanki'za Anumzamofoma amage'ma nentaza vahe'mo'za, knare zamagi erigahaze. Ra Anumzamofona agi'a ahentesga hanune!<verse eid="PSA 149:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 149"/>
  <chapter number="150" style="c" sid="PSA 150"/>
  <para style="s">Ra Anumzamofo agi'ma ahentesga hu zagamere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 150:1"/>Ra Anumzamofona agi'a ahentesga hanune. Ra Anumzamofona Agri noma'afi eta, agi'a ahentesga hanune. Agri hihamu hankavema erinte ama'ma nehia mona kumapina, Agri agi'a ahentesga hiho. <verse eid="PSA 150:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 150:2"/>Agrama hankavenentake eri'zama eri'nea zamo'a, knare huno so'e zantfa hu'neanki' agi'a ahentesga hiho. <verse eid="PSA 150:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 150:3"/>Ufena nereta Anumzamofo agi'a ahentesga nehuta, laeriema nehaza zavenane hapuema nehaza zavenane neheta, Anumzamofo agi'a ahentesga hiho. <verse eid="PSA 150:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 150:4"/>Nase'nasepa neheta zagame huta avoa nehageta, kita zavena neheta konkenenareta Anumzamofo agi'a ahentesga hiho. <verse eid="PSA 150:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 150:5"/>Tare kapa tamazampi eri'neta runkasase hinkeno, agasasa neranigeta Anumzamofo agi'a ahentesga hiho. Anazana runkasase'ma hanageno ra agasasama neranigeta, Anumzamofo agi'a ahentesga hiho. <verse eid="PSA 150:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 150:6"/>Maka zagama tamasimu'ma erita nemanisaza zagamota, Ra Anumzamofo agi'a ahentesga hugahaze. Ra Anumzamofo agi'a ahentesga hanune.<verse eid="PSA 150:6"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 150"/>
</usx>
